window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":1301,"title":"Chapter 1301 A Flurry of Slaps","paragraphs":["1301 A Flurry of Slaps","Chu Yunfan’s shout shook the entire hall.","Everyone’s eyes were focused on him. Many people couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air.","Chu Yunfan had finally begun to make a move. After the Great Formless Sect had suppressed the Chu clan several times, he had finally begun to make a move.","Previously, many people did not think highly of Chu Yunfan at all. They felt that he should not be Mi Siyuan’s match. However, at this moment, they remembered that no matter what, Chu Yunfan was a Core. He was not a terrifying existence that they could compare to.","Many people even began to feel their legs trembling. It was too terrifying.","Now, just thinking about how Chu Yunfan had once killed a Core, they began to feel fear.","The contempt they had felt before had disappeared without a trace. Compared to Chu Yunfan, they were just ants on the ground. Ants on the ground actually dared to laugh at the eagle in the sky. Wasn’t that courting death?","However, in front of Chu Yunfan’s power, Soul Hunter seemed to not see it. He only sneered at Chu Yunfan and said, “Chu Yunfan, others may not know your background, but do you think I don’t? You clearly haven’t stepped into the Core Stage yet! Although I don’t know what method you used, don’t pretend to be a big wolf in front of me.”","Soul Hunter’s words instantly caused an uproar among the guests.","Chu Yunfan was not a Core?","This was the first time many people had heard of such a secret. What they had heard was that Chu Yunfan had killed Ancestor Wusheng, who had entered the Core Stage. Chu Yunfan should also be a Core. Otherwise, it would be an unimaginable miracle for a Divine to go against a Core. It was even more shocking than accepting that Chu Yunfan had already entered the Core Stage.","Everyone looked at him, but he had no intention of denying it.","Chu Yunfan smiled faintly because he knew that this matter would be revealed sooner or later. He had not entered the Core Stage yet, so he did not have the special divine power fluctuations and various phenomena of the Core Stage. As long as someone paid attention, it would be difficult to hide this matter.","However, he was not as shocked as Soul Hunter thought. Soul Hunter thought that he had exposed a big secret of Chu Yunfan, but in fact, it did not matter to Chu Yunfan at all.","Although he wasn’t in the Core Stage, it wasn’t like what Soul Hunter had thought. He hadn’t relied on some means to barely raise his combat strength to the Core Stage.","It was because he truly possessed the terrifying strength to sweep through the intermediate Void Core Stage. Because of this, it did not matter to him whether his opponent was in the Core Stage or not.","“It seems that you know this, which is why you are acting more and more unscrupulously!” Chu Yunfan sneered at Soul Hunter.","“That’s right. You think you can hide it from others, but you can’t hide it from my master. If you’re not in the Core Stage, you’re not in the Core Stage. You want to scare others by pretending to be mysterious, but you can’t scare me.” Soul Hunter looked at Chu Yunfan coldly, a hint of jealousy flashing through his eyes.","In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was only in the Divine Abilities Stage, yet he was able to create such a great reputation. Some people even called him the sixth strongest expert in the empire.","Compared to Chu Yunfan, he was only one of the top ten experts of the younger generation. It seemed majestic, but in fact, the difference was too great.","Under Chu Yunfan’s discerning eyes, Soul Hunter’s cultivation was also revealed. At such a young age, he had already stepped into the peak of the half-step Core Stage. In terms of cultivation, he was probably stronger than the Emissaries.","In the future, there was a great chance for Soul Hunter to step into the Core Stage. The Great Formless Sect had nurtured its younger generation in this way, becoming stronger and stronger.","“Hahaha, you want to kill me?” Soul Hunter laughed out loud and then flew up into the sky. “This is not the place to fight. If you have the ability, come with me.”","As Soul Hunter spoke, he stepped on a flying light and flew out of the city.","Chu Yunfan looked at this scene coldly and chased after him. Many of the guests present were basically Divine Abilities Stage and above experts, so they also rode their flying lights to chase after them.","“Chu Yunfan, today, I will expose you in front of the world!” Soul Hunter shouted. Suddenly, he felt his vision blur. He didn’t know when Chu Yunfan had already rushed in front of him and slapped him.","Smack!","Soul Hunter did not even have time to react. His entire body was sent flying like a spinning top.","Spurt!","Soul Hunter was slapped until he was dizzy and his bones almost broke. He widened his eyes. He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be so ruthless. He attacked immediately and slapped him without giving him a chance to react.","He finally got a taste of how terrifying Chu Yunfan’s strength was.","Opposite him, Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a puzzled expression. Although it seemed like he had casually slapped him, ordinary Divines would explode in the air if they were slapped by him. It was impossible for them to be fine and spit out just a mouthful of blood.","But then, Chu Yunfan saw that there was a bronze inner armor protecting Soul Hunter under his tattered clothes. This inner armor was flowing with a dazzling spiritual light, which was definitely different from the light of ordinary magic weapons.","“It’s a spirit weapon, and a defensive at that. No wonder you’re so arrogant. You know that I’ve killed Cores before, but you still dare to appear in front of me,” Chu Yunfan said as he glanced at Soul Hunter.","He immediately knew where Soul Hunter’s confidence came from. It turned out that he had this life-saving spirit weapon. This kind of defensive weapon was several times more expensive than ordinary spirit energy. Ordinary Cores could not afford it.","However, Soul Hunter had one. It would probably be very difficult for an ordinary Coid Core to attack the defensive spirit energy on his body.","“That’s right, it’s a spirit weapon. Chu Yunfan, you can’t even break through my defense. Hahahahaha!” Soul Hunter burst into laughter."]},{"number":1302,"title":"Chapter 1302 Squeezing Soul Hunter to Death","paragraphs":["1302 Squeezing Soul Hunter to Death","Soul Hunter’s wild laughter echoed through the sky.","“You were the one who sent people to kill Chu Hongcai?” Chu Yunfan asked casually.","“That’s right. It was me!” Soul Hunter laughed out loud and said without hiding anything.","“Good.” Chu Yunfan nodded. He had never suspected Mi Siyuan from the beginning to the end because there was no need for him to do so. If Mi Siyuan wanted to make a move, he would probably appear directly in Conglong and above the Zhongxin Marquis’s residence.","The target would only be him or Chu Yaowei.","An expert of that level wouldn’t even bother to attack Chu Hongcai. In the eyes of ordinary people, Chu Hongcai was an outstanding person. However, in the eyes of Cores, he was like an ant that could be easily killed.","It was not worth targeting at all.","Mi Siyuan had set up such a big trap just to force him out. He would not put the others in his eyes at all.","“Since that’s the case, then use your life to pay for it,” Chu Yunfan continued indifferently.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think you can kill me?!” Soul Hunter roared, his eyes filled with madness. The more indifferent Chu Yunfan was, the more he disliked him.","“You’re courting death!” Chu Yunfan sneered and slapped him again.","Soul Hunter was horrified to find that although he could see Chu Yunfan’s attack, he could not dodge it. It was as if his entire body was frozen, and it was difficult for him to move.","Bam!","Soul Hunter was once again slapped. All the bones in his body seemed to have been broken. He was immediately dazed and spat out another mouthful of blood.","The guests who followed behind were scared to death when they saw this scene. The infamous Soul Hunter in the southern part of Great Wei was like a spinning top, being whipped by Chu Yunfan at will.","Soul Hunter was covered in blood with just two slaps. They had no doubt that if it weren’t for the protection of the inner armor, Soul Hunter would have been slapped to death by Chu Yunfan by now.","Many people felt a chill run down their spines when they saw this scene. Chu Yunfan was too cruel, even more so than the rumors said.","Previously, they only knew that he had killed Ancestor Wusheng, but they did not know how he had done it. Now, they could see how he had killed Ancestor Wusheng.","Soul Hunter was a powerful figure, but he was now being toyed with by Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan, you can’t kill me, hahaha!”","Soul Hunter burst into laughter. He had gone completely insane. The viciousness in his bones had been completely stimulated by Chu Yunfan.","“Idiot.” Chu Yunfan slapped him again, sending him flying far away.","Bam!","Soul Hunter was sent flying.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Soul Hunter had lost count of how many times he had been slapped. Every time a slap came down, the bones in his body would loosen once, and some of them would even break and collapse.","Even with the protection of his spirit weapon, he had no chance of winning against Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, he no longer had any thoughts of competing with Chu Yunfan. All his previous speculations were wrong. Although Chu Yunfan had not reached the Core Stage, his combat strength had steadily stepped into the Core Stage.","Soul Hunter was at the peak of half-step Core Stage, yet he was beaten up like this after putting on the spirit inner armor. Even an ordinary Core couldn’t do this.","How did Chu Yunfan train? Was he really a monster?","Finally, Soul Hunter stopped. His face and body were covered in blood. He looked extremely miserable. The arrogance and dominance he had when he was trying to establish the merchant alliance earlier were gone.","At this moment, he only had one thought, and that was to escape!","However, just as he was about to escape, Chu Yunfan’s big hand lunged at him, turning into a large hand of energy and grabbing him in his hand.","“Chu Yunfan, I’ve already informed my master. When he gets here, it will be your death. You can’t kill me!” Soul Hunter said in a crazed manner.","However, Chu Yunfan only sneered and said, “Idiot.”","His big hand suddenly began to exert strength. Just when Soul Hunter thought that Chu Yunfan could not do anything to him and could not break through the defense of his inner armor...","He heard a cracking sound coming from his inner armor. He didn’t know when, but his inner armor was already covered in all kinds of cracks. Now, under Chu Yunfan’s fierce grasp, it shattered inch by inch.","“Impossible! How could you break my spirit weapon armor with your bare hands?!” Soul Hunter said in disbelief.","At this moment, he realized that he was afraid, just like those people he killed casually. They were actually so afraid before they died.","“You can’t kill me. If you kill me, my master will never let you get away!”","Soul Hunter roared, but it was already too late. Chu Yunfan ruthlessly crushed Soul Hunter into a cloud of blood mist, then put the blood into the Mountain River Diagram and poured it on the Brahma Tree.","The Brahma Fruit on the Brahma Tree matured even more.","All of this happened too quickly. It took a long time to describe, but in just a short span of ten breaths, the previously arrogant Soul Hunter died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. From the beginning to the end, he did not cause any harm to Chu Yunfan.","“How terrifying! Chu Yunfan is ten times more terrifying than the rumors say!”","“I’ve never seen anyone kill someone as cruelly and casually as he did!”","“I can feel the killing intent on his body. He must have slaughtered tens of thousands of people to have such a terrifying killing intent!”","“Where did this Chu Yunfan come from? Why haven’t I heard of him before?”","Many people were terrified. After seeing Chu Yunfan crush Soul Hunter to death, they turned their gazes over and were even more afraid.","They were afraid that Chu Yunfan would kill them all.","However, Chu Yunfan only looked at them and said, “Next, you have to pass a message to Mi Siyuan. Since he wants to force me out, I’ll fulfill his wish. Three days from now, I’ll be waiting for him outside Conglong at Eternal Lake!”"]},{"number":1303,"title":"Chapter 1303 Three Days Later, by Eternal Lake","paragraphs":["1303 Three Days Later, by Eternal Lake","In just one night, Chu Yunfan crushed Soul Hunter to death and issued a challenge to Mi Siyuan, causing a sensation throughout Great Wei.","All the major factions heard about this matter overnight.","They were completely shocked. Even without mentioning Mi Siyuan, Soul Hunter himself was still a young expert who was in the limelight in Great Wei.","His strength was unmatched in the entire generation of Great Wei. However, when facing Chu Yunfan, who was much younger than him, it was as if he had met his nemesis.","There were even rumors that he was crushed to death by Chu Yunfan while wearing a spirit inner armor.","!!","When this rumor first spread, many people scoffed at it and did not believe it at all.","Soul Hunter, who was wearing a spirit inner armor, would be a difficult opponent even for a Core. It was like encountering a turtle, which had shrunk into its shell and could not be dealt with at all.","It would be very difficult to break through it even with a spirit weapon. Otherwise, this kind of defensive spirit weapon would not be so precious. It was several times more precious than ordinary spirit weapons.","If they couldn’t even do it with an offensive spirit weapon, it was simply nonsense, let alone Chu Yunfan doing it barehanded.","Even though hundreds of famous figures in the southern part of Great Wei had said this in unison, there were still many people who were skeptical or did not believe it at all.","They felt that they were exaggerating Chu Yunfan’s strength. Moreover, every time such a rumor spread, it would become more ridiculous. How could someone crush a spirit weapon with their bare hands?","Wasn’t that a monster?","However, compared to Chu Yunfan challenging Mi Siyuan, Chu Yunfan killing Soul Hunter was nothing. Soul Hunter was just a half-step Core. Compared to a real Core, he was nothing.","Although Chu Yunfan was not a Core, he used the death of Soul Hunter to let everyone know that even if he was not in the Core Stage, his strength had already steadily entered this realm.","Even a figure like Soul Hunter had died in his hands, so there was no need to say anything else.","In the eyes of many people, this battle between the two sides was unavoidable. It was even an abnormal battle to the death.","The Great Formless Sect was the first to start the war. Hundreds of people from the Chu clan were killed, causing the entire Chu clan to be in mourning.","The Great Formless Sect had paid an extremely painful price. The successor who was said to be the most promising to enter the Core Stage in recent years had been crushed to death by Chu Yunfan.","Both sides had paid a painful price and were about to collide fiercely.","Three days later, at the edge of Conglong, by Eternal Lake, a peerless battle between Cores was going to take place. This battle had not even begun, but it had already attracted the attention of countless people in Great Wei.","Countless powerful existences in Great Wei began to move toward Eternal Lake.","Such a battle could be said to be rare in decades or even centuries.","These people rushed over at the fastest speed. Soon, many unfamiliar faces with different accents appeared in Conglong. However, without exception, each of these people had unique skills and extremely terrifying cultivation. The local forces had long been warned not to provoke these people.","Soon, many people in Conglong knew the whole story and why. The newly ascended mythical figure from Conglong and the legendary southern magnate of Great Wei, the legendary sect master of the Great Formless Sect, Mi Siyuan, were going to fight at Eternal Lake outside the city.","Instantly, the entire city was in an uproar.","In just two days, all the inns in the city were filled with experts from all over the world. These people, without exception, all had powerful strength. This gave Conglong’s officials a headache because these people were too arrogant and unruly. It was not easy to control them.","In the end, even the city lord of Conglong couldn’t suppress the situation anymore. There were even several half-step Cores among those who had come. And this was just the number of experts who had appeared on the surface. There were even more who had come and were hiding quietly.","The identity and strength of each of these people were not below the city lord. It was impossible to control them.","In just two short days, there were more than a hundred fights. Moreover, they were all experts above the Divine Abilities Stage. They had a feud with each other, to begin with, and they had only met at this time.","In the end, Chu Yunfan’s words came out from Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. If anyone dared to fight in the city in the next few days, Chu Yunfan would personally deal with them. No matter what grudges they had, they should not settle them in Conglong.","At this moment, everyone fell silent. After all, they all knew Chu Yunfan’s valiant battle record. Regardless of whether Chu Yunfan was a match for Mi Siyuan or not, it was still very easy for him to deal with them. After these people restrained themselves a little, Conglong finally gained some peace.","The third day soon arrived.","Early in the morning, these experts from all over the world left the inns and rushed to Eternal Lake outside the city.","There were many people who were travel-worn. They had just arrived at Conglong and did not even have a place to stay. They rushed straight to Eternal Lake.","These people, together with the ordinary people who wanted to watch the show, formed a mighty team.","However, when the commoners were about ten miles away from Eternal Lake, they were stopped by Conglong’s soldiers. All of them were stopped by the front line.","Many people were extremely depressed. They woke up early in the morning to come and watch the show, but who knew that they would be stopped outside?","The soldiers from Conglong were also very depressed about this. They directly shouted, “What kind of existence do you think Cores are? Even if the aftershock only swept past you, you would die. At that time, you won’t be able to escape!”","Many people thought about it and felt that what these soldiers said made sense. It was good to watch the show, but if they were swept by the aftershock, they would die.","But suddenly, someone pointed at two women walking together not far away and said, “Why are they allowed to go?”","“That’s right. My father is in the city’s garrison. Why can’t I enter?”","“That’s right, my father is also the city’s chief registrar. Why won’t you let us go?”","At this moment, a few of the scions of the nobility started to clamor.","The soldiers only glanced at them and said, “Don’t you know them? They’re the eldest daughter of the Marquis Anguo and the eldest daughter of the Situ Merchant Guild’s president. They’re in the Divine Abilities Stage, but what about you?”"]},{"number":1304,"title":"Chapter 1304 Even Half-Step Cores Become Merely the Background","paragraphs":["1304 Even Half-Step Cores Become Merely the Background","The soldier’s words made these scions speechless.","In this world, strength reigned supreme. Although their families could provide them with a lot of help, what really decided everything was their own strength.","However, they could only be considered ordinary and were only in the Innate Stage. They usually looked majestic, but now, with just one sentence, they were rendered speechless.","However, they knew that An Xiuxiu and Situ Miaoyi were famous geniuses in Conglong. They had already entered the Divine Abilities Stage at such a young age. Their future was limitless.","At this moment, An Xiuxiu and Situ Miaoyi walked into the encirclement. There were many people—thousands, in fact.","Even with their family backgrounds and knowledge, they were still tongue-tied. This was because these thousands were all elites above Divine Abilities Stage.","The city lord had issued an order to keep all martial artists below the Divine Abilities Stage outside and not allow them to approach. Otherwise, a major accident with casualties was very likely to happen.","Even so, over a thousand experts above the Divine Abilities Stage had come in three days. If there was more time, say ten days, the number of people who had come might have multiplied by several times.","Even those experts who were in seclusion were alarmed by this battle. After all, a life-and-death battle between Cores was not something that ordinary people could watch. Most people would never see a Core in their lifetime, let alone see them fight to the death.","“What power! This turnout is huge!” An Xiuxiu looked at the crowd and said in surprise.","She only knew a small portion of the thousand Divines here. However, this small portion was made up of people who had great reputations in Conglong and even the entire southern Great Wei.","As for the remaining people, although she did not know them, it was not difficult to imagine that they were definitely famous peerless experts from all over Great Wei.","When Situ Miaoyi saw this scene, her eyes were filled with complicated emotions. There was some joy, some worry, and some sadness.","It was completely different from when she first met Chu Yunfan. At that time, although he appeared calm, in her eyes, they were still people from the same world.","However, Chu Yunfan was now like a divine dragon high above. Even Divines could only look up at his back.","“Are you thinking about him?” An Xiuxiu glanced at Situ Miaoyi and sighed in her heart. How could she not understand her good friend’s thoughts?","Situ Miaoyi was forced to go on a blind date with Chu Yunfan. At that time, she would never have thought that this day would come.","However, she really did not think that Chu Yunfan would be a good match for Situ Miaoyi because the difference in their ranks was too great. Now the situation had flipped. It was Situ Miaoyi’s turn not to be worthy of Chu Yunfan.","How could a divine dragon in the sky stop for an ant on the ground?","An Xiuxiu had received guidance from Chu Yunfan for a period, so she knew Chu Yunfan better. What kind of person was he? It was not something that ordinary people could imagine. His footsteps would definitely not be limited to the small Great Wei.","Such a person was destined to be born to pursue the Dao and would not be a good match.","Situ Miaoyi bit her lower lip and said with a sad expression, “It wasn’t that long ago. How did it become like this?”","Situ Miaoyi also couldn’t understand it. It had only been a few months, but Chu Yunfan had transformed so fiercely. From the half-step Core Stage to the Core Stage. It was almost a leap.","It was to the point where she couldn’t even look up at his back.","However, Situ Miaoyi quickly collected her thoughts and looked forward. There were not many people by the lake. Even Divines did not dare to get too close. There were only a dozen people standing alone.","Without exception, these people all had deep cultivation.","Even among the many Divines, they were outstanding existences.","‘Half-step Cores!’","Situ Miaoyi quickly made a judgment because he saw a familiar figure among the group of people. It was the city lord of Conglong.","In the past, no matter where he went, the city lord was the absolute protagonist. The focus of everyone’s eyes. However, among these dozen or so people, he was lost in the crowd. He was not that outstanding at all.","It was not because he had become weaker, but because none of these people’s cultivation levels were lower than his. In fact, they were even stronger than him.","Among these people, An Xiuxiu saw the few half-step Core big shots who had fought in the battle at the Marquis Zhongxin residence. Zhang Ling, Yu Xuanfei, Lady Shui Ji, and Fu Wentai. Any one of them could have caused a commotion in Conglong.","And now, these four people had come so quietly.","Suddenly, at this moment, an old man dressed in black slowly walked over and entered the group of people, standing side by side with them.","“Who is that? His cultivation is terrifying!”","“I think I’ve seen him before. Oh, my God. Isn’t that the director of the agency?”","“That’s right! That’s him! He’s truly powerful. He’s the king of the shadows. This battle has even attracted him!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. The black-robed old man was none other than the director of Secrets. As for the other half-step Cores, when they saw the director, many of them showed varying degrees of disgust on their faces.","Everyone knew that the agency was a lackey of the Imperial Court, and the director was the dog’s head.","However, the director cared not one bit. He did not take these people to heart at all.","“I didn’t expect this battle would even attract you,” an old man slowly said.","It was an old man in his seventies or eighties. He was dressed in a black robe with the word “Wei” embroidered on his chest. Everyone knew that it was the symbol of the imperial family.","“This battle is a rare battle that happens only every hundred years,” the director glanced at the old man and said.","However, before they could say anything more, another person arrived, which caused an uproar. Even these arrogant half-step Cores all wore solemn expressions. They didn’t dare to relax like before.","“It’s Elder Ku. I didn’t expect him to come!”","“It’s been so many years since I’ve seen him come out.”","“This battle is really amazing!”"]},{"number":1305,"title":"Chapter 1305 Even a God Can’t Save You Now!","paragraphs":["1305 Even a God Can’t Save You Now!","These half-step Cores were all shocked. It was fine that they had appeared because to them, this was a rare battle.","However, even Elder Ku, a Core who had once dominated the world, had appeared.","What did this mean? It meant that even Cores were paying attention to this battle.","Although Elder Ku was the only one who showed up, there were more than one or two other Cores who had not shown up but were paying attention.","Thinking of this, even these half-step Cores began to feel uneasy. In front of ordinary people, they were naturally high and mighty existences. However, when facing Cores, their pride was nothing.","“Elder Ku!”","These half-step Cores greeted him. Elder Ku was not only much stronger than them, but he was also older than them.","Elder Ku looked at them and nodded. However, he didn’t say anything to them. He just went straight to the people from the Marquis Zhongxin’s residence and Chu Yaowei.","“Elder Ku, why are you here?” Chu Yaowei looked at Elder Ku in shock.","“You’ve caused such a huge commotion recently. The entire Great Wei knows about it. How can I not know? Coincidentally, I was nearby dealing with the matters of the right king, so I came to take a look,” Elder Ku explained casually.","Many people finally understood why Elder Ku, who had not shown his face for a long time, suddenly appeared here.","“Where’s Chu Yunfan?” Elder Ku asked.","“He hasn’t arrived yet. We’re also waiting for him.” Chu Yaowei shook his head and smiled bitterly.","Elder Ku nodded and did not ask any more questions. Although he was just standing aside and ignoring everyone, he still gave off huge pressure.","At Eternal Lake, everyone was silent. No one dared to speak.","Suddenly, a figure walked out of the crowd and slowly walked over.","The crowd was in an uproar because of his arrival.","“It’s Chu Yunfan!”","“Chu Yunfan is here?”","Many people turned their gazes over. Indeed, a young man who looked to be around 20 years old, dressed in black, and had a thin and slender frame, slowly walked over.","It was Chu Yunfan!","Spotting him, Elder Ku quickly walked up and said, “Chu Yunfan, I didn’t expect you to cause such a big thing in such a short time. Even I heard that you were going to fight Mi Siyuan.”","Chu Yunfan glanced at Elder Ku and said, “Mi Siyuan has gone too far. I think everyone knows the reason, so I won’t say anything else. Since he wants to die, I’ll send him off.”","Chu Yunfan’s words made everyone gasp. He did not care about the powerful Mi Siyuan at all and even declared that he would kill Mi Siyuan.","What kind of person was Mi Siyuan? He was like a giant in the south of Great Wei, but in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, he was here to die.","“Are you confident?” Elder Ku stared at Chu Yunfan. “You have to know that he’s not a newbie who has just entered the Core Stage like Ancestor Wusheng. Even I am no match for him!”","Elder Ku spoke bluntly. He did not hide the fact that he was not Mi Siyuan’s match. In fact, there was nothing to hide because this was something that everyone knew.","“It’s fine. I’m confident,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","Seeing this, Elder Ku didn’t say anything more. After all, he and Chu Yunfan weren’t that good at being pretentious. The most taboo thing while interacting with others was to talk about deep things.","Suddenly, at this moment, a terrifying aura enveloped the entire lake and the surrounding area. With a loud boom, the calm lake suddenly surged with huge waves. The fishing boats nearby swayed in front of these waves, almost capsizing.","Meanwhile, the faces of the ordinary people who had come from all over the world to watch the commotion outside the quarantine line turned pale.","Those scions who were clamoring about why they were not allowed to approach, their faces were even paler now. Just the pressure released made them feel as if they were being crushed by Mount Tai.","If they were to go any closer, they had no doubt that all the bones in their bodies would be crushed by this terrifying pressure.","“Is this a Core?”","“So terrifying. I can’t even withstand the pressure.”","“This is a completely different level.”","A look of disbelief flashed across the eyes of many people. If they had not seen it with their own eyes, they would not have been able to understand how a Core could run rampant throughout Great Wei.","Boom!","Immediately after, a figure tore through the sky and arrived on a beam of light.","“Chu Yunfan, I’m here to kill you!”","It was a roar filled with anger. Immediately after, everyone saw a burly old man appear in front of everyone and fly over Eternal Lake.","Those Divines also felt the pressure of Mount Tai pressing down on them, and they were unable to stand still. They had to retreat until they were more than a hundred meters away from Eternal Lake.","Only the half-step Cores were able to stabilize themselves and not be affected by this imposing manner. They were the only ones who could still stand by Eternal Lake without batting an eyelid.","“A Core is so terrifying!”","Situ Miaoyi looked at Chu Yunfan worriedly. Mi Siyuan’s reputation was too great. He was a giant in the south of Great Wei. A terrifying existence that no one could match.","No matter how one looked at it, Chu Yunfan was no match for him.","Under everyone’s gaze, Chu Yunfan said indifferently, “”You’re here to die.”","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you! You only have some trivial means, but you dare to shout in front of me. You killed my disciple, and today, I’ll make you pay with blood!” Mi Siyuan said.","Chu Yunfan sneered. ” Mi Siyuan, cut the crap. Didn’t you use so many methods just to force me out? Aren’t you afraid that you won’t be my match when my strength grows in the future? Don’t you think that I’m not your match now?","“In that case, then what’s the point of wasting time? I came here today with only one goal, and that is to kill you! Even if a god descended to the mortal world, they would not be able to save you!”"]},{"number":1306,"title":"Chapter 1306 Terrifying Might","paragraphs":["1306 Terrifying Might","Mi Siyuan looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. Chu Yunfan had seen through his thoughts. Or rather, he had never hidden this thought from the beginning.","The reason why he had taken action was that, other than in the Yuwen clan, the southern part of Great Wei could not allow another master to appear.","The Great Formless Sect had its current supreme glory because of the foundation laid down by the previous sect master. That place was dominated by a single clan. There was simply no one who could compare to the Great Formless Sect.","If the person who had entered the Core Stage was just an ordinary person, although Mi Siyuan would be afraid, he would not immediately kill that person. Because after reaching this step, he knew how difficult it was to advance further.","It could be said that it was as difficult as climbing up to the sky.","Even if ordinary people broke through, their potential would be exhausted. However, Chu Yunfan was different. When he had just entered the Core Stage, he had attracted lots of attention.","Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties. At this age, even if he had only entered the Core Stage in terms of combat strength, his future was limitless.","Such an existence could be said to be a fatal threat to the Great Formless Sect. It was estimated that it would not be long before Marquis Zhongxin’s residence would rise because of Chu Yunfan and become a giant in the south of Great Wei.","Because of this, Mi Siyuan regarded Chu Yunfan as a thorn in his flesh. The Yuwen clan incident was just a pretext. His mother had died a long time ago, and most of his direct relatives in the Yuwen clan had died. He had no feelings for the Yuwen clan. How could he fight with another Core for the Yuwen clan?","Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at Mi Siyuan. Of course, he knew that Mi Siyuan was not just trying to vent his anger. In the past three days, he had read all the information related to Mi Siyuan.","When the Great Formless Sect was under the control of the previous sect master, it was not considered a giant. It only had a bit of power in the south of Great Wei. However, it was only until Mi Siyuan’s generation that, the sect had come to dominate the south for decades under his leadership.","This kind of person was definitely a formidable figure. How could he be so childish? The real root cause could only be the conflict of interests.","“You’re right. Your existence is like a ferocious tiger blocking the way of the Great Formless Sect. For the sake of my sect, you can’t live,” Mi Siyuan said coldly.","“So you don’t want to take revenge for Soul Hunter?”Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Of course, I have to, but it doesn’t make any difference. Even if I have thousands of reasons to kill you, you only need to die once.” Mi Siyuan looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","A hint of greed flashed through his eyes. Ever since he knew that Chu Yunfan had cultivated to this level at such a young age, other than fear, he was more greedy. He wanted to know how Chu Yunfan had cultivated to such a level. If he could dig out Chu Yunfan’s big secret, he had a feeling that it would be earth-shattering.","As he spoke, Mi Siyuan suddenly rushed toward Chu Yunfan like a bolt of lightning. He had said so much just now to cover up. His real goal was undoubtedly to attack Chu Yunfan.","“Formless!”","Mi Siyuan instantly displayed a set of earth-shattering strike techniques. As he slapped out, the waters of Eternal Lake were stirred up, turning into two incomparably huge palms that suddenly slapped down on Chu Yunfan.","As soon as Mi Siyuan attacked, there was an overwhelming power. It was just a simple attack, but this attack could blast a mountain into pieces.","Even the half-step Cores who were standing by the lake had no choice but to retreat. The Divines who had already retreated immediately retreated past the quarantine line.","The ordinary people and soldiers from Conglong who were outside the quarantine line did not dare to stop. They hurriedly fled.","Just this simple attack had made them feel the true terror of a Core. Even if they were only swept by the aftershock, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Chu Yunfan was completely unmoved by such a sudden attack. How could he let Mi Siyuan take advantage of him? Mi Siyuan had underestimated him too much.","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and then threw a punch.","Boom!","The two huge palms formed by the lake water were shattered by this punch. The sky turned into a waterfall that filled the sky and fell like heavy rain.","Chu Yunfan’s punch penetrated the waterfall, which looked extremely terrifying.","The only one who didn’t leave was Elder Ku, who was also in the Core Stage. However, under such a level of attack, he could only protect himself. Of course, this was under the condition that he didn’t interfere in the battle between the two.","Just the aftermath of the battle was not enough to move him.","However, the intensity of this attack had exceeded his limit. The level of the battle had clearly surpassed the existence of an early Core like him.","Whether it was Mi Siyuan, who had long been famous in the world, or Chu Yunfan, who had directly killed a Core in a battle that made him famous, any one of them was obviously an ordinary person.","‘This is terrifying. I can’t resist either of them. It’s fine if it’s Mi Siyuan, but this Chu Yunfan is so young. How could he have cultivated to such a level?!’","The more Elder Ku looked, the more shocked he became. Chu Yunfan was not even a fraction of his age, but in terms of combat strength, he was actually above him.","Before this attack landed, Mi Siyuan’s second attack fell, creating a huge hole in the sky. The air collapsed.","The entire scene was extremely terrifying.","Formless Strike!","That was the ultimate technique of the Great Formless Sect. Mi Siyuan relied on this invisible strike to fight all over the world.","This Formless Strike casually slapped down. It was devoid of form, but it was like a thunderbolt. It was simply invincible.","Coupled with Mi Siyuan’s extremely powerful cultivation, he was almost invincible.","However, Chu Yunfan was also extraordinary. He punched out and collided head-on with Mi Siyuan, not giving in in the slightest.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Loud explosions sounded like thunder on the ground. Many people’s mouths hung wide open as they watched this unforgettable scene."]},{"number":1307,"title":"Chapter 1307 Slashing Mi Siyuan","paragraphs":["1307 Slashing Mi Siyuan","It was extremely difficult to make Cores like Mi Siyuan take action.","Generally speaking, they didn’t need to do anything at all. They could solve any problem just by relying on their reputation. And if their reputation could not resolve it, it would often be a big matter.","However, they would usually restrain each other and would not easily come to this point. After all, they were all big shots of a region. If they killed each other at will, the entire Great Wei would be turned upside down.","In their eyes, Mi Siyuan in the air had turned into dozens of figures and attacked Chu Yunfan from all directions.","Just one person had the power of a thousand troops.","Great Formless Sect’s ultimate technique, Formless Strike. He was like the wind and clouds in the sky, and it was difficult to grasp his movements.","What was even more terrifying was Chu Yunfan. He just stood where he was and casually punched out. No matter how many times Mi Siyuan changed his body, he did not care. He just followed his own rhythm and punched out directly at one of the figures!","On the other hand, Mi Siyuan did not dare to do so because Chu Yunfan could ignore his attacks and follow his own rhythm. If he ignored Chu Yunfan, he could severely injure him with one punch.","Chu Yunfan’s fist force was terrifying. He had only fought with Chu Yunfan for a while and could already feel it. Compared to Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength, which was as deep as the sea, what was truly terrifying about him was that he had already cultivated a powerful body that was indestructible.","Therefore, from the looks of it, Chu Yunfan seemed to be completely suppressed by Mi Siyuan. The many attacks were almost endless, and Chu Yunfan seemed to be unable to pull back. However, a true expert could tell that he was the one who held the reins.","Mi Siyuan was using all his strength, but Chu Yunfan was only casually dealing with all of his attacks.","The Divines present were completely dumbstruck. It was simply terrifying.","A Core condensed all the divine power in his body into a golden core. Every attack could release 100% of his power. On the contrary, Divines couldn’t do that. Therefore, even if their cultivation levels were similar, if they encountered a Core, they would simply be defeated in one move.","Ordinary Divines could only release a portion of their power in one attack. However, Cores would use all their power every time and in the next moment, could recover most of their strength.","This was the most terrifying part.","The difference between the Divine Abilities Stage and the Core Stage was simply heaven and earth turning!","“Have you had enough fun?” Suddenly, Chu Yunfan smiled coldly.","Mi Siyuan’s expression froze, but Chu Yunfan suddenly attacked.","A huge golden asura appeared behind Chu Yunfan. The asura threw a punch, and Mi Siyuan, who was originally attacking furiously, instantly disappeared, leaving only one figure in front of Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","This punch landed on Mi Siyuan’s body, forcing him to retreat.","“What technique was that?” Mi Siyuan’s expression changed.","Chu Yunfan sneered. Then, he grabbed at the air with his big hand. Countless lightning powers flew out and turned into a long saber. With the saber in hand, Chu Yunfan’s entire demeanor changed. He became extremely domineering!","He slashed down at Mi Siyuan with his saber. Mi Siyuan repeatedly blasted out countless large energy strikes to slap down in an attempt to resist. In an instant, thousands of terrifying strikes were blasted out, but they were not Chu Yunfan’s match. They could not resist Chu Yunfan’s saber.","Chu Yunfan turned everything into nothingness with just one slash.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan had already moved forward and arrived in front of Mi Siyuan. He slashed down with his saber again. The saber split the air in half, and the sky was filled with rain.","Chu Yunfan stepped on the waves and approached Mi Siyuan step by step.","In the face of Chu Yunfan’s attacks, Mi Siyuan could only blast out strike after strike to block, but he was still forced back by Chu Yunfan.","Everyone was dumbfounded. It had only been a short time, almost in an instant, but Chu Yunfan had turned the situation around. He had forced Mi Siyuan to retreat with the saber. It was terrifying.","In their opinion, Chu Yunfan’s saber technique was not very exquisite. It was just an ordinary saber technique, but it was fast, accurate, and ruthless.","Each strike was vicious and fatal!","What did it mean to simplify the complex? This was to simplify the complex. However, this simple saber technique erupted with great power, forcing Mi Siyuan into a corner.","“What an overbearing fighting style!”","Elder Ku was dumbstruck. He had seen more than one or two Cores fight in his life. He had heard of all the Cores, but none of them had such a domineering fighting style as Chu Yunfan.","This was using a tyrannical body and unfathomable divine power to beat you up until you didn’t have any strength to fight back.","Generally speaking, this was a way for high-level masters to suppress low-level masters, but Chu Yunfan was going against the flow. He was using a lower cultivation level to gain such an advantage. It was simply shocking.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan once again slashed through Mi Siyuan’s attack and forced him back.","Spurt!","Mi Siyuan spat out a mouthful of blood. His face was extremely pale. As the saying went, a long defense would lead to a loss. He was like this. Originally, there was no flaw in his defense, but Chu Yunfan had managed to make a hole in it. This was the most terrifying thing.","At this moment, he was truly shocked. He originally thought that Chu Yunfan was only in his twenties. Even if his combat strength had entered the Core Stage, he would at most be only slightly stronger than Ancestor Wusheng. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan was so terrifying? Not only was he slightly stronger than Ancestor Wusheng, but he was even stronger by 30%.","He was a terrifying existence who had already stepped into the Intermediate Void Core Stage!","Chu Yunfan stepped on the surface of the lake, his entire body bobbing up and down along with the surging waves. He held the thunder saber in his hand, and lightning would appear from time to time under his feet.","He was as terrifying as a god of war!","“Mi Siyuan, if this is all you have, you will definitely die today.”","Chu Yunfan sent Mi Siyuan retreating with a slash, but he was not in a hurry to chase after him.","Compared to Ancestor Wusheng, Mi Siyuan was indeed much stronger. Unfortunately, Mi Siyuan encountered Chu Yunfan.","Everything was destined!"]},{"number":1308,"title":"Chapter 1308 Establishing Might, Mi Siyuan’s Death!","paragraphs":["1308 Establishing Might, Mi Siyuan’s Death!","“All right then. In that case, I’ll let you see my true strength!”","Mi Siyuan roared loudly. In an instant, all the power in his body erupted, and it was actually a level higher than before.","“What? This isn’t his full strength?” Elder Ku’s eyes widened.","The Mi Siyuan now was already terrifying. If Mi Siyuan attacked with all his strength, Elder Ku might not be able to withstand more than 30 moves. However, even so, this was not Mi Siyuan’s true strength.","‘But if that’s the case, if Chu Yunfan had already seen through it, why didn’t he stop him? Why didn’t he take advantage of the victory and pursue him?’","This thought appeared in the minds of many people, especially those half-step Cores. They didn’t understand why Chu Yunfan didn’t have any intention of chasing after Mi Siyuan. This was very unbelievable.","Logically speaking, when faced with an expert like Mi Siyuan, one should seize every opportunity to kill the other party.","Unless...","“Unless he wants to establish his authority!”","At this moment, someone suddenly had a big idea. Many people were shocked when they heard it.","In a battle of this level, Chu Yunfan still had the strength to suppress Mi Siyuan’s counterattack.","This was the most terrifying part!","The only conclusion was that although Mi Siyuan had not used his full strength, Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength either, right?","“The warm-up is over. It’s time to deal with you once and for all,” Chu Yunfan said.","“What an arrogant brat!” Mi Siyuan roared.","He flew up into the sky. Along with him, all the water of Eternal Lake was instantly brought up with him, forming a terrifying water curtain.","“Terrifying! His power has actually reached this level!”","Standing among the half-step Cores, Zhang Ling couldn’t help but gasp.","It was rumored that truly top-notch martial arts could overturn rivers and seas and capture the stars and the moon, but that was only a myth.","Even for experts like them, such a thing was still a myth. However, what Mi Siyuan was doing now felt like something from a myth.","Mi Siyuan turned the entire lake upside down, and then the water suddenly rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","It was impossible to calculate how much water there was in Eternal Lake. It simply formed an overwhelming might.","Many people were terrified, especially the common folk. They ran as fast as they could. The lake water of Eternal Lake covered them, forming a huge flood.","Boom!","The lake water surged toward Chu Yunfan like a tsunami. From a distance, it was as if a landslide had occurred.","In the face of all this, Chu Yunfan was not flustered. The saber in his hand grew bigger and bigger, and countless lightning powers turned into a terrifying domain around him.","Slice!","Immediately after, everyone saw a very shocking scene. Facing the overwhelming lake water, Chu Yunfan simply slashed down and cut the water curtain apart. The water curtain, which was hundreds of meters high, was cut in half by Chu Yunfan’s saber. It was as if the sky had been cut in half.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s blade directly cut through the divine power hidden in the lake water. It suddenly fell down and hit the ground. Like an earth dragon turning over, the entire ground shook violently, turning the area within a radius of thousands of meters into a swamp.","The monstrous tide formed and spread out in all directions.","“Stop the water!”","Under the command of the city lord, the Divines hurriedly began to use their divine power to block the lake water. Although the foreign experts had come from other places, they would not just stand by and watch the lake rage. They also helped, even the half-step Cores, using their divine power to stop it.","Fortunately, after controlling the water, it no longer had the terrifying impact it had at the beginning. Even so, it still exhausted them. Working together, they barely managed to control the raging lake water, but the two people in the sky had done it singlehandedly.","After Chu Yunfan’s saber split open the water that filled the sky, its momentum did not decrease and struck Mi Siyuan.","Bam!","Mi Siyuan was instantly sent flying and spat out a mouthful of blood. A huge bloody scar appeared on his chest.","He was hit by Chu Yunfan’s saber light!","Mi Siyuan’s face turned pale. Just controlling the water to form this overwhelming attack had exhausted all his strength and divine power. However, before he could recover his divine power, Chu Yunfan’s saber had already followed him like a shadow, slashing at his chest.","“Why is this happening?!”","Mi Siyuan looked at everything in front of him in disbelief. Even an intermediate Vodi Core would not be able to withstand this attack. The attack range was too large, and there was no way to escape.","If he were to take it head-on, he would be heavily injured by the lightning strike.","That was what he had thought, but the reality was completely different from what he had imagined. Chu Yunfan was too strong. He had directly broken through the attack, making his previous plan a delusion. He could not stop Chu Yunfan at all.","At this moment, Mi Siyuan finally accepted the fact that Chu Yunfan’s strength was above his. Although he did not dare to believe it and was unwilling to believe it, this was the truth.","He landed on the surface of the water, skidding a few times. Chu Yunfan followed him like a shadow and pounced forward. The long saber in Chu Yunfan’s hand slashed down again.","Slice!","Another even more terrifying saber light slashed down, almost splitting Mi Siyuan in half. The wound was so deep that his bones could be seen.","Mi Siyuan broke out in a cold sweat. At this moment, he suddenly understood why Chu Yunfan had not killed him when he clearly had the strength. It wasn’t that he was soft-hearted, nor was it that he didn’t know the way of battle.","It was that Chu Yunfan was waiting for Mi Siyuan to use his full strength and then defeat him at his peak condition.","Chu Yunfan was establishing his might!","“You actually dare to use me to establish your might?!” Mi Siyuan was furious.","“You finally figured it out, but it’s too late now. Go to hell!”","Chu Yunfan shouted and sliced off Mi Siyuan’s head."]},{"number":1309,"title":"Chapter 1309 Everyone Was Shocked","paragraphs":["1309 Everyone Was Shocked","Mi Siyuan’s head, which had been sent flying, had an expression of complete disbelief. He was a dignified big shot, a supreme expert at the Void Core Stage. But now, in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, he was just a target to establish his might.","However, this thought lasted for only a while before it disappeared because he was already dead!","Mi Siyuan probably regretted everything before he died. If he hadn’t come to provoke Chu Yunfan, he probably wouldn’t be in such a miserable state. He never thought that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength would be so great.","It was simply terrifying!","Not only was Mi Siyuan in disbelief before his death, but the other experts who were watching also seemed to be dumbfounded. They could hear endless lake water whistling in their ears, and it felt like a thousand horse was galloping through their hearts, making their hearts race.","What happened to the world-shocking battle? What happened to the ten days and ten nights? In the end, in just a short time, the victor had been determined.","Before the battle, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was no match for Mi Siyuan. For Chu Yunfan, the best outcome was to retreat unscathed.","Chu Yunfan was just a newbie. It would be an incredible miracle if he could escape from Mi Siyuan’s hands. It was enough to make Chu Yunfan famous.","Who would have thought that his performance would be so fierce? Not only was he completely intact, but he had also killed Mi Siyuan in one strike.","What was even more terrifying was that Chu Yunfan still had some strength left. He could wait for Mi Siyuan to use his full strength before killing him. This was a blatant display of power to let everyone know his terrifying strength. If an ordinary intermediate Void Core encountered Chu Yunfan, they would probably die.","“The situation is changing. The southern part of the empire is going to undergo a change. Marquis Zhongxin’s household is going to rise!”","“Truly terrifying. I didn’t expect the Great Formless Sect, which has dominated the southern part of the empire for so many years, to suffer such a downfall!”","“That’s right. The rise of the Great Formless Sect relied on Mi Siyuan. Now that he is dead, if they’re smart enough, they’ll immediately shrink their tentacles and hide their strength.”","Many people predicted the destruction of the Great Formless Sect. It had grown up by relying on Mi Siyuan. Now that he had fallen, it would cause the behemoth Great Formless Sect to collapse with a loud bang.","Of course, it was impossible for the Great Formless Sect to only have one expert, Mi Siyuan. There were probably some half-step Cores. But no matter how many half-step Cores there were, they would only be courting death in front of such a powerful expert.","All of this depended on Chu Yunfan’s intentions. If Chu Yunfan wanted the Great Formless Sect to die, then the Great Formless Sect would be uprooted.","In the process of the Great Formless Sect’s previous expansion, it was unknown how many people’s interests they had snatched. Although they had looked incomparably powerful before, that was under the circumstances of Mi Siyuan. The others dared not speak out in anger, and they did not dare to do anything to them.","However, once Mi Siyuan fell, it was equivalent to countless hungry wolves around them. They were all emitting green light and wanted to bite off a piece of meat from their bodies or even corpses.","And all of this depended on Chu Yunfan’s words. One sentence from him could decide life and death.","This was the highest realm!","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan differently. From today onward, he had the final say in matters of the south of Great Wei. He alone could decide everything.","Among these people, Chu Yaowei was the most excited. Even with his shrewdness, he could barely contain the joy on his face.","Before Chu Yunfan won, he was the most worried. Whether he was willing or not, he was bound to Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan failed, then his household would also face a catastrophe. Even if they relied on the power and protection of Great Wei, they would at most be able to drag out their days.","However, now that Chu Yunfan had won, everything was naturally different. It was finally time for the residence to be powerful and soar high into the sky.","That was what Chu Yaowei felt right now.","The experts of the residence beside him were also extremely excited. They could imagine how powerful the residence would be from now on. They would also benefit from it.","Only Chu Hongcai was truly happy for Chu Yunfan. Before the battle, he was very worried for his brother. Now, he could finally breathe a sigh of relief.","“Congratulations! From now on, you can make a decision with a single word in the whole south of Great Wei, Marquis Zhongxin.”","At this moment, someone came up to congratulate Chu Yaowei.","Chu Yaowei took a look and saw that the person was also a marquis. His status was not lower than his. Usually, it was absolutely impossible for him to be so humble.","“Congratulations! In the future, Great Wei’s southern region will only follow the orders of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.”","“That’s right. In the future, if you have any orders, we’ll definitely go through fire and water, even if we have to die, Marquis Zhongxin.”","Chu Yaowei was crowded by a group of people who came to congratulate him.","In the distance, Situ Miaoyi’s face was slightly red. She was excited as she looked at Chu Yunfan’s god-like figure with bright eyes.","“Now that he finally won, you can breathe a sigh of relief. Look at how nervous you were. You’re even more nervous than when you are in the ring,” An Xiuxiu, who was standing at the side, teased.","Truth be told, An Xiuxiu was also extremely nervous earlier, but she fared a little better than Situ Miaoyi.","Situ Miaoyi blushed as she glanced at her friend and said, “If you say it again, I’ll tear your little mouth apart!”","“Okay, okay. I won’t say it anymore!”","The sound of the two teasing each other could be heard far away, but no one paid attention to them.","Further away, the experts from the Great Formless Sect were completely dumbfounded. Some of them came from the Great Formless Sect, while some were experts from sects and families that were attached to the Great Formless Sect.","These people treated Mi Siyuan as if he was a god. Who would have thought that Mi Siyuan would be killed so easily by Chu Yunfan?","It felt like heaven had collapsed and earth had crumbled!","They could think of what the others could think of, and they had even thought of it earlier than they did. When they thought of the outcome that they might face in the future, they felt their bodies tremble.","Even the true half-step Cores felt that the world was no longer safe. Everyone looked at them with malicious eyes.","They had the urge to run away immediately but they didn’t dare to move. They knew that it was useless to move. It would only expose them faster. No matter how stupid Chu Yunfan was, seeing them run away impatiently, could he not tell who was friend or foe?","They felt completely hopeless. Why was this happening?"]},{"number":1310,"title":"Chapter 1310 Within Three Days, Those Who Caused Trouble, Come and Accept Your Own Death!","paragraphs":["1310 Within Three Days, Those Who Caused Trouble, Come and Accept Your Own Death!","Chu Yunfan grabbed Mi Siyuan’s corpse and crushed it, turning it into a bloody mist that filled the sky. He gathered it into the space of the Mountain River Diagram and poured it on the Brahma Tree on the herb mountain in the Mountain River Diagram.","The Brahma Fruit on the Brahma Tree matured a little more, and the medicinal fragrance became even richer.","It wouldn’t be long before the Brahma Fruit ripened. After such a long time, not only did Chu Yunfan’s strength and cultivation increase rapidly, but the Brahma Tree was also growing at an astonishing speed.","If it was the Brahma Tree that Chu Yunfan had eaten in the past, then with Chu Yunfan continuously watering it with the blood essence of Divine Abilities Stage, half-step Cores, and even Cores, coupled with endless spirit energy, he probably would be able to grow an entire tree.","However, the Brahma Fruit of that level was not very useful to Chu Yunfan’s current cultivation. Now, the Brahma Tree had grown at least twice as big as when Chu Yunfan had first obtained it.","The quality of the Brahma Fruit produced by it had also undergone a world-shaking change.","Although Chu Yunfan was still in the Divine Abilities Stage, in terms of power and tier, he was almost on par with a Core. He was even more powerful than many Cores. Ordinary natural treasures and medicinal pills were completely useless to him.","However, once this Brahma Fruit ripened, it would be enough to help him advance a step further. It would save him countless years of cultivation and allow him to reach tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage. Perhaps, it would be enough for him to rush to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage in one go.","His combat power was enough to cause a world-shaking change.","Seeing that the Brahma Fruit was finally about to ripen, Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a hint of joy. He landed on the ground and used his incomparable divine power to push the lake water that had spread out back into the lake.","When everyone saw this scene, they sucked in breaths of cold air. Previously, when Mi Siyuan poured out the lake’s water as an attack method, it shocked them. Now, Chu Yunfan’s attack was not inferior to Mi Siyuan’s previous attack. In fact, it was even more terrifying.","This was because Chu Yunfan’s move was much more difficult than Mi Siyuan’s.","After Chu Yunfan was done, he said, “I’ve killed Mi Siyuan, and I don’t want to start a massacre. However, whether it’s the members of the Great Formless Sect or anyone else, as long as they participated in the attack on the Chu clan, they are to come to Marquis Zhongxin’s residence to receive their death within three days. Otherwise, three days from now, I’ll flatten the entire Great Formless Sect.”","Chu Yunfan’s words made countless people suck in a breath of cold air. Chu Yunfan’s words were as domineering as they could be. He was making these people come forward voluntarily to die.","There was no doubt that they wanted the Great Formless Sect to give an explanation. Everyone who had participated in the planning would have to come and die, and it was likely that many of the higher-ups of the Great Formless Sect would be involved.","This made many people feel sad. After all, they were all high and mighty figures, and the people who were killed in the Chu clan were only low-level people. They had to be buried with these people.","In their eyes, this was Chu Yunfan’s most domineering aspect. He treated them the same as those minions.","Those from the Great Formless Sect were similarly shocked and furious because there were those among them who were responsible for planning this matter. Some of them had even taken action personally!","Previously, they did not feel that there was any problem because their sect held an absolute advantage. So what if they killed someone? Could the Chu clan seek revenge on them?","Now it seemed that the Chu clan did not have the ability, but Chu Yunfan had the ability and the will.","However, they knew that this was just the beginning. It was definitely not the end.","The Chu clan had suffered such a huge loss. It wasn’t just the loss of personnel, but the economic loss was also incalculable. And all of this was for the Great Formless Sect to be responsible for compensation!","At that time, the Great Formless Sect would probably bleed heavily.","However, in the eyes of many people, it was already a good thing that the Great Formless Sect was able to retreat unscathed. It was impossible to ask for more.","After saying that, Chu Yunfan didn’t say anything else. The Great Formless Sect naturally knew what to do. Anyway, the monks could run away, but the temple couldn’t. As long as the Great Formless Sect was still there, they had nothing to worry about.","However, just as everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was about to leave, he went straight to the director of the agency and said, “May I know if you’re the director of the Agency of Secrets?”","The director was also extremely shocked. Chu Yunfan actually recognized him and even came to find him in public.","“That’s right, I am. May I know what you need, Master Chu?” the director asked.","“I have something to talk to you about. Could we find the time to talk?” Chu Yunfan said directly.","The director nodded. He seemed to have thought of something because he had received a secret report before that Chu Yunfan planned to enter the capital to see him. However, he did not expect that the matter of Mi Siyuan would erupt later, forcing him to come here and he had bumped into Chu Yunfan in advance.","After Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he left with the director. Only now did everyone finally heave a sigh of relief, especially those experts from the Great Formless Sect. They felt as if they had escaped death.","Although Chu Yunfan had previously said that he would let the troublemakers among them come and die themselves, who wouldn’t be willing to live a little longer?","“It’s over. Looking at Chu Yunfan, although he doesn’t have the intention of uprooting us, I’m afraid he won’t let us off easily.”","The disciples of the Great Formless Sect looked at each other, and their faces revealed solemn expressions.","“There are still three days. We still have a chance!”","These experts of the Great Formless Sect were naturally unwilling to die. As long as there was still a chance, they would fight with all their might.","At this time, more people turned their attention to Chu Yunfan and the director. They were all speculating in their hearts about what Chu Yunfan had to discuss with the director.","Chu Yunfan and the director were fast. In a moment, they had already returned to Conglong and returned to Chu Yunfan’s small courtyard in Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","After the two of them sat down, the director asked, “May I know why you are looking for me, Master Chu?”","“I’ll get straight to the point. I want you to help me find someone. I know that the agency’s intelligence network is the strongest in Great Wei.”"]},{"number":1311,"title":"Chapter 1311 Secluded Meditation, Stormy Winds and Clouds","paragraphs":["1311 Secluded Meditation, Stormy Winds and Clouds","“It shouldn’t be a problem if you’re just looking for an ordinary person.”","When the director made this statement, he was clearly confident.","The Agency of Secrets had been established at the beginning of the Great Wei Kingdom. It specialized in gathering all kinds of intelligence. In Great Wei, many people’s ancestors did not seem to be abnormal, but this person might be a spy of the agency.","In terms of high-end martial strength, he did not dare to boast in front of Chu Yunfan. After all, the person in front of him had killed Mi Siyuan, the legendary master in the south of Great Wei.","However, the situation was different when it came to intelligence. In Great Wei, if he said that he was second, no one would dare to claim that he was first.","“May I know who you are looking for?” The director had already made up his mind to find the person Chu Yunfan was looking for even if he had to dig three feet into the ground.","After this battle, no one would dare to ignore Chu Yunfan. If one could win Chu Yunfan over, even the emperor of Great Wei would not easily give up such an opportunity.","Unlike those old foxes, Chu Yunfan had not yet made his position clear. Of course, no one dared to force him to make his stand clear, but all kinds of roping in and influencing him were going on at all times.","“Here.”","Chu Yunfan’s hand grabbed at the air and took out a photo. In this photo, there was a girl wearing a snow-white robe. She looked a little cold, but when she was taking the photo, her face was filled with a faint smile.","Although it was only a shallow smile, it was like a moment when flowers bloomed in the room. It had a unique kind of charm.","“Her name is Tang Siyu. I hope to use your agency’s network to find her,” Chu Yunfan said.","The person he was looking for was naturally none other than Tang Siyu, who had been separated from him after coming to the Spirit Realm. Although he was certain that Tang Siyu was different from him and had safely entered the Spirit Realm, no one knew where she had landed. Even he was not sure. The Spirit Realm was too vast, and he could not find her even if he wanted to.","However, the only thing that made him feel slightly relieved was that Tang Siyu was already at the peak of the half-step Core Stage back then. She should have entered the Core Stage by now. Speaking of which, even in the Spirit Realm, this was not a strength that could be easily controlled.","She should be able to protect herself.","Chu Yunfan had been making a lot of moves recently, and his goal was to make himself famous. In the situation where he couldn’t find Tang Siyu, becoming famous was the best way to ensure her safety.","If Tang Siyu knew about him, she would probably come and meet him soon.","“I understand.”","When the director received the photo, his entire body trembled because the figure in the photo was clear. Although there were portraits of various experts in the agency, even if the portrait was lifelike, they could only be said to be similar in spirit. However, this photo was completely different. It was as if the person was printed on it.","This was completely against his understanding. However, he was knowledgeable. Although he didn’t know where Chu Yunfan got it from, he didn’t lose his composure and didn’t ask Chu Yunfan about his relationship with this woman.","It was a great taboo for people to talk about deep matters with shallow friends.","The director’s relationship with Chu Yunfan was clearly not good enough to ask this question.","“All right, I’ll get someone to investigate immediately. Do you mind if I make a copy of this portrait?” the director asked. He didn’t know that this was a photo and only thought it was a portrait.","“No problem.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","He knew that if he handed over the photo, everything would proceed quickly. In the eyes of many people with ulterior motives, he did not care. The faster he could get news about Tang Siyu, the better it would be.","“If there’s any news, I’ll inform you immediately,” the director quickly said, “In that case, I’ll head back and make the arrangements. I’ll take my leave first.”","After the director took his leave, Chu Yunfan immediately began his secluded cultivation to summarize. Although he had completely crushed Mi Siyuan from the beginning to the end of the battle, and Mi Siyuan seemed to be unable to withstand a single blow from him, this was all on the surface. In reality, he had used absolute strength to defeat Mi Siyuan. However, this battle still benefited him greatly.","Although he had killed three Cores, he had only fought with them three times. After the information in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories and the result of this battle were mutually verified, it made him understand a lot.","As the saying goes, reading a thousand times is not as good as walking ten thousand miles.","There were many things that he could only comprehend more deeply after personally experiencing them.","In martial arts, after mutual verification, one could advance by leaps and bounds. After one battle, it was comparable to the results of years of cultivation.","This was the reason why Chu Yunfan’s cultivation had improved by leaps and bounds, but his foundation was not unstable. It was because he had a complete understanding of these things.","There was no such thing as a forced upgrade.","While Chu Yunfan was in seclusion to verify his understanding of this battle, the storm outside was just the beginning.","When the results of this battle spread throughout Great Wei, everyone was shocked. Even those who had the highest hopes for Chu Yunfan had never thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to defeat or even kill Mi Siyuan. It was already good if Chu Yunfan could escape from Mi Siyuan.","However, the truth once again slapped the faces of those who had confidently declared that Chu Yunfan was definitely no match for Mi Siyuan.","They were completely speechless!","Everyone understood that Great Wei was going to undergo a reshuffle. Chu Yunfan had killed Mi Siyuan, and the busybodies could not wait to add him to the ranks of Great Wei’s five experts.","In this storm after the battle, Marquis Zhongxin’s residence naturally obtained great benefits. The territories that were originally lost were quickly recovered. The shops and profits that had been taken away by the Great Formless Sect or other local tyrants were returned at an astonishing speed. No one dared to delay, nor did anyone dare to probe Chu Yunfan’s thoughts.","In order to make amends, those who had taken away the Chu clan’s profits had spat out more than twice the profits to appease the Chu clan’s anger.","When the Chu clan was full of food, everyone turned their gaze to the Great Formless Sect. Everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had asked the troublemakers to come and claim their deaths within three days, and no one dared to underestimate his words.","Not many people dared to try to fool Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1312,"title":"Chapter 1312 The Great Formless Sect’s Death Struggle","paragraphs":["1312 The Great Formless Sect’s Death Struggle","Everyone knew that if they were to fool Chu Yunfan, it would be fine if they were not exposed, but if Chu Yunfan saw through them, even if one of them didn’t come to accept their death, the Great Formless Sect would be uprooted.","No one would want to test whether what Chu Yunfan said was true or false.","Even if he wanted to save his face, he had to ensure that he would keep his word. He could not let the Great Formless Sect fool him like this.","Everyone was looking at the Great Formless Sect’s response.","Although Mi Siyuan was already dead, there were definitely many higher-ups of the Great Formless Sect who participated in the plan to target the Chu clan. This wave would definitely cause the Great Formless Sect to suffer a great loss.","And at this time, inside the Great Formless Sect, it was like a storm was brewing. To most of the Great Formless Sect disciples, this matter had nothing to do with them because they had not participated in it.","However, some were completely scared out of their wits. They had participated in the matter against the Chu clan. Many of them had even personally killed the members of the Chu clan.","Now that Mi Siyuan was defeated, it was their turn to bear the consequences.","In a secret meeting room of the Great Formless Sect, many high-ranking members of the sect had gathered to discuss Mi Siyuan’s defeat and Chu Yunfan’s request for them to receive their death within three days.","The atmosphere in the conference room was extremely oppressive. Everyone was silent and their faces were ashen. Many people’s faces were flashing with fear. When they thought of the scene where Chu Yunfan killed Mi Siyuan, that terrifying figure that was like a god made many people shudder.","“Tell us. What should we do about Chu Yunfan’s request?”","At this moment, a black-robed old man slowly spoke. This person was none other than the Great Formless Sect’s great elder.","Usually, his status in the Great Formless Sect was second only to Mi Siyuan. Now that Mi Siyuan had been killed by Chu Yunfan, the Great Formless Sect naturally took him as the leader.","“What else can we do? His request is too much!” one of the higher-ups shouted.","If it could be said that to the ordinary Great Formless Sect disciples, most of them had nothing to do with this matter and could temporarily heave a sigh of relief, then to the higher-ups like them, most of them had something to do with this matter. This was the most terrifying.","Although the Chu clan could only be considered a second-rate force in the south of Great Wei, it was still a piece of fat meat after years of accumulation.","Back then, when Mi Siyuan gave the order, who knew how many factions within the Great Formless Sect would pounce over and bite off a piece of the meat?","As the saying went, everyone had their share of the profits. All the factions had more or less snatched some. The factions that had snatched some were very happy, but they had not expected that this would be their death.","Among these people, there were very few who dared to pat their chests and say that they had nothing to do with this matter.","Perhaps they didn’t react in time, or perhaps they were too weak. They didn’t show up in the previous wave. But now, this had become their life-saver.","Chu Yunfan wanted them dead. If he had killed them outrightly, it would have been fine, but now he wanted them to personally come and receive their death. This was the most terrifying thing.","“That’s right. He’s simply going too far. Let’s fight it out with him!” another higher-up roared, “Since we’re going to die anyway, we have to make him suffer!”","“How can we make him suffer? He’s a Core. Even the sect master has failed,” someone said.","Many people felt a little hopeless when they thought of the supreme might of a Core. They were a sect with a Core, so they knew how powerful these people were.","Even if all of them were to join forces, they wouldn’t be able to kill a Core. Not to mention that Chu Yunfan was a top expert among the Cores. Even the sect master was not his match, so how could they fight him?","“So according to what you said, you want us all to die? If we all die, won’t the Great Formless Sect be completely finished?” someone said sinisterly.","“Since you want us to die, then don’t think that everyone will have an easy time.”","The expression of the higher-ups of the Great Formless Sect who roared angrily became incomparably ferocious.","“We’re all dead, so what’s the point of the Great Formless Sect’s existence? Either we advance and retreat together, or we’ll be destroyed together!”","In the face of death, these experts of the Great Formless Sect had gone completely mad and furious.","There were even some people who were crazy enough to drag the Great Formless Sect down with them. However, most people were completely silent about this. If it was any other time, it would definitely attract countless attacks, but now, no one said anything.","To them, after they died, they would not care about the flood.","Either we lived together or we died together!","“At most, we can just hide in this sect. Our sect has been consolidated by two generations of sect masters for many years. Even Cores can’t do anything to us. I don’t believe that Chu Yunfan will break in directly.”","“That’s right. Who does he think he is? Even if the imperial court’s conquering army wants to take down our Great Formless Sect, they will have to pay a painful price. What can he do alone? Just based on the few crooked melons and rotten dates of the Chu clan?”","“That’s right. Let’s fight it out with him. They can wait. At most, we can just seal off the mountain and not come out. I don’t believe that he can live for another thousand years. At most, we can just wait for a generation to pass. When another Core appears among us, Chu Yunfan will be old by then.”","These higher-ups of the Great Formless Sect were all talking at once. In short, they wanted to hide and rely on the barrier of the Great Formless Sect to resist Chu Yunfan.","At most, they would endure for a few hundred years before leaving the mountain. It was just a generation’s time. Although they would feel aggrieved, it was better than being killed by Chu Yunfan.","“If it doesn’t work, then we can only do this. But before that, we can’t just give up. At most, we can report it to the Core Council and let them pressure us. I don’t believe that Chu Yunfan dares to go against all the Cores in the world!” the grand elder of the Great Formless Sect gritted his teeth and declared.","He did not want to die either. He was also involved in the matter against the Chu clan, but he did not want to die just like that.","Many people’s eyes lit up when they heard the great elder’s words. That’s right, they could rely on the Core Council. When they thought of the deterrence of the Core Council, they suddenly felt hopeful.","As long as the Core Council was willing to step forward, they still had hope.","If Chu Yunfan failed, the Chu clan could still rely on Great Wei’s imperial court. But after they failed, they had no one to rely on. The only hope they could rely on was the Core Council."]},{"number":1313,"title":"Chapter 1313 A New Level of Strength, a Storm Is Coming","paragraphs":["1313 A New Level of Strength, a Storm Is Coming","At this time, among the higher-ups of the Great Formless Sect, hope rose.","The Core Council!","This was an organization that they had only heard of. Ordinary people had never heard of this organization. This organization did not officially exist, and Great Wei’s imperial court did not recognize the existence of such a council. Therefore, ordinary people did not know about its existence.","However, they knew about it. As a matter of fact, Mi Siyuan was a member of the Core Council, so they knew a little about the Core Council.","To be precise, the Core Council was not a permanent organization, nor was it an official one. In fact, its members did not even meet each other on a daily basis.","However, the Core Council was a real existence. Its members were all Cores in Great Wei.","However, experts of that level were extremely rare in Great Wei. There were not many of them. To become a member, one had to be at least a Core. Even half-step Cores could only be peripheral members of the council. They basically had no access to the core secrets and were only regarded as errand boys.","This organization was very loose and usually did not manage anything. It was normal for them not to hold a meeting for a few years.","No one knew when the Core Council had started. Some said it was at the beginning of the establishment of Great Wei, while others said it had already existed before the establishment of Great Wei.","No one knew exactly when it began to exist. Although the history of the founding of the Great Formless Sect was long, it was obvious that it had not yet reached the beginning of the founding of Great Wei.","That was a thousand years ago!","However, the purpose of the establishment of the Core Council was to coordinate the interests and conflicts between these Cores.","A Core was like a nuclear weapon in human form. It was not difficult for him to destroy a city with a casual move. Such a terrifying existence, if not restrained, would pose a huge threat to the entire Great Wei. It was precisely because of this that there was the existence of the Core Council.","Generally speaking, if there were any conflicts between the two parties, they would try their best to resolve them within the framework of the Core Council. If someone went too far, the top experts of the Core Council would naturally punish them.","This time, the battle between Chu Yunfan and Mi Siyuan was not a member of the Core Council, so the Core Council had no reason to interfere.","Apart from mediating the conflicts between the Cores and preventing them from fighting each other over trivial matters, the Core Council also organized the people to fight against the invasion of the Cores from the outer realms.","Because of this rule, although Great Wei had never acknowledged the existence of the Core Council, they had never denied or suppressed it. Perhaps they had tried to suppress it, but it had not succeeded. They could only turn a blind eye and acquiesce.","And because of this, in the Great Formless Sect’s opinion, this might be their only chance.","The only people who were willing to stand out and had the ability to stop Chu Yunfan was Great Wei’s imperial court.","However, Chu Yunfan was a member of the loyal Chu clan. He was clearly also a member of Great Wei court. How could the court find trouble with Chu Yunfan for them? It was more like the other way around.","They were all clear that the Core Council was, in a sense, a product of the joint efforts of Cores. One of their goals was to deal with Great Wei’s imperial court. Of course, this was not to take the initiative to fight against Great Wei’s imperial court. It was just to protect themselves.","Although Great Wei’s imperial court was not as powerful as the Federation, its strength was far above any sect with a Core. Even a few Cores were not a match for Great Wei’s imperial court. After so many years, no one knew how many experts Great Wei had recruited.","Only with the help of the Core Council could the Core Stage experts join forces to fight against Great Wei’s imperial court. They would not be swallowed up or become a vassal of Great Wei’s imperial court.","Because of this, they felt that there was a great chance to ask the experts of the Core Council to mediate the situation. In a sense, the Core Council was naturally the opposite of Great Wei, which stood behind Chu Yunfan.","“Then let’s do it. We must use all our connections to get the Core Council to intervene. I believe the elders in the Core Council won’t be so short-sighted. After all, the weather is unpredictable. They can’t guarantee that they’ll be fine. If they die, their sect will be destroyed. They won’t want to start with such a bad thing,” the Great Formless Sect’s great elder said after thinking for a moment.","This was the only hope in everyone’s hearts.","After making up their minds, the Great Formless Sect quickly got to work. Ordinary people would not be able to find where the door of the Core Council was, but the Great Formless Sect was different. In order to not die, the entire sect’s higher-ups were doing their best.","At this time, the entire situation seemed extremely strange. The Great Formless Sect was closed as if they were planning something big. On the other hand, Chu Yunfan also looked like he was not afraid of anything.","He would only react after three days.","The two eyes of the storm unexpectedly remained strangely calm, which made many people who were prepared to watch a good show drop their jaws.","However, everyone knew that no matter how restrained both sides were, it would only take three days at most.","Everyone knew that the Great Formless Sect wouldn’t willingly come to accept their death. At that time, they would have to determine whether Chu Yunfan’s methods were tougher or the Great Formless Sect’s schemes were more advanced.","Soon, Chu Yunfan spent a day and a night verifying his gains from the battle before coming out of seclusion.","After a day and a night, Chu Yunfan had undergone earth-shaking changes. Although his cultivation had not improved much, his entire mental outlook had been renewed, and his understanding of the Great Dao had reached new heights.","Chu Yunfan stood in the courtyard with his hands behind his back. He was like a mountain, unmoving.","“Next, I’ll wait for the Brahma Fruit to ripen. Once it ripens and I consume it, my cultivation will be able to advance to tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage. Then, I’ll stimulate the potential in my body and break through to the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. At that time, the Core Stage will be just around the corner,” Chu Yunfan muttered to himself."]},{"number":1314,"title":"Chapter 1314 Ambassador of the Core Council","paragraphs":["1314 Ambassador of the Core Council","After breaking through to tier nine of the Divine Abilities Stage, there was still a hurdle, which was the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. Only those who could stimulate the potential of their entire body were qualified to break through to the Core Stage.","At that time, with Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength, he could basically break through the limit of the half-step Core Stage and enter the Core Stage directly. He wouldn’t need to go through the half-step Core Stage.","The half-step Core Stage was not a stage that one would definitely pass through. Some people had comprehended some Core Stage techniques, but they had not yet entered the Core Stage. However, not everyone had to go through this stage.","At that time, Chu Yunfan’s strength would undergo an earth-shattering change and reach a new level in one fell swoop. At that time, he would be able to go anywhere in the world.","As soon as Chu Yunfan came out of seclusion, a servant boy who was waiting at the side came forward to inform him that there was a special guest waiting for him.","At this moment, in the residence, Chu Yaowei, who had been very pleased with himself recently, was entertaining a young man in a luxurious robe.","This young man in luxurious robes had a handsome face and a somewhat impatient expression.","Chu Yaowei had a fawning expression on his face.","“Marquis, why hasn’t Chu Yunfan come out yet? Do you want me to continue waiting here?” the young man in the luxurious robe said.","Chu Yaowei revealed a bitter smile and said, “We don’t know. Yunfan went into seclusion, and we don’t know when he will come out.”","“If you delay things, can you afford to be punished?!” the young man in the luxurious robe shouted.","Chu Yaowei, who had been trying to curry favor with the youth, finally showed some anger on his face. He said, “Ambassador Lin, if you want to find him, then go ahead.”","Chu Yaowei finally couldn’t hold back his impatience anymore. If it wasn’t for the fact that the young man in the luxurious robe had an extraordinary identity, he would have turned hostile long ago. He was a marquis of the empire. During this period of time, because of Chu Yunfan’s powerful rise, many people fought to curry favor with him.","Now, he was actually being scolded by a guy who was far younger than him. Even when Chu Yunfan was talking to him, Chu Yunfan was very friendly. However, this young man’s strength was far inferior to Chu Yunfan’s, but he used his status to act arrogantly in front of him.","He had been holding it in until now, and he finally couldn’t hold it in anymore.","“Chu Yaowei, what are you saying? Are you trying to defy the will of the council?”","The young man in the luxurious robe was used to being high and mighty. With his status, he would be treated courteously wherever he went. Even the princes of Great Wei did not dare to offend him. But now that he was here, he couldn’t see Chu Yunfan, and even Chu Yaowei, who he didn’t care about, dared to throw a tantrum at him.","How could the arrogant him accept this?","“If you want to convey the will of the council to Chu Yunfan, then go ahead. Why are you looking for me? They’re not looking for me,” Chu Yaowei said coldly.","There was a limit to his patience. Although he didn’t want to offend Great Wei’s imperial court, he wasn’t afraid of them either. He just didn’t want to cause trouble.","“Why you...” The young man in the luxurious robe was furious. “Chu Yaowei, think carefully. Do you want to be enemies with the Core Council?”","“I don’t want to be enemies with the Core Council, but you can’t represent the Core Council, can you?” Chu Yaowei glanced at the young man and said casually.","That’s right, this young man in luxurious robes, Ambassador Lin, was the representative sent by the Core Council.","Most people didn’t know about the existence of such a council, but Chu Yaowei, who was Marquis Zhongxin, had heard of the existence of the Core Council.","However, to him, it was also a legendary existence. It was a powerful organization that only accepted Cores as members. Even half-step Cores could only be peripheral members.","However, his cultivation base was still far from the half-step Core Stage. Therefore, the matters of the Core Council were just some random records from the marquis.","From those records, he knew about this organization and how terrifying it was. He didn’t even need to find any concrete examples. It was already very shocking that they only recruited Cores as members.","Other than Great Wei’s imperial court, where else could one find a behemoth that could resist this organization?","That was why he didn’t want to offend Ambassador Lin, who was a representative of the Core Council. However, Ambassador Lin’s overbearing attitude finally infuriated him.","“Very well. Chu Yaowei, you’re just a small marquis. How dare you make an enemy out of the Core Council!”","Ambassador Lin was furious.","“Can I assume that this is Chu Yunfan’s intention?”","“So what if it’s my intention?”","Just as Ambassador Lin finished speaking, a cold voice sounded. Following this figure, a young man in a black robe slowly walked in.","“Marquis,” the black-robed young man greeted upon entering.","Chu Yaowei’s face immediately revealed a surprised expression. He quickly said, “Yunfan, you’re finally here!”","Only then did Ambassador Lin realize that this black-robed youth was the rumored Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan looked young. He was at most 20 years old. Some people would even believe that he was a teenager as he looked even younger than the rumors claimed.","Ambassador Lin immediately restrained the fury on his face, but there was a hint of jealousy in his eyes. This person was the rumored Chu Yunfan. He was clearly much younger than him, but he could actually alarm the Core Council.","He was slightly older than Chu Yunfan, but he could only be an ambassador of the Core Council. This made the fire of jealousy in his heart burn.","Ambassador Lin had always thought of himself as the number one talent in the world. He could not accept that there was someone who was about the same age as him, but whose strength and status were far above him.","Chu Yunfan nodded and sat on a chair. He looked at Ambassador Lin with a faint smile.","The jealousy in Ambassador Lin’s eyes could not be hidden from his eyes. However, he did not say anything. He was just wondering why the Core Council had sent Ambassador Lin here.","The servant Chu Yaowei sent to inform Chu Yunfan was also a confidant. He had told him everything that needed to be explained, so on the way here, Chu Yunfan learned a lot of things—including about the Core Council."]},{"number":1315,"title":"Chapter 1315 An Invitation From the Core Council","paragraphs":["1315 An Invitation From the Core Council","Before this, Chu Yunfan had no idea about the existence of the Core Council. He had risen to power too quickly, and he had been hiding his strength and biding his time to recover.","He was not very clear about the various secrets of Great Wei. He had never known about the existence of the Core Council. However, he immediately understood why there was such a council. Just like the United Nations, there was a need for such a platform to coordinate these terrifying existences that could destroy the world.","If two Cores were to fight to the death, Great Wei would be in chaos.","At the same time, he also knew that Great Wei had never publicized such an organization. They were afraid that this organization had the intention of Cores working together to protect themselves against Great Wei’s imperial court.","However, it was undeniable that this organization was indeed an extremely terrifying and powerful organization. Just by thinking about their recruitment criteria, one would know.","The young man in the luxurious robe was Ambassador Lin.","Ambassador Lin reacted quickly. Although he was holding back his anger and felt extremely jealous, he did not show it on his face. Instead, he bowed and said, “I am Lin Sheng, the ambassador of the Core Council. Greetings, Master Chu.”","Although he was indignant, he didn’t dare to show it because he knew how terrifying this person was. Chu Yunfan had killed two Cores in one go, and Soul Hunter, who was once as famous as him and ranked among the top ten young experts of Great Wei, was crushed inch by inch by Chu Yunfan while wearing a spirit inner armor. Just thinking about it made Chu Yunfan seem extremely terrifying.","Although Lin Sheng was jealous, he was not stupid.","“I don’t remember having any dealings with the Core Council. May I know why they’ve sent you?” Chu Yunfan said calmly as he glanced at Lin Sheng.","“I’m here on behalf of the Core Council for two things. First, if you know about the Core Council, you should know its standards, Master Chu. Without a doubt, you’ve met the standards of the council. The council wants to recruit you as a member.”","Lin Sheng calmed himself and suppressed the jealousy in his heart as he tried to speak in a calm tone.","So that was the case.","Chu Yunfan soon understood what was happening. After he killed Ancestor Wusheng and Mi Siyuan in succession, his combat strength was widely known. Even though his cultivation had not entered the Core Stage, few people dared to underestimate him.","In two days, the news of him killing Mi Siyuan in one battle spread throughout the entire Great Wei, especially in the south.","Originally, these places were the territory of the Great Formless Sect. Now that Mi Siyuan had been killed, it was clear that everything was going to be reshuffled.","In just two days, all the major forces had handed over the property that they had taken from the Chu clan. They didn’t dare to stop. Even if they didn’t offend the people of the Marquis Zhongxin’s household, they still sent out generous gifts. After all, if they sent out generous gifts at this time, Chu Yunfan might not remember them, but if they didn’t, there was a high chance that they would be remembered.","Marquis Zhongxin’s household also took advantage of this opportunity to expand their sphere of influence to the Great Formless Sect at lightning speed. No one dared to stop them, and the Great Formless Sect had already withdrawn all their forces back to their own sect, so how could they dare to stay outside?","At the same time, this also meant that Chu Yunfan had established absolute authority in the south of Great Wei. No one could rival him. At this time, it was not surprising that the Core Council wanted to rope him in.","“Let’s talk about this later. Didn’t you say there was something else? What is it?” Chu Yunfan asked.","Chu Yunfan didn’t release any pressure, but when he thought about how this young man with an indifferent expression had killed many half-step Cores and even killed two Cores, he couldn’t help but feel a chill down his spine.","“Master Chu, I’ve brought the council’s wishes. They hope that you will quite while you’re ahead and put an end to things, Master Chu,” Ambassador Lin said after some thought.","Then, he felt his courage return to him. Yes, although Chu Yunfan was powerful, he had the legendary Core Council behind him. In Great Wei, even the imperial court did not dare to ignore the decisions of the council.","“Put an end to things? Quit while I’m ahead? Do you want me to let the Great Formless Sect go?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“That’s right, we should stop while we’re ahead. We’ve brought along the proposal of the Great Formless Sect. If you let them go, they’re willing to compensate the Chu clan ten times their losses, Master Chu,” Lin Sheng said directly.","“Ten times the compensation?” Chu Yunfan looked at Lin Sheng with a faint smile.","“That’s not going to happen. The Great Formless Sect killed at least a hundred people from my clan, and now they want me to let them go so easily? How is that possible?” Chu Yaowei butted in and said.","He couldn’t help but speak first. With his shrewdness, he wouldn’t suddenly interrupt, but he was afraid that Chu Yunfan would agree. If that happened, the Chu clan’s plan would fall short.","If Chu Yunfan let them go, the entire Chu clan would have no way to explain themselves, not to mention that as the Chu clan rose up, weakening the Great Formless Sect would become an inevitable matter. If the Great Formless Sect’s strength was not damaged, then it would still be a colossus and a huge threat.","No matter how one looked at it, the Great Formless Sect had to be eradicated. They absolutely could not let them go so easily.","“Marquis, I’m afraid you have no say in this matter.”","Lin Sheng did not even look at Chu Yaowei. If it was not for Chu Yunfan, he would not even take Chu Yaowei seriously.","Facing Chu Yaowei’s sudden interruption, Lin Sheng reprimanded him without holding back.","“I’ve already made myself clear. How could I let this go just like that? Otherwise, whoever comes to kill my clan’s disciples in the future can be easily brushed off. Who knows how many clowns will jump out.” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","“Master Chu, the Great Formless Sect made an unintentional mistake. Moreover, you’ve already killed Mi Siyuan. Do you still have to be so heartless and exterminate them?”"]},{"number":1316,"title":"Chapter 1316 Prerequisite","paragraphs":["1316 Prerequisite","Lin Sheng explained everything to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan instantly understood the cause and effect. The reason why the Core Council would suddenly intervene and appear was probably that the Great Formless Sect had sought them out.","In the entire Great Wei, the only one who could help them, apart from Great Wei’s Imperial Court, was the Core Council. And it was clear that the Imperial Court would not help them. Therefore, the only one they could ask for help was the Core Council.","He just didn’t know how much the Great Formless Sect had paid to get the help of the Core Council.","Thinking about it, Chu Yunfan found it funny.","When the Yuwen clan went to the Great Formless Sect for help, the Great Formless Sect probably never thought that they would end up like the Yuwen clan.","He was not interested in exterminating the Yuwen clan. After all, the one who offended him was Yuwen Chang, not his clan. The one who really wanted to exterminate the Yuwen clan was Great Wei.","Yuwen Chang had betrayed Great Wei and colluded with Jinzhanghan, and this was the price they had to pay. However, the Great Formless Sect was different. In order to force Chu Yunfan out, Mi Siyuan killed more than a hundred people from the Chu clan alone. The others added up to hundreds.","Of course, Chu Yunfan couldn’t just let it go like that. Otherwise, what would others think of him? Wouldn’t he be bullied casually? Anyway, as long as they paid a sufficient price, it would be fine.","“Must I kill them all?” Chu Yunfan sneered as he looked at Lin Sheng. “If I had been defeated back then, would you have stood out to persuade Mi Siyuan not to kill me and let the residence go?”","Looking at Chu Yunfan’s half-smile, Lin Sheng could not help but feel speechless. He understood what Chu Yunfan meant. If Chu Yunfan were defeated, then Mi Siyuan would definitely take the opportunity to beat the Chu clan into a pulp and fall from then on. He might not even be able to keep Chu Yaowei’s head.","The battles in Great Wei were just so cruel.","And the Core Council would never ask Mi Siyuan to show mercy and let the Chu clan off for Chu Yunfan. This was very obvious.","Chu Yaowei understood the mocking smile on Chu Yunfan’s face—he was mocking their double standards.","At this point, Lin Sheng had no room for retreat, so he said, “No matter what, this is the decision made by the entire Core Council. The elders in the council do not wish for the Great Formless Sect to be exterminated like this. Don’t forget, Master Chu, even if you are in your prime now, there will inevitably not be such a day in the future.”","When Lin Sheng said this, there was a hint of threat in his tone. He had already thrown caution to the wind. How could Chu Yunfan have such a high level of cultivation and be on equal footing with the council elders?","The indignation in his heart instantly turned into a high-pitched voice.","“How dare you!” Chu Yaowei was shocked and angry as he shouted.","Lin Sheng was using the Chu clan to threaten Chu Yunfan. If anything happened to Chu Yunfan in the future, the Chu clan would end up like the Great Formless Sect.","Now that the Chu clan was at its peak, he actually cursed the Chu clan to be raided and exterminated in the future. How could Chu Yaowei not be angry?","Chu Yunfan did not have such a big reaction. Through Lin Sheng’s words, he finally understood the thoughts of the council elders. They wanted to compress the fight within a relatively reasonable range, leaving a line in their actions so that they could meet in the future.","Clearly, Chu Yunfan’s pursuit of the Great Formless Sect had made them feel the grief of the fox when the rabbit died. No one wanted to die, and the orthodoxy they left behind would be uprooted.","“You dare to threaten me with this?”Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes and sneered. “I’m telling you that there’s no room for discussion on this matter. If I want to uproot the Great Formless Sect, none of you will be able to stop me. If you don’t believe me, you can give it a try. I’m giving them a chance by letting them die. I don’t want to hurt the innocent, but if they are stubborn and want to drag the entire sect down with them, then I’ll give them that chance.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, his aura was released. It was just a trace, but it made Lin Sheng feel like he had fallen into an ice cave, and his entire body was drenched in a cold sweat.","Chu Yaowei did not feel it at all, but to Lin Sheng, it was as if Hell had appeared in front of him. He suddenly felt that death was so close to him!","How terrifying was this?!","He suddenly remembered that even though he had the support of the Core Council, in the eyes of this person, he was no different from an ant. What he relied on was nothing in front of Chu Yunfan.","It was laughable that he had tried to put on airs in front of Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, the flames of jealousy that had risen because of Chu Yunfan’s young age were instantly suppressed by this terrifying experience of being on the verge of death.","After he truly understood the difference between the two of them, his previous thoughts disappeared without a trace.","“But Master Chu, this is the decision of the entire council. The deputy chairman is personally involved in this matter. Before I came, the deputy chairman asked me to pass on a message to you.” Lin Sheng said through gritted teeth.","He felt his entire body was drenched in cold sweat. With every word he said, he felt that he was getting closer and closer to death.","He didn’t even know how to say these words. In front of Chu Yunfan’s power, his legs almost gave out. It was an unprecedented feeling. If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have believed it. How could there be someone in the younger generation who was so powerful? It was simply not an existence that he could look up to.","All his pride was nothing in front of Chu Yunfan.","“In that case, if I don’t agree to let the Great Formless Sect off, I won’t be able to join the council.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“That’s right, letting the Great Formless Sect go is the prerequisite for you to join the council, Master Chu,” Lin Sheng braced himself and continued.","“Hahahahaha, what a good condition. You make it sound as if I want to join this council. But, my friend, since you’re here, why are you hiding?” Chu Yunfan suddenly said as he looked at Lin Sheng."]},{"number":1317,"title":"Chapter 1317 The Five Great Experts of Great Wei","paragraphs":["1317 The Five Great Experts of Great Wei","Just as Chu Yaowei and Lin Sheng were confused, as Chu Yunfan’s voice faded, Lin Sheng’s body suddenly emitted a bright light.","Then, Lin Sheng’s eyes were filled with confusion as if he had lost his mind, and then suddenly turned sharp again.","Instantly, Lin Sheng’s entire aura changed. Before Chu Yunfan’s aura, Lin Sheng could only struggle to hold on, but now, it had changed, and he could actually stand on equal footing with Chu Yunfan’s aura.","He was fighting against Chu Yunfan.","“He was possessed?” Chu Yaowei instantly felt that something was wrong. Although his cultivation wasn’t too high, he had deep knowledge.","Almost immediately, he noticed the problem that Lin Sheng had encountered, and that was that he was possessed.","He was terrified. Although he did not like Lin Sheng, he also regarded him as a terrifying master.","As the ambassador of the Core Council, his strength was extremely terrifying. He was definitely above half-step Core Stage. An expert of this level could become an overlord in Great Wei and dominate a region.","And now, something had taken over his body without any warning!","One could imagine how terrifying the person who had occupied his body was. His cultivation had probably reached a level that could shock the heavens and the earth.","“I didn’t expect you to notice me,” Lin Sheng said as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","Even when he was facing Chu Yunfan, he no longer felt the fear and trepidation from before. He looked at Chu Yunfan at the same level, even looking down at him.","Chu Yunfan said indifferently, “Do you really think you can hide from me?","“Let me guess who you are. Are you the deputy chairman of the council? Do you really think you can scare me?”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Chu Yaowei, who was beside him, was frightened. He knew about the structure of the Core Council.","In the council, the person with the strongest cultivation base and the highest status was the unfathomable chairman, who was usually elusive. He was also the number one of the five experts in Great Wei—the sect master of the Demon Subduer Sect—Yun Huang.","Not many people in the southern part of Great Wei knew about the Monster Subduers. This was because they were mainly stationed in Monster Mountain in the western part of Great Wei.","Since the birth of the Demon Subduers, they had been constantly fighting with many monsters and demons in Monster Mountain. They guarded the western part of Great Wei day and night.","Among them, the strongest was naturally the sect master, Yun Huang. He was not only the sect’s leader, but he was also the number one expert in Great Wei. It was said that his cultivation level was already extremely high in the Core Stage. There were even rumors that he had already broken through to another level.","Chu Yaowei knew much more than others. He knew that the Core Stage was also divided into different levels. The first level was the Void Core Stage. If Yun Huang’s level broke through to another level above the Void Core Stage, it would be unimaginable.","It was because of Yun Huang’s status and strength that Great Wei had never relaxed over matters concerning him. Whether Yun Huang had a breakthrough, other than the Demon Subduers, Great Wei’s officials knew best.","It was because of Yun Huang that Great Wei could suppress the countless powerful monsters in Monster Mountain, ensuring that Great Wei would not be invaded and harassed by large-scale monsters.","However, because Yun Huang was located in the west, he would not appear often. Hence, the matters of the Core Council were usually handled by the deputy chairman.","And this deputy chairman was no ordinary person!","Currently, on the surface of Great Wei, there were the so-called five experts. Other than the fifth-ranked Mi Siyuan whom Chu Yunfan had been killed, there was the first-ranked Demon Subduer’s sect master, Yun Huang.","Ranked second was General Ye Fei, who was currently the leader of Great Wei’s army. Ye Fei was the number one person in Great Wei’s military and his strength was unfathomable. It was said that he was a top expert second only to Yun Huang.","It was because of his existence that he was able to suppress the many forces that were restless inside and outside Great Wei. It was said that his strength was invincible among the many Cores.","Ye Fei had been fighting outside all year round. He had countless military achievements and killed countless experts. It could be said that everyone throughout Great Wei knew about his ferocious might.","After Ye Fei, the person ranked third was the number one guardian of Great Wei’s imperial family. No one knew his background. They only knew that he was already the number one guardian of Great Wei’s imperial family when the previous emperor of Great Wei was in power. After so many years, he was still ferocious and illustrious.","After the other imperial guardians joined the Imperial Court, their reputation slowly became no different. This First Guardian had a record of taking action in recent years, and the targets he killed were people like Ancestor Wu Sheng who had betrayed Great Wei and joined the foreign tribes, or experts from other countries who had invaded their country.","However, unlike General Ye Fei, who had fought everywhere and established outstanding martial arts, the First Guardian almost never left the capital in recent years, so few people had actually seen him. It was just that his illustrious reputation was spread by word of mouth.","Under the First Guardian, the fourth of the five experts was none other than the deputy chairman of the Core Council, also known as Blood King.","No one knew his real name because when he appeared in Great Wei, he was already a Core. His cultivation was earth-shattering, and he had created his own world in Great Wei.","However, he was different from the others. He mostly stood alone and did not have many disciples. He was not like the others who had their own huge forces.","However, no one dared to underestimate him. In fact, because of this, he was feared by others. Because he did not have any faction to drag him down, he could act as he pleased. Once he became ruthless, no one could stop him.","Even though he had rarely made a move in recent years, his name was enough to tell how famous he was in the past.","Who knew how many sects he had slaughtered to obtain this ferocious and illustrious reputation?","Chu Yaowei felt suffocated when he thought about Blood King standing in front of him."]},{"number":1318,"title":"Chapter 1318 Stop Pretending to Be a Big Wolf in Front of Me","paragraphs":["1318 Stop Pretending to Be a Big Wolf in Front of Me","Chu Yaowei was different from Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan was just a distant descent of the Chu clan. In reality, he was not from Great Wei at all. He was not even from the Spirit Realm.","Therefore, he did not feel anything toward this Blood King.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan had cultivated all the way here. It could be said that he would kill anyone who stood in his way. In front of him, all authority was useless.","Chu Yaowei was different. He was born and raised in Great Wei, so it could be said that he grew up hearing about Blood King. In fact, because he was a dignitary of Great Wei, he knew much more than the average person.","It was because he knew more that he was more afraid. He understood how terrifying Blood King was.","Even among Cores, Blood King was a terrifying existence. His reputation was because he had killed Cores like Chu Yunfan.","The first thing Chu Yaowei felt was suffocation. It wasn’t because of the aura that Blood King was releasing. Just his past fame was enough to make him feel suffocated.","Chu Yaowei immediately sent a telepathic message to Chu Yunfan and told him about the five experts. He emphasized the matter of the deputy chairman, who was also the legendary Blood King.","Only then did Chu Yunfan understand what kind of person this deputy chairman of the Core Council was.","He didn’t know that there was such a big name. However, he wasn’t surprised. The ordinary members of the Core Council were all in the Core Stage. He would be surprised if the deputy chairman was not famous.","However, he still did not have any feelings for this “Blood King” title. He was just curious as to how the other party managed to possess Lin Sheng.","He glanced at Blood King and found a jade pendant on his body. Chu Yunfan immediately understood that this was the problem. A part of Blood King’s primordial spirit must have been attached to the jade pendant, and then it was used to possess Lin Sheng.","Lin Sheng was a half-step Core, and to the average person, he was already a master of a region. But for a master of Blood King’s level, even if it was just a part of their primordial spirit, they could easily possess someone if they were not careful.","“You are Blood King?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Since you know me, you still dare to be impudent in front of me?” Blood King sneered and looked at Chu Yunfan.","However, he was still a little surprised. He had not intended to show himself, but who knew that Chu Yunfan had seen through his possession of Lin Sheng’s jade pendant?","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t say it explicitly, for an expert of his level, if he continued to pretend that he didn’t know, it would be too embarrassing. He couldn’t afford to lose face.","He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to see through his disguise so easily.","“Even if your true body were in front of me, I wouldn’t be afraid, let alone a wisp of your primordial spirit. Stop pretending to be a big wolf in front of me.” Chu Yunfan sneered at Blood King.","When Chu Yaowei saw Blood King, his face turned pale. However, that was only Chu Yaowei. To Chu Yunfan, this was nothing.","Blood King looked at Chu Yunfan with a somewhat dejected expression. His reputation was useless in front of Chu Yunfan. Of course, he also knew that he was only a wisp of primordial spirit now. He might still be able to fight against ordinary Cores, but the person in front of him was the legendary Chu Yunfan.","Just from one glance at Chu Yunfan, he could feel that Chu Yunfan’s divine power was like an ocean. It was unfathomable. He was not like ordinary people who could be seen through a single glance.","Could it be that if he did not make a move these few years, he would not have any deterrence against these juniors?","However, when he saw Chu Yaowei’s pale face and breathless face, he nodded in satisfaction.","It wasn’t that he didn’t have any deterrence, but Chu Yunfan was a freak.","“Others may be afraid of you, but I’m not.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “I don’t know what kind of benefits the Great Formless Sect has promised you, but I said that I want them to come and die, so they have to come and die. Otherwise, I’ll uproot the entire Great Formless Sect.”","“How overbearing. Young man, haven’t you heard of the principle that it’s easy to break if you’re too hard?” Blood King narrowed his eyes, a cold light flashing through them.","“That depends on whether you have the ability,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at Blood King.","“What an arrogant brat.” Blood King’s face revealed a hint of anger. If it wasn’t for the fact that his main body was still in seclusion, he would definitely have killed Chu Yunfan with a single slap.","It had been a long time since anyone dared to be so impudent in front of him, let alone a junior.","“It’s fine if I didn’t come today, but since I’m here, you have to give way.” Blood King looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. “Moreover, even I find the barriers and array formations of the Great Formless Sect troublesome. And you intend to destroy the Great Formless Sect singlehandedly?”","“It’s none of your business what I do. You want me to give in, but I won’t. I want to see how you force me to give in.” Chu Yunfan stood up from his seat and slowly looked at Blood King.","He was not afraid of such a notorious figure. In terms of reputation, he was not inferior to Blood King back in the Federation.","“refusing the carrot and choosing the stick. If it wasn’t for my true body not being around, would you dare to be impudent in front of me?” Blood King said coldly.","Before he could finish his sentence, a terrifying aura erupted from Blood King’s body as all his blood essence was ignited. It should be said that Lin Sheng’s blood essence had been ignited by Blood King, and he had surpassed the limit of his half-step Core Stage.","In an instant, he had already broken through the limit of the half-step Core Stage and rushed into the Core Stage. Moreover, he had broken through continuously and directly reached an extremely profound realm.","He had reached a peak in an instant!","“Go to hell!”","Blood King instantly attacked. He slapped out a huge bloody handprint and slapped it toward Chu Yunfan.","All these changes took a long time to describe, but in reality, they happened in an instant. Blood King forcefully attacked, and Chu Yaowei, who was at the side, was completely dumbfounded.","All they could see was Blood King’s blood-red hand suddenly slapping Chu Yunfan’s body.","Boom!","A terrifying energy burst out from Chu Yunfan’s body."]},{"number":1319,"title":"Chapter 1319 A Breath of Air, Destroyed Into Ashes","paragraphs":["1319 A Breath of Air, Destroyed Into Ashes","Bam!","With a loud bang, the palm landed on Chu Yunfan’s body.","Blood King’s face revealed a ferocious expression. He was not a good person, and he never paid attention to the rules. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have the title of Blood King.","Chu Yunfan dared to contradict him again and again, which instantly made him furious. He launched a sneak attack, trying to seriously injure Chu Yunfan or even kill him.","As he expected, Chu Yunfan didn’t expect him to suddenly attack and was hit directly. However, the scene that followed made his eyes widen.","He tried his best to hit Chu Yunfan with his palm, but it did not pierce through Chu Yunfan as he had expected.","On the contrary, it did not affect Chu Yunfan at all. He did not move at all. Even when his palm landed, it did not even tear his clothes.","Chu Yunfan was surrounded by a layer of light purple lightning power that protected him. Blood King even felt some numbness in his arm, which was feedback from Chu Yunfan’s body.","“How is this possible?” Blood King said with his eyes wide open.","At this moment, Chu Yaowei, who was beside him, suddenly reacted. He was almost suffocated by the energy wave that was stirred up by this attack.","He felt as if thousands of demons were running through his heart when Blood King suddenly attacked without any warning.","He attacked without saying a word!","“If you were to attack me personally, I’d be a little afraid of you. However, this person is only a half-step Core. Even if you burn all of his blood essence, the strength you unleash will still be unable to withstand a single blow from me.”","Chu Yunfan sneered. If it was any other Core, they would have been severely injured by Blood King’s attack, or even killed. After all, Blood King had attacked without any warning.","However, Blood King had met him. His physical cultivation had already reached an earth-shattering level. Even if he did not take the initiative to defend, both the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique would automatically kick in to defend him. Ordinary attacks could not hurt him at all.","“You deserve to die!” Blood King said through gritted teeth. He tried to mobilize the divine power in his body to attack Chu Yunfan again, but suddenly, countless wrinkles covered his face, and his body began to wither rapidly as if his blood essence had been sucked dry.","In fact, that was not wrong. Lin Sheng himself was only a half-step Core, but this attack had clearly surpassed the half-step Core Stage, and even surpassed the ordinary fledgling Void Core Stage, directly charging into the intermediate Void Core Stage.","This was not something that Lin Sheng could do, but it was Blood King who had forcibly taken over his body and burned all the blood essence in his body in exchange for this.","It was all for the sake of severely injuring or even killing Chu Yunfan.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan was not effected in the slightest.","As for Lin Sheng?","Blood King had forgotten that this was just an ant at the half-step Core Stage. He had killed countless of them. How could he be moved?","Chu Yaowei was stunned. He looked at the scene in front of him. This was simply like a legend. Chu Yunfan blew out a breath and blew Blood King into ashes.","However, he was knowledgeable and immediately understood what was going on.","It should be said that Blood King had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. He had forcefully drawn out Lin Sheng’s blood essence to launch that attack. Now, the blood essence had completely dried up and he had died.","But in reality, the one who died was Lin Sheng, not Blood King!","Thinking of this, he could not help but suck in a breath of cold air. Blood King was simply too terrifying, and at the same time, Chu Yaowei was shocked by his cold-bloodedness. Blood King did not care about Lin Sheng’s life at all, treating him like an ant.","In the eyes of these truly important figures, they were probably just ants.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, did not change his expression as he watched Blood King turn into ashes in front of him. As for Lin Sheng’s death, he was not moved at all. After all, Lin Sheng did not die by his hands.","However, after this incident, there would not be any buffer between him and the Core Council. Or at least Blood King.","Blood King would probably come knocking on his door very soon.","However, Chu Yunfan wasn’t someone who would retreat after being scared by someone.","“Yunfan, what should we do? Blood King will definitely not let this go,” Chu Yaowei quickly asked.","He felt suffocated at the thought of facing a huge organization like the Core Council. Any one of them was not someone he could deal with. Even if they were just peripheral members, they were still terrifying existences that he could not deal with.","Back then, he had only dealt with a half-step Core Ancestor Wusheng, and he had almost caused the residence’s lineage to be cut off. One could imagine what would happen if it was the Core Council now.","“I’m afraid the Core Council won’t let this matter go so easily.”","Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “Don’t worry. I’ve just learned about the Core Council. If I’m not mistaken, it should be a loose organization. Except for fighting against foreign enemies or uniting against the Imperial Court, there shouldn’t be anything that can unite them.”","Chu Yaowei nodded when he heard Chu Yunfan’s words. It was indeed as Chu Yunfan had said. Ordinary matters weren’t enough to unite the Core Council. Usually, this was a loose organization that no one cared about.","The truly terrifying thing about this organization was that one had to be at least in the Core Stage to become a member. Even the members of the Core Council were in conflict with each other. They were not united at all.","“Even so, Blood King’s strength can’t be underestimated. He has a great influence on the council. Now that we have fallen out with him, he’ll definitely mobilize all his connections in the council to deal with us,” Chu Yaowei said.","When he thought of all this, he couldn’t help but tremble."]},{"number":1320,"title":"Chapter 1320 The Great Formless Sect That Resisted Stubbornly","paragraphs":["1320 The Great Formless Sect That Resisted Stubbornly","Just Blood King alone was unbearable for him, let alone the entire Core Council.","“Then let’s kill him before he can react,” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “As long as he’s dead, I don’t believe that the other members will come looking for trouble with me because of him.”","Chu Yaowei was frightened by Chu Yunfan’s grand goal. Indeed, if Chu Yunfan killed Blood King first, everyone in the council would be shocked by Chu Yunfan.","Other than Yun Huang, Blood King was the second strongest expert in the council. As long as Blood King was dead, no one else would dare to attack. Otherwise, they would end up like Blood King.","However, the prerequisite was that Chu Yunfan had to defeat Blood King in order to scare the other members of the council.","“But Blood King’s cultivation is unfathomable. It is said that he is already at the peak of the Void Core Stage.” Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Yunfan in confusion.","He had never seen Chu Yunfan’s strength clearly. Every time he thought he had seen Chu Yunfan’s strength clearly, he would be slapped in the face by reality. Therefore, he didn’t dare to make any deductions now.","Who knew what kind of strength Chu Yunfan could unleash?","“That’s just a rumor. I dare to conclude that he’s only at the late Void Core Stage,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","Just that small exchange just now had revealed Blood King’s strength to him. Although it was only Blood King’s power after burning Lin Sheng, Chu Yunfan could easily determine Blood King’s strength.","He was much stronger than Mi Siyuan. Mi Siyuan was only at the peak of the intermediate Void Core Stage and had yet to step into the late Void Core Stage. However, Blood King was definitely in the late Void Core Stage.","However, he should not have reached the peak yet. Therefore, Chu Yunfan was not afraid of him.","However, judging from the situation earlier, even if Blood King had not yet entered the peak, he was probably not far away. Therefore, there was not much time left for Chu Yunfan. He had to kill him before he broke through. Otherwise, things would be really troublesome.","With Chu Yunfan’s strength, it was impossible for him to deal with a peak Void Core. At most, he could only protect himself. It was impossible for him to kill a peak Void Core.","However, if it was only the late Void Core, Chu Yunfan was confident that he could defeat them.","He was already at the peak of the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. In terms of combat strength, even Mi Siyuan, who was at the peak of the intermediate Void Core Stage, was no match for him.","However, if he wanted to kill the current Blood King, Chu Yunfan had to go one step further.","If it were anyone else, it would be impossible for their cultivation to advance in a short period of time. However, Chu Yunfan had the Brahma Fruit. As long as he consumed the fruit, it was a certainty that he would reach the ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. At that time, he was confident that even if Blood King could overturn the heavens, he would not be his match.","When Chu Yaowei heard Chu Yunfan’s words, he almost fainted. Even if he was only at the late Void Core Stage, to him, Blood King was a terrifying enemy that he could not imagine.","That terrifying existence could kill him with just a finger.","However, seeing Chu Yunfan’s confident look, Chu Yaowei could only choose to believe him.","In fact, he had no other choice. Now, he could only place all his hopes on Chu Yunfan. Both sides were in a situation where they would rise or fall together.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan seemed to be quite confident, and Chu Yaowei had no other choice.","“However, since we’re going to make a move, then let’s wipe out the entire Great Formless Sect.”","At this moment, Chu Yaowei became ruthless.","“Our clan is still a noble family of Great Wei, after all. We have a wide network of friends among the generals. Since we have already shed all pretense of cordiality and will not rest until one of us dies, I’ll use all my power to wipe out the Great Formless Sect!”","His expression was a little ferocious. He had no other choice but to be ruthless. The Great Formless Sect was a terrifying behemoth.","Usually, he would not even think about making a move against the Great Formless Sect. But now, he had nothing to show off. Moreover, with Chu Yunfan taking the lead, their success rate greatly increased. Although they would definitely suffer heavy losses, at this point, it was no longer the time to consider losses.","“You don’t have to interfere.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. ” I reckon that since the Great Formless Sect has approached the Core Council, they definitely won’t come to die so easily. They will definitely put up a stubborn resistance.","“Since they want to die, I’ll send them on their way!”","Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “The Great Formless Sect has gone through several generations of construction. Now, the base is easy to defend and difficult to attack. If it’s just you alone, I’m afraid it will take a very long time.”","Chu Yaowei was very familiar with the background of these behemoths. Each of them was unfathomable and had all kinds of methods. It was very difficult to eliminate them.","Even if it was Great Wei’s Imperial Court, they would have to pay an extremely painful price to do so. Otherwise, Great Wei’s Imperial Court would not have allowed these forces to develop and would have long eliminated these unstable factors.","He originally wanted to share the benefits of the Great Formless Sect with the various major factions, urging the various major factions to send troops and join forces to destroy the Great Formless Sect. Since he had offended them, he would completely destroy the Great Formless Sect.","Since they were going to wipe them out, they would not drag things out. Otherwise, after a long time, when the Core Council reacted, their idea could not be implemented.","But now, Chu Yunfan said that he had a way. He didn’t know if Chu Yunfan really had such a method or if he was too confident. However, he understood that this matter was probably not something he could resolve.","At this moment, no one in the outside world knew that such a soul-stirring scene had happened in the residence.","Everyone was waiting for the final outcome of this matter.","There was no other news from Marquis Zhongxin’s residence, but the Great Formless Sect did not seem to be waiting for death. On the contrary, all kinds of information about their connections were flying everywhere.","The Great Formless Sect’s emissaries had traveled to every faction. They tried to get them to oppose the Chu clan and form an alliance with the Great Formless Sect. They were even willing to sacrifice a lot of money and give up a lot of benefits.","In the eyes of many people, the Great Formless Sect was crazy. Everyone from top to bottom had gone crazy. All kinds of empty promises were casually thrown out as if they were free.","Some people had calculated that even if the Great Formless Sect could survive this calamity, just the benefits they had promised were enough to cause the Great Formless Sect to suffer a great loss, regressing it by decades or hundreds of years overnight."]},{"number":1321,"title":"Chapter 1321 The Core Council Intervenes","paragraphs":["1321 The Core Council Intervenes","There were some higher-ups in the Great Formless Sect who were clamoring.","Otherwise, they would be destroyed along with the Great Formless Sect. It was impossible for them to obediently accept their deaths.","Looking at the various crazy actions of the Great Formless Sect, the eyelids of the various factions twitched. Was this a mutual destruction?","Facing this Great Formless Sect that was clearly already crazy, the various large factions had already clearly chosen to watch from the sidelines. It was clear that they did not want to casually participate in this kind of matter.","It was obvious that both sides were about to start fighting with their lives on the line. If they were to casually participate at this time, they would be courting death.","Although the Great Formless Sect no longer had a Core Stage master, in terms of strength, it was still a colossus in the southern part of Great Wei. How could it be so easy for others to deal with the Great Formless Sect?","Not to mention the current Marquis Zhongxin residence. Just Chu Yunfan alone was enough to make others flinch. Who would dare to participate in a collision of this level?","This was a collision between two extremely terrifying behemoths.","Soon, the time limit of three days that Chu Yunfan had given arrived. The various major powers that had been paying attention to the situation finally discovered that many of the higher-ups of the Great Formless Sect had not gone to accept their deaths as Chu Yunfan had instructed.","Clearly, they wanted to put up a stubborn resistance.","Of course, the various major powers could understand this. This was because not everyone could make a person die calmly. Right now, the entire Great Formless Sect had clearly gone completely crazy. Many of the higher-ups wanted to drag the Great Formless Sect down with them.","However, even more people could see that the Great Formless Sect did not want to drag their sect down with them, but they were certain that Chu Yunfan could not do anything to them.","In just three days, the Great Formless Sect withdrew all the disciples and members from all over the world into the Great Formless Sect. It was as if they were going to hide in a turtle shell and fight Chu Yunfan to the end.","In the hearts of many forces, this was a solution. After all, with the foundation of the Great Formless Sect, it would not be easy for Chu Yunfan to break through the sect’s defenses.","And back then, Chu Yunfan had been so high-profile that he had demanded the higher-ups of the Great Formless Sect come to receive their death. And now, what the Great Formless Sect was doing was no different from ruthlessly slapping his face.","This was a huge blow to Chu Yunfan, who was currently in hot demand.","Everyone was waiting for Chu Yunfan’s response.","However, just as everyone was waiting for Marquis Zhongxin’s residence and Chu Yunfan’s stance, another behemoth revealed its fangs.","When no one expected it, the Core Council suddenly issued a statement that they absolutely would not allow Chu Yunfan to attack the Great Formless Sect. Moreover, the council issued a statement that they would pursue the matter of Chu Yunfan killing a member of the council.","Instantly, everyone was in an uproar. Before this, no one had thought that the Core Council would interfere so rashly.","To many people, the Core Council was an unfamiliar force. However, almost immediately, everyone knew what kind of giant the council was.","The council participated in many major events in Great Wei. However, many people did not know that it was the council.","However, as long as they knew the true nature of the council, no one would be able to ignore such a colossus.","A terrifying existence that even the ordinary members were in the Core Stage.","At first, some people didn’t understand why the council would suddenly intervene. Normally, the council would mediate the conflicts between its members, but they would rarely intervene forcefully","After all, the council members had a lot of conflicts with each other. It was extremely difficult to get them to work together.","But this time, the council’s sudden intervention was out of everyone’s expectations.","Many people finally understood what the trump card of the Great Formless Sect was. They dared to go against Chu Yunfan because they had the support of the Core Council.","Obviously, the council would never allow anyone to destroy the Great Formless Sect, because the Great Formless Sect’s former leader was once a member of the council. If the power of every fallen member was uprooted, then even they would be in danger. These foxes were sad that the rabbit had died.","Soon, everyone found out from various channels that the person who wanted to protect the Great Formless Sect was none other than the deputy chairman of the council, Blood King.","Everyone was in an uproar. Under the current situation where Yun Huang, the chairman of the council, was not in charge, the deputy chairman, Blood King, was the true person in charge.","Soon, more news spread. It turned out that in order to win the support of Blood King, the Great Formless Sect was willing to give half of their annual income to him as protection fees.","Everyone who knew about this news could not help but feel their breathing quicken. The Great Formless Sect was a colossus in the southern part of Great Wei. Its annual income was simply incalculable.","Originally, as the sect master of the Great Formless Sect, Mi Siyuan could only obtain a portion of it. It was not even one-tenth, but it was enough for him to break through to the Core Stage.","But now, the Great Formless Sect was willing to give half of it to Blood King to fight for its protection.","Such a price was enough to move any expert.","Everyone finally understood why Blood King and the Core Council would go against their usual behavior and support the Great Formless Sect. They even wanted to hold Chu Yunfan accountable.","As everyone knew, Blood King was an independent cultivator. He didn’t have any powerful force supporting him.","The amount of money needed for cultivation was terrifying, especially for Cores. Unless the organization was a giant, it wouldn’t be able to cultivate Cores.","A true dragon like Chu Yunfan, who was trained in the water, was against the rules.","If they were Blood King, they would definitely not let go of this opportunity.","Almost immediately after the Core Council announced its stance, news spread from all over the world that the members of the council had already set off for the Great Formless Sect.","There were even people who swore that they had seen several Cores rushing to the vicinity of the Great Formless Sect. It was obvious that they were here to stop Chu Yunfan.","A terrifying battle was about to erupt.","On one side was the Core Council, whose members were all in the Core Stage. And on the other side was Chu Yunfan, who was in the limelight.","No matter which side it was, they were clearly not ordinary people.","“Even the Core Council has taken action. I’m afraid Chu Yunfan will have to back down.”","“Of course. No matter how strong he is, he can’t compare to the entire Core Council.”","“The Great Formless Sect has made the right move. They can finally guarantee that their legacy will not be destroyed.”"]},{"number":1322,"title":"Chapter 1322 I’ll Let Them Know What It Means to Seek Death","paragraphs":["1322 I’ll Let Them Know What It Means to Seek Death","Everyone was discussing animatedly. They felt that the Great Formless Sect had made the right move. With the protection of the council, even if Great Wei’s Imperial Court wanted to exterminate them, they would have to think twice.","Was Chu Yunfan really going to fall out with the council for this? Moreover, he stood alone.","In the eyes of most people, the Great Formless Sect had already passed the most dangerous stage.","Under the pressure of the council, even Chu Yunfan himself could not protect himself. After all, Blood King had already announced that he would pursue the matter of Chu Yunfan killing a member of the council.","In other words, Chu Yunfan was about to face the powerful investigation of the council, so how could he have the time to continue investigating the troubles of the Great Formless Sect?","Following the statement made by the council, everyone quickly turned their attention to the council and Chu Yunfan. How would Chu Yunfan react in the face of such a powerful force?","“I’m afraid Chu Yunfan can only admit defeat now.”","“He’s too aggressive, forcing the Great Formless Sect to this extent.”","“That’s right. This time, he can be said to have lost both his wife and his soldiers.”","“Now he has to think about how to deal with the council’s investigation.”","After the council intervened, all the rumors against Chu Yunfan broke out overnight.","Chu Yunfan was too strong. Although he only left one sentence after killing Mi Siyuan, that sentence alone was enough for everyone to see his strength.","In this process, it was unknown how many people’s interests were affected. However, Chu Yunfan was difficult to control previously, and no one was his opponent. No matter how dissatisfied many people were, they did not dare to say anything when facing him.","But now, with the strong intervention of the council, many people seemed to see hope of fighting against Chu Yunfan.","Moreover, in the eyes of many people, since Blood King wanted to interfere, he would definitely not let Chu Yunfan off easily. Under such circumstances, it was already good enough that Chu Yunfan could protect himself.","For a time, all kinds of rumors flew around. Many people could not even tell what the truth was.","Under such circumstances, everyone was waiting for the final result.","Early in the morning of the third day, the door of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence, which had been shut all this time, finally opened. A young man in black robes slowly walked out.","Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","At this moment, an old man who had been waiting at the side went forward and stopped him.","Chu Yunfan glanced at Elder Ku, who was walking straight ahead. He didn’t expect to meet him before he set off.","“Chu Yunfan, I heard that Blood King wants is coming to deal with you,” Elder Ku said.","Elder Ku was stunned. He had rushed over as soon as he received the news, but he was still too late.","“How did you know?”","Chu Yunfan paused and then said, “”Because he and I have already fought.”","He didn’t hide anything and told Elder Ku about his fight with Blood King.","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Elder Ku was stunned. He had never expected that Chu Yunfan and Blood King had already fought. Moreover, it seemed that Blood King’s surprise attack did not make Chu Yunfan hesitate in the slightest.","“Looks like Blood King is determined to interfere.” Elder Ku sighed. “According to the information I received, he’s currently in seclusion. However, it won’t be long before he comes out.","“I’ve brought the First Guardian’s message. If there’s a need, the Imperial Court will come forward to mediate the conflict between you and the council.”","Elder Ku recalled the Imperial Court’s decree that he had received earlier. He wanted to take advantage of the conflict between Chu Yunfan and the council to rope Chu Yunfan in.","Unexpectedly, Chu Yunfan didn’t wait for him to finish and said, “No need. Even if Blood King doesn’t come to me, I will go to him.”","Chu Yunfan sneered. Since he had completely shed all pretense of cordiality, he had nothing to worry about.","“But Blood King is someone who doesn’t even come close to Mi Siyuan. Don’t think that you can deal with Blood King just because you killed Mi Siyuan,” Elder Ku quickly said.","He was afraid that Chu Yunfan would not know the difference in strength between the two sides and would rashly find a fight with Blood King.","“Don’t worry. Since I’ve said so, I’m confident,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly. He naturally knew about Blood King’s strength, but he was still confident.","Seeing this, Elder Ku did not say anything else.","“Are you going to the Great Formless Sect?” Elder Ku asked.","“That’s right. Since the Great Formless Sect dares to ignore my words, then I’ll let them know what it means to seek death.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“But you’re alone. How are you going to take down the Great Formless Sect?” Elder Ku asked in astonishment.","Based on the information he had received, no troops had been mobilized in Great Wei during this period. It would not be easy for Chu Yunfan to take down the Great Formless Sect alone.","“I naturally have my ways,” Chu Yunfan said.","Then, he did not say anything more to Elder Ku. He stepped on a beam of light and flew in the direction of the Great Formless Sect.","Elder Ku gritted his teeth and stomped his foot. His body rose from the ground and turned into a beam of light that chased after Chu Yunfan.","Outside the Great Formless Sect, three figures with astonishing auras blocked the path into the mountain. They stood in a separate direction, but each of them had an aura that ordinary people could not imagine.","One was a woman who looked to be in her thirties or forties, but her face had a cold and vicious expression.","The other was a boy who looked to be only around ten years old. He was also small in size, but his face carried a hint of power.","The last one was an extremely simple and honest-looking middle-aged man. He looked no different from an ordinary man, but his body emitted an extremely dangerous aura.","In the distance, there were many figures floating in the air. However, their figures could not be seen clearly. There were hundreds of them. They were all experts from all over the world who wanted to witness the collision between the new Cores and the council.","Although many people thought that Chu Yunfan would not dare to fight the council head-on, many people wanted to see him lower his head.","“I think he doesn’t dare to come. After all, there are three experts here.”","“That’s right. He offended Blood King, so why isn’t he looking for reinforcements?”","“The world is so big, but there aren’t many who can fight against Blood King.”","Suddenly, just as everyone was discussing, someone exclaimed.","“Chu Yunfan’s here!”"]},{"number":1323,"title":"Chapter 1323 If You Don’t Move, You Will Die","paragraphs":["1323 If You Don’t Move, You Will Die","Just as everyone was discussing animatedly, thinking that Chu Yunfan would not appear, they suddenly saw him appear outside the Great Formless Sect on a light beam.","With Chu Yunfan’s arrival, the relaxed atmosphere from before disappeared. The entire atmosphere tensed up.","Since Chu Yunfan had already appeared, it meant that he would not compromise in front of the council. Otherwise, coming to the Great Formless Sect personally would be asking for humiliation.","The few experts who were guarding the Great Formless Sect stood vigilant. They did not know what Chu Yunfan wanted to do.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you ignore the decision of the council,” the Core with a child-like figure opened his mouth. However, his voice was incomparably old. It was obvious that he had experienced many vicissitudes of life.","“I’m not a member of the council. What does their decision have to do with me?” Chu Yunfan laughed contemptuously as he looked at the three experts blocking his way. “Besides, didn’t the council want to find trouble with me? And now you expect me to follow your bullsh*t decision? Do you think I’m stupid, or are you stupid?”","When the three of them heard Chu Yunfan’s words, their faces turned red with anger.","“How dare you!” the middle-aged woman with an enchanting figure shouted, “How dare you disobey the deputy chairman’s decision!”","On the other side, the honest-looking man also revealed a shocking murderous aura.","The three of them formed an array in front of Chu Yunfan, the Three Talents Array.","This was a basic array, but it could unleash the strength of the three people to the extreme at the same time.","The three of them were emitting an astonishing baleful aura, but at the same time, they understood that the fellow in front of them was not an ordinary person.","He had killed two great Cores consecutively.","Chu Yunfan glanced at them and said, “I’ll give you one last chance. Get lost now. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being rude.”","“How arrogant. You want to kill the three of us? That depends on whether you have the ability!’ the middle-aged man shouted. He was completely enraged by Chu Yunfan. Although he looked like a middle-aged farmer, he was actually a top expert. He was the ruler of a region, but he was looked down upon by Chu Yunfan.","“If you don’t dodge, you’ll die!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","He had no intention of showing mercy to these people in front of him. These people naturally wouldn’t come to stand up for the Great Formless Sect because they were filled with righteous indignation. They were clearly accepting gifts from the Great Formless Sect.","Now, they had to pretend to be righteous. It was simply disgusting.","“Attack!”","At this moment, the child-like Core shouted and took the lead to attack.","His tiny body pounced on Chu Yunfan as if he was going to crush the entire world. The surrounding divine power boiled and shook violently, becoming one with the world.","Immediately, a dense killing intent emerged.","But in the face of such an attack, Chu Yunfan did not panic. A terrifying aura boiled around him, and a sea of lightning appeared under his feet.","In the next moment, he appeared in front of the boy.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s punch shattered the sky. The punch contained the power of lightning and tore everything apart. The attack of the child Core was torn apart.","Thud, thud, thud!","The child Core retreated, a hint of horror flashing through his eyes.","This Chu Yunfan was even more powerful than the rumors said.","With just this punch, it broke through all of his attacks and shattered them. In fact, its momentum did not decrease as it directly chased after him.","At this time, the enchanting woman stepped forward. The flag in her hand rolled out a yellow-colored divine power that filled the sky and turned into a thick wall, blocking Chu Yunfan’s fist force.","Boom!","A terrifying explosion sounded like the sound of metal clashing. The entire sky trembled.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan could see that the flag was dark yellow in color, and it was shining with the light of the earth of the five elements.","He immediately knew why this middle-aged woman could block him.","Among the five elements of heaven and earth, metal was the main attacker and could destroy all things in the world. No one could stop it. Earth was the main defender and could block all attacks in the world. Naturally, it was extraordinary.","Even for a Core, the power of the five elements was still a very high-end power, especially if one could refine the power of the five elements into a magic weapon, which was extremely amazing.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan understood why these three people dared to stop him despite knowing that he was notorious and had even killed Mi Siyuan.","So they had such backing!","In Chu Yunfan’s opinion, although the strength of these three people was extraordinary, they were only ordinary intermediate Void Cores. They were far inferior to Mi Siyuan.","“You want to stop me?” Chu Yunfan sneered. The moment he reacted, he immediately rushed forward and threw a punch.","The enchanting woman waved the dark yellow flag in her hand. Suddenly, earth element energy filled the sky and blocked Chu Yunfan’s path.","But this time, Chu Yunfan didn’t hold back. His punch tore apart the earth energy and smashed directly toward the woman.","The woman turned pale with fright. She never thought that her most prized defensive spirit weapon would be so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan. She hurriedly wrapped herself with the dark yellow flag.","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan’s punch landed on her body.","Boom!","The woman let out a muffled groan and flew backward like a kite with a broken string. She spat out a mouthful of blood.","“He’s strong!”","The middle-aged woman’s eyes flashed with fear. If it weren’t for the dark yellow flag, she would have been killed by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Chu Yunfan took advantage of his victory and chased after her.","At this moment, the child Core and the honest-looking man launched their attacks at the same time.","The two of them, one with a fist and one with a saber, attacked Chu Yunfan from the left and right.","They tried to stop Chu Yunfan from moving forward."]},{"number":1324,"title":"Chapter 1324 One Attack, One Person","paragraphs":["1324 One Attack, One Person","Their attacks surged, and their killing moves converged into a torrent that attacked Chu Yunfan head-on.","“Trying to stop me?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","His big hand grabbed at the air and pulled out a ball of lightning power. This ball of lightning power turned into a long blade and exploded in the air, slashing down at the two people.","Boom!","The entire sky seemed to have been torn apart. Wherever the blade passed, the sky collapsed and turned into an unstoppable torrent that welcomed the two people’s attacks.","Boom!","The attacks collided, and Chu Yunfan’s long blade split their attacks almost instantly. Even if the two of them joined forces, they were still too weak when facing him.","Even Mi Siyuan, who was at the peak of the intermediate Void Core Stage, could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan, let alone ordinary intermediate Void Cores like them.","Just as Chu Yunfan’s saber light was about to hit the two of them, another dark yellow light swept over and swept toward the two of them, protecting them and blocking the terrifying saber light.","It was the woman who turned around and pounced back onto the battlefield.","At this moment, countless experts who were watching the battle from afar were dumbfounded. They could see that these three people had clearly joined forces more than once or twice.","The woman was in charge of defense, while the other two were in charge of offense. The three of them had a tacit understanding.","Such a lineup could even gain the upper hand against the original Great Formless Sect Master, Mi Siyuan. Unfortunately, they met Chu Yunfan.","“So strong. Is this Chu Yunfan’s true strength?”","“The three of them joined forces, and he still has the upper hand.”","“How terrifying. Even if it’s just the aftershock of the attack, it’s enough to kill us!”","While many people were discussing animatedly, in the depths of the Great Formless Sect, a group of higher-ups of the Great Formless Sect could not help but heave a sigh of relief. Although the three of them were still suppressed by Chu Yunfan, they were not defeated.","It was indeed worth it for them to pay such a huge price to hire these three people.","However, when they looked at the figure that was like a demon god between heaven and earth, they felt a lingering fear.","If it wasn’t for the fact that the three of them were top-notch experts, an ordinary person would probably be easily torn apart by the other party.","No wonder the other party had no intention of letting them off. If they had that kind of strength, they would definitely not let it go so easily.","At this moment, a higher-up of the Great Formless Sect spoke. However, before he could react, he saw that in the sky, Chu Yunfan’s aura erupted to another level when facing the three experts.","Everyone was shocked and even dumbfounded. Chu Yunfan’s previous strength was not his limit.","In a battle of this level, he actually still dared to hold back.","“How can he be so strong? He’s so powerful even when he’s fighting three people!”","“I’m afraid that only a handful of people in the council can defeat him. Only Blood King can suppress him.”","“This is too terrifying. How did he train to such a level? He’s only in his twenties!”","Just as everyone was in shock, the countless lightning powers in Chu Yunfan’s hand were condensing and rotating, turning into a terrifying blade light.","“Break!”","Chu Yunfan’s blade swept out, shattering half the sky. In an instant, it was already slashing down on the three experts.","The middle-aged woman cried out, and all the divine power in her body was poured into the dark yellow flag, completely enveloping the three of them.","Just the power of this saber strike alone made them feel that they were completely vulnerable.","Only now did they truly understand why Mi Siyuan, who was so famous and much stronger than them, had been defeated.","This Chu Yunfan was too terrifying!","If they were given another chance, they would definitely not choose to step into this pool of muddy water. They would be risking their lives for those benefits.","However, now, they had no choice but to fight.","Bam!","The saber light slashed at the dark yellow flag, and a terrifying wave of air swept out. The energy tide, with the collision of the two sides as the core, rolled back in all directions.","The entire sky shook violently. Everyone saw the air collapse at an astonishing speed at the center of the collision.","Spurt!","The woman spat out a mouthful of blood. Her face instantly turned pale. It was obvious that she had suffered a great loss in the collision with Chu Yunfan.","“Agh!” the woman finally couldn’t withstand it anymore. She let out a miserable cry and hurriedly retreated.","In front of them, the dark yellow flag was cut into two halves. This supreme defensive spirit tool that could withstand the full-force bombardment of spirit weapons was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s saber.","Before everyone could exclaim in shock, a saber light tore through the sky and arrived in front of the woman.","Slash!","The woman didn’t have time to dodge. Or rather, she was locked on by Chu Yunfan’s aura and couldn’t resist at all. She was directly cut in half by the saber.","She died instantly!","Chu Yunfan immediately stowed away the woman’s corpse. He turned it into a rain of blood that filled the sky and poured it on the Brahma Tree.","All of this took a long time to describe, but in fact, it happened within minutes. Seeing their companion die tragically and their defenses gone, the other two began to panic.","However, they were ruthless characters. They were definitely not willing to wait for death so easily.","The two of them looked at each other and gritted their teeth. Instead of retreating, they advanced and counterattacked Chu Yunfan.","This was a strategy of attacking instead of defending. To them, pure defense was tantamount to courting death. It was impossible for them to compete with Chu Yunfan. The death of their companion had made them understand that their previous ideas were not feasible.","Only by attacking instead of defending, there was still a glimmer of hope.","Their attacks were like a flood that hit Chu Yunfan.","However, before they could rejoice, they realized that their companion had fallen into Chu Yunfan’s hands like a clay ox entering the sea. There was no ripple at all.","Compared to the enchanting woman from before, Chu Yunfan’s defense was truly absolute."]},{"number":1325,"title":"Chapter 1325 Killing a Core, Nuclear Explosion of the Great Formless Sect!","paragraphs":["1325 Killing a Core, Nuclear Explosion of the Great Formless Sect!","“Sh*t!”","The two of them finally realized that Chu Yunfan was invulnerable. It was different from what they had thought before. Whether it was offense or defense, they had no chance of winning against Chu Yunfan.","The two of them were scared out of their wits by Chu Yunfan.","Their attacks were unable to break through Chu Yunfan’s defense, and they could not pose a threat to him. They had previously thought that they could stop Chu Yunfan and obtain the benefits of the Great Formless Sect’s offerings.","Only now did they realize that they were simply too naive. They were jokes.","But at this moment, there was no time!","In their eyes, Chu Yunfan had transformed into a golden-winged roc and launched an attack like a golden light.","It was the Garuda Punch!","Quick!","Quick!","Quick!","The golden light tore through the sky and hit the child-like Core.","Bam!","The child-like Core didn’t have time to dodge or react before he was blown up by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","All the defenses on his body could not block Chu Yunfan’s punch!","It was too fast!","It was only after Chu Yunfan had smashed the child-like Core into pieces with a single punch and crushed his corpse into pieces before pouring it into the Brahma Tree that everyone finally reacted.","One slash, one kill!","One punch for one!","“That was too fast. I didn’t even have time to react!”","Among the onlookers in the distance, there were hidden Cores waiting for an opportunity to strike. However, they found that they could not see Chu Yunfan’s punch. They only saw a golden light flash, and then the child-like Core, whose strength was far more terrifying than them, was smashed by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Most of them were still shocked by Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength. He was like a demon king who could kill a Core with ease.","In the eyes of many people, Cores were like gods in the sky, but they were slaughtered in front of Chu Yunfan.","They had no strength to fight back at all!","At this moment, the remaining middle-aged man among the three revealed an inexplicable look of shock. How could he not understand that this person in front of him was simply a monster?!","“Monster!” the middle-aged man shouted and turned to run. How could he dare to stay?","He originally had the intention to retreat, but not long after he thought of it, his two companions had already died, which frightened him to the core.","Swoosh!","In the next moment, the middle-aged man had already run more than 1,000 meters away. He used all his strength to burn his blood essence to escape from Chu Yunfan’s pursuit.","However, how could he escape Chu Yunfan’s pursuit? A pair of lightning bolts rose from Chu Yunfan’s back and caught up with the middle-aged man.","The middle-aged man’s speed was already fast, especially after burning his blood essence. He was even faster to a certain extent, but when facing Chu Yunfan, he still had no chance of winning.","He was directly caught up to!","The middle-aged man felt a gust of wind behind him. He turned around and saw Chu Yunfan holding a long blade made of lightning power and slashing down.","“Impossible!”","He had never thought that he would still be unable to escape Chu Yunfan’s pursuit even though he had tried so hard.","Slash!","As the saber light fell, the middle-aged man was cut into two halves and died on the spot.","When Chu Yunfan put away the middle-aged man’s body, it had only been a short time since Chu Yunfan had fought with the three of them. In the time it took to catch his breath, the three experts had all died.","Such killing efficiency was too shocking.","Everyone was stunned. Looking at the scene in front of them, they were completely dumbfounded. Their eyes widened and they were dumbfounded.","“That’s too fast!”","“They were not a match at all. Chu Yunfan has no intention of compromising in front of the council.”","“That’s right, Chu Yunfan is planning to go head-on with the council!”","“But even so, it’s impossible for him to take down the Great Formless Sect. There are countless barriers in the Great Formless Sect, and many of them were set up by Cores. If Chu Yunfan relies on his own strength, it’ll probably take him a month or two to take them down.”","While many people were shocked by Chu Yunfan’s terrifying lethality, they were still not optimistic that Chu Yunfan would be able to take down the Great Formless Sect. To them, that was a miracle that was impossible to achieve.","Even if Chu Yunfan killed three experts in a row, their judgment would not change.","After killing the three people, Chu Yunfan flew further away from the Great Formless Sect under everyone’s burning gazes. Everyone was curious about what he was doing.","Could it be that he planned to set up a teleportation array to summon thousands of troops?","This was what everyone was thinking. That was Chu Yunfan’s only way to take down the Great Formless Sect.","Even though they had yet to receive any news regarding the mobilization of troops.","As for the Great Formless Sect, they were also shocked by Chu Yunfan’s strange actions.","Chu Yunfan did not rush into the Great Formless Sect directly, so the inescapable net they had prepared for Chu Yunfan was useless, let alone be able to scheme against him.","“What is he trying to do?”","This thought appeared in everyone’s mind in the Great Formless Sect.","“No matter what he wants to do, as long as we guard the barrier and the array formation, he won’t be able to rush in. There’s nothing to be afraid of!”","“That’s right. As long as we hold our ground and don’t let mess up, so what if he’s a Core?”","“As long as we hold on until Blood King comes out of seclusion, it will be Chu Yunfan’s death!”","The experts of the Great Formless Sect encouraged each other.","Then, Chu Yunfan waved his hand and took out a very strange prop. It was like a beehive that had been enlarged countless times.","The beehive was densely covered with long tubes as thick as a person.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","A shrill sound of air being torn apart rang out. Immediately after, the hundreds of long pipes dragged a long tail of flames and swept toward the Great Formless Sect like a storm.","“Danger incoming!”","The moment the hundreds of long tubes were activated, all the experts above the Divine Abilities Stage instinctively sensed danger. A threat of death enveloped their hearts.","No one knew where this inexplicable sense of danger came from. However, these people trusted their sixth sense very much and instinctively began to escape. However, no matter how they fled, they felt that this threat of death would not disappear.","Boom! Boom! Boom!","Hundreds of huge mushroom clouds slowly rose up."]},{"number":1326,"title":"Chapter 1326 Destroying the Great Formless Sect","paragraphs":["1326 Destroying the Great Formless Sect","In the distance, countless people watched this scene with pale faces. Their faces were dumbfounded, and there was no expression on their faces.","The destructive scene in the distance had scared them silly.","They had never seen such a scene before.","Even though they were floating in the sky, they could still feel the terrifying explosion. The air was trembling violently.","In the distance, above the Great Formless Sect, it felt as if hundreds of suns had risen at the same time. Even though they were all experts above the Divine Abilities Stage with remarkable abilities, they were instantly blinded.","The endless shockwaves of the explosion tore everything apart and flattened everything. In their eyes, the entire ground collapsed.","The mountains that had originally covered the Great Formless Sect were blasted to the ground in this terrifying explosion. The mountain peak was flattened and turned into crystals.","The terrifying shockwaves of the explosion swept out in circles, destroying everything as if it was the end of the world!","“What method is this...?”","After a long time, someone finally spoke, trembling with fear.","Everyone was stunned. Even when Chu Yunfan killed three experts in one go, they were not so shocked. He had killed three experts in one go, but in essence, he had not surpassed their understanding.","However, the terrifying scene of the collective explosion of hundreds of nuclear bombs made their minds go blank. It was like a terrifying existence that could destroy the world. The terrifying tide that tore through everything and the dazzling light that covered everything.","All of this had completely overturned their understanding.","As far as they knew, there was no such thing. That was why they were dumbfounded.","A terrifying destructive force that could destroy a behemoth overnight!","“Now I understand what Chu Yunfan’s trump card is.”","“No wonder he could ignore the statement of the council. Even if the Great Formless Sect wanted to hide, in the face of this level of destructive power, they would not be able to withstand a single blow!”","“What kind of magic treasure is this? It has such great power!”","Many people were dumbfounded. They were still thinking about the scene of destruction. No one knew what kind of magic treasure Chu Yunfan had and how it could have such terrifying power.","Compared to the magic weapons Chu Yunfan had taken out, the strategic magic weapons of Great Wei were nothing.","Hundreds of nuclear bombs could cover a battlefield and kill millions of enemies.","Facing such an overwhelming bombardment, even a Core Stage expert would not be able to escape, especially at such a close distance. It was almost impossible to escape unless they were far enough away.","Who could resist it?","“No, that’s not a magic treasure. I didn’t feel any fluctuations of divine power just now. It’s purely a weapon.”","A Core immediately reacted and said.","However, after saying that, he felt that it was even more impossible. What kind of weapon could have such terrifying power?","At the very least, there was no such thing in Great Wei. It was the crystallization of wisdom from a completely different path.","It was not something they could understand.","It was the same logic as how primitive people could not understand nuclear explosions. It was not that their level of civilization was too low, but that they were walking on a different path of civilization, which was completely different from the science on Earth.","No matter what, when everyone looked at Chu Yunfan, who was standing still in the distance of the Great Formless Sect, they did not dare to look at him as they did before.","How many trump cards did such a person have? Unless he revealed it, how many people would know?","At this moment, they looked at the Great Formless Sect where the mushroom cloud of nuclear explosion was gradually dissipating. The entire Great Formless Sect had been flattened.","Unlike the Federation, which had many barriers and arrays that were specifically designed to counter nuclear attacks, which were usually not destroyed in one strike, the Spirit Realm had never had such an attack before. Therefore, their barriers and arrays would not be specially designed to counter nuclear bombs and other weapons of mass destruction.","The Great Formless Sect became the first sect in the Spirit Realm to taste the power of a nuclear bomb.","Hundreds of nuclear bombs covered the area, and the Great Formless Sect, which occupied a vast area like a small city, completely disappeared.","The mountain peak was flattened, and the ground was completely crystallized. It looked strangely beautiful.","As for those who were inside, they were completely annihilated. The terrifying temperature of the nuclear bomb explosion completely vaporized them.","“Is this the scene of hell?” Some people couldn’t help but fantasize. Perhaps the legendary hell was just like this.","Desolation, a deathly stillness that annihilated all life.","Chu Yunfan looked at the scene in front of him with an indifferent expression. Such a level of nuclear power might be shocking enough for the experts of Great Wei, but it was nothing to him.","In the Federation, all parties used nuclear bombs as a conventional method. They would use nuclear bombs to open up a path and cover it up at any time.","It was to reduce losses.","This was not a very brilliant technique. In fact, it was nothing more than simple and crude. Relying on the shocking power of the nuclear bomb, he swept away the enemy.","Before Chu Yunfan left the Kunlun Realm, he had brought some miniaturized nuclear bombs with him in the Mountain River Diagram. Those truly strategic nuclear bombs were all huge and inconvenient to carry. Moreover, the launching method was too complicated. It required the cooperation of an entire system and could not be carried out by one person.","This was the difference between science and martial arts. Martial arts emphasized individual strength. One person could often destroy the world and be omnipotent, but science emphasized collective strength.","Without the collective, the power of science would be weakened to an unimaginable extent.","It was just like how Chu Yunfan knew the principle of nuclear bombs. According to the education he received in university, he could make a nuclear bomb. However, starting from the basics of making a nuclear bomb, it was a huge and complicated system.","Chu Yunfan still had to develop this foundation from scratch, and the entire process would take an unknown amount of time.","Basically, it was impossible to replicate it with one’s own strength.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan only used a few of these nuclear bombs. Unless it was necessary, he was not willing to use them casually.","Moreover, when facing true top-tier experts, the effect would not be as strong. If they were too far away, these experts would easily escape. If they were too close, the power of the nuclear explosion would easily backfire on him.","Only in a specific situation, such as this environment, could the true power of a nuclear bomb be unleashed.","But no matter what, he was very satisfied with the results of this battle."]},{"number":1327,"title":"Chapter 1327 A Person Not to Be Trifled With","paragraphs":["1327 A Person Not to Be Trifled With","Hundreds of nuclear bombs had been successfully launched to wipe out the Great Formless Sect. This effect was naturally unquestionable.","It shocked everyone.","Although there had always talked about wiping out cities and destroying countries, razing them to the ground. But they were merely exaggerated adjectives. However, Chu Yunfan’s hundreds of nuclear bombs had really razed a place to the ground.","It was the most direct word.","The Great Formless Sect’s encampment had turned into ruins. It was likely that not even a blade of grass would grow for a long time.","And the result of this battle spread like wildfire throughout Great Wei at lightning speed.","The result of this battle completely shocked countless people. Even those who had the most optimistic opinion of Chu Yunfan had never thought that this battle would end in such a manner.","Chu Yunfan had actually kept his word and razed the Great Formless Sect to the ground. In this process, even the fact that he had killed three experts in a row in one breath did not seem strange compared to this matter.","Before this, everyone had thought that even if Chu Yunfan would take revenge, it would be a small but long-term one. He would slowly take revenge on the Great Formless Sect until he finally uprooted the Great Formless Sect.","In fact, when many people found out that Chu Yunfan had gone to the Great Formless Sect, they felt that he was too impatient. If he rushed over like this, other than asking for humiliation, what other benefits could he get?","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be so cruel?","He really did it without any hesitation.","“How is that possible? How did he do it? He razed the Great Formless Sect to the ground with his own strength? I don’t believe it!”","“Is this something that can be done by humans? What kind of magic weapon was that weapon of his?”","“This is Chu Yunfan’s trump card. It’s too shocking. He must have a powerful sect supporting him. Otherwise, where would he get such a trump card?”","Many people’s first reaction was disbelief. In fact, quite a number of people personally rushed to the periphery of the Great Formless Sect and saw the tragic situation there.","In that battle, no one in the Great Formless Sect managed to escape. The barriers and array formations that were originally used to protect the Great Formless Sect had become iron locks that locked them down, making it impossible for them to escape even if they wanted to.","In other words, even if most people were not locked by the array and barrier, they would not be able to escape because their reaction speed was not that fast.","After this battle, the once awe-inspiring Great Formless Sect was finally completely destroyed.","Under such circumstances, the earth-shattering scene became the focus of countless people’s research. Everyone wanted to know what kind of method Chu Yunfan used to create such an amazing effect.","It was simply shocking.","In particular, many of the factions that originally did not think highly of Chu Yunfan and were even hostile to him could not help but break out in cold sweats. Fortunately, this was the Great Formless Sect. If Chu Yunfan had done the same to them, it would have been a true calamity.","The ones who were truly shocked were the members of the Core Council. Many of them were eager to get involved in this matter and gain some benefits from it. But now, they were drenched in cold sweat. If it were them, there would probably be no other outcome.","What shocked many more was that Chu Yunfan had the strength of a large-scale sect. In the eyes of many people, he was no different from a super large sect.","Chu Yunfan could do something that even super-large sects couldn’t do. He was no different from the deterrence Great Wei’s Imperial Court posed.","Many people suppressed their eagerness. At least, before they figured out where Chu Yunfan’s nuclear bomb came from, or before they figured out how to deal with this destructive weapon, many people gave up on the idea of finding trouble with him.","The conflict between Chu Yunfan and the Yuwen clan had resurfaced. Before this, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan had no chance of winning and might even have to lower his head and avoid it.","Only now did they know that Chu Yunfan had such a powerful background and such terrifying means.","This made many people’s hearts sway.","In everyone’s eyes, Chu Yunfan, who wielded such a great killing weapon, was invincible. At the very least, he would not be defeated easily.","After this battle, Marquis Zhongxin’s residence, which originally had the potential to dominate the south of Great Wei, was now expanding at an even more astonishing speed.","Many forces that originally wanted to join joined the residence quickly joined.","Of course, the one who was really working hard was Chu Yaowei. The benefits that came from all over the world were endless. Even with the size of the residence, he was afraid of being stuffed to death.","In just a few short days, the low-grade spirit stones sent by various parties as gifts had already exceeded 50 million.","Of course, Chu Yaowei didn’t dare to keep these for himself. He sent them all to Chu Yunfan. He knew very well that Chu Yunfan was the foundation of the residence’s strength. If it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan, they would be like a child holding gold bricks in the downtown area, waiting to be robbed.","He was in both pain and joy. Even the first generation of the residence did not dare to imagine such a good situation appearing in front of them. As long as they crossed it, the residence would be able to achieve a leap in development.","Outside, the rumors about Chu Yunfan were getting more and more intense.","In the Spirit Realm, no one had ever seen a nuclear bomb before. They were shocked by its power, but it did not mean that they were fools. On the contrary, they quickly found the various weaknesses of the nuclear bomb.","Obviously, the most powerful part of a nuclear bomb was its terrifying power that could completely destroy a Core. In an instant, a city would turn into nothingness.","However, this was also its greatest weakness. It was precisely because its power was too great that it could not be used easily. Otherwise, if it was not careful, the person who used the nuclear bomb would suffer a backlash.","If the distance was too far, the Core would have enough time to escape the range of the nuclear bomb.","After deducing this, the panic of the various major forces in Great Wei toward the nuclear bomb was slightly reduced.","They could guess that Chu Yunfan would not use such a weapon easily. Otherwise, he would have used it long ago.","But even so, in everyone’s eyes, Chu Yunfan’s forehead was stuck with a note that said he could not be provoked. He had become a person that could not be provoked!"]},{"number":1328,"title":"Chapter 1328 Ninth Tier of the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["1328 Ninth Tier of the Divine Abilities Stage","Chu Yunfan’s strength was unimaginably powerful, not to mention the fact that he had such a powerful killing weapon in his hands. In many people’s eyes, if he wanted to die together with his enemy, he would have the ability to do so.","However, in the eyes of many people, he was not that stupid, and there was no need for that.","After this battle, the Marquis Zhongxin residence naturally became the one with the greatest gains. It could be said that they had won a complete victory, establishing the unparalleled position of residence in one fell swoop.","But on the other side, the one who was slapped in the face was undoubtedly Blood King.","Chu Yunfan’s current fame was earned through slapping Blood King.","Everyone saw that Blood King was so confident that he didn’t even put Chu Yunfan in his eyes. He had sentenced Chu Yunfan and wanted to pursue Chu Yunfan. At that time, he was so heroic. However, who knew that he would be slapped by Chu Yunfan when he changed his hand?","Blood King did not stay idle. An ambassador from the council announced Blood King’s decree to the world.","Chu Yunfan had killed three members of the council. This showed that he was looking down on the council. When Blood King came out of seclusion, he would come and kill Chu Yunfan personally.","Instantly, the world was in an uproar. No one had expected that even after Chu Yunfan had revealed his trump card, Blood King would still be so domineering and would not give in.","If it was said that Chu Yunfan had lowered his head before, then this statement was filled with killing intent. He must kill Chu Yunfan.","Suddenly, the entire southern part of Great Wei was engulfed in a strange atmosphere. Even the experts of Great Wei began to pay attention to the situation.","After Chu Yunfan killed Mi Siyuan, in the eyes of many people, he had replaced Mi Siyuan as one of the five new experts of Great Wei.","Now, the fourth-ranked Blood King and the fifth-ranked Chu Yunfan were about to have a life-and-death battle. This was undoubtedly a major event that would affect the entire Great Wei.","From the influence of both sides, Blood King was alone and did not have much power behind him. Although Chu Yunfan had the support of Marquis Zhongxin, the strength of the residence was not enough to participate in a collision of this level. It was equivalent to being a lone cultivator.","The strength of both sides was enough to make everyone look askance.","Not to mention the mysterious weapon that Chu Yunfan had used to destroy the Great Formless Sect in one fell swoop. In many people’s eyes, it had the ability to destroy the world. In many people’s eyes, once the two sides truly erupted into a battle, it would definitely be a battle that would shake the heavens and earth.","Facing Blood King’s strong statement, Chu Yunfan seemed to be completely speechless and did not make any response.","Many people were waiting anxiously.","The recent events were coming wave after wave. Many people even felt that it was too much for their eyes to take in.","Judging from Chu Yunfan’s performance, he probably wouldn’t give up easily, let alone compromise. There would definitely be a battle between the two sides, but no one knew where this battle would take place.","And this battle would even affect whether the council would become stronger or be weakened by Chu Yunfan. It would indirectly affect the balance of Great Wei.","While everyone was looking forward to it, Chu Yunfan unexpectedly entered a state of seclusion in his small courtyard.","The entire courtyard was heavily guarded by the Chu clan, and not even a fly could fly in. However, Chu Yunfan didn’t care about this at all, because he hid in the Mountain River Diagram. This was his real seclusion place.","In the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan floated above the herb mountain. And at this moment, onthe mountain, that incomparably gigantic Brahma Tree blotted out the sky and sun, growing larger and larger.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand, and countless spirit stones in the distance instantly shattered, turning into streams of spirit energy torrents that poured into the tree like the Yangtze River and Yellow River.","His expression was solemn. He was trying to ripen the Brahma Fruit on the Brahma Tree at all costs.","After Chu Yunfan destroying the Great Formless Sect, although had not gained anything good because of the destructive power of the nuclear bomb, the various factions were scared out of their wits. 50 million low grade spirit stones had been delivered to the residence in just a few days.","All of a sudden, Chu Yunfan’s pocket became full again. It had been three days. In these three days, he had burned tens of millions of low-grade spirit stones and poured them all into the Brahma Tree.","Most of it was absorbed by the tree itself, but there was still a portion that was used to ripen the Brahma Fruit. In just three days, the Brahma Fruit was maturing at a speed visible to the naked eye.","A strange fragrance filled the entire space.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan finally stopped watering the tens of millions of low-grade spirit stones. In front of him, the Brahma Fruit had finally matured.","From this ripe fruit, a strange fragrance ten times stronger than before assaulted his nose.","Chu Yunfan took a deep breath and immediately felt all the pores on his body open up. His cultivation had improved a little.","“Great. This is it!”","Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. The Brahma Fruit had finally matured. Once he swallowed the fruit, his cultivation would improve. At that time, his strength would also undergo a world-shaking change.","He knew that Blood King was also racing against time to cultivate in seclusion, trying to come out as soon as possible.","However, Blood King was just a regular cultivation. It was too long for a Core. However, Chu Yunfan was different. With the Brahma Tree in his hand, it was almost like he had activated a cheat code.","In terms of cultivation speed, Blood King was definitely no match for him.","“You want to kill me? At that time, let’s see who will kill who!” Chu Yunfan sneered and then sat down cross-legged again. In front of him, he plucked the Brahma Fruit and swallowed it.","Boom!","The powerful medicinal strength of the Brahma Fruit was instantly released. It melted as soon as it entered his mouth, turning into a terrifying torrent that spread into Chu Yunfan’s limbs and bones.","Chu Yunfan did not dare to stay any longer. He hurriedly circulated the Emperor Method and began to desperately refine the medicinal strength of the Brahma Fruit.","Almost immediately, Chu Yunfan felt the powerful medicinal strength of the fruit. His cultivation grew crazily at a speed visible to the naked eye, and he charged straight towards the ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","Chu Yunfan, who was already at the peak of the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, didn’t encounter any obstacles and rushed into the ninth tier."]},{"number":1329,"title":"Chapter 1329 Another Wave","paragraphs":["1329 Another Wave","The terrifying medicinal strength of the Brahma Fruit easily pushed Chu Yunfan’s cultivation to the ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","All of this was like pushing a boat with the current. There was no difficulty at all.","Even though Chu Yunfan had not advanced to the eighth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage for a long time, his foundation was extremely solid. Even without the Brahma Fruit, if he wanted to break through, he would be able to do it in a few months.","It took ten to twenty years to reach the Core Stage, or even decades. In that aspect, Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed was as fast as a rocket.","However, the Brahma Fruit provided an opportunity. The powerful medicinal strength was slowly being converted into Chu Yunfan’s power, and it was continuously pouring into his body.","Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in the air. Every breath he took formed two torrents at the tip of his nose. These two torrents were like two long air dragons, coiling around his body.","After reaching the ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage, Chu Yunfan’s strength rose like a rocket. The moment he broke through, his strength broke through to more than double his original strength in a short period.","And it was still rising at an astonishing speed.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was already very shocking, not to mention that it had more than doubled in one go. It had really reached a terrifying level.","The mana around his body boiled and spread out in all directions like an ocean. The entire space of the Mountain River Diagram trembled slightly. Chu Yunfan’s divine power spread throughout the space.","Inside Chu Yunfan’s body, the medicinal power of the Brahma Fruit slowly boiled in Chu Yunfan’s meridians. It was like a round ball that kept spinning at high speed. With every revolution, a portion of the energy in the energy ball in his meridian was sucked away and absorbed.","Cultivation knew no time. In the blink of an eye, ten days had passed.","During these ten days, Chu Yunfan shut himself in and did not ask about the world. However, in the outside world, a huge commotion had stirred up because of him. A full ten days was enough for everyone to know that Chu Yunfan had flattened the Great Formless Sect.","Even if one knew nothing about this before, after being bombarded by everyone in the past ten days, they came to know about it.","This was especially true for the various major factions in the southern part of Great Wei. They felt this the most strongly.","The Great Formless Sect, which was once as high and mighty as the previous emperor and held an important position in the entire southern part of Great Wei, with unimaginable influence, had been destroyed just like that.","Moreover, the degree of extermination had reached a level that many people found inconceivable. Not a single person had managed to escape.","It could be said that other than some people who were outside for various reasons, everyone in the entire Great Formless Sect, from the higher-ups to the ordinary people, was wiped out.","As for the remaining people, they were as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns. Moreover, they were all outer sect disciples with very distant relationships.","Therefore, the existence of the Great Formless Sect as a sect power could be considered to have completely disappeared.","However, after the Great Formless Sect disappeared, the power of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence was immediately replenished. However, the power of the residence was far inferior to the power that the Great Formless Sect had developed over the years. Although it had grown rapidly during this period, it had only taken over the territories that originally belonged to the Great Formless Sect.","The strength and foundation of the entire Chu clan could not be improved in just a few days. It would take years to grow. Under such circumstances, Blood King, who was about to come out of seclusion, became the focus of many people’s attention.","Without a doubt, once Blood King came out of seclusion, he would definitely kill until blood flowed like a river. In fact, this battle was much more terrifying than before.","Blood King’s strength was not something that Mi Siyuan could compare to at all.","Among the five great experts, the weakest was Mi Siyuan. It should be said that he was able to become one of the five great experts largely because of the support of the Great Formless Sect.","Because the previous sect master of the Great Formless Sect was one of the five great experts of Great Wei. Meanwhile, Mi Siyuan had only taken over the position of the sect master of the hundred-million-strong Great Formless Sect.","Chu Yunfan could defeat and even kill Mi Siyuan, who was relatively weak in terms of experience and strength, but in the eyes of many people, he was definitely not a match for Blood King.","Once Blood King came out of seclusion, it would be a disaster for Chu Yunfan.","Blood King’s second declaration was filled with killing intent, wanting to take Chu Yunfan’s life. Chu Yunfan’s attitude had clearly angered Blood.","At this moment, many people began to watch. In fact, many of them had already sided with Blood King without any hesitation.","Chu Yunfan was equally powerful and had amazing talent. His future was limitless. In many people’s dictionary, he was a person who could not be offended. However, with Blood King’s order for him to be killed, Chu Yunfan’s fate was sealed.","It was unknown whether he could live until then.","For a time, discussions about whether Chu Yunfan could survive Blood King’s pursuit flew all over the place. Even those who didn’t know or cared about this before knew that it wouldn’t be long before two top-tier experts had an earth-shattering battle.","At this moment, a plan was being set up against Chu Yunfan.","When no one expected this, almost everyone thought that everyone was waiting for Blood King to make a move to test Chu Yunfan’s strength. However, overnight, the various factions received a piece of news.","A group of about a dozen warriors from Jinzhanghan had entered the border.","Immediately, this news made the various factions feel as if they were facing a great enemy.","Ordinary people did not know much about Jinzhanghan. In this ancient feudal society, it was already good enough for ordinary people to know where their city was. They had no knowledge of Jinzhanghan thousands of miles away.","However, these high-level elites of Great Wei knew that Jinzhanghan was a huge entity.","To Great Wei, it was a terrifying shadow. It was a terrifying existence that suppressed them until they could not breathe.","This group of more than a dozen warriors had entered the country. Each of them had an aura like the sea, and they were extremely terrifying. If it was any other time, the scale of this lineup would be enough to shake the entire Great Wei."]},{"number":1330,"title":"Chapter 1330 The Attack of Jinzhanghan’s Warriors","paragraphs":["1330 The Attack of Jinzhanghan’s Warriors","Such a lineup should have shaken the entire Great Wei.","However, the truth was that this group of people had smoothly passed through the border. Great Wei’s officials had tacitly agreed to this and did not send any experts to stop them.","To many people, this was abnormal. The relationship between Great Wei and Jinzhanghan was one of life and death. Jinzhanghan was ready to go south at any time, and they were eyeing Great Wei covetously.","For Great Wei, any enemy could be reconciled with except Jinzhanghan.","Everyone knew that if there was even the slightest possibility, the tens of millions of horsemen from Jinzhanghan could act out at any time.","If such a day really came, it would be a disaster for Great Wei.","Regardless of the reason why the experts of Jinzhanghan had entered Great Wei, they would be swiftly attacked. This was because the Jinzhanghan warriors most likely had their motives for entering Great Wei.","This was something that had never changed, and it had always been the case since ancient times.","However, Great Wei’s officials had a strange taciturn attitude toward these experts. The imperial guardians didn’t make a move either as if they were waiting for the arrival of these people.","Soon, a piece of news spread among the various factions of Great Wei.","The group of experts were indeed experts of Jinzhanghan, but they were subordinates of the Right King of Jinzhanghan, and their target was none other than Chu Yunfan.","Along with this news came the grudge between Chu Yunfan and the Right King","The news that the Right King had tried to teleport to Conglong, but was defeated by Chu Yunfan and even severely injured spread quickly among the higher-ups of all the major forces in Great Wei.","The crowd finally understood why Jinzhanghan’s warriors had come for Chu Yunfan.","After all, no matter how one looked at it, the two parties should not have any interactions.","The Right King did not make a move this time. Everyone knew that it was impossible. The Imperial Court of Great Wei would never allow him to enter the territory of Great Wei.","Any one of those experts had the terrifying power to massacre a city.","If the Right King entered Great Wei, it would definitely be the day he brought tens of millions of cavalrymen. Moreover, he would probably not come personally. Once Great Wei made up its mind to deal with him, he would probably be finished.","No matter how strong he was, it was impossible for him to compete with the power of Great Wei.","However, the Right King hated Chu Yunfan to the core, so sending experts to kill Chu Yunfan was the only and best way.","Soon, the identities of this group of people were figured out by the various forces of Great Wei.","The leader was dressed in a long silk robe. However, his attire was completely different from that of Great Wei’s people. There was a heavenly third eye on his forehead, and his aura was like that of a mountain.","“That’s right, I remember now. It’s indeed him. I didn’t expect the Right King to hate Chu Yunfan so much that he actually sent out his generals.”","“Atela once killed three Cores of Great Wei. A few decades ago, he was a terrifying existence who made all the children of our Great Wei stop crying.”","Some of the higher-ups of the major forces had already started discussing in small groups.","Other than Atela, the identities of the others were also found out one after another. There was no doubt that they were all powerful Cores under the Right King.","Many people could not help but be shocked by the Right King’s generosity. This kind of lineup even dared to sneak into the capital to assassinate the emperor of Great Wei.","And this lineup was just to kill Chu Yunfan.","One could imagine how much the Right King hated Chu Yunfan.","Thinking of Atela’s identity and strength, he was probably not inferior to Blood King. If such a person came to kill Chu Yunfan personally, then it would be useless even if Chu Yunfan had ten lives.","“Chu Yunfan really knows how to cause trouble. He actually offended these two experts in succession. Let’s see how he continues to stand.”","“I heard that the Imperial Court wants to recruit him, but unfortunately, he rejected it. Otherwise, he wouldn’t be alone and helpless.”","“That’s right. He has thoroughly offended the Core Council too. If Great Wei’s Imperial Court is included, then there’s no place for him in the world.”","Many people were paying attention to this matter, but at the same time, they also understood that Chu Yunfan was in big trouble. For those who didn’t like him, this was undoubtedly a great opportunity.","Many people chased after Atela and the others as if they wanted to see Chu Yunfan’s head being cut off. Whether it was Atela or Blood King, both of them were famous and were much stronger than Chu Yunfan.","If the two of them attacked, even if Chu Yunfan had ten lives, he would die.","At this moment, outside a mountain range, a group of more than a dozen people were shuttling through the mountain range at an astonishing speed. The group was extremely fast, like bolts of lightning, crossing the mountain range at lightning speed.","These people were none other than Atela and his men from Jinzhanghan.","“Lord Atela, why don’t we fly?” a man with a strong build behind Atela said with a respectful expression on his face.","Although he was a Core, he didn’t show the slightest bit of pride when facing Atela. He was only humble and respectful.","Atela was terrifying. He was the true number one general under the Right King. In terms of strength, he could be ranked in the top 20 in Jinzhanghan.","Although they were both in the Core Stage, the difference in status between them was too great.","The others also looked at Atela like wolves.","Atela looked into the distance and paused for a moment before speaking slowly, “It’s very simple. I want to catch Chu Yunfan off guard.”","His gaze seemed to be able to pierce through the sky and see through everything."]},{"number":1331,"title":"Chapter 1331 The Reason to Kill Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["1331 The Reason to Kill Chu Yunfan","“In that case, we should be flying faster,” the expert said doubtfully.","If he wanted to catch the other party off guard, shouldn’t he reach Conglong as soon as possible?","Although they ran as fast as cheetahs and could traverse the forest as if it was flat ground, it was still not as fast as flying.","“Because it’s more covert this way. If we fly, we’ll be exposed to the Wei people. No matter where we go, we’ll be monitored by them,” Atela said as he flew. In just a short while, he had crossed the entire mountain range.","“This time, we were able to enter Great Wei because of the order of the Right King to retrieve Chu Yunfan’s head, but there are also people in Great Wei who want to use us to get rid of Chu Yunfan.”","Atela slowly revealed a shocking secret. Someone in Great Wei had colluded with him and tried to get him to enter the country to kill Chu Yunfan. Once this news was leaked, the entire Great Wei would be in an uproar.","“But don’t forget, that man wanted Chu Yunfan dead, but at the same time, he was also a Wei person. The Wei people and Jinzhanghan are old enemies. Jinzhanghan’s tens of millions of cavalry are sharpening their weapons and could attack at any time,” Atela continued.","At the mention of the millions of horsemen of Jinzhanghan, these experts all looked proud.","“Because of this, once we kill Chu Yunfan, we will have no use for him anymore. This is the most dangerous thing for us. We don’t know when Great Wei will turn against us. At any time, there may be experts who join in the encirclement. Even if we are surrounded by the elite army, we’ll still have to drink.”","Everyone immediately understood. They weren’t stupid and immediately understood what Atela meant. They had cooperated with Great Wei, but who knew when this cooperation would end?","Not to mention that there were many Wei people who did not know about this and would not make way for them. Once they gathered together, they were not afraid of a small number, but if there were a large number, they might die here.","After all, this was not the grassland of Jinzhanghan, but the hinterland of Great Wei. Although they could burn, kill, plunder, and commit all kinds of evil before they died, those they killed were ants. They were not willing to die for ants.","“The Wei people have always been cunning. I reckon that they have already formed an encirclement against us. It’s like a big net surrounding us.” Atela looked into the distance as if he could see through the layers of encirclement and the ferocious faces behind them.","“Because of this, we have to kill Chu Yunfan before that huge net traps us. After that, we have to escape immediately. We can’t stay for long. Don’t forget that our mission is not to cause trouble in Great Wei, but to get Chu Yunfan’s head,” Atela said with a vicious expression.","The killing intent emitted from his body made the dozen people behind him shudder. They all knew how terrifying Atela was. Slaughtering a tribe was as easy as playing. Killing people was like stepping on an ant.","However, there were also some people who revealed a somewhat regretful expression and said, “It’s a pity that we can’t occupy this beautiful land of Wei.”","“What’s there to be sad about? It’s only a matter of time. When we’re ready, it won’t be long before we attack and turn the beautiful lands of Wei into our pastures. We’ll kill all the men of Wei and train the children of Wei into our slaves. The women of Wei will then become the reproductive tools of Jinzhanghan and produce powerful warriors for us.”","Atela’s face revealed a ferocious expression as if he could see the scene of thousands of cavalry marching south.","In fact, Jinzhanghan had been like this ever since it was born. They killed all the men in the enemy country, turned the children into slaves, and turned the women into their reproductive tools, making Jinzhanghan stronger and stronger.","Everyone felt their blood boil when they heard this. Now that they were in the hinterland of Great Wei, they had to restrain the bestial nature in their hearts and could not kill.","“However, after I came here, I heard that the Blood King of Great Wei also wants to kill Chu Yunfan. Why don’t we wait until he makes his move?” a tall and strong warrior asked, “Isn’t it better to let the Wei people fight each other? Why do we have to do it ourselves?”","“The Right King didn’t ask us to kill Chu Yunfan but to bring his head back. Do you dare to disobey His Highness’ orders?” Atela said.","In fact, if it wasn’t too dangerous, the Right King would have come personally.","He hated Chu Yunfan for hurting him.","Seeing everyone’s eyes, Atela smiled contemptuously and said, “Do you think that the reason why the Right King wanted to kill Chu Yunfan was because Chu Yunfan had once injured him?”","Everyone looked at Atela strangely. Wasn’t that the case?","No matter how one looked at it, it seemed that the Right King had been completely angered by Chu Yunfan, and had actually sent so many of his Cores to hunt Chu Yunfan down.","“That was just to confuse the Wei people. How could you believe it? His Highness is so talented and bold. How could he send us to Wei to take risks because of such a matter?” Atela sneered.","When everyone heard Atela’s words, they suddenly understood. No wonder they felt that something was wrong. Judging from the Right King’s behavior, this was something that was very unexpected. However, the Right King was very powerful in Jinzhanghan, so they did not dare to disobey him.","“The real reason is that Chu Yunfan is too talented. I don’t know how Great Wei produced such a person. From the information we received, he’s only in his twenties, but he has already cultivated to such a level. If he is given some more time, he will be a direct threat to Jinzhanghan in the future.” Atela revealed the true purpose of this trip. “Blood King is nothing. One Chu Yunfan is more of a threat to Jinzhanghan than ten Blood Kings. The Right King will only be at ease if he is dead.”"]},{"number":1332,"title":"Chapter 1332 The Person Behind the Scenes","paragraphs":["1332 The Person Behind the Scenes","The experts of Jinzhanghan finally understood why the usually talented Right King would send them to Great Wei just to kill a junior in his twenties","However, after hearing what Atela said, they immediately understood what the Right King was thinking. If it was just one person, Chu Yunfan’s strength was not enough to move them. But if they looked at his age, they would feel a chill down their spines.","Judging from Chu Yunfan’s current strength, if he was given another few decades, he might even reach an unimaginable level in the future.","If Chu Yunfan was in his fifties or sixties, they would be afraid of him, but they would not want to kill him so badly.","“So no matter what, we must kill this Chu Yunfan. Fortunately, the Wei people have always been good at internal strife. They have such a genius in their country, but they have never thought of protecting him well,” Atela said with a cold smile as if he was mocking the people of Wei who liked to fight among themselves.","However, it was thanks to these Wei people that they had the opportunity to take advantage of the situation.","At the same time, in a magnificent palace, a middle-aged man in a luxurious robe was waiting for news. In front of him, a light screen flashed from a comms talisman. On the light screen, an old man’s figure appeared.","“Where are they?” the middle-aged man asked.","“We’ve lost Atela. He’s very cunning. It’s obvious that he has realized this. We can’t find them,” the old man said gloomily.","“What? You lost him?” The middle-aged man revealed a sinister smile. “Everyone, hurry to Conglong immediately. No matter how cunning Atela is or where he hides, his final goal must be Conglong. As long as we guard Conglong, they won’t be able to escape.”","The middle-aged man sneered. This was a plan to kill two birds with one stone. He could use Atela to kill Chu Yunfan, and at the same time, he could kill Atela and severely injure the high-end combat forces of Jinzhanghan.","If all the Jinzhanghan warriors died in Great Wei, they would be able to intimidate Jinzhanghan.","“Not bad!” The old man immediately reacted.","“I want to see the heads of Chu Yunfan and Atela!” The middle-aged man sneered. “Chu Yunfan, if you want to blame someone, blame yourself. Who asked you to ruin my plan? If I don’t kill you, it will be difficult to appease the hatred in my heart!”","The more the middle-aged man thought about it, the harder it was to erase the killing intent in his eyes.","The chess pieces he had painstakingly set up in the south of Great Wei were about to be harvested, but they were destroyed by Chu Yunfan in one fell swoop.","The arrival of Jinzhanghan’s Cores undoubtedly attracted the attention of the entire Great Wei. But soon, news came that Jinzhanghan’s Cores had disappeared from everyone’s sight.","This caused many people to be shocked.","However, there were even more people who hurried in the direction of Conglong because they knew that no matter where these people disappeared, they would definitely end up in Conglong as their target, Chu Yunfan, was there.","At this moment, in Conglong, Chu Yaowei was pacing back and forth in the residence. He was extremely anxious because he had just received the news.","When he received the news, he felt terrible. Chu Yunfan had attracted the warriors of Jinzhanghan, and they were terrifying existences with fierce reputations in Jinzhanghan.","And there was also Atela.","In Jinzhanghan, Atela was definitely one of the top 20 experts. Every move of an expert of this level could attract the attention of countless people. All kinds of information about Atela had long been piled up into a mountain.","When he thought about how such a terrifying existence was currently rushing to Conglong at high speed, his hair instantly stood on end.","Beside him was Fu Wentai.","However, Fu Wentai’s expression wasn’t very good.","What kind of concept was it to have more than a dozen Cores? With the current defense of Conglong, if the other party was determined to kill them, it would probably be able to raze the entire Conglong to the ground in a short time.","“I didn’t expect the Right King would linger around and even sent Atela. What should we do?” Chu Yaowei said. He had always been very calm, but now he felt a little lost.","From the information they had received, no one knew where these people had gone. In other words, they might appear outside Conglong in the next second.","“The best way is to leave as soon as possible. If the other party comes, their first target will be Conglong. If we continue to stay here, we will definitely encounter them,” Fu Wentai quickly suggested.","Against a master like Atela, he might not even be able to block a single move and would be crushed to death. If the other party wanted to kill him, it would be as easy as killing an ant.","“If we ask the Imperial Court to take action now, will it be too late?” Chu Yaowei asked.","“If the Imperial Court was willing to act, how could Atela be so arrogant? There must be someone in the Imperial Court who wants to use him as a pawn,” Fu Wentai said.","It was not convenient for ordinary people to say it, but he didn’t have any scruples because his relationship with Marquis Zhongxin’s residence was extraordinary.","Fu Wentai’s words immediately made Chu Yaowei tremble. This matter had revealed something unusual from the beginning. Atela and the others actually dared to swagger into Great Wei. Even if they were discovered, they had no intention of retreating.","Clearly, they had a tacit understanding with some people. They did not even need to stop Great Wei’s elders from taking action. As long as they delayed for a short period of time, it would be enough to make them die without a burial ground.","“But who has the ability to stop those elders from attacking? Isn’t he afraid of incurring the wrath of the entire Great Wei?” Chu Yaowei said furiously.","At this moment, he was incomparably furious and could not restrain his anger, but he also felt a chill run down his spine.","“What’s there to be afraid of? As long as Atela dies here, wouldn’t it be fine? Who would remember our affairs? Everyone would be cheering for him!” Fu Wentai sneered."]},{"number":1333,"title":"Chapter 1333 I Won’t Surrender!","paragraphs":["1333 I Won’t Surrender!","Fu Wentai’s words made Chu Yaowei understand his plan. As long as Atela died here, everyone would forget about the Chu clan. No one would remember that the Chu clan was destroyed.","Everyone would only see the glorious results of the battle. Chu Yunfan was dead, and the Chu clan was just a thing of the past. Who would remember them?","It was not difficult to deduce that everyone was not a fool. On the contrary, everyone was a smart person. However, this was not a conspiracy in itself, but an open one. As long as Atela and the others wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, they would have to take the risk and face the encirclement of Great Wei in the end.","Everything was lost on the surface. There was no conspiracy. The final victory or defeat still depended on each other’s strength.","Among these three parties, the weakest was the Chu clan. If Chu Yunfan wasn’t there, they could easily crush the Chu clan.","They didn’t have the chance to show off. All their hopes were pinned on Chu Yunfan.","“But who would have such a huge grudge against our Chu clan?” Chu Yaowei asked with a little doubt.","“Marquis, have you forgotten who Mi Siyuan supported?” Fu Wentai said slowly.","Suddenly, Chu Yaowei thought of something, and his thoughts became clear. He immediately understood where the problem lay.","In Great Wei, there were dozens of princes. However, in these decades, other than those who died prematurely and those who were eliminated, there were only a few left.","Among them, the current second prince of Great Wei was Mi Siyuan’s supporter.","This matter was not a secret. One of the second prince’s consorts was from the Yuwen clan, and thus, Mi Siyuan naturally began to support the second prince.","Once Mi Siyuan died, it would have the greatest impact on the second prince. However, the second prince had an extremely wide influence on the Imperial Court over the years. Who knew how many forces were under his command?","It was impossible for an ordinary person to interfere with the affairs of the imperial family’s servants. However, it was possible for the second prince to intervene personally.","As long as he could delay for a while, let Atela kill Chu Yunfan, he would then kill Atela after that. Then, the entire Great Wei would be speechless.","Killing more than ten Cores of Jinzhanghan was a great merit.","Thinking of this, Chu Yaowei suddenly understood everything. He couldn’t help but break out in cold sweat. It was really a plan to kill three birds with one stone. Killing Chu Yunfan would be revenge, and killing the general of Jinzhanghan would increase his prestige to a higher level, completely overshadowing the current eldest son of the emperor.","“What a good plan to kill three birds with one stone!” Chu Yaowei said through gritted teeth.","He immediately understood why Atela had suddenly disappeared. It was obvious that Atela must have seen through this trap.","In fact, this trap wasn’t complicated. Even Fu Wentai could see it. As long as he knew the key points, it wasn’t difficult to figure it out. However, no matter what kind of strategy it was, it still depended on whether he had the strength to do it.","“Now that Conglong has become a place of trouble, we can only escape if we leave immediately,” Fu Wentai hastily suggested.","“It’s useless.” Chu Yaowei sneered. After he understood everything, he immediately understood everything. “Right now, I’m afraid that the entire residence is filled with spies. If we leave, believe it or not, our location will be immediately announced.”","Chu Yaowei shook his head and said, “Besides, if the second prince can borrow Jinzhanghan’s knife to kill us, it’s obvious how much he hates us. In Conglong, they don’t dare to be presumptuous and can’t do anything to us. However, once we leave, no one will know which valley we die in.”","He knew all too well how these influential figures did things. In these cities, they would restrain themselves and be wary of the influence of Great Wei. However, if they were in the wilderness, they would not have the slightest scruple.","“So we have no choice.” Fu Wentai immediately understood Chu Yaowei’s meaning and felt like a storm was brewing.","The key to solving this situation was none other than Chu Yunfan.","“However, the second prince is too impatient. If he had waited until Master Chu and Blood King fought, wouldn’t it be better?” Fu Wentai asked with a puzzled expression after some thought.","“Isn’t it obvious? The second prince wants to rope in Blood King. Right now, among the five great experts, Blood King is the one who doesn’t have a clear target to support,” Chu Yaowei immediately said.","If someone were to look from the second prince’s point of view, they could easily know what he was thinking. In the end, it was all about benefits.","If the second prince could plot to kill Chu Yunfan, it would not be difficult for him to rope in Blood King who hated Chu Yunfan.","In the battle for the throne of Great Wei, the support of these top experts was absolutely indispensable. Otherwise, even if he sat on the throne of Great Wei, he would not be able to sit firmly.","Just as everyone was guessing the whereabouts of Atela and the others, some people who were close to them had already arrived at Conglong.","However, none of them dared to approach Conglong because the ordinary people in Conglong didn’t know about it. However, the higher-ups knew that Conglong had become a volcano.","It could erupt at any moment.","All the nobles in the city were fleeing frantically. They had fled far away, fearing that they would be implicated in a great battle at the level of the Core Stage.","If they were affected, they would die.","When more masters arrived, Atela and the others, who had been hiding in the dark, suddenly made their move. The people outside the city suddenly saw a huge barrier around the city. It covered dozens of miles around the city.","Obviously, this barrier did not exist in Conglong.","Everyone looked at each other. They all realized that Atela had come.","This was a standard method to prevent the enemy from sending reinforcements through a teleportation array.","Meanwhile, the ordinary people in Conglong were discussing strange stories about the nobles fleeing for their lives. They had yet to realize what kind of danger they were in.","A terrifying aura descended from the sky and swept across the entire city.","All the living beings in Conglong knelt down as if they were welcoming a god."]},{"number":1334,"title":"Chapter 1334 Sword Headshot","paragraphs":["1334 Sword Headshot","A terrifying aura swept across the whole of Conglong. Many martial artists in the city could not withstand the pressure of this aura and knelt.","At this moment, they suddenly remembered that countless nobles had fled outside like ants moving their houses. Previously, they did not understand why, but now they finally understood.","Experts were attacking.","Moreover, this expert was probably someone who killed people like flies. Just the terrifying aura alone made them feel as if they had fallen into hell.","Following the sweeping of this pressure, more than a dozen people appeared in Conglong.","“Chu Yunfan, come out and die!” Atela shouted, shaking the entire Conglong.","Around him, the Core Jinzhanghan warriors were attacking Conglong frenziedly. The city was protected by layers of barriers and formations, and they wanted to break through these barriers and formations.","A half-step Core was enough to break these barriers and formations, not to mention these Cores. A casual attack from them could penetrate more than ten layers of barriers. They could not stop them. In just a moment, the barriers used to defend the city collapsed.","The entire city was shaking in the face of these Cores who were like nuclear bombs. The aftershock of their attacks shook the entire city slightly.","Everyone’s mind was blank as if they could not believe that they had actually provoked such powerful experts.","More than ten Cores! Any one of them had the terrifying strength to slaughter the entire city!","Previously, Ancestor Wusheng was about to pierce through the city with his own strength. Not to mention the dozen or so people now. They were simply no match for them.","Atela’s shout made them understand why these experts were obviously from Jinzhanghan. He was here for Chu Yunfan.","Some of the quick-witted people thought of how Chu Yunfan had defeated the Right King.","The formation of a dozen Cores was considered a great deal even in Jinzhanghan. Besides the Right King, who else had reason to hate Chu Yunfan to the bone?","Many people wanted to move, but they were unable to. It was as if their bodies were being suppressed by a huge mountain. Their hands trembled, and they could not withstand it.","Boom!","With the bombardment of these Cores, the barriers above Conglong collapsed with a loud bang and turned into nothing.","“Hahahaha, kill them all!”","Bloodthirsty light flashed through the eyes of the Jinzhanghan warriors. Usually, once a city like this was breached, a large-scale massacre would be carried out. However, just as they were about to wipe out the entire city, they were stopped by Atela.","“Have you forgotten? What we lack the most is time. Kill Chu Yunfan first and then escape.”","After all, Atela was the most cunning general of Jinzhanghan. He was cunning by nature. Although he was not afraid of death, he did not want to die in Great Wei for no reason, especially if he became someone else’s pawn and helped others kill.","Now, he was sure that as the news of his appearance spread, the experts of Great Wei were already on their way. He couldn’t afford to waste any time. If he stayed any longer, he might die here.","The Jinzhanghan warriors calmed down at Atela’s words and stopped their slaughter. Although it was a pity, they still knew what was more important.","At this moment, everyone in the residence knelt on the ground like lambs waiting to be slaughtered. Among them, only Fu Wentai was slightly better because his cultivation had already entered the half-step Core Stage. However, in the face of such a terrifying power, he could not even protect himself. His entire body was emitting the sound of metal rubbing against each other.","It was the sound of his bones being suppressed and constantly rubbing against each other.","He was gritting his teeth and persevering.","This seemed to be a great benefit to him, but at the same time, he realized that this was also an excellent opportunity. He lacked a chance to enter the Core Stage. To him, this was like a poppy flower. The opportunity to enter the Core Stage was incomparably beautiful, but it was also incomparably dangerous.","“If anyone dares to stand, I’ll kill you.” One of the Jinzhanghan warriors sneered. He took a step forward and slapped Fu Wentai, who was still standing.","A ferocious expression appeared on the warrior’s face. The half-step Core Stage was no different from an overlord to others, but to him, it was just an ant.","“Sh*t! I’m going to die!” Fu Wentai cried out as despair flashed through his eyes.","Suddenly, just as the palm was about to hit Fu Wentai and kill him, a sword light appeared out of thin air and swept over from the depths of the residence.","Slash!","The sound of the sword light tearing flesh was heard. The light pierced through the Jinzhanghan expert’s head, causing it to explode.","His body fell to the ground. Even a Core would die if his head was blown off.","This sudden change shocked everyone.","This was especially true for the Jinzhanghan warriors. Although the person who was attacked was only at the fledgling Void Core Stage, he was still an expert who had stepped into the Void Core Stage.","He had actually been head shotted by a sword!","He didn’t even have time to react!","Although he was ambushed, this sword was truly terrifying!","They instinctively began to calculate the situation. If it were them, even if they were prepared, they would not be able to resist.","That sword was too fast—as fast as a bolt of thunder!","No, it should be said that it was just a bolt of thunder turning into a sword light!","“Who did that?!” these people immediately reacted and shouted one after another, revealing ferocious, furious expressions on their faces.","None of them had expected that one of them would die at the beginning of the game.","Atela looked into the depths of the residence with a solemn expression. He knew that the only person with such strength here was their target, Chu Yunfan.","Sure enough, a figure slowly walked out. It was a young man in a black robe. Compared to the old Atela, he was young—too young."]},{"number":1335,"title":"Chapter 1335 Casually Slaughtered","paragraphs":["1335 Casually Slaughtered","In fact, compared to all the Cores present, Chu Yunfan was incomparably young.","Many people thought of the grandchildren in their family. Chu Yunfan could not even be considered their grandchildren. If they really counted their ages, he might be their great-grandson.","Their great-grandchildren might have just learned how to be a warrior on the battlefield. All the cultivation of Jinzhanghan had to be carried out on the battlefield.","But now, Chu Yunfan, this young fellow, was already on par with them. He was a terrifying existence that required so many experts to join forces to kill him.","They were all humans, but in comparison, they were too far apart.","Then, they recovered from the shock of Chu Yunfan’s age and remembered the person who had been killed by Chu Yunfan with a single sword strike.","Instantly, a series of gasps could be heard.","With a headshot, he killed one of them. They would never be able to do this. They didn’t even dare to think about it.","Although Chu Yunfan was a man who did this, they wouldn’t be able to do it. His strength was even more terrifying than they had imagined.","At this moment, they seemed to understand why Right King had mobilized such a large lineup just to kill Chu Yunfan.","“Jinzhanghan? The Right King must have sent you,” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","“That’s right, you must be Chu Yunfan. Today, we have been ordered by Right King to take your life,” Atela said slowly.","“So it really was him,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, “He worked so hard. He sent you all from afar just to send you to your deaths.”","As expected, Chu Yunfan’s words immediately infuriated the Jinzhanghan warriors. They all shouted at Chu Yunfan angrily.","“What an arrogant brat!”","“Arrogant!”","“Watch me chop off your head!”","Just as one of them shouted that he was going to behead Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan’s body suddenly swayed slightly. A ball of thunder burst out from under his feet and instantly appeared in front of him.","“Watch out!”","Atela was the first to react, but he saw that on Chu Yunfan’s palm, electric currents were gathering crazily, instantly forming a terrifying electromagnetic cannon.","Boom!","The terrifying electromagnetic pulse cannon shot across the sky and swept toward the Core Jinzhanghan warrior.","The Jinzhanghan warrior was instantly pierced through. He didn’t even have time to react. Chu Yunfan was too fast.","He was heavily injured by a single shot. Chu Yunfan had destroyed his entire chest, and his entire body was broken into two.","That Jinzhanghan warrior had never expected that he would die at Chu Yunfan’s hands without being able to fight back.","His face was filled with disbelief. His eyes were wide open as he stared at Chu Yunfan.","“You want to kill me?” Chu Yunfan sneered and looked at the Jinzhanghan warrior. The smile on his face was like a demon from hell.","He had killed them as he said. He didn’t treat these Cores as Cores. They were just like weeds on the roadside. He had killed them as he said.","Instantly, all the Jinzhanghan warriors tensed up as if they were facing a great enemy. They all got into formation to face Chu Yunfan.","Two people had been killed consecutively. Even if they were arrogant and looked down on Chu Yunfan, they didn’t dare to relax anymore.","It was an understatement.","From the beginning to the end, Chu Yunfan’s killing was completely understated. They should be fighting for three days and three nights and killing each other after a bloody battle. But this did not apply to Chu Yunfan at all.","In front of Chu Yunfan, these things did not exist.","Seeing Chu Yunfan kill two Cores in a row, the Conglong experts cheered. For them, there was no doubt that Chu Yunfan’s performance was powerful. For them, the hope of them being saved was much greater.","The scene of the arrival of more than ten Cores was terrifying. It was as if they had easily disintegrated the defenses of Conglong, making them feel despair.","As for the Divines who were watching the battle with their divine will from afar, their pupils narrowed.","It was too terrifying!","“Chu Yunfan is much more powerful than the rumors say.”","“It’s not just stronger than the rumors say. I was there when he fought Mi Siyuan. I dare say that he was definitely not so terrifying at that time.”","“Someone wanted to kill Chu Yunfan with the help of the barbarians, but now it seemed that their idea might not be feasible. With Chu Yunfan’s strength, if he made up his mind to escape, no one would be able to stop him.”","“That’s right. If he wants to escape, the others might not be able to stop him. I’m afraid Jinzhanghan has made a mistake today.”","The crowd discussed animatedly, but they did not dare to go up and help. In a battle between Cores, even the aftermath of the battle was enough to wipe them out.","Above Conglong, the Jinzhanghan warriors surrounded Chu Yunfan from all directions. It was as if they were afraid that he would run away.","“Are you afraid that I will run away?” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly.","“That’s right. We’ve already set up an inescapable net today,” Atela said as he looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","“Don’t worry, I don’t plan to escape today, but I can’t do anything here.”","As Chu Yunfan spoke, a beam of light appeared under his feet and he disappeared into the horizon.","The dozen or so people were shocked. They had not expected Chu Yunfan to be so fast that he could escape from their encirclement. After exchanging glances, they immediately gritted their teeth and chased after him.","Chu Yunfan rushed all the way to Eternal Lake. Behind him, more than a dozen figures with unimaginable terrifying power chased after him.","In almost an instant, both sides had already rushed to the lakeside.","“Got to hell, Chu Yunfan!”","As soon as they arrived above the lake, a Jinzhanghan warrior had already arrived before Chu Yunfan. The figure of this Jinzhanghan expert swelled to the size of a small mountain and smashed down with astonishing momentum.","“Die,” Chu Yunfan said casually. One of his hands was wrapped in endless electric current. Like an electric drill, he punched through the mountain-like Jinzhanghan warrior.","Stab!","Chu Yunfan instantly pierced through the Jinzhanghan warrior, unable to fight back."]},{"number":1336,"title":"Chapter 1336 Don’t Even Think About Running","paragraphs":["1336 Don’t Even Think About Running","It was too fast. Chu Yunfan’s killing was like a bolt of thunder.","It should be said that he had turned into a bolt of thunder, and his entire body was surrounded by shocking electric currents.","Atela’s expression changed. He knew that Chu Yunfan was not easy to kill, but he had not expected Chu Yunfan to be this difficult to kill.","They had only just started, and three people had died.","This was completely different from what he had planned. In his plan, even if Chu Yunfan was extremely vicious, he would only be able to kill one or two of them. After all, whether it was their strength or numbers, they completely surpassed Chu Yunfan.","No matter how vicious Chu Yunfan was, so what?","Who knew that Chu Yunfan was even more vicious than he had imagined? His killing efficiency was terrifying.","What was even more terrifying was that Chu Yunfan’s ability to control the power of thunder had clearly surpassed the information they had received before.","Such a person was definitely a troublesome opponent.","At the thought of this, killing intent boiled in Atela’s eyes, turning into a murderous aura that filled the sky, aiming straight for Chu Yunfan.","Such a person must not live.","Chu Yunfan finally made his move. To him, he had no scruples when he attacked after leaving Conglong.","The barriers of Conglong had been destroyed. If they were to fight in Conglong, the entire city would be destroyed and there would be heavy casualties. That was not a situation he wanted to see.","But here, he could use his full strength.","Boom!","A terrifying aura was released from Chu Yunfan’s body, far surpassing that of before. When he was in Conglong, he did not dare to attack casually and could only choose to attack with less powerful moves.","But now, he had no scruples.","“Sh*t!”","Atela suddenly felt a terrifying pressure pressing down on him. His expression changed. Chu Yunfan had been hiding his strength.","Previously, Chu Yunfan had only displayed the strength of an intermediate Void Core. Although he was already at the peak of the intermediate Void Core Stage, it was about the same as what the intelligence had said.","But Atela didn’t care. This was because he was already at the late Void Core Stage. The difference in strength was like the difference between heaven and earth.","Therefore, even though Chu Yunfan had shown his might and killed the masters of Jinzhanghan, he was furious and his killing intent surged, but he was not afraid at all.","Chu Yunfan had concealed his strength and made him think that he could easily kill him. It was a scheme from the beginning, and they were lured away.","If they were to fight in Conglong, Chu Yunfan would be restrained, but they would have no scruples.","This would greatly limit Chu Yunfan’s performance.","The battle had actually started early in the morning. Chu Yunfan had led them to their own pace from the very beginning.","Not only Atela, but the others also immediately realized this. Although they looked like boorish fools, who could cultivate to this extent was truly a fool? On the contrary, they were all smarter than the other.","Almost immediately, they realized that they had been deceived by Chu Yunfan.","“I’m going to massacre the city!”","One Jinzhanghan warrior was instantly enraged, and a beam of light appeared beneath his feet as he prepared to flee in the direction of Conglong.","He was completely enraged by Chu Yunfan. He had always thought of himself as an old fox, but in the end, he was played by a young man like Chu Yunfan.","“No, you don’t.”","Chu Yunfan’s cold voice was heard. Endless thunder was released from his body, turning his body into a sea of thunder. In the endless thunder, he was like a god of thunder.","Previously, he had only displayed the powerful strength of his Imperial Physique. Now, he had truly unleashed his other physique—the Thunderclap Physique.","The Thunderclap Physique was a special physique that shocked the world during the Ancient Zenith Civilization. With the power of thunder in hand, one was the thunder emperor above the nine heavens. No one could compare to it.","Swish!","Suddenly, the power of thunder flew out and turned into a giant hand of thunder, grabbing the Jinzhanghan warrior.","The Jinzhanghan warrior tried to break free, but he couldn’t. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s thunderbolt easily shattered his protective energy shield and branded his body.","“Aaaaah!” the Jinzhanghan warrior screamed in pain, and a burnt smell spread throughout the entire province.","His skin had been charred by the power of thunder. In just a moment, it turned pitch-black.","“Hmph.” Chu Yunfan let out a cold snort.","He killed this powerful Core using thunder. He turned into a bloody mist that filled the sky and was taken into the Mountain River Diagram to water the Brahma Tree.","Such a brutal combat technique had completely frightened everyone. The experts watching the battle from afar widened their eyes in disbelief. In Chu Yunfan’s hands, Void Cores were no different from weeds that could be casually uprooted by the roadside.","“Is this Chu Yunfan’s true strength?”","“Why do I have a feeling that this is surreal? It looks like it’s hard to say who will kill who in the future and who will be the hunter.”","“How powerful... He’s like a thunder god!”","Many people were dumbfounded. It was not that there were no experts who cultivated thunder techniques, but compared to Chu Yunfan, it was simply a joke.","Normally, they would only be able to sweep out a bolt of thunder as thick as a water tank with all their might. Even then, the power was already very terrifying.","The power of thunder surrounding Chu Yunfan was like thunder dragons, each of which far exceeded the limit of what they could release. Compared to Chu Yunfan’s thunder dragon, they couldn’t even be considered small snakes.","They were simply not on the same level.","Chu Yunfan was too powerful. His understanding of thunder techniques had reached a shocking level.","What they didn’t know was that Chu Yunfan had the constitution of the Thunderclap Physique. He could learn the cultivation related to thunder laws after just seeing it once. His cultivation progressed by leaps and bounds, far exceeding the imagination of others.","“You came here today and you want to leave?” Chu Yunfan sneered, “You guys forced me out of seclusion. It’s a good time to test the results of my cultivation during this period.","“Your Right King dared to send people to kill me. Sooner or later, I will kill him.”"]},{"number":1337,"title":"Chapter 1337 Clearing the Area","paragraphs":["1337 Clearing the Area","When Jinzhanghan warriors heard Chu Yunfan’s words, their expressions changed. Chu Yunfan was not only arrogant, but he also looked down on Jinzhanghan.","In Great Wei, even the most confident expert would feel nervous when they encountered Jinzhanghan.","But Chu Yunfan was completely different. He was different from any other Wei expert. He had no fear of Jinzhanghan.","He no feelings for Jinzhanghan.","Even though the Great Wei experts hated Jinzhanghan to the core and hated the Right King to the core, they still respected him.","Unlike Chu Yunfan, who had no respect for the Right King, he didn’t have the respect that came from the bones of the people of Wei.","They could all tell that the Right King was not a demonic existence to Chu Yunfan. He was just a person who was more powerful than him now. Sooner or later, he would come to seek revenge.","Chu Yunfan had killed three people in a row, which made the expressions of these people become extremely solemn. Everyone arranged themselves into a military formation and surrounded Chu Yunfan.","Everyone’s aura was connected, forming a whole. Unknowingly, their strength had increased greatly. They understood that if Chu Yunfan seized the opportunity to attack, they would not be able to hold on for long.","The efficiency of killing one person in one move was too shocking.","“Chu Yunfan, don’t be too arrogant. Do you think you can escape today?” Atela looked at Chu Yunfan coldly and released his aura.","The late Void Core Stage.","He suppressed everyone.","Such strength, even from far away, was enough to make the Great Wei experts tremble in fear.","Atela’s strength had clearly surpassed Mi Siyuan’s, one of the five great masters of the empire, and it was far beyond that. He was a true top-notch expert, one of the top experts in the entire Jinzhanghan.","Now that he had completely unleashed his strength, it was truly terrifying.","The others were not bad either. The weakest among them were existences who had entered the Void Core Stage for a long time. There were even a few intermediate Void Cores among them.","Such a lineup was even enough to sneak into the Imperial Capital and kill the emperor of Great Wei.","However, such a lineup was used to deal with Chu Yunfan. One could imagine how shocked everyone was.","“Attack!” Atela roared. In an instant, he made his move. His body was like a mountain as he flew toward Chu Yunfan.","A long saber appeared in his hand. This saber was like an antique that had been around for a long time. It was rusted and had an ancient aura.","However, there was an incomparably terrifying baleful aura. As soon as it danced, the entire world was swallowed by the overwhelming baleful aura.","Suddenly, the entire world turned into endless thunder, and Chu Yunfan was like a powerful thunder god standing in the world.","Many people were shocked. How powerful was Chu Yunfan’s divine power? If it were them, they would need to use all their strength to release one of the lightning dragons, let alone Chu Yunfan who had released it so casually.","Before Atela could react to Chu Yunfan’s words, he saw Chu Yunfan disappear from where he was. The murderous aura from his saber could not lock onto Chu Yunfan.","Hurry up!","Hurry up!","Hurry up!","Chu Yunfan was too fast. His figure was like a bolt of lightning. In this place that had completely evolved into a home ground, his speed had really reached a terrifying realm.","Swish!","Chu Yunfan appeared in front of a Core. A lightning dragon appeared around him and flew toward the Core at lightning speed.","Boom!","This Core was hit by Chu Yunfan, and his entire body was charred. The terrifying strength that he was proud of was so weak in front of Chu Yunfan.","The other experts in the formation also felt a huge force coming over. Their qi was connected, and now they were also implicated by him. They could only watch Chu Yunfan kill him.","“Stop, Chu Yunfan. Do you dare to fight me fairly?” Atela spoke crazily.","Chu Yunfan had killed another one. It was a great humiliation for him, especially after he stopped hiding his strength.","“I’ll kill you after I take care of all this trash.” Chu Yunfan sneered and disappeared again, leaving Atela with nothing.","He had already pounced on the other Core Jinzhanghan warriors.","When those Cores saw Chu Yunfan pouncing over, they were shocked and angry.","Chu Yunfan was treating them like pushovers and killing them first.","They had been on the battlefield for countless years. When had they ever suffered such a huge loss?","“Join forces and kill him!” a warrior of Jinzhanghan shouted, hating Chu Yunfan.","The Jinzhanghan warriors were telepathically connected. They did not need to communicate. Their intuition on the battlefield had given them enough tacit understanding.","The battle energy on their bodies boiled and connected into a blurry shadow. This shadow was fierce and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. The huge axe in its hand slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","This was an attack that combined everyone’s strength. It was even more terrifying than any one of them. It even surpassed the intermediate Void Core Stage and charged into the late Void Core Stage.","“Just in time!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud. At this moment, he felt his blood boiling, and he could fight without holding back.","In his hand, a ball of lightning energy transformed into a two-meter-long saber. As he waved the saber, he casually slashed it down, splitting the world into two halves.","Bam!","The long saber and the battle axe collided with each other, but there was no earth-shattering collision as many people imagined. On the contrary, Chu Yunfan’s long saber instantly slashed the battle axe into half.","The shadow that had condensed into a monstrous flame was split into two by Chu Yunfan. It could not affect him at all.","Boom!","Then, Chu Yunfan’s terrifying blade light ruthlessly slashed at the battle formation formed by many Cores."]},{"number":1338,"title":"Chapter 1338 Destroying the Jinzhanghan Warriors With One Slash","paragraphs":["1338 Destroying the Jinzhanghan Warriors With One Slash","The entire battle formation shook violently, and everyone felt a huge force sweeping down. And this was after the battle formation had dispersed most of Chu Yunfan’s strength. If one of them were to take Chu Yunfan’s attack head-on, he would probably be cut in half by Chu Yunfan’s saber.","Everyone looked at each other and immediately saw the shock in each other’s eyes. It was as if they were completely in disbelief. They did not understand how Chu Yunfan could be so powerful.","When everyone joined forces to face Chu Yunfan, they were actually at such a disadvantage.","“Argh! Die!”","The saber in Atela’s hand slashed toward Chu Yunfan like a shadow. Wherever the saber light passed, the air collapsed visibly, and a terrifying shock wave swept out in all directions.","However, his blade simply passed through Chu Yunfan’s body. He failed to hit Chu Yunfan.","‘What kind of movement technique is this?’","Atela was shocked!","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan’s next attack had already condensed, and he swung his sword downward.","“Fight it out! Stop him!” one of them shouted. They were forced to this point. They had no choice. If they could not block Chu Yunfan’s attack, they would all be finished.","They didn’t believe that they couldn’t stop Chu Yunfan. They didn’t want to live anymore.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan’s saber came as expected and slashed at the battle formation. On the saber light, lightning dragons were instantly released. Countless lightning dragons raged and instantly blasted into the battle formation.","Spurt!","Spurt!","Spurt!","These warriors all spat out mouthfuls of blood as if they had been hit hard. The electric dragons wreaked havoc and severely injured them.","These experts hastily retreated, and some were even sent flying. Their faces were extremely pale. Chu Yunfan had only used one move, but he had severely injured them.","When they looked at Chu Yunfan again, their eyes were filled with disbelief.","Even if Atela’s strength was far above theirs, it was impossible for him to injure more than ten Cores with one move. It was simply a miracle.","“This is the last slash. All of you are about to die!” Chu Yunfan shouted. The long saber in his hand swelled with the wind and grew to hundreds of meters long. He suddenly slashed down.","The Core Jinzhanghan warriors quickly reacted.","These experts roared and burned the divine power in their bodies. At this point, if they could not block Chu Yunfan’s saber, they would surely perish.","At this moment, a terrifying aura was released, turning into a phantom that went up against the saber light.","Swish!","The saber light slashed down and killed the phantom. Then, the light fell into the army formation.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom","Under the watchful eyes of the crowd, those Core Jinzhanghan warriors were chopped into balls of blood mist by Chu Yunfan’s saber.","Chu Yunfan’s blade light was too terrifying. Even if more than ten Cores joined forces, they were not a match for him. His strength had completely surpassed everyone else and reached another level.","The was dead silence.","Everyone was dumbfounded.","Chu Yunfan only used three moves to kill these Cores.","Many people could not help but gulp. They were completely in disbelief.","These were Cores, not cabbages on the roadside. How could they be killed so easily?","This was completely beyond their imagination.","“A person can actually be so strong.”","“Strong... Too strong. I’ve never seen such a powerful expert in my life!”","“How did Chu Yunfan cultivate? He’s simply a monster!”","“I felt like the entire world was split into two by that attack!”","The experts watching from afar had complicated expressions. Chu Yunfan’s attack had completely surpassed their imagination.","There were Cores among them. However, when they put themselves in the middle of it to calculate, they only felt that it was extremely terrifying. If it were them, it would be useless no matter how they dodged. It was impossible to dodge Chu Yunfan’s saber. What was even more terrifying was that if they were cut by Chu Yunfan’s saber, they would die without a doubt.","“This attack has clearly surpassed the ordinary late Void Core Stage. No wonder Chu Yunfan has such confidence.”","“That’s right. If I had such strength, I wouldn’t have compromised with Mi Siyuan or the Core Council!”","“I’m afraid that the council is now in a difficult situation. I thought that Chu Yunfan was just a lucky rookie who was nothing compared to the strength of the entire council. Who knew that he would be so terrifying.”","“That’s right. With Chu Yunfan’s strength, he would at least be the deputy chairman of the council. In the next hundred years, he would definitely become the chairman.”","Many people were discussing animatedly. In their hearts, they were now much more optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s odds than they had been at the beginning. The strength that he displayed was enough to completely change their minds.","Although he couldn’t be said to have the upper hand against the council, at least he had the ability to protect himself. He wasn’t an existence that could be easily crushed.","Atela, who was in the sky, was even more shocked. Chu Yunfan had completely wiped out the Core Jinzhanghan warriors with a single slash.","It was just one slash!","The experts who had followed him all the way here were all dead!","What kind of terrifying strength was this?!","Only now did he truly understand how troublesome the person he was facing was. It far exceeded any opponent he had dealt with before.","“Please end the match. It’s time for us to settle our grudges!” Chu Yunfan withdrew his saber and looked at Atela. “It’s your turn next. How about it? Do you have any last words?”","When Atela heard Chu Yunfan’s words, he was furious and said, “Chu Yunfan, do you know what kind of existence you have provoked? You have offended the most powerful country in the world. Even if you escape with your life today, Jinzhanghan will hunt you down to the ends of the earth!”","Chu Yunfan sneered and looked at Atela. “Do I need to escape? Besides, what’s so great about the Jinzhanghan Kingdom? Do you believe that I’ll be able to take over the royal tent of Jinzhanghan within ten years?”"]},{"number":1339,"title":"Chapter 1339 Atela’s Death","paragraphs":["1339 Atela’s Death","Great Wei had an imperial capital, but Jinzhanghan did not. Jinzhanghan itself was a country made up of nomadic people. They did not have the concept of an imperial capital. Every year, their Khan lived in the royal tent by a river.","The location was different every year.","And the royal tent was equivalent to Great Wei’s imperial capital.","Because of this, everyone who heard Chu Yunfan’s words couldn’t help but gasp.","This was no different from someone claiming to break into the Imperial Capital to kill the emperor of Great Wei.","It was completely unbelievable. Ordinary people would not even dare to think about it.","The Imperial Capital of Great Wei was filled with experts, and even a top-notch expert like the Right King of Jinzhanghan would not dare to barge into the Imperial Capital alone.","That was tantamount to courting death.","Not to mention that Jinzhanghan was even more powerful than Great Wei. There were many experts in the royal tent. No matter how strong a person was, he would be surrounded by countless experts and eventually die.","Not to mention the Khan of Jinzhanghan, who was one of the top experts in Jinzhanghan. It was impossible for him to take down the royal tent.","For Chu Yunfan, this was nothing. After all, he had done similar things before. If it was in the Human Federation, there was still room for it to be realized. After all, countless nuclear bombs could destroy the royal tent in minutes.","Even a Core would not be able to withstand the power of a nuclear bomb.","When Atela heard Chu Yunfan’s words, his eyes immediately turned red. He gritted his teeth and looked at Chu Yunfan. “I want you dead!”","After saying that, Atela rushed at Chu Yunfan with lightning speed.","In the next moment, he had already appeared in front of Chu Yunfan. His ancient saber blade light spread out, and it was as cold as winter.","The light of this saber seemed to absorb all the vitality in the world. Countless spirit energy condensed into a terrifying long stream and slashed fiercely in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","At this moment, a black inner armor appeared on Chu Yunfan’s body. It turned into a long black dragon around him and instantly coiled up, protecting him.","Clang!","The saber slashed down and hit the black dragon. It couldn’t move an inch and couldn’t hurt Chu Yunfan.","“You think you can hurt me?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “You haven’t seen what true power is!”","Atela suddenly saw the scene and thought, ‘Sh*t!’","He had never expected Chu Yunfan to take his attack without even dodging. This had disrupted all his plans.","Sure enough, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of him and threw a punch at him.","Bam!","Atela was hit directly, and he flew back hundreds of meters in an instant before he barely managed to stabilize himself.","“Huff, huff, huff!”","Atela’s breathing quickened. He had been severely injured by this attack. It was not obvious on his face, but the left side of his body was completely numb.","With a slight tremble, pieces of inner armor fell from his body. If it wasn’t for the armor that helped him block the attack just now, he would have been smashed into half by Chu Yunfan.","It was too terrifying.","He had never seen such a terrifying physique cultivator.","Even in Jinzhanghan whose citizens were famous for their strong physiques, there was no one who could cultivate to Chu Yunfan’s level.","Atela had never thought that such a terrifying existence would appear among the Wei people whom he had always looked down on.","At this moment, he completely understood what Chu Yunfan’s true trump card was. It was his terrifying strength.","It was laughable that he had thought that Chu Yunfan was trying to stall for time until the Great Wei experts arrived to help.","After all, no matter how much those people disliked Chu Yunfan, it was still an internal conflict between the ten Wei Kingdoms, and they were mortal enemies.","However, he finally understood how ridiculous his previous thoughts were. Chu Yunfan had only wanted to lure them away from Conglong. He had never thought of waiting for reinforcements.","With his strength, would he still need reinforcements?","A bitter smile appeared on Atela’s face. Before he came, the Right King had even told him that if there was a possibility of capturing Chu Yunfan alive, it would be best to do so. There was a secret technique in Jinzhanghan that could brainwash people and turn them into puppets.","With Chu Yunfan’s talent, he might soar to the sky in the next ten or twenty years. If such a person could be used by the Right King, he would be more confident in fighting for the position of Khan.","After all, in Jinzhanghan, the Left King was the first heir to the throne, while the Right King was second.","Now that Atela thought about it, the arrangement the Right King had made back then was simply laughable. With Chu Yunfan’s monstrous strength, unless the Right King personally made a move, it would be useless no matter how many people Jinzhanghan sent.","What made him feel even more ironic was that such a result was obtained by using so many of their lives for experiments.","At this time, Chu Yunfan didn’t give Atela any time to react. He flew up and slashed down with his saber as if he was splitting the world.","Bam!","Atela instinctively raised his saber to block, but he was no match for it and was sent flying.","Crash!","Crash!","Crash!","Under Chu Yunfan’s attack, Atela was in a sorry state. In a short while, his entire body was covered in blood.","That was because Chu Yunfan’s strange strength had shaken him into that state.","“Again!” Chu Yunfan shouted, and the lightning saber in his hand cut the long spirit saber in Atela’s hand into two halves.","Although Atela tried his best to block it, he was cut in half by Chu Yunfan’s blade.","Slash!","Blood splattered everywhere. Before Atila’s corpse could fall to the ground, it was grabbed by Chu Yunfan’s large hand. Then, it was shoved into the Mountain and River Diagram, crushed into a bloody rain, and poured onto the Brahma Tree."]},{"number":1340,"title":"Chapter 1340 Heavily Injured, Intimidating!","paragraphs":["1340 Heavily Injured, Intimidating!","Everyone held their breath and looked at the scene in front of them in shock.","This scene was too shocking. If they had not seen it with their own eyes, they would have found it unbelievable.","More than a dozen Cores from Jinzhanghan had broken into Great Wei, including Atela, who was a notorious existence.","Almost immediately after they learned of the news, it caused a sensation in the entire Great Wei. Countless people in Great Wei were paying attention to this group of powerful experts at all times.","It might even require all of Great Wei to encircle and annihilate these Core Jinzhanghan warriors. Even so, they might still escape.","However, when such a powerful lineup was faced with Chu Yunfan, they were so vulnerable that they were easily killed by him.","After luring them away from Conglong, Chu Yunfan, who could attack with all his might, was so terrifying. He was like a thunder god, holding the most powerful lightning power in the world.","“Is this the end?” someone said in disbelief.","“This is too scary. Chu Yunfan is only a few years old now. Who can cure him in the next twenty years?”","“He definitely has the potential to become number one in the world!”","Many people discussed it.","At this moment, in the sky, ripples of a teleportation array appeared again. Then, more than a dozen figures were teleported outside of Conglong.","These figures had monstrous auras, and each of them carried an extremely terrifying auras.","After they were teleported over, they immediately rushed to Eternal Lake. However, to their surprise, they did not see a battle between trapped beasts.","They didn’t even see the people from Jinzhanghan.","According to the information they had received, many Jinzhanghan warriors had besieged Chu Yunfan. However, they only saw Chu Yunfan floating above the lake and there were no Jinzhanghan warriors in sight.","These people were instantly dumbfounded. This was completely different from the information they had received.","“Chu Yunfan, where are the Jinzhanghan warriors?” someone asked.","“You’re asking me? Hehe, shouldn’t this be within your control?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He had already figured out the whole story. Someone wanted to kill him with the help of Jinzhanghan.","That was why these experts had come late on purpose. They wanted to wait for him to be killed by Jinzhanghan warriors before they came to clean up the mess and kill the Jinzhanghan warriors.","At that time, they would become the hero of Great Wei.","“Chu Yunfan, what’s with the attitude?!” the expert roared angrily, “We’re here to help you!”","“Help me? At a time like this, you still want to lie?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “No matter who’s behind you, help me pass a message to them. Clean your neck and wait for death. I won’t let this matter go!”","After saying that, Chu Yunfan turned around and wanted to fly away. The Core who was ignored by Chu Yunfan from the beginning to the end was completely furious.","“Insolent!”","After he shouted, he immediately attacked. His hands formed a seal and smashed down on Chu Yunfan.","“You’re courting death!” From afar, a Core who saw this scene could not help but spit out these words.","The other people all agreed with him. They had all seen Chu Yunfan kill Atela and the others earlier.","Naturally, they understood how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","An ordinary Core would not even be able to survive a single move from him.","Sure enough, Chu Yunfan turned around and pointed his finger. In an instant, the seal was broken.","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan’s attack did not slow down. It brought with it a torrential tide and hit the expert head-on.","Stab!","The Core screamed and flew backward.","After flying for several hundred meters, he finally stopped. Everyone looked over and saw that his chest was a bloody mess, and his face was pale. Just a finger had severely injured him.","“As expected.”","When the people in the distance saw this scene, their expressions did not change. To them, this scene was as expected.","Compared to Chu Yunfan’s ruthless attack just now, this was definitely mercy.","“I’ll spare your life. If you dare to attack again, don’t blame me for being rude.” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly.","Although these people might have come with ill intentions, they were not foreign barbarians like Jinzhanghan. Although he did not care if he was alone, if the Marquis Zhongxin’s residence wanted to survive in Great Wei, they had to preserve some face.","However, it was just a bit of face. If these people dared to attack again, then he would not be polite.","The other Cores who had come with the expert glared at Chu Yunfan, but they did not dare to attack. The strength that Chu Yunfan displayed stunned them.","More importantly, after calming down, they realized that there were ruins everywhere on Eternal Lake. It was obvious that another battle had taken place.","They were all experienced fighters, and from the traces left behind, they could infer what kind of battle had taken place.","Atela and the others wanted to kill Chu Yunfan. However, after a huge battle, Atela and the others disappeared, but Chu Yunfan was still there.","The answer was obvious. Atela and the others obviously wouldn’t retreat just because they were here. Combined with the fact that Chu Yunfan had easily injured one of their companions, it was not difficult to guess what had happened.","Atela and the others had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. At the very least, most of them had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","After coming to this conclusion, they couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air as if they had seen a ghost.","They did not want to believe such a ridiculous fact. They were called here to clean up the mess and surround Atela. They were the first batch of experts to arrive, and their goal was to delay Atela and prevent him from escaping. Who knew that when they arrived, they would find that the battle had already ended?","Chu Yunfan, who they had thought was dead, was still alive, while Atela and the others, who should have been alive, were probably dead.","This made them look at each other, not knowing what to do. Especially now, they didn’t know if they should make a move.","However, Chu Yunfan clearly didn’t have the time to waste on them. He stepped on a beam of light and disappeared into the distance.","After a long time, someone said.","“Inform His Highness immediately that the plan has gone wrong!”"]},{"number":1341,"title":"Chapter 1341 The Wind and Clouds","paragraphs":["1341 The Wind and Clouds","The news that Chu Yunfan had killed Atela and the other Cores of Jinzhanghan spread throughout Great Wei overnight.","Instantly, everyone fell silent. Everyone was dumbfounded. This was completely different from any situation they had imagined.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was clearly far beyond their imagination.","People couldn’t help but readjust their evaluation of Chu Yunfan’s strength. Most of them didn’t know how to differentiate between Cores. Even if they knew the nuances, they couldn’t tell.","Anyone in the Core Stage was a formidable opponent for those below the Core Stage.","However, among the experts present, there were also experts above the Core Stage. They were just hiding in the crowd and did not show themselves. According to their judgment at the scene, Atela was definitely a powerful existence who had stepped into the late Void Core Stage.","Such an existence was as rare as phoenix feathers and qilin horns in Great Wei. It could even be said that he was a formidable existence. But even so, Atela died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Without a doubt, one thing that could be confirmed was that Chu Yunfan definitely had strength that was at the late Void Core Stage or above.","There was no doubt about it.","This refreshed everyone’s estimation of Chu Yunfan’s strength. From the initial half-step Core Stage, to the combat strength of the early Core Stage, and later on, even Mi Siyuan died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","This time, Atela, who was ten times more terrifying, also died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. He couldn’t fight back.","At this moment, everyone finally understood that Chu Yunfan probably possessed the strength of a late Void Core. He possessed a cultivation that was comparable to Blood King. No wonder he was not afraid of Blood King.","“I finally understand now. So this is Chu Yunfan. No wonder he doesn’t care about the council.”","“At this rate of cultivation, I’m afraid that in less than 20 years, the entire council will have to obey him.”","“Not just the council, in 20 years, I’m afraid the entire Great Wei will bow down to him and he will become a true pillar that holds up the sky.”","“How did such a terrifying existence appear in Great Wei? There’s still no clue about the sect behind him.”","As everyone discussed, it spread Chu Yunfan’s reputation. Now, even those who originally despised him did not dare to underestimate him.","Before this no one thought that Blood King could defeat Chu Yunfan in the battle against Blood King. In fact, compared to Chu Yunfan, Mi Siyuan was nothing. Whether it was talent or strength, they were not on the same level and were not worthy of being compared,","No one doubted that the future would be Chu Yunfan’s, and it would not be easy for Blood King to cut off Chu Yunfan’s present.","In a certain palace in the Imperial Capital, the second prince threw the porcelain teacup in his hand onto the ground and smashed it into pieces.","“Trash1 All of you are trash!”","The second prince’s expression was extremely ferocious, like a demon that had crawled out of hell.","When he saw the report, he could not believe it. The powerful Atela and his men, who had shocked all the experts in Great Wei, had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","One could imagine how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","Thinking of Chu Yunfan’s last words, he felt a chill down his spine. He could feel that Chu Yunfan would definitely not let the matter rest easily.","However, even if he regretted it now, there was nothing he could do. He had completely offended Chu Yunfan. Therefore, he placed all his hopes on Blood King. As long as Blood King came out and killed Chu Yunfan, all the danger would be resolved.","On the comms talisman in front of him, an old man appeared on the screen.","“How long will it take for Blood King to come out of seclusion?” The second prince forced himself to calm down.","“Three months. He’ll come out of seclusion in three months. At that time, according to the information we have, Blood King enter the peak Void Core Stage. He will be comparable to the few experts ranked before him. At that time, killing Chu Yunfan will be as easy as lifting a finger,” the old man said.","“That’s right. As long as we wait another three months, he’ll be dead for sure!” The second prince gritted his teeth.","However, when he thought about how he was made to tremble in fear during this period, he was furious.","All of this was caused by Chu Yunfan.","“When Chu Yunfan is dead, I want Marquis Zhongxin’s residence wiped out,” the second prince said coldly.","“When Chu Yunfan is dead, a mere marquis will be nothing. Once you give the order, Your Highness, the entire residence will be wiped out.”","Only then did the second prince reluctantly nod his head. He forcefully suppressed the anger in his heart and that trace of fear.","Facing the heated discussion in the outside world, the Core Council that had been silent all this time finally showed up. Since Blood King was the deputy chairman of the council, they couldn’t just ignore it.","They announced that Blood King would come out of seclusion and kill Chu Yunfan in three months.","It immediately caused an uproar.","Three months from now, Blood King would come out of seclusion.","All of a sudden, the direction of the wind changed.","Those who had previously thought highly of Chu Yunfan turned against him. After all, even though he had improved after his seclusion, he was only barely on par with Blood King. In many people’s hearts, he was no match for Blood King.","And once Blood King advanced a step further, according to the news that was spread out, it would already be at the peak Void Core Stage. That cultivation level was the number one expert in the world because the current number one expert in the world, Yun Huang, was at the peak Void Core Stage.","When Blood King came out of seclusion, his cultivation would improve, and he would be able to stand shoulder-to-shoulder with Yun Shuang.","That cultivation was like a thunderbolt to Chu Yunfan.","Against an expert of that level, Chu Yunfan had no chance of winning.","For a time, Great Wei’s situation changed. Everyone was not optimistic about Chu Yunfan, nor did they think highly of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. For a time, many experts who wanted to rely on them also began to wait and see.","No one wanted to pick a side before the outcome was decided. If they chose the wrong side, they would be truly finished.","For a time, the wind and clouds surged."]},{"number":1342,"title":"Chapter 1342 Becoming a Pawn","paragraphs":["1342 Becoming a Pawn","As for Blood King’s clamor, Chu Yunfan acted as if he didn’t hear it and entered secluded cultivation.","And the Marquis Zhongxin residence stopped their expansion and defended with all their might.","Everyone knew that they were not the ones who would decide the outcome. Even if they expanded their forces to the entire south of Great Wei, if Chu Yunfan was defeated by Blood King, then what they did today would be like a flower in the mirror, a moon on the water.","In fact, no matter how many people they sent out, they would die.","The forces who were fawning over them today would become wolves and pounce on them to tear them into pieces.","At this time, the residence stopped all project. Everything could only be decided after Chu Yunfan came out of seclusion.","During this month, Chu Yunfan and the residence did not respond.","A month later, he came out of seclusion. However, no one knew. Everyone was waiting for Blood King to come out of seclusion three months later.","In their opinion, Blood King would come out of seclusion in three months. That would be the time to decide everything.","On this day, in the residence.","Chu Yunfan was sitting across from the director of the Agency of Secrets. The two of them were discussing the Dao.","“It’s been a long time. I wonder if you’ve found what I asked you to find?” Chu Yunfan said,","“That girl called Tang Siyu. We have already searched the entire Great Wei. I can tell you very responsibly that she is definitely not in Great Wei. Now, we are searching outside Great Wei. However, in the outer realms, our agency’s strength is much weaker. It’s not like in Great Wei where we control everything,” the director slowly said.","Chu Yunfan nodded. This wasn’t the Federation. There was no Internet here. To have managed to investigate the entire country in a month, the power of the agency was already very shocking.","“But you didn’t come to find me today to tell me that you haven’t found her yet, right?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Of course. I wonder if you’d be interested in Blood King’s whereabouts, Master Chu?” the director said.","Chu Yunfan’s pupils constricted. What he was most concerned about was the whereabouts of Blood King.","Three months from now, Blood King would come out of seclusion. Everyone was waiting for him to appear.","However, how could Chu Yunfan just sit and wait for Blood King to appear?","Though Chu Yunfan’s strength had improved, he would still have no chance of winning against Blood King, who also had in improvement of strength. At most, he would only be able to protect himself. Self-preservation was meaningless to Chu Yunfan.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan had ordered the entire Marquis Zhongxin residence to do their best to find Blood King. It was best to take advantage of the fact that he had yet to break through and wipe him out.","Chu Yunfan wasn’t about to wait for the enemy to be ready before attacking.","Since Blood King was not ready, now was the best time to strike.","Therefore, although it seemed that the entire residence had not made any moves, in truth, all the spies had been sent out in secret. Once they found Blood King, Chu Yunfan would make his move.","But at this time, he discovered that the network of the residence was too weak, and the place where a martial arts expert went into seclusion was often a top secret.","Blood King was not like Mi Siyuan, who had his own base camp. If Blood King had such a base, Chu Yunfan would have charged over long ago. Even if it was as powerful as the Great Formless Sect, so what? It would still be uprooted by Chu Yunfan.","The real problem now was that they couldn’t find him.","Even if the director didn’t come, Chu Yunfan would still choose to look for him.","However, Chu Yunfan never expected that the director would personally come looking for him.","“Why? Do you have any news about him?” Chu Yunfan asked slowly.","“That’s right. As far as I know, he’s currently in seclusion in an extremely secretive valley in Sierra Luanyun. Although his whereabouts are top secret and can be hidden from others, it’s impossible for him to hide from me,” the director said.","With the agency as a behemoth, even an ordinary Core would have to give in to him.","“So, he’s in Sierra Luanyun.”","Chu Yunfan immediately knew where Blood King was. After all, he had been looking at the map of Great Wei a lot recently.","“He really hid himself well. If it weren’t for you, I’m afraid it would be very difficult for me to find him.","“But why did you help me? This matter shouldn’t have anything to do with you. Why did you choose to wade into this muddy water?” Chu Yunfan asked.","He began to doubt the director’s purpose. After all, everyone knew that the director was loyal to the emperor of Great Wei.","Everyone knew that this matter involved the second prince, so he should know about it. However, if he were to get involved so rashly, wouldn’t he be afraid of offending the second prince?","“Everyone knows that this matter is related to the second prince, right? Are you planning to fall out with the second prince?”","This was what he found the strangest. With the agency’s status, even the second prince would choose to curry favor with the agency before he ascended the throne. At the very least, he would not let a behemoth like the agency fall to his opponent.","“Sharp as ever, Master Chu. Since you’ve asked, I’ll tell you the truth.”","The director glanced at Chu Yunfan and knew that Chu Yunfan was suspicious. If he did not have a reasonable explanation, Chu Yunfan would not believe him.","“Although the second prince has a wide network in the court and has an extremely large influence, there are many people who don’t like him,” the director said, “As for why I’m involved, to be honest, it’s because they’re exploiting a weakness I have. I have no choice but to help them.”","Chu Yunfan was a little surprised. The director had actually confessed to this extent. He even revealed that they were blackmailing him.","However, he understood in the blink of an eye. This was to win Chu Yunfan’s trust, and the most important thing was who was behind him that could force the director to make such a decision.","He thought about it for a moment and understood that there were probably many people who wanted the second prince dead. The struggle for the throne had always been extremely bloody.","The second prince making a name for himself by killing Atela was clearly not something that many people did not want to see. It was as if Atela had become a pawn in someone’s hand, and Chu Yunfan had become a pawn in someone else’s to kill Atela.","But this time, Chu Yunfan was willing to be that pawn."]},{"number":1343,"title":"Chapter 1343 The Shocked Agency Director","paragraphs":["1343 The Shocked Agency Director","Although someone wanted to use him to kill someone, he felt that it didn’t matter. As the saying goes, when you’re sleepy, someone will send you a pillow.","No matter what their motives were, the existence of Blood King was like a fishbone stuck in Chu Yunfan’s throat. If he didn’t get rid of it, he wouldn’t be able to feel at ease.","Chu Yunfan didn’t know who was behind the agency’s operation. Or rather, it was possible that more than one force was involved.","However, he knew that it was definitely not just one force. After all, the agency was the emperor’s loyal dog. They had always been loyal to the emperor and would kill whoever the emperor wanted!","This was an objective that could not be changed because if it was changed, no emperor would be able to tolerate the leader of such a huge intelligence organization siding with outsiders.","If they wanted to force the agency to provide information to Chu Yunfan, even a so-called weakness was definitely not enough. It must be the result of many forces working together.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan understood that there were many people who wanted the second prince to have a bad life.","Although many people were not optimistic about him, there were many people who hoped that he would win. Chu Yunfan didn’t say which side he would stand on, it was still better for the neutral side to win than for Blood King to stand on the second prince’s side.","“Besides, this is also my selfish wish to help you,” the director said, “Great Wei and Jinzhanghan have not fought many times on the surface, but the secret battles have never stopped. And we have lost more than we have won.","“This time, you killed Atela and more than ten Cores in one go. It can be said to be a rare victory for our country. You have to know that under normal circumstances, even if Great Wei has the ability to eliminate these people, the price we have to pay is extremely high. If it’s for Great Wei, I’m willing to help you.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the director, but he didn’t completely believe what the director said because only the director knew the real reason. However, Chu Yunfan now knew about Blood King’s secluded cultivation grounds. That was enough.","A battle in three months? Who would wait for someone for three months?","Chu Yunfan sneered.” In that case, there’s no time to lose. I’ll set off immediately. If what you’ve told me is true, I’ll thank you heavily when I return.","“Aren’t you stuck at half-step Core Stage? I can help you break through to the Core Stage.”","Chu Yunfan’s words instantly made the director, who had been calm all this while, excited. He had been stuck at half-step Core Stage for far too long, even though he was considered an overlord in the eyes of ordinary people.","However, he knew very well that he was nothing in front of a true Core.","Only by relying on his status as the director of the Agency of Secrets was he treated equally by those Cores. However, it was not so much to give him face, but rather to give face to Great Wei.","If these people turned hostile, he would not have any strength to retaliate.","Over the years, he had tried countless methods, but he had not been able to break through the limit and enter the Core Stage. Even he himself had already given up hope and felt that it was impossible.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would give him hope at this time?","Even though he was extremely shrewd, he could not hold it in anymore and quickly asked, “Really, Master Chu? I still have hope of entering the Core Stage?”","“That’s right. If I’m not wrong, you must have been careless in your cultivation in your early years. You went berserk once, and after that, you never recovered completely. That’s why you can’t enter the Core Stage,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Chu Yunfan had even seen through his energy deviation in his early years.","He had never revealed this secret to anyone. Therefore, there should not be a second person who knew about it. Chu Yunfan could discern so many things purely by looking.","The director’s heart was in turmoil. He had secretly looked for the imperial physicians in the palace to treat him, but they were all useless. Most of the imperial physicians did not even know where the problem was.","However, Chu Yunfan could see through it and even said that he had a way. This made the director excited.","In this world, only those in the Core Stage could be considered a big shot. As for those who were half step Core Stage, no matter how much he used the tiger’s might and put on the tiger skin of Great Wei, there were still many people who did not give him face.","However, once he stepped into the Core Stage, it would be different. He could be on equal footing with those experts. Moreover, he had a huge organization like the agency in his hands. Who would dare to underestimate him?","It wasn’t that he didn’t think that Chu Yunfan might be bluffing him, but he immediately remembered that in the intelligence report, there was a report that Chu Yunfan had easily cured An Xiuxiu, the eldest daughter of Marquis Anguo. Also, CHu Yunfan had saved the leader of the Battle Wolf Gang from the brink of death.","Immediately, he no longer had any doubts in his heart. Chu Yunfan was probably also a doctor at a national-level. It was just that ordinary people were blinded by his identity as a senior alchemist.","“Master Chu, please save me!” The director quickly stood up and bowed deeply to Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, he could not care less about his dignity. There was nothing more important than healing his injuries.","“Get up.” Chu Yunfan stretched out his hand, and the director immediately felt as if he was being supported by a huge force and straightened his back.","He was shocked. Chu Yunfan’s power was as unfathomable as the rumors said. No, it was even a hundred times, a thousand times more terrifying than the rumors.","“It doesn’t matter. I’ve said it before. No matter why you’ve told me Blood King’s whereabouts, I’m a person who has always been clear about gratitude and resentment. Since you’ve helped me, I won’t be stingy with helping you,” Chu Yunfan said, “The injuries on your body may be helpless to others because they don’t understand, but to me, it’s just a piece of cake. It’s nothing.","“Wait here in the residence. After I kill Blood King, I will save you and help you heal.”"]},{"number":1344,"title":"Chapter 1344 Killing at One’s Doorstep","paragraphs":["1344 Killing at One’s Doorstep","“Thank you, Master Chu!”","The director said in an overjoyed manner. Even someone as shrewd as him could not help but be overjoyed. One could imagine what it meant for him to advance his cultivation.","Once his cultivation advanced further, he would become a true big shot in Great Wei.","Even if the new emperor ascended the throne in the future, he would not casually kill him, because at that time, his power would not only come from the power and information held by the agency.","Most importantly, his own cultivation was also enough to make others not dare to easily attack him.","It was like a drowning person who would instinctively grab onto anything that could be grabbed, even if it was just a straw.","“There’s no time to lose. I’ll set off immediately.” Chu Yunfan stood up and wanted to set off.","Beside him, the director was startled. ‘Master Chu sure is rash. He’s going to attack just like that.’","However, he immediately realized. If Chu Yunfan was someone who had a slow personality, he would not have such a shocking cultivation at this age. Thinking of Chu Yunfan’s age and his possible cultivation, the director felt a sense of dizziness. It was simply terrifying.","The so-called geniuses of Great Wei from ancient times to the present were nothing compared to Chu Yunfan. There was nothing to compare.","Many people were speculating in their hearts. What kind of sect was behind Chu Yunfan to be able to teach such a person.","The director was curious. With the agency’s power, it could be said that there were very few things in Great Wei that could be hidden from the agency. However, they had no clue about Chu Yunfan’s matter. No matter how much they investigated Chu Yunfan’s past, they couldn’t find any clues.","It was as if Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength had erupted overnight.","Before this, Chu Yunfan was terrifyingly mediocre. But this was impossible. There was only one answer, and that was that Chu Yunfan had concealed his strength, so no one knew.","However, it was what people found strange. With the environment of Great Wei, it was impossible to raise such a true dragon. This was not self-deprecation, but a fact. The achievements that anyone could achieve were often directly related to the environment they were in.","Although there were people who had transcended their environment, such people were extremely rare. Moreover, Chu Yunfan was so young. Whether it was his understanding of martial arts or his comprehension of cultivation, it was not something that he could come up with out of thin air. There must be a huge and powerful force supporting him from behind. Only then would it be possible.","However, no one knew what this force was. This was the strangest part.","This was the biggest doubt in many people’s hearts. No one knew where Chu Yunfan’s master was.","Just as the director’s imagination ran wild, Chu Yunfan stepped on a flying light and flew out of the residence. In a moment, he had already flown out of Conglong.","Of course, Chu Yunfan didn’t fully believe the director’s words. After all, the director’s reason for helping him was based only on the director’s words. No one knew what the actual situation was.","He seemed to have believed the director’s words, but in fact, he had his own confidence. With his cultivation, there were very few people in Great Wei who could pose a threat to him. Even if he were to face an expert at the peak Void Core Stage, he had the confidence to protect himself.","Even if there was a trap, he was not afraid!","However, if what the director said was true, then it would be a good opportunity to take down Blood King.","Was he supposed to wait for Blood King to come out of seclusion in three months?","Chu Yunfan’s appearance was not concealed, so it quickly attracted the attention of the major forces. He came out of seclusion and left the city as soon as he came out of seclusion.","Chu Yunfan’s speed was so fast that no one could keep up with him. However, this did not prevent them from spreading the news.","Many people were confused by Chu Yunfan’s actions. They didn’t know what he was doing. However, it was obvious that he was not out for a stroll.","In less than half a day, Chu Yunfan arrived at Sierra Luanyun.","This was an extremely steep mountain range that stretched for thousands of miles. There were mountains and forests everywhere, and the heights were even hundreds of meters high, surrounded by clouds and mist.","However, with Chu Yunfan’s eyesight, he quickly spotted a place in the mountain range where spirit energy was sealed by an array. It was clearly different from other places.","The entire area surrounded by the array was shrouded in clouds and mist. These clouds and mist transformed into an array formation that locked down the entire mountain range. No living beings could approach.","Chu Yunfan immediately deduced that this was the place where Blood King was in seclusion.","There was a huge city near Sierra Luanyun, Luanyun City.","There were many experts in Luanyun, and it could be considered an important town in the central part of Great Wei. However, it was obvious that the experts in Luanyun did not know that there was a super expert living in seclusion in this place that was so close to them.","Generally speaking, the place where these top experts secluded themselves was either heavily guarded or unknown to ensure their safety. When one was in seclusion, they could not be disturbed. If disturbed, they would fail and would go mad.","“Blood King, are you here? Come out!” Chu Yunfan circulated his energy in his meridian and shouted loudly, shaking the whole of Sierra Luanyun.","Even the nearby Luanyun City was shaken. The experts there were instantly alarmed.","“What ? Blood King is nearby?”","“Who’s shouting?”","“Could it be Chu Yunfan?”","In just a moment, many streaks of light flew out from within Luanyun, flying toward the location of the voice.","“I just received news that Chu Yunfan had left Conglong. Could it be that he came here?”","“There’s no mistake. It must be Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, who would dare to cause trouble for Blood King so brazenly?”","“However, Blood King’s secluded cultivation place should be a secret. How did Chu Yunfan find out?”","“I never expected Blood King to go into seclusion in our mountain range.”","Many experts discussed animatedly. At the same time, they all stepped on the light and rushed in the direction of Sierra Luanyun.","Above Sierra Luanyun, Chu Yunfan took one step at a time. He seemed slow but was actually fast as he headed toward the valley locked by the array."]},{"number":1345,"title":"Chapter 1345 One Hit, Team Wipeout!","paragraphs":["1345 One Hit, Team Wipeout!","Boom!","The moment Chu Yunfan stepped into the array, he immediately felt a rebound force hit him.","An ordinary Core would be sent flying by a bullet, let alone a Divine. Just the rebound force of the array formation was enough to severely injure him.","However, Chu Yunfan reacted instantly and was not sent flying. On the contrary, his feet released waves of thunder power. The power of thunder rippled like water.","Boom!","Under Chu Yunfan’s power of thunder, the array collapsed. In the blink of an eye, the light purple barrier collapsed under Chu Yunfan’s feet. The valley that was originally shrouded in clouds and mist finally revealed its original appearance.","Originally, this should have been an ordinary valley. However, at some point, this valley had been filled with a gorgeous palace. The carved beams and jade buildings looked extremely gorgeous.","However, there weren’t many people in this magnificent palace complex. Chu Yunfan glanced at them and saw that there were only two to three hundred people.","Immediately, Chu Yunfan understood. This was Blood King’s secluded cultivation ground, so the fewer people who knew about it, the better. Those who were here were definitely Blood King’s most trusted aides.","Although Blood King was a lone cultivator and had never established a sect, it did not mean that he did not have anyone he could use. He even accepted disciples. It was only compared to the sects that opened their doors to recruit disciples with great fanfare, Blood King’s faction was scattered and did not have many people.","And this force was created to serve Blood King.","This was the biggest difference between him and the ordinary sects.","After Chu Yunfan destroyed the array, a loud alarm rang throughout the valley. These people instantly reacted. Two figures flew out of the valley.","These two figures were actually half-step Cores. One on the left and one on the right, they surrounded Chu Yunfan almost instantly.","“Who are you? How dare you trespass into Luanyun Valley!” one of them shouted and looked at Chu Yunfan with an extremely sharp gaze.","“What’s wrong? Blood King wants to kill me, yet you can’t recognize me?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","At this time, the two of them finally seemed to have remembered something. They immediately looked at Chu Yunfan in front of them, and a hint of horror flashed through their eyes.","“You’re Chu Yunfan?” one of them said.","The two of them carefully sized up Chu Yunfan. Wasn’t he the person their master wanted to kill? Thinking of this, killing intent could not help but appear on their faces.","The person their master wanted to kill was the person they wanted to kill. There was no doubt about it.","“Chu Yunfan, there is a way to heaven, but you didn’t take it. You barged into hell, and today is the day you die!” one of them said loudly.","At this moment, another hundred figures rose from the ground. They were all experts above the Divine Abilities Stage.","However, for a Core, it was much easier to guide a talented person into the Divine Abilities Stage. After cultivating to the Core Stage, the many cultivation mysteries of the Divine Abilities Stage were no longer a secret to them. This was an extremely simple matter.","“You’re going to kill me?” Chu Yunfan sneered, and the corners of his mouth curled up into a smile. “Just you lot?”","At this moment, the Luanyun experts rushed into Sierra Luanyun. When everyone saw Chu Yunfan, they recognized him immediately. As Chu Yunfan’s reputation rose, his standard attire also left a deep mark in many people’s minds.","Everyone knew that this was a person that absolutely could not be provoked.","“It’s Chu Yunfan. It’s really him!”","“He managed to find Blood King’s meditation place!”","“Awesome!”","Everyone gasped.","Blood King had killed countless people and had a tough personality, so he was considered a powerful figure. Now that they saw Chu Yunfan, they realized that they were wrong.","In terms of strength, Chu Yunfan wasn’t any weaker than Blood King. He couldn’t tolerate even a speck of sand in his eyes.","Blood King announced that he would come out of seclusion three months later to kill Chu Yunfan. However, Chu Yunfan had found Blood King’s hiding place in less than a month and killed his way in.","Many people simply felt that this wave of climax was unending, and they were a little overwhelmed by it.","Every time they thought that things were going to end, Chu Yunfan would always make an unexpected move.","Just like this time, when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan would obediently wait for Blood King to come out of seclusion in three months, Chu Yunfan used his actions to tell everyone that they were thinking too much.","He couldn’t even wait a month.","Many people had even overthrown their guesses about Chu Yunfan’s strength. Since he dared to attack them, it was obvious that Chu Yunfan had absolute confidence in his own strength.","Even if Blood King was only half a step away from stepping into the peak Void Core Stage, it seemed that he could not make the slightest concession.","Then, they saw a shocking scene.","The people who flew out of Luanyun Valley seemed to have been brainwashed. They all charged at Chu Yunfan with bloodshot eyes. They did not care about the difference in strength between the two sides. In fact, in their eyes, there might not even be such a difference in strength.","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and grabbed at the air with both hands. He suddenly produced a ball of thunder energy. Soon, this ball transformed into a long saber.","The saber light bloomed out and covered the sky. It was a hundred feet long and suddenly slashed down. In an instant, it was as if the entire world had been split into two.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","...","A series of explosions rang out. Those people from Luanyun Valley who had rushed over were swept by the powerful pressure of the saber light before they could even get close to the saber. They exploded into a cloud of blood mist in mid-air.","Even the two half-step Cores were no exception.","As long as they were swept by the saber light, regardless of their level, they would all explode into a bloody mist.","One hit, team wipeout!"]},{"number":1346,"title":"Chapter 1346 Petty Tricks, How Dare You Be Insolent","paragraphs":["1346 Petty Tricks, How Dare You Be Insolent","“Who are you?! How dare you act so presumptuously in my valley!”","Immediately after, an angry roar came from within.","This roar set off a monstrous tide, shattering the clouds and mist in the sky.","In the distance, the expressions of the Luanyun experts instantly changed. Without a doubt, it was Blood King.","“Is Blood King coming out of seclusion? He had thought that the battle would be held three months later, but it had been brought forward.”","“That’s true. I’m afraid no one will wait for their opponent to break through before fighting them.”","“That’s right. This is a battle of life and death. The loser will die. It’s not an ordinary spar.”","Everyone understood why Chu Yunfan wanted to kill his way to Blood King’s door before Blood King came out of seclusion. After all, this was a battle of life and death. If he failed, he would die.","“Blood King, didn’t you want to kill me? I’m here alone. If you have the ability, come kill me!” Chu Yunfan shouted mercilessly.","“So, it’s you. You’re courting death!”","A figure rushed out. That terrifying aura shook the entire Sierra Luanyun. The aura covered the sky and earth. Although it did not destroy the sky and earth, it engulfed everything.","“How terrifying. Is this Blood King’s strength?”","Many people sucked in a breath of cold air. With just one move, Blood King’s aura swept through Sierra Luanyun. Within a radius of hundreds of miles, one could feel his terrifying breath.","One could imagine how powerful Blood King was now!","“Could it be that the three months he mentioned was just a smokescreen? Did he actually break through long ago?” someone exclaimed.","Many people had the same guess in their hearts. It did not seem impossible. After all, Blood King had been in seclusion for more than a day or two. It was not impossible for him to have broken through long ago.","At this moment, everyone finally saw what kind of existence it was. It was a man of medium build. His face was a little strange, but just by standing there, he gave off an endless sense of oppression. Dressed in military attire, he looked extremely terrifying.","This was one of the five great experts of Great Wei—Blood King.","Speaking of which, Chu Yunfan had fought with Blood King before, but it was his first time seeing Blood King in person.","This was his true body.","Compared to one’s true body, a wisp of primordial spirit that possessed someone else was nothing. It was simply incomparable.","During the Ancient Zenith Civilization, a top-notch expert didn’t even need to possess someone else’s body. A wisp of primordial spirit could directly transform into a person. That was the true top-notch divine power.","He had not expected Chu Yunfan to appear in Sierra Luanyun. His first realization was that someone had betrayed him. Otherwise, how would Chu Yunfan know where he was cultivating?","There was no doubt about it.","Thinking of this, the killing intent in his eyes became even more shocking. However, the most important thing now was not to find the person who betrayed him, but to kill Chu Yunfan.","Thinking of this, the anger in his heart boiled even more fiercely. He was just a little bit away from stepping into the peak Void Core Stage, but now, he was interrupted by Chu Yunfan.","“You actually dare to appear in front of me and disturb my breakthrough?”","The more Blood King spoke, the more ferocious his expression became. As for Chu Yunfan killing his disciples and servants, it was a trivial matter to him.","“I will seal you and make you my slave forever to make up for your mistake!” Blood King said.","“You?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “I came here today to kill you. This matter had nothing to do with you, but you insisted on interfering. I’ll let everyone know the consequences of meddling in other people’s business.”","“You’re courting death!”","Blood King let out a furious roar. The aura from his entire body was released, almost tearing the sky apart. It was as if thousands of troops were galloping.","In an instant, the entire sky turned blood-red, covering everything. It was terrifying.","In terms of strength alone, Blood King was much stronger than Atela. It was an existence that ordinary people could not imagine.","The distant Luanyun experts were instantly swept by the blood-red aura. Immediately, they felt the killing intent in their hearts begin to boil. However, they immediately suppressed the killing intent in their hearts. After circulating their internal energy slightly, they returned to normal.","They were all extremely shocked. They were so far away, but just a mere sweep of the aura had affect their minds. If they were closer, they would probably be completely affected by Blood King’s aura.","“I finally understand why Blood King is known as invincible in group battles. No matter how many people go up, they’ll be nothing more than weaklings. Instead, they’ll be affected by his aura.”","Many people were terrified and retreated, not daring to move forward.","Boundless blood energy was released and became thicker and thicker. In the sky, countless blood-colored soldiers were formed. Each of these soldiers was wearing blood-colored battle clothes and holding blood-red battle spears. They were like an army as they rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","There was no need to doubt the terrifying might of an army galloping together.","“You dare to be impudent in front of me with your petty skills?”","Just as everyone was shocked by Blood King’s methods, they saw Chu Yunfan’s indifferent expression. He raised his right arm high. A ball of thunder power boiled around him, turning into a terrifying storm with his body as the center.","His divine power had completely transformed into the power of the heavenly thunder. It was extremely terrifying.","Behind him, countless blades, spears, swords, and halberds materialized, forming a wall of weapons. The dense number of heavenly weapons filled the sky, flashing with the light of thunder. It blinded everyone’s eyes.","Chu Yunfan waved his hand slightly, and countless thunder weapons swept toward the blood-red army in front of him at lightning speed. The countless thunder weapons formed a terrifying storm.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Massive explosions sounded out as the thunder weapons struck the blood-colored soldiers. The blood-colored soldiers were unable to resist and were blown up in the air.","Everyone saw that the defense line formed by these blood-colored soldiers instantly collapse. They were completely vulnerable."]},{"number":1347,"title":"Chapter 1347 The Son of Hells","paragraphs":["1347 The Son of Hells","Rumble!","A series of thunderclaps turned into a terrifying sound wave that spread in all directions.","The crowd saw that the bloody army could not withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan’s weapons formed from thunder. The army was blown up in mid-air and the weapons swept toward Blood King.","At this moment, a gorgeous armor appeared around Blood King’s body. These thunder weapons landed on his body one after another.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","A series of violent explosions drowned the area.","“Is the battle about to end?”","Many people gulped. The series of battles was too terrifying.","Whether it was Blood King or Chu Yunfan, it was clear that numbers were meaningless in front of them. Whether it was 1,000 or 10,000, they could easily kill them.","Experts of this level were like nuclear weapons in the Spirit Realm. There was no doubt that there was only one way to deal with them, and that was to have experts of the same level. Otherwise, there was no way to resist.","At this moment, an even more terrifying blood energy tore apart the thunder and swept away the surrounding thunder power.","Blood King’s stern voice sounded, “Chu Yunfan, you’re indeed amazing, but you’re still far from being able to go against me. Now, I’ll let you see why I’m called Blood King!”","Following this loud roar, a blood-colored figure rushed out of the energy tide. Everyone saw that it was a figure wearing an emperor’s robe. There was a faint supreme majesty in it.","“Martial intent! It’s martial intent!”","Someone had already figured out what it was.","Then, they saw the bloody figure punch at Chu Yunfan.","“The Sons of Hell ”","This punch carried the supreme majesty of an emperor. In an instant, it tore through the sky and smashed fiercely toward Chu Yunfan.","This punch shattered everything. The clouds in the sky were punched through by him. Just one punch was more powerful than Chu Yunfan’s body.","“It has appeared. It is indeed the famous ultimate technique of Blood King, the Sons of Hell!”","Blood King had been running amok in Great Wei for many years. His famous ultimate skill was no secret. Sons of Hell was a supreme fist technique. The fist intent could evolve into the legendary king of Hell.","It was a set of supreme ultimate techniques. In Great Wei, there was once a unique skill ranking, and the Sons of Hell technique was on it. Moreover, it was a powerful ultimate technique that was ranked in the top five.","Countless people wanted to learn it, but unfortunately, Blood King did not accept disciples on a large scale. Many people had only heard of the technique and had never seen the power of the Sons of Hell.","Now that they had seen it, it was indeed as terrifying as the rumors said. No, it should be said that it was much more terrifying than the rumors.","Clang!","The punch landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, and a sinister smile appeared on Blood King’s face. This time, even if Chu Yunfan didn’t die, he would be severely injured.","However, to everyone’s surprise, the punch landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but it did not send him flying. It only exploded with a sound like the sound of metal clashing.","It was as if he had used all his strength to smash into a piece of iron.","“How is this possible?!”","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. They saw Chu Yunfan standing, still as a rock, and taking the blow that was bigger than his body.","“Impossible! Die!” Blood King roared. The huge blood-red figure suddenly exerted more strength, and the power attached to its fist increased by leaps.","His divine power was burning, instantly turning into a terrifying attack.","Boom!","An even more terrifying explosion erupted around Chu Yunfan’s body, but it still could not shake him.","“No, the attack didn’t even hit Chu Yunfan!”","Everyone saw that the fist, whom everyone thought had hit Chu Yunfan, had in fact, not touched him at all. The fist was an inch in front Chu Yunfan’s body, but it was blocked by a jade-like layer of energy force that was around Chu Yunfan.","“It’s a energy shield. What kind of cultivation technique does Chu Yunfan cultivate? It’s just an energy shield, yet it can block Blood King’s attack!” someone gasped.","They discovered a shocking fact. In Great Wei, even Yun Huang did not dare to say that he would dare to take on Blood King’s attack without moving.","The terrifying power of this punch caused an explosion that caused mountains to collapse and the earth to crack. The sun and moon lost their light!","Who knew how many powerful enemies Blood King had killed. But now, it was useless against Chu Yunfan.","“Blood King, is this the technique you’re famous for? It’s so weak!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","This set of martial arts was extremely impressive. Generally speaking, the more powerful the thing manifested in the martial will, the more impressive this set of unique skills would be.","It could not be said that this Sons of Heaven was not powerful. Opponents of the same level would surely be swept away.","For example, if Atela were to face this punch, he would probably be instantly defeated. But when he met Chu Yunfan, it was as if he had met his nemesis.","The greatest power of the Sons of Hell was actually not the fist force, but the martial intent hidden within the fist force. It could invade the human brain, causing illusions and even death.","Unfortunately, Blood King had met Chu Yunfan.","When this martial intent invaded Chu Yunfan’s mind, it was absorbed by the godhead in Chu Yunfan’s mind. It did not affect him in the slightest. Moreover, his willpower was firm, so how could he be easily affected by this fist intent?","“Impossible! How are you not affected?!” Blood King’s expression turned pale.","However, his expression immediately darkened again. The blood energy in his entire body burned, and an even more terrifying attack was prepared.","Boom!","The divine power of the Core Stage spread out, turning into a terrifying fluctuation that swept across Sierra Luanyun. Even the ground trembled slightly, with a power that could overturn the world.","Swish!","Blood King stomped on the ground and turned into a streak of blood-red energy. He appeared in front of Chu Yunfan and a palace appeared above his head."]},{"number":1348,"title":"Chapter 1348 Beating up Blood King","paragraphs":["1348 Beating up Blood King","This huge palace emitted boundless blood energy as if it had just been fished out of a pool of blood.","There were two words written on the palace—Hell Palace.","The words contained a sense of ferocity.","The Hell Palace pressed down. It was a spirit weapon. Although it was only a low-grade spirit weapon, it possessed great power. It was not something that a magic weapon could compare to.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, the Hell Palace was about to land on Chu Yunfan’s body. Suddenly, an extremely evil flame burned on Chu Yunfan’s body and turned into a blood-red skeleton, blocking the Hell Palace.","That was the Demon Descends Illustration. At the critical moment, it automatically protected its master.","After Chu Yunfan’s years of continuous refinement and transformation, the illustration had advanced from a magic tool to a spirit tool. For a moment, it erupted with extremely shocking light and ripples.","Many experts in Luanyun were shocked. They knew how powerful Blood King was, but they didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to be as powerful as him. No wonder Chu Yunfan was so confident that he dared to attack Blood King","With Chu Yunfan’s terrifying strength, not to mention the future, even now, there were not many people who could stand shoulder to shoulder with him.","Not only was everyone shocked by Chu Yunfan’s strength, but even Blood King was. All of his methods were useless against Chu Yunfan. Who the hell knew how Chu Yunfan had such powerful physical cultivation?","For a physique cultivator to be able to cultivate to this level, it was truly terrifyingly powerful.","“Chu Yunfan!” Blood King roared. The blood-colored flames on his body burned. His divine power was burning as if it was a real flame, displaying unparalleled power.","All of Blood King’s comprehension of martial arts was also manifested in this arrogant aura. Everyone even had a feeling that he alone could pacify the world.","When this kind of expert was angry, he could easily kill millions of people.","In an instant, Blood King attacked once again. His wide palm condensed into a fist. A powerful aura that covered the sky and earth condensed and pervaded the air. It transformed into a terrifying phantom in the sky. It was Sons of Hell.","Every hair of this figure was formed from countless divine power.","This punch was so powerful that Chu Yunfan felt like he couldn’t dodge it.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan, who had been motionless all this while, began to move.","“I’ve already experienced your fist technique just now. Now, I’ll let you see my fist technique!”","With a swoosh, Chu Yunfan took a step forward and crossed the distance. He rushed in front of Blood King and then punched out. This punch instantly turned into a golden asura behind him.","The fist force turned into a golden light that streaked across the sky.","Boom!","The fist force instantly tore apart the Son of Hell that Blood King had sent out.","The Son of Hell was defeated in an instant, unable to withstand Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s fist did not lose its momentum and hit Blood King’s body.","Blood King let out a muffled groan as he was sent flying backward. An armor appeared on his body and protected him. Fortunately, he had this armor. Otherwise, his chest would have been smashed into a bloody mess by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","But even so, he did not feel good. He felt that his breath was stuck in his throat and he could not breathe.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan had already arrived in front of Blood King. He was like a shadow, and he had no intention of letting the Blood King escape.","“Another punch!”","Chu Yunfan turned into a golden light. Under the golden light was a golden roc. This golden roc traversed the sky and instantly collided with Blood King.","Bam!","Blood King, who was caught off guard, was directly hit.","From afar, everyone could only see that Chu Yunfan seemed to have activated his beating mode and completely beat up Blood King. Chu Yunfan’s speed was so fast that they couldn’t even see his movements clearly.","Especially after Chu Yunfan performed the Asura Fist, his speed reached a whole new level. Even a Core could not keep up with Chu Yunfan’s speed, let alone these Divines and half-step Cores.","They couldn’t see clearly. They could only see Chu Yunfan’s body turn into a golden light. Because he was too fast, new light was produced, and the old light hadn’t dissipated yet. These dense lights interweaved into a dense network in the air.","Each of these attacks could split mountains and rocks, let alone so many of them landing on one person.","Blood King let out a miserable cry as he was sent flying. The armor on his body was instantly shattered.","In a short period of time, the armor on his body had suffered many attacks from Chu Yunfan and exploded on the spot.","Spurt!","Blood King spat out a mouthful of blood. Although most of the attack was absorbed by his armor, the remaining part was still extremely terrifying. He felt as though several of his ribs had been broken.","What was even more terrifying was that Chu Yunfan’s speed was so fast that it was impossible to guard against him. The power of each of his punches was extremely terrifying. Without the protection of the armor, he would probably die without a burial place.","Shock flickered in his eyes. He had never expected that he would be forced into such a state one day, and he was unable to retaliate.","Chu Yunfan’s strength was so terrifying. Blood King was clearly already at the peak of the late Void Core Stage, but the strength that Chu Yunfan displayed was able to suppress him.","Was Chu Yunfan even human?","What made Blood King even more resentful was that he was just a little bit away from breaking through. At that time, Chu Yunfan would be no match for him, but Chu Yunfan didn’t give him the chance.","In the distance, Chu Yunfan slowly walked over. He seemed slow but was actually fast. In a moment, he had already charged toward Blood King without any pause.","“Chu Yunfan, you forced me to do this! Even if I die today, you have to die with me!” Blood King roared in rage. The divine power on his body suddenly began to burn, and the aura of his entire body increased by another level."]},{"number":1349,"title":"Chapter 1349 Killing Blood King","paragraphs":["1349 Killing Blood King","After being forced into a dead end, Blood King could only erupt.","He had to use his true strength.","Blood King was forced to unleash all of its strength. His entire body suddenly grew by a level.","Blood King, who was originally of medium build, looked a little oppressive at this moment. All the mana in his body began to boil, and it even surpassed the peak of the ordinary late Void Core Stage.","“This was the divine power that I used to break through to the peak Void Core Stage, but now you forced it out. Now, you have to use your death to atone for your sins.”","Blood King enunciated each word as Chu Yunfan forced him to reveal his trump card. He was using a secret technique to store his divine power until now.","One had to know that everyone’s body was like a water tank. Before the capacity was expanded, there would be a limit. When the divine power was full, it would not increase further. Even if it increased, it would be lost.","If one’s cultivation increased too much in a short time, it would cause the physical body to collapse. This was the same for anyone.","This included Blood King, but his limits were far beyond the imagination of ordinary people. Ordinary people’s limits were meaningless to him. Therefore, this was the manas that he had stored using a secret technique. He had stored them for many years so that he could successfully break through to the peak Void Core Stage in one go.","Who knew that it would be used here instead of during his breakthrough?","Blood King was burning with rage when he thought about how he had lost such a great opportunity. This kind of opportunity was not something that could be obtained easily. If he wanted to break through again, he would have to wait at least a few years, or even ten years. And all of this was because of Chu Yunfan.","His eyes were filled with terrifying killing intent. However, he had never thought that if he hadn’t been so aggressive, the situation wouldn’t have developed to this point.","Boom!","Blood King made his move. With just a slight movement, blood-red energy instantly filled the sky, filling the world and transforming into a Hell Son. However, compared to the previous Hell Son, this one was clearly much stronger.","Although his aura had only increased by a little, for an expert of their level, any increase would be an unimaginable increase. It would be the last straw that broke the camel’s back.","This was Blood King’s true trump card.","Chu Yunfan’s face finally revealed a somewhat solemn expression. Blood King’s strength had indeed increased by a lot, especially in this explosive state. Ordinary late Void Cores could not withstand a few of his moves.","For example, if Atela encountered Blood King in such a bloodthirsty and crazy state, he would not even be able to withstand 20 moves and would be seriously injured. If he could not escape, Blood King would probably kill him on the spot.","For experts at their level, unless they encountered a monster like Chu Yunfan, it was easy to determine the winner, but it was not so easy to determine life and death.","As soon as the huge figure appeared, it pressed down on Chu Yunfan. The Hell Son killed all powerful enemies.","“So you’re hiding such a trump card. No wonder you’re so arrogant. You want to kill me? I want to see how you’re going to do it!”","Although Blood King’s strength had increased by a lot, Chu Yunfan was not afraid. However, compared to before, Blood King finally gave him a sense of threat, although it was only limited to the increase in his strength.","Boom!","An asure appeared behind Chu Yunfan and tore apart the Hell Son that Blood King had transformed into.","“You’re trying to block me?!” Blood King roared and punched out again. It was another huge Hell Son.","At this moment, his divine power had increased greatly, and he could continuously blast out powerful Hell Sons. It was completely different from before.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at his attack. He swept out his hands and tore the Hell Sons apart.","“You’re sweeping away my attacks with just your sleeve?!”","Blood King let out a series of roars as he stepped on the heaven and earth, continuously throwing out Hell Sons. Every punch shook the entire sierra. However, Chu Yunfan blocked all his attacks, and he was unable to pose a great threat to Chu Yunfan.","“Impossible! How are you stronger than me?!”","Blood King kept roaring as if he couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan was stronger than him. He had already given it his all. How could Chu Yunfan be stronger than him?","Blood King opened his mouth and a terrifying blood-red light shot out from it. It turned into a terrifying torrent that swept toward Chu Yunfan, wanting to drown him completely.","When many people saw this scene, they felt their breath freeze in their lungs, especially those in the direction where the blood-red light swept toward.","Everyone hastily retreated and set up barriers one after another, but they were still frightened. They had a feeling that if they were swept by this blood-red light, they could be said to be dead for sure. There was no possibility of survival.","“Break!” Chu Yunfan shouted and stretched out his hand, forming a giant hand of spirit energy. It expanded with the wind and grabbed the blood-red energy in his hand, crushing it inch by inch.","This terrifying blood-red energy could not pose a threat to Chu Yunfan. This instantly caused the Luanyun experts who were watching the battle from afar to heave a sigh of relief.","Then, after Chu Yunfan crushed the blood-red light with a palm, he rushed toward Blood King with lightning speed. With a backhand, he threw a punch at Blood King.","Boom!","With a loud explosion, everyone heard Blood King let out a muffled groan as he spat out a mouthful of blood. His entire body was like a kite with a broken string.","However, Chu Yunfan did not stop. In the blink of an eye, he had caught up to Blood King and punched down fiercely.","Blood King spat out a mouthful of blood. His entire body was like a deflated balloon, and all the power in his body was rapidly being drained. He was holding his breath and forcefully improving himself, but he was destroyed by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","Now, he had suffered the backlash of forcefully increasing his cultivation. His entire body was exploding, and blood was spurting out.","Blood King was still struggling, but Chu Yunfan took a step forward. The power of thunder condensed into a blade and slashed down.","Slice!","Blood King’s head was chopped off, and he died instantly."]},{"number":1350,"title":"Chapter 1350 Shaking Great Wei","paragraphs":["1350 Shaking Great Wei","As soon as Blood King died, his entire body exploded. His blood essence erupted. His body could not withstand so much divine power in the first place. It was just that he had forcefully suppressed it.","Now, he died tragically as his divine power had completely exploded.","The blood essence that filled the sky was immediately absorbed by Chu Yunfan into the Mountain River Diagram to water the Brahma Tree.","The Luanyun experts were unable to react to this scene for a long time.","“Blood King is really dead... Dead!”","“Two! Chu Yunfan has already killed two of the five great experts of the empire. Is he going to kill all of them?”","“This is too terrifying. Blood King has been suppressed by Chu Yunfan from the beginning to the end.”","“I’ve never seen such a terrifying expert. He can’t be an expert at the peak Void Core Stage, right?”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. However, the death of Blood King was undoubtedly a shock to Luanyun.","At this moment, there were many people who had just received the news and were directly teleported to Luanyun from all over the world. Although the cost was not cheap, it was worth it in order to be able to catch up with this battle of the century.","Who knew that when they arrived, it was already a mess. Blood King had already been killed by Chu Yunfan, along with his disciples and confidants. They did not even see the aftermath of the final battle.","By the time they arrived, Chu Yunfan had already left. However, just from the aftermath of the battle, they knew how shocking the battle was. There were even remnants of energy in the air.","Very soon, they learned about that earth-shattering battle from the Luanyun experts. It was truly shocking.","Chu Yunfan had penetrated the defensive barrier of Luanyun Valley with his own strength, killed many experts in the valley with a single strike, and then suppressed Blood King. In the end, even Blood King who had erupted was still killed by Chu Yunfan.","Many people couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air. They were even a little numb. How many times had Chu Yunfan ruthlessly exceeded their expectations? They couldn’t even remember.","It seemed that from the moment they knew about Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan had been surprising them one after another. Layers of encirclement and layers of encirclement failed to kill Chu Yunfan.","Now that even Blood King had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, everyone realized that Chu Yunfan’s rise was inevitable. There were only three people in the world who could meet Blood King, and none of them dared to say that they could take down Chu Yunfan with a hundred percent certainty.","Even Yun Huang, which was ranked number one, probably did not have such a hundred percent confidence. And if he couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan in one strike, then he would have to face Chu Yunfan’s endless revenge.","In the eyes of many people, after this incident, Chu Yunfan’s rise would be unstoppable. No one would have to go against him for the sake of Blood King. Marquis Zhongxin’s residence and Chu Yunfan would definitely become a colossus in the southern part of Great Wei.","Not long after Chu Yunfan left, this news spread like wildfire to Great Wei. Almost overnight, the news of Chu Yunfan killing Blood King became the biggest news in Great Wei.","At the same time, all the major factions were in an uproar. Chu Yunfan had killed two of the top five experts of Great Wei in one go. The so-called battle in three months seemed to have become a joke.","Chu Yunfan’s combat strength shocked the entire country, and the major forces once again refreshed their understanding of Chu Yunfan’s strength. In the current world, it was almost impossible to find an opponent. He was terrifyingly powerful.","Many people were not only surprised by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing combat strength but also by his ruthlessness. Many of them thought that Chu Yunfan would wait for Blood King to come out of seclusion before making a move. In many people’s eyes, it was already good enough for Chu Yunfan to survive Blood King.","After all, he was still young. It was not a big deal for him to endure humiliation for a while. He would definitely be even more powerful in the future.","After burying his head for ten years, he would be able to raise his head and meet Blood King.","That was what everyone thought. Ten years was just a snap of a finger for Chu Yunfan’s age.","At that time, Chu Yunfan would come out of seclusion, and he would be one of the top people in the world. It would be impossible for Blood King to suppress Chu Yunfan again. In another 20 years, even Blood King would not be Chu Yunfan’s match.","Therefore, in the eyes of many people, this was definitely worth it.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would not wait until that time and would go straight to Blood King and kill him?","This not only revealed Chu Yunfan’s extraordinary strength but also his ruthless and decisive side.","If Blood King had already broken through, then what awaited Chu Yunfan would be a fierce battle. It was unknown if Chu Yunfan could even escape unscathed.","However, Chu Yunfan still did it. His determination was rare in the world.","They didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had absolute confidence in protecting himself, which was why he went to Blood King. In their opinion, Chu Yunfan was gambling, and it was obvious that Chu Yunfan had won.","Without the deterrence of Blood King, the Chu clan’s takeover in the south of Great Wei was like a raging fire—like a snake swallowing an elephant. If it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan’s support, the Chu clan would have been stuffed.","***","Imperial City, the second prince’s residence.","When the second prince heard that Blood King had also died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, he was shocked and furious.","First, it was Atela, then Blood King. Chu Yunfan rose at a speed that was unimaginable to ordinary people. In fact, the speed of his rise far exceeded everyone’s imagination.","“Chu Yunfan must die!” the second prince roared.","As long as Chu Yunfan was alive, he would not be able to sleep or eat in peace. There was no doubt that he was a petty person, but Chu Yunfan was also someone who would take revenge.","Atela wanted to kill him, but Chu Yunfan had killed him instead. Blood King claimed to want to kill him, but Chu Yunfan killed him too.","Once such a person made up his mind, he would be extremely terrifying.","Now that Chu Yunfan had taken care of Blood King, he would definitely find time to find trouble with the second prince. Now was the most critical time to fight for the throne.","The second prince’s subordinates would probably panic. After all, they followed him for the sake of the dragon, not to seek death.","“I have to find a way to kill him!”"]},{"number":1351,"title":"Chapter 1351 A Conflict Rises to the Surface","paragraphs":["1351 A Conflict Rises to the Surface","The second prince gritted his teeth, his expression extremely ferocious.","Mi Siyuan was dead, and his biggest supporter among the people had also been uprooted by Chu Yunfan. However, he still had Blood King. He had paid an unknown price to finally persuade Blood King to support him.","Who knew that Blood King would be so vulnerable and die so easily at Chu Yunfan’s hands?","After the death of Blood King, it was almost impossible to find a supporter of this level in Great Wei.","Blood King and Mi Siyuan were two of the five great experts of Great Wei. They were the best of the best in the Core Stage in terms of strength and influence. Without the support of such top experts, his foundation in the Imperial Court would be unstable. Everything he had now was like drifting with the wind and could disappear at any time.","And all of this was caused by Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan, even if I die, I won’t let you have it easy!”","The matter of Chu Yunfan killing Blood King was brewing in Great Wei. The waves it caused had even exceeded Chu Yunfan’s initial expectations.","Chu Yunfan was not a native of Great Wei, so he did not know how much influence the five great experts of Great Wei had on its people.","Of course, there were more than a few Cores in the vast Great Wei. However, only a few people could stand out among them. The most well-known existence was these five experts.","Although the five great experts had also changed, just like how Mi Siyuan had taken over the title of one of the five great experts from the previous Great Formless sect master, however, there had never been a time like this.","In just a short period, two of the top five experts had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","According to Chu Yunfan’s unbending character, if anyone else provoked him, he would kill them.","This terrified many people. Chu Yunfan might even kill his way up and turn the entire Great Wei upside down.","Especially now, Chu Yunfan had blatantly killed the deputy chairman of the council. As the chairman of the council and the number one expert in the world, wouldn’t Yun Huang have any reaction?","And if Yun Huang wanted to make a move on Chu Yunfan, then based on Chu Yunfan’s performance, they would have to use force to fight force.","Under such circumstances, the entire Great Wei would probably be turned upside down.","Regarding this, some people were happy, and some were worried. Those who did not like Chu Yunfan naturally hoped that Yun Huang would make a move to suppress Chu Yunfan’s current arrogance. However, for many people, they did not wish for such a situation to happen.","For a moment, the entire Great Wei was in turmoil. It was as if everyone’s gaze was focused on the small Conglong.","The scouts of the various large factions arrived at Conglong one after another. In their eyes, there was no doubt that Conglong would become the gathering place of Great Wei for a long time in the future.","However, very quickly, a piece of news spread throughout the entire Great Wei overnight.","The person who had instigated Atela and Blood King to find trouble with Chu Yunfan was none other than the country’s second prince.","For a time, this news caused a huge uproar.","Many forces knew that there had been a force plotting against Chu Yunfan. This was something that everyone could see. From the fact that Atela dared to swagger into Great Wei, it was already very clear.","Someone was letting them through from behind.","Some people were very clear about this force, but most people were not very clear. There were not many forces that were so high-end that they could easily know these secrets.","But now, this piece of news had brought the up undercurrent under the surface. At the same time, it also brought the conflict between the second prince and Chu Yunfan to the public for the first time.","In the beginning, many people’s first reaction was that it was impossible, but soon, they understood. The reason was not difficult to guess. Mi Siyuan was the second prince’s greatest power, and now that Mi Siyuan was dead, the Great Formless Sect was also uprooted by Chu Yunfan, and all of them died overnight.","If one were to ask who had suffered the greatest loss, it was undoubtedly the second prince. It was not surprising that he would take revenge.","However, what was really surprising was that the second prince had taken out such a huge amount of money. It could be said that it was very shocking, but in the end, he still could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","Atela and the others were killed by Chu Yunfan in one fell swoop, making Chu Yunfan a hero of Great Wei. Then, Chu Yunfan killed Blood King.","He had completely uproot all the forces that the second prince could influence.","This time, the second prince had suffered a great loss. The damage this time might not even be able to be made up for in the next ten or twenty years. The loss of conventional forces was not great, but high-end supporters like Mi Siyuan and Blood King were not often found.","Experts of this level either supported the other princes or expressed their neutrality and would not participate in the prince’s fight for the throne.","The deaths of Mi Siyuan and Blood King could be said to have caused the second prince’s faction to collapse and be on the verge of death.","Without the support of a top-notch expert, even if the emperor of Great Wei intended to pass the throne to the second prince, he would have to think twice. After all, if the throne was passed to a prince who was unpopular, Great Wei might be thrown into chaos.","It could be said that Chu Yunfan’s killing of Blood King was a death sentence for the second prince’s faction.","It was not without reason that such a top Core could influence Great Wei’s Imperial Court and was known to be able to cover the sky with one hand. Even if the second prince could find the support of other Cores, it would be difficult for him to compare with the influence brought by Mi Siyuan and Blood King.","Not to mention, the second prince had established a strong enemy like Chu Yunfan.","Everyone could imagine that as long as Chu Yunfan didn’t die, he would be able to become number one in the world within thirty years, or even twenty years. No one knew how far he could go in the future.","After offending such a powerful enemy, even those Cores might not dare to help the second prince anymore. After all, they had already learned from Mi Siyuan’s and Blood King’s mistakes.","Unless they were courting death, they would definitely not make such a choice.","For a time, Great Wei was in an uproar."]},{"number":1352,"title":"Chapter 1352 The Imperial Court Bows It Head","paragraphs":["1352 The Imperial Court Bows It Head","This time, many truly understood how much influence a top-notch expert could have on the Imperial Court. It was also the focus of most people’s attention. After all, although Chu Yunfan beat the second prince badly, he still represented Great Wei.","Besides the mighty Imperial Guardians and the number one guardian of the imperial family, there were also top-notch experts like General Ye Fei in the hands of Great Wei. They were almost above the Core Council regarding strength.","Undoubtedly, Great Wei would not allow Chu Yunfan to kill the second prince, no matter what. After all, it was related to the face of the Great Wei’s Imperial Court.","Chu Yunfan’s threatening rise and reckless killing intent had already terrified the Imperial Court. Therefore, the Imperial Court would never give in. Still, he probably would not let the matter rest judging from Chu Yunfan’s style of doing things. In everyone’s eyes, not even Mi Siyuan, Atela, or even the powerful Blood King could deal with him.","Chu Yunfan’s best option was to avoid the attack. However, he did not have such thoughts as he was decisive and ruthless. He had even said he would not let the mastermind off the hook. It would not be easy to make him back down.","Someone reacted almost immediately. Although they did not know who spread the news, there was no doubt they wanted to expose the conflict between Chu Yunfan and Great Wei.","Both sides could still have a way out if the matter were not exposed, but everything had become public. The contradiction between the two sides appeared before everyone, forcing both sides to become stubborn.","Someone wanted to use Chu Yunfan to kill the second prince or use Great Wei’s power to kill Chu Yunfan. No matter which it was, it was apparent they had ulterior motives. However, neither side seemed to be willing to bow. Everyone awaited the final showdown. Chu Yunfan’s attitude would determine whether or not the two sides would have a collision of the century.","Although Chu Yunfan seemed to be alone and only Marquis Zhongxin’s residence might stand on his side on this issue, Chu Yunfan was already the most significant deterrent. None could underestimate him. Even the Imperial Court had to treat him seriously as long as he was around.","This was extremely difficult for the various significant forces in the south of Great Wei. If this matter had not been exposed, they could have chosen to cooperate with Marquis Zhongxin without any obstacles and curry favor with Chu Yunfan.","Still, everyone had no choice but to overthink after Chu Yunfan unexpectedly killed several powerful enemies in succession. Moreover, the last behemoth to appear was the Imperial Court.","The power of Great Wei was even more terrifying than all the powerful enemies Chu Yunfan had killed before. If Chu Yunfan refused to bow, it would be a life-and-death struggle. No matter which side they joined, it would not be the most suitable choice.","The entire situation remained strangely calm momentarily. Everyone thought the situation was about to break out when news came from the Imperial Capital. The emperor of Great Wei had proclaimed to imprison the second prince for five years.","Great Wei was in an immediate uproar about the news. No one expected the final result to end up like that. They thought the Imperial Court would never give in but it ultimately did.","Although the Imperial Court said nothing, everyone knew it was trying to show goodwill to Chu Yunfan by facing the wall and imprisoning the second prince. Though the second prince’s faction was strong, it had no leader now. The other prince’s forces would probably devour them five years later. This also indirectly indicated the Imperial Court’s intention.","They were unwilling to have direct contact with Chu Yunfan. After all, someone with ill intentions would take advantage of them if that happened. That was something neither Chu Yunfan nor Great Wei was willing to face.","While everyone was unaware, a secret ambassador from Great Wei had snuck into Marquis Zhongxin’s residence.","Chu Yunfan wore a black robe as he sat opposite the director in the residence’s back garden. The former repeatedly performed hand seals, producing waves of divine power that surged into the director’s head.","The director felt his internal injury healing. His chronic illness had plagued him for many years. He could never cure it even if he suppressed it with his potent cultivation. He was almost in despair and did not think there was hope for a cure.","Chu Yunfan retracted his power after a long while and sighed. Then he said, “I’ve treated most of your injury. I’ll give you a prescription for the rest. You can take this medicine according to the prescription. You’ll recover fully after half a year. You can enter the Core Stage by then.”","The director opposite Chu Yunfan revealed an excited expression despite himself. Finally, he had a chance to break through. With his accumulated cultivation over the years, he would have been in the Core Stage long ago without this hidden injury. Now that Chu Yunfan had healed him, it was equivalent to giving him a new life.","Even though Chu Yunfan did it to repay him for the information he had supplied about Blood King, the latter knew that a piece of information from Blood King was not worth Chu Yunfan’s help. Although it was a piece of cake for Chu Yunfan, it was a matter of life and death for him.","“Thank you for your help, Master Chu!” the director hurriedly said.","Chu Yunfan looked at the director with a faint smile and said, “It’s what I promised you. It’s nothing much. However, you didn’t come here just for this, right? Tell me, what did the Imperial Court say?”","“Master Chu, I’m here on the Imperial Court’s behalf. His Majesty already knows about the matter between you and the second prince. His Majesty hopes you can let the second prince go,” the director slowly said."]},{"number":1353,"title":"Chapter 1353 The Imperial Court’s Compensation","paragraphs":["1353 The Imperial Court’s Compensation","Chu Yunfan glanced at the director and said, “Why should I? Or rather, do you think I’ll chase after him?”","The director glanced at Chu Yunfan and said, “Master Chu, you should understand the agency has already collected much information. Our analysts say you won’t let it go so easily.”","The director spoke bluntly as these were not secrets. No matter which Core was born, the agency would collect much information about them. It was just that the agency would have kept its eyes on ordinary people long ago, unlike Chu Yunfan, who appeared without warning.","According to the information they had received, Chu Yunfan was narrow-minded and would not be generous enough to let go of an enemy who had framed him. He would repay both kindness and revenge.","Even the Imperial Court found such a person troublesome. This time, it unprecedentedly lowered its head. This was beyond everyone’s expectations. The Imperial Court had ever only acquiesced in the face of a colossus like the Core Council and had lowered its head.","Chu Yunfan took the initiative to deal with the second prince because the latter had caused trouble everywhere and provoked a monster like Chu Yunfan. The second prince also wanted Chu Yunfan to bow.","That was out of everyone’s expectations, even the director’s. He knew the emperor’s character well. The emperor had grown accustomed to being domineering, and no one could make him lower his head.","Chu Yunfan was the first to make the emperor bow since the latter overtook power. Although Chu Yunfan was formidable in ordinary people’s eyes, the First Guardian of the imperial family and General Ye Fei should be above Chu Yunfan. They would not lower their heads to Chu Yunfan. At most, they tacitly agreed to this matter and waited for things to calm down.","However, the director finally understood why. It was primarily because Chu Yunfan’s method of uprooting the Great Formless Sect was too shocking. Although he did not know what magic weapon Chu Yunfan used, it was undoubtedly one that even a Core could not resist.","Once the explosion swept them, they would almost certainly die. If Chu Yunfan used such a magic weapon to bombard the Imperial Capital, it would probably raze it to the ground. That was the reason why they feared Chu Yunfan.","It was insufficient for Chu Yunfan alone to make the Imperial Court afraid or even lower their heads. However, the Imperial Court would have no choice but to bow and give in if a nuclear bomb was added to the equation. They did not want to force Chu Yunfan into a corner. If such a thing happened, it would end in a life-and-death situation. They did not want to pay such a huge price.","Chu Yunfan quickly understood what the Imperial Court feared. He smiled over using the nuclear bomb to scare others. Now that he had achieved this effect, he knew his previous choice was correct. Otherwise, he would have used hundreds of nuclear bombs to deal with the Great Formless sect. After all, he could decide whether or not to kill the Great Formless Sect’s ordinary people.","“There’s a chance I can let him go, but what benefits can you offer?” Chu Yunfan smiled.","He intended to kill the second prince, whom he had never met, but he was not hard up about it. The second prince resembled a stay dog to him. Without Mi Siyuan and Blood King’s support, others would swallow up the second prince’s power sooner or later. To kill or not to kill was just a matter of words. Hence, it would be best if Chu Yunfan could use it to exchange for good benefits.","“The Imperial Court will tacitly acknowledge the influence your residence has on the south of Great Wei. They will be allowed to take over all the connections and benefits of the Great Formless Sect,” the director slowly said.","Chu Yunfan responded lightly, “That’s the spoils of war I deserve. You can’t move me with this alone.”","The director exclaimed, “Don’t be too aggressive, Master Chu. It’s not good for you to force the Imperial Court like that.”","Chu Yunfan replied, “What’s wrong with that? I’ll just leave if you force me into a corner.”","“Y-You...” Chu Yunfan’s words choked the director. After a long while, the latter finally said, “As far as I know, you have yet to enter the Core Stage, Master Chu.”","“You’re right. But how does that affect the state of the human body?” Chu Yunfan asked lightly. Increasing numbers of people knew he was not in the core stage the more he attacked. No one was foolish and knew there was a difference between Divine and Core techniques.","The director knew about this but did not know what to say when he saw Chu Yunfan readily admitting it. “Of course not, but it mustn’t be easy if you want to enter the Core Stage.”","The director was almost unbeatable in the Divine Ability Stage, like Chu Yunfan. Naturally, it was more challenging for him to advance further than ordinary people.","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes, saying, “What are you trying to say? Speak your mind.”","The director replied, “Do you know about Spirit Spring Water, Master Chu?”","“Spirit Spring Water? You have some?” Chu Yunfan immediately widened his eyes because he found its records in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","Spirit Spring Water was rare spring water that was versatile. If he used it to concoct pills, he could improve the quality of pills by a considerable level. If one used it to assist cultivation, it would significantly increase one’s cultivation speed. Most importantly, the Spirit Spring Water could release one’s full potential.","Chu Yunfan had already reached the ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage but had to reach the peak if he wanted to take another step forward. He could only break through to the Core Stage by reaching the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage. He had to release all his body’s potential to reach the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage."]},{"number":1354,"title":"Chapter 1354 Finally Getting News of Tang Siyu","paragraphs":["1354 Finally Getting News of Tang Siyu","The Spirit Spring Water could release all the potential in one’s body. If that were the case, Chu Yunfan would not be so surprised. Spirit Spring Water could also increase one’s potential, which was rare.","Chu Yunfan knew of many treasures that could release potential. He even knew some pills could do it. Given time, he could reach the peak of Divine Abilities Stage. However, he had to delay it this time because collecting all those natural treasures was challenging.","Although one had limited potential, Spirit Spring Water could increase it. One’s achievements were directly related to one’s potential. After all, one’s achievements correlated with one’s potential. That potential was talent.","It resembled a thin person practicing boxing for ten years who could not withstand someone with infinite strength who had practiced boxing for only two months.","The path of martial arts mainly depended on talent. The more potent the talent, the stronger the potential, and the higher the limit one could reach. This talent was not only in comprehending martial arts but also in physical talent. Chu Yunfan could defeat Voids at the Divine Abilities Stage because he had both the Imperial and Thunderclap Physiques. His potential was much higher than ordinary people’s.","Even so, he had his limits. This Spirit Spring Water could further increase his potential and develop his strength. If he wanted to fight against more vigorous opponents in the future, he had to expand his upper limit further. And Spirit Spring Water was among the rarest things. A treasure of that level could tempt even Chu Yunfan.","“It seems you already know what Spirit Spring Water is, Master Chu,” the director hurriedly said, “We’re willing to provide ten drops of it as compensation if you’re willing to let the second prince go.”","Chu Yunfan pondered momentarily. To him, killing the second prince was a matter of words, but ten drops of Spirit Spring Water were extraordinary. He nodded after some thought. “All right, I’m willing to let him go if you’re willing to provide me with ten drops. Of course, the premise is that he doesn’t provoke me further.”","The director quickly grabbed a porcelain bottle from the void. Inside was none other than the Spirit Spring Water. Chu Yunfan opened the bottle in front of the director and looked inside. Indeed, it contained Spirit Spring Water. Although the former did not recognize it, he knew what it was due to the Alchemy Emperor’s memories.","Of course, Spirit Spring Water covered the sky and the earth, not such a pitiful ten drops of Spirit Spring Water. He probably would not even look at it if he were the Alchemy Emperor. However, it was a very precious thing to Chu Yunfan.","With these ten drops, it was only a matter of time before he cultivated the peak. He could even break through to the Void Core Stage in one go and condense a Void Core in his meridian. Then, his strength would have a massive increase.","The director recalled something then and said, “Oh, right. There’s one more thing. Didn’t you ask us to look for that girl named Tang Siyu? We already have a lead.”","“You have a lead?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes lit up as he spoke. “Where?”","The director took out a bracelet that wholly differed from the magic tools in Great Wei. It looked high-tech. Chu Yunfan quickly realized the bracelet was Tang Siyu’s terminal. No one else except her had such a terminal in the Spirit Realm. It seemed it was indeed a clue to finding Tang Siyu.","Chu Yunfan hurriedly took the terminal and looked at it. However, half of the terminal looked damaged as if a powerful external force had hit it. His expression turned sinister.","Everyone knew his and Tang Siyu’s terminals were unique. Unlike standard terminals, these were made of the most cutting-edge materials in the Federation. Divine Abilities Stage attacks could not cause any damage unless a Core ambushed them. Since half of Tang Siyu’s terminal was destroyed, one could imagine the wearer must have encountered a colossal battle.","“It seems like this item belongs to Miss Tang Siyu. The information we received is correct.” The director nodded.","“Where did you find this?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Here’s the name of the person in the outer regions,” the director said, “However, someone is still chasing after her. Several of our agency’s agents who have been lurking for over a hundred years have died to get this bracelet. Our intelligence network in Yunshan City has been uprooted.”","“Someone is chasing after us!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with cold, killing intent, and his breathing quickened. “I want to know who it is.”","Immediately after, the director and Chu Yunfan began discussing some of the outer realm’s forms. They knew the outer realm was different from Great Wei.","Great Wei was under the powerful rule of the Imperial Court. Even though it could not extend to all aspects of society, like the Federation, it was still a unified political power. However, a large area in the outer realm was no man’s land. Powerful sects or families ruled one or even several cities in such a place, forming separation. These forces were the kings and lawless in their respective territories.","As for Yunshan City, it was a neutral region."]},{"number":1355,"title":"Chapter 1355 Heading to the Outer Realms","paragraphs":["1355 Heading to the Outer Realms","Yunshan was a place that was not under the direct jurisdiction of any major force. However, it was supported by a powerful force. It was just that this place was more neutral than the direct forces of various sects and families. Anyone could come here.","However, if they wanted to act presumptuously here, they would suffer a blow from the city lord of Yunshan.","For many people in the outer realm, this was a very good trading point. They didn’t have to worry about being blackmailed by other forces. After all, no one dared to offend the city lord of Yunshan. And it was because anyone could come here that many experts from the outer realms gathered in Yunshan, forming an extremely prosperous town.","Many powerful people were willing to come here and spend money to enjoy benefits that could not be enjoyed elsewhere. It could be said that this was a region filled with slaughter and rarely seen peace.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood what kind of place this was. In the Federation, there were many places like this, but they were not as blatant. This was clearly a place where various countries, sects, and families could not interfere.","It was a place between Great Wei and Jinzhanghan.","“Yunshan City? Nine Stars Cult?” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. He hadn’t heard any news about Tang Siyu for more than a year. He didn’t expect her to be in the outer realm.","Originally, he thought that with Tang Siyu’s strength, she should be able to protect herself. Who knew that Tang Siyu would encounter the pursuit of Nine Stars? Moreover, from the degree of damage to the terminal, it was likely that the injury was not light. Otherwise, the bracelet would not have been damaged.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s killing intent boiled even more.","“Who is this Nine Stars?” Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes, and a cold killing intent flashed through his eyes.","“As far as we know, Nine Stars seems to be a very powerful cult in the outer realm. There are many experts in this cult, and they have more than one Core,” the director said, “However, their encampment is very far from Great Wei, so we don’t know much about them. We’ve only heard some rumors.”","Chu Yunfan narrowed his eyes. Nine Stars was clearly not a good entity. To be able to do well in a place like the outer realm, their strength must be extraordinary.","However, Chu Yunfan’s killing intent had already formed. Nine Stars would not be able to escape. However, he wasn’t in a hurry to deal with them, because he had to find Tang Siyu first. As for this damn Nine Stars Cult, it was only a matter of time before they were eradicated.","However, he was a little curious as to why Tang Siyu would provoke Nine Stars. What was the reason behind it?","“This is all we know,” the director said.","“I understand. Thank you for this,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Master Chu, don’t say that. I’m already very grateful that you helped me treat my internal injuries,” the director said. “Oh, I have a map of the outer realm here. If you want to go there, you’ll need it.”","As he spoke, the director handed over a map. This was a very detailed map, which marked many situations in the outer realm. There was also a faint light flashing on it. It was clear that it had been enhanced with divine power and was not easy to damage.","“Thank you so much.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“It’s our honor to be able to help you, Master Chu,” the director hurriedly said.","The director nodded and hurriedly left.","Chu Yunfan looked at the map. In a corner of the map, the location of Yunshan City had been marked. It was indeed very far from Great Wei. Even with Chu Yunfan’s speed, he would have to fly for a day and a night to get there.","One had to know that Chu Yunfan’s current flying speed was not the same as before. Even so, he still had to fly for a day and a night. One could imagine how fast he was flying.","However, when he thought of Tang Siyu’s possible misfortune, Chu Yunfan was already a little impatient. “Nine Stars, Tang Siyu better be fine, or I’ll make you beg for death,” he muttered coldly.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan couldn’t sit still anymore. He immediately called for Chu Yaowei. “Marquis, I will be leaving Great Wei for a time. During this period, if you encounter any problems or enemies that you can’t resolve, it is best to endure and wait for my return.”","If he couldn’t solve it with the fame he had built up during this period, then the matter would be very troublesome. At this time, if he were to fight head-on, the entire residence would suffer heavy losses.","“I understand, don’t worry.” Chu Yaowei nodded. He wasn’t a child, so he knew what to do.","After Chu Yunfan finished his instructions, he immediately flew in the direction of Yunshan without any hesitation. Not long after he left, all the scouts in Conglong were alerted. The news of his departure immediately spread throughout Great Wei.","No one knew where his destination was, but Chu Yunfan’s move shook the entire Great Wei. Especially those forces that were not on good terms with Chu Yunfan and Marquis Zhongxin’s residence, they became inexplicably nervous.","Half a day later, Chu Yunfan arrived at the border of Great Wei. This place was different from the kingdom. The northern border of Great Wei was a vast grassland that stretched as far as the eye could see. The sky was vast, and the wind blew through the grass, revealing cattle and sheep.","It was quite a majestic scene, like the lonely smoke in the desert and the sunset in the long river.","At the border of Great Wei, there was a very, very long city wall. It was the Great Wall. This Great Wall was different from the Great Wall on Earth. It was even taller.","Thanks to the strong bodies of the humans in the Spirit Realm, they were far stronger than the Chinese in the feudal era. The Great Wall they built was also very tall. It was built on flat ground and was dozens of meters tall. Looking up from the bottom, it was as if it towered into the clouds.","This Great Wall of Wei had been built a long, long time ago. Even now, Great Wei was still constantly strengthening it, blocking the invasion of powerful enemies from the north more than once or twice."]},{"number":1356,"title":"Chapter 1356 It Was a Trap From the Beginning","paragraphs":["1356 It Was a Trap From the Beginning","Because of this, the Great Wall had a very high status in the hearts of all the people of Great Wei. Chu Yunfan had only heard of it before and had never seen it before.","In the Federation, this kind of city wall could be said to be common. In fact, there were even more spectacular city walls with shocking defensive power throughout the Federation, but they were all made from the power of technology and machinery.","This magnificent building that was built purely by human power was different. It looked extremely majestic. There were many traces left behind by battles on the city walls. After countless years of polishing, only a few shallow traces were left. However, the traces still made everyone who saw it feel a surge of emotion.","Chu Yunfan was no exception. However, he had come here for something, so he only stayed for a while before flying toward the outer realm. After flying out of the borders of Great Wei, he was greeted by another scene.","On the vast grassland, countless monsters lurked. Although they were all low-level monsters, their numbers were extremely large. Tens of thousands of herbivorous monsters galloped across the grassland, followed by tens of thousands of carnivorous ones.","Apart from that, Chu Yunfan could also see through his divine will that there were many tribes standing on the ground. It was just that these tribes were far apart and lived by the grass.","According to the map, further in, there were even more forces. Families and sects had built cities and lived together, forming an extremely huge force. Because this was the area between Great Wei and Jinzhanghan, the two sides had become a no man’s land without large-scale military operations.","However, when Chu Yunfan was less than a thousand miles deep into the grassland, the surrounding environment suddenly changed. He did not know when, but the environment around him had changed, and it was no longer the appearance of the endless grassland. Everything was distorted, making it impossible for him to see clearly what it had become.","Chu Yunfan realized he had been ambushed!","He had not expected to be ambushed as soon as he entered the plains!","Chu Yunfan’s mind spun rapidly, and then he said, “Since it’s already come to this, why don’t you come out and meet me?”","As soon as he finished speaking, the void distorted. In the distance, an army of tens of thousands of people appeared. This army was all elites dressed in nomadic clothes. They held long spears and surrounded Chu Yunfan.","These tens of thousands of people were all experts above the Innate Stage, and there were even thousands of experts above the Divine Abilities Stage. In other words, the leader of this army was a Divine.","Even in Jinzhanghan, such a troop would be the best of the best, the trump card of the trump cards. They would not be used casually. And once used, it was usually to gnaw at the hardest bone.","This army was moving, but they did not make any sound other than the sound of footsteps. One could imagine how elite they were. Soon, a dozen Cores appeared outside the army. Each of these Cores carried an extremely wild and terrifying aura.","Chu Yunfan felt that these figures were not inferior to Atela. He couldn’t have possibly accidentally encountered such a lineup. It was clear that they were here for him. Or rather, they had been waiting for him to come.","But how did the people of Jinzhanghan know? No matter how fast the news spread, it was impossible for them to know that Chu Yunfan had left when he had departed so suddenly. Besides, no one knew where he had gone except for himself, let alone ambush him so accurately.","Unless this was a trap from the beginning.","Chu Yunfan instantly understood everything. This plot had probably started a long time ago, perhaps even since Tang Siyu’s incident. Only through Tang Siyu’s matter could the forces guide Chu Yunfan to Yunshan.","Chu Yunfan, who was eager to find someone, would definitely choose the shortest route. Then, it would be logical to ambush him. Only then could he have fallen into the trap.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan understood everything. It was not difficult to understand. If it were him, he would be afraid too. The reason Great Wei could tolerate a lawless existence like Blood King was that his potential was limited to this extent. Although he was very strong, if the Imperial Court was ruthless, they could still eliminate him.","Compared to Blood King, Chu Yunfan was a completely different matter. His current strength might not be considered invincible in Great Wei, but his potential was too terrifying. Considering that he was not even 30 years old and had not even stepped into the Core Stage, if he was allowed to enter the Core Stage, then Great Wei would be enveloped by Chu Yunfan’s shadow.","At that time, if Chu Yunfan wanted to abolish the emperor, he could do it with a single word. The entire Great Wei would be controlled by him. When that happened, Great Wei would truly be in a state of decline. Under such circumstances, it would be impossible for the powerful emperor of Great Wei to not view him as a thorn in his side. If it were him, he would probably choose to kill him before he was fully fledged and truly invincible.","Whether it was Tang Siyu’s information or the Spirit Spring Water, they were just baits to lure him here.","“What a bold move.” Chu Yunfan smiled coldly. In order to trick him into this trap, the Imperial Court had not hesitated to give him ten drops of Spirit Spring Water.","The value of these ten drops of Spirit Spring Water was immeasurable. No wonder he couldn’t wait to make a move after leaving Great Wei."]},{"number":1357,"title":"Chapter 1357 The Recruitment of Jinzhanghan","paragraphs":["1357 The Recruitment of Jinzhanghan","The Imperial Court knew the importance of the Spirit Spring Water to Chu Yunfan. If he chose to consume the Spirit Spring Water, who knew how strong he would become? At that time, he would be even more difficult to deal with.","Therefore, they had to make the first move and reveal the information about Tang Siyu so that Chu Yunfan would not enter seclusion and consume the Spirit Spring Water. They calculated everything without the slightest flaw and had taken into account Chu Yunfan’s reaction.","Even if they were enemies, Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but admire them.","The emperor had truly appeared before Chu Yunfan, but once he decided to become Chu Yunfan’s enemy, he was so ruthless. Compared to the emperor, the situation with the second prince was too small and could not be mentioned in the same breath.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan’s heart was boiling with anger. In order to kill him, the court of Great Wei had chosen to cooperate with Jinzhanghan. One could imagine how shocking Chu Yunfan was to them.","Great Wei had set up this trap, but Jinzhanghan was also willing to cooperate. It could be imagined that Jinzhanghan was also afraid that Chu Yunfan’s sudden rise would affect the balance. For the two big countries, Chu Yunfan, who was uncontrollable and extremely terrifying, was the most dangerous. It was better to completely destroy a power that they could not control.","And Great Wei had such thoughts. It could be said that they hit it off with Jinzhanghan. That was why there was an ambush. Although Chu Yunfan didn’t know their specific plan, he could more or less guess it. And that wasn’t a hard thing to guess. The most difficult part was to trick Chu Yunfan into coming out. The rest was not difficult.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think you can run away today?” In the silence, a tall man in a luxurious robe from Jinzhanghan boomed.","Chu Yunfan looked at the man. There was a three-headed wolf embroidered on his clothes. This was the symbol of Jinzhanghan. Only the imperial family of Jinzhanghan could wear such clothes.","Moreover, only those who were close to the current Khan were qualified to wear this robe. It was not difficult for Chu Yunfan to guess that this man was part of the imperial family or even a prince.","In Jinzhanghan, the Khan had given birth to countless princes. Among them, only the Left King and the Right King held true power. The Left King was the crown prince of Jinzhanghan, while the Right King was his substitute. Both of them were high and mighty among the princes, and they held heavy fists.","However, the other princes were not simple either. The strength of this prince from Jinzhanghan was probably not inferior to Blood King. He was only a step away from breaking through to the peak Void Core Stage.","There were only a few experts like Blood King in Great Wei. It was clear that Jinzhanghan had more experts than Great Wei.","“What a big lineup.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“Of course, it’s a big lineup. I’ve heard about you. You’re considered a hero among the people of Wei. Otherwise, my father wouldn’t have asked me to mobilize his trusted Blood Barbarians to deal with you.”","The Jinzhanghan prince clicked his tongue in wonder and said, “You should know that the tens of thousands of Blood Barbarians are enough to roam the outer realms and wipe out cities and countries. No one can stop them.”","Chu Yunfan suddenly understood. No wonder this army was so elite. Any ordinary soldier was a master above the Innate Stage. There were also armies of this level in the Federation, but they were usually special forces. It would be good to find a few hundred elites among the elites. They were basically scattered in various military regions and could not be used together. Basically, they still had to rely on mechas to contend against them.","However, Jinzhanghan had gathered tens of thousands of Innates, and even more than a thousand Divines. Even the Holy Land of the past could not gather such a lineup, let alone the Federation.","The power of Jinzhanghan was truly terrifying.","During this period, Chu Yunfan had learned a lot about Jinzhanghan, and he had heard of these Blood Barbarians. Among the tens of millions of troops of Jinzhanghan, there was a troop of 100,000 men, known as the elites of the elites—the elite guards of Jinzhanghan.","It was clear that only a portion, about 30 thousand, of the Blood Barbarians had come here, but the power they formed was even more astonishing than an army of a million soldiers. Ordinary soldiers of Great Wei, with a million people, might not even be able to withstand the charge of these 30 thousand Blood Barbarians. They would be directly pierced through and suffer heavy casualties.","A single expert was already very shocking, let alone an army formed by tens of thousands of experts. The military power formed by it was frightening for martial arts experts. Moreover, Chu Yunfan could feel that these Blood Barbarians had not only formed an army but also a military spirit. Just the formation of an army was already an elite among elites, and the formation of a military spirit was even more terrifying.","If a martial arts expert wanted to kill an ordinary army, it would be as easy as lifting a finger. However, if this army formed a military spirit, it would instinctively attack a martial arts expert. The military spirit formed by tens of thousands of Blood Barbarians was terrifying. An ordinary Core would be severely injured and die instantly.","Facing an army of this level, they would either have to run far away or find an army that could contend with them. This was the fundamental reason why Jinzhanghan and Great Wei could control the world. Even the powerful martial arts experts did not dare to be presumptuous in front of such big kingdoms.","One or two martial arts experts could not withstand the impact. They would be killed in a moment, especially in this situation where they were surrounded. They were almost certain to die.","It was not easy for Chu Yunfan to easily kill his way out of an army with a military spirit. Whether an army had the might or the spirit was two completely different concepts.","“However, my father cherishes talents. Now, it is obvious that the emperor of Wei is eager to kill you. Why don’t you join Jinzhanghan? If you’re willing to join us, you will not die today.”"]},{"number":1358,"title":"Chapter 1358 Turn the Cheek, Making a Move","paragraphs":["1358 Turn the Cheek, Making a Move","The prince looked at Chu Yunfan with a sense of superiority in his eyes. So what if This Chu Yunfan was a martial arts genius? In front of Jinzhanghan, he had to lower his head obediently.","The prince had seen too many so-called geniuses like this. In the grasslands, there was no longer anyone who dared to resist Jinzhanghan. In the past countless years of war, they had long been uprooted by the endless Iron Cavalry.","The clan leaders, sect leaders, and aristocratic family leaders who were once extremely powerful could pose a fatal threat to ordinary warriors of Jinzhanghan, but they were utterly vulnerable when faced with the Blood Barbarians.","The Blood Barbarians’ military spirit was the best counter to martial arts experts. Even their attacks would be greatly reduced when faced with the Blood Barbarians’ military spirit. Normal Core would be easily killed by the Blood Barbarians.","In front of this elite force, no one could escape. And in the prince’s opinion, Chu Yunfan was no exception. If Chu Yunfan was smart, he would surrender obediently. As for what the ambassador sent by the Wei people had said about killing Chu Yunfan, he did not care. He wished that the person who killed Chu Yunfan was the Wei people, not Jinzhanghan.","The people of Wei could not tolerate such a person, but Jinzhanghan could. To be able to recruit such a genius under his command, wouldn’t it be great if he could turn around and destroy Wei? It would be best if the Wei people fought among themselves. Of course, the prerequisite was that Chu Yunfan had to be obedient.","“Do you believe that I will surrender?” Chu Yunfan’s lips curled up into a faint smile. After understanding everything, he was no longer nervous. No matter what kind of conspiracy, in the end, it was all about strength.","Chu Yunfan had thought it through. Great Wei’s Imperial Court would definitely not tolerate the existence of a monster like him who was above everyone. There had been too many such things since ancient times, and the list was too numerous to mention.","Even in the history of the Federation, there was no lack of such existences. If Chu Yunfan continued to grow, there was a possibility that he would threaten the foundation of Great Wei. Hence, the Imperial Court would definitely not tolerate his existence.","“Of course, but before that, you have to obediently swallow this Soul Pin Centipede. If you don’t listen to our orders, you will be killed by this centipede with just a thought,” the prince said slowly.","There was a box made of bones in his hand, and in the box was the Soul Pin Centipede. Since Jinzhanghan dared to take Chu Yunfan in, they naturally had confidence. Jinzhanghan had always used the Soul Pin Centipede to deal with masters who were positioned to be disloyal. As long as they swallowed the centipede, no matter how powerful they were, they had to obey obediently. Otherwise, with a single thought, they would die.","There had never been an exception. There had even been people who had cultivated to the point of surpassing the Core Stage, but they still died under the Soul Pin Centipede.","Jinzhanghan had absolute confidence in the centipede. As long as Chu Yunfan swallowed it, he would not be able to escape.","Chu Yunfan took a look at the box made of bones and immediately understood Jinzhanghan’s confidence. Although he did not know what the effect of this so-called Soul Pin Centipede was, it was clearly not something good. It was probably used to control people.","However, this kind of thing was useful to ordinary people. Chu Yunfan, who had inherited the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, had a thousand ways to kill this centipede. Even if he swallowed it into his body, he had enough ways to kill it. It was too childish to use this kind of thing to control him. However, he had no intention of compromising with Jinzhanghan on this issue.","“What? Where’s the Right King? Why didn’t he come personally? Doesn’t he want to kill me?” Chu Yunfan asked","“The Right King naturally has his own strength. To deal with you, he doesn’t need to personally come. I am enough to deal with you,” the prince said impatiently,” Chu Yunfan, you don’t have to try to stall for time. This method is no good against me. You can either kneel and surrender now, or I’ll kill you immediately.”","As soon as the prince finished speaking, the thirty thousand Blood Barbarians unleashed their full power. Through the formation, the power of tens of thousands of people was completely condensed into a terrifying military spirit. It was a huge blood-red spirit, and the murderous intent of a soldier leaping into the sky. If Chu Yunfan said no, the miliary spirit would immediately explode and attack him.","“I don’t even care about the Right King, let alone you. Who do you think you are to make me kneel and surrender?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","“You’re asking for death. In that case, I’ll send you on your way!” the prince shouted, and the enormous blood-red military spirit swung its long spear at Chu Yunfan.","The military spirit froze the sky, and in an instant, the entire world seemed to have flipped over. It was terrifying. Its attack was even stronger than Blood King at his peak. It had reached the peak of the Core Stage.","And this was only from mere 30,000 Blood Barbarians. If all 100,000 Blood Barbarians gathered together, the military spirit released would be enough to kill experts at the Void Core Stage and above. The capital that Jinzhanghan relied on to dominate the world was naturally extraordinary. It was not something that ordinary people could compare with.","Chu Yunfan’s body was then covered with a layer of blood-red energy, turning into a blood-red skeleton. But when the blood-red skeleton encountered the dagger-axe formed by the military spirit, it was instantly slashed apart. The skeleton formed by the Demon Descends Illustration was unable to resist.","It was instantly cut through like tofu and the attack slashed straight at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan swayed slightly. He stepped on the power of lightning and appeared hundreds of meters away in a flash, avoiding this fatal blow.","Boom!","The military spirit’s blood-red dagger-axe shattered the sky. Large amounts of air collapsed, forming a terrifying cyclone that swept out.","Chu Yunfan’s expression was slightly solemn. This was the first time he had encountered an army that had formed a military spirit. The most terrifying thing about this spirit was that it could gather the strength of the entire army. For martial arts experts, it was simply a bane.","Moreover, the power of the spirit was very special. It could even neutralize the divine arts of martial arts experts."]},{"number":1359,"title":"Chapter 1359 Shattering Cores in the Mid-Air","paragraphs":["1359 Shattering Cores in the Mid-Air","An ordinary army could not form a military spirit, so their strength could not be gathered together. It was not enough to pose a threat to a Core. Even a Divine could easily kill their way out.","A single top-notch expert was enough to carve out a bloody path.","However, the Blood Barbarians were different. Not only did they have a military spirit, but their military spirit was also terrifyingly powerful. An ordinary Core could be killed with a single blow if they were unable to block the Blood Barbarians ‘attacks.","This was the key reason the prince was so confident in encircling Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, why would he have done so knowing about Chu Yunfan’s ferocious reputation and the number of Cores he had killed?","Although Chu Yunfan had dodged the attack, he could feel that he was being instantly suppressed. The Blood Barbarians had surrounded him, and their military spirits had almost covered the sky and earth. They had completely replaced the power of the world, forming a strong suppression on Chu Yunfan.","It felt as if Chu Yunfan was being repelled by an inexplicable force as if he was being repelled from the entire world, preventing him from borrowing power from nature. This was the most terrifying part of the military spirit.","Originally, martial arts experts could borrow enough spirit energy from nature. It could be said to be endless and could not be exhausted. However, after being suppressed by the military soul, they could not borrow power from nature. Even if they could not be killed immediately, they could be slowly worn to death.","“You want to kill me? I’ll kill you first!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","In an instant, he appeared in front of the prince. However, his movements were a little slow. The military soul in the air also slowed his movement speed, just like a person walking in water. Even so, Chu Yunfan was still extremely fast. In an instant, he had already appeared in front of his target.","The prince shouted and thrust his spear at Chu Yunfan. This spear was like a giant black snake, devouring the world. In an instant, it was about to bite Chu Yunfan to death.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan suddenly shouted and flung his arm, forming a terrifying tide that deflected the spear. It did not pose any threat to him at all. Chu Yunfan’s attack was even more shocking. He casually punched out. The golden fist force transformed into a golden roc, and in an instant, it struck the prince.","Bam!","The prince was hit by the punch. He felt as if he had been hit by a mountain at an extremely high speed.","Spurt!","The prince spat out a mouthful of blood and flew backward like a kite with a broken string. The intense pain instantly woke him up. However, he still could not imagine that Chu Yunfan was so powerful. His cultivation had already reached the peak of the late Void Core Stage, which was not much weaker than Blood King. Such cultivation was enough to dominate the world, but it was useless against Chu Yunfan.","When they saw the prince being severely injured by Chu Yunfan, three Void Cores of Jinzhanghan instantly flew over, trying to stop Chu Yunfan.","“Trying to block me?!” Chu Yunfan shouted,” Can you?!”","Chu Yunfan retracted his fist to his abdomen and punched out with a terrifying fist force.","Boom!","With a loud bang, the three experts were hit by the golden asura formed by Chu Yunfan’s fist.","“Gaaaah!”","The three experts screamed in pain as their bodies exploded in mid-air.","Immediately, even the Blood Barbarians, who dared to attack anyone, could not help but feel their momentum stagnate. Chu Yunfan was too terrifying. With one punch, he blew up three Void Cores.","One had to know that these were Cores. Although they were only at the fledgling Void Core Stage, they were still high and mighty figures in Jinzhanghan. There were very few people who could be compared to them. But now, they couldn’t even survive Chu Yunfan’s punch.","On the other side, the prince finally understood why they needed to mobilize 30,000 Blood Barbarians to deal with a young Wei. With such a lineup, even the so-called number one expert of the Wei Kingdom, Yun Huang, would die if he was surrounded by the Blood Barbarians. It was impossible to survive.","In Jinzhanghan, the Blood Barbarians were rarely used, because once they were used, it would be a massacre. It had been a hundred years since they were sent out just for one person. However, he now understood that his father had not underestimated Chu Yunfan. This Chu Yunfan indeed had such strength. It was simply terrifying.","He simply could not believe it. How could Chu Yunfan, who was merely in his twenties, be so terrifying? He, who had already stepped into the late Void Core Stage, could not even withstand a punch from Chu Yunfan. On top of that, according to the report, Chu Yunfan hadn’t entered the Core Stage yet.","‘If he entered the Core Stage, what would happen?’","Thinking of this, the prince’s killing intent boiled even more. For Jinzhanghan, if they did not kill such a person, they would not be able to sleep or eat in peace. Sooner or later, even Jinzhanghan would be no match for him.","The prince retreated into the army formation, becoming one with the army. Only then did he finally feel a little safer, and only then did he have the time to circulate all the power in his body to heal his injuries. Chu Yunfan’s punch had shattered his defensive magic tool and turned it into ashes. He had never encountered such a terrifying monster before.","His ribs were all broken!","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t been slowed down by the military soul at the critical moment, he would have been punched through by Chu Yunfan. That was the most terrifying thing.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re dead. Since you’ve refused the charity of Jinzhanghan, I’ll make you die without a burial place!” the prince roared, “Attack! Kill him!”","As he gave the order, the entire army began to rotate violently. The already formed military spirit became even more solid. It lifted the dagger-axe in its hand and smashed it down at Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","The air collapsed at a speed visible to the naked eye. The dagger-axe was like a long dragon, directly enveloping Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1360,"title":"Chapter 1360 Killing Move From the Outside","paragraphs":["1360 Killing Move From the Outside","The formation formed by the 30 thousand Blood Barbarians was the most terrifying when it was truly activated. Its suppression was several times stronger than before.","If Chu Yunfan was able to borrow some spirit energy from nature before, then now, Chu Yunfan could not borrow any at all. Unless he could dig a way out, it would be possible. Under such circumstances, even a Core with profound divine power would not be able to last long.","This was the prince’s ultimate plan. No matter how strong Chu Yunfan was, he was not a Core. Even a Core could not last long, let alone a Divine. However, he had underestimated Chu Yunfan. Although Chu Yunfan was not a Core, in terms of the density of his divine power, he was much stronger than an ordinary Core.","In addition, he had both the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique. It would be wishful thinking if they wanted to fight a battle of attrition with him.","However, even if it wasn’t a battle of attrition, the military spirit formed by the Blood Barbarians was still extremely terrifying. As time passed, a few more shadows formed by the military spirit appeared in the sky and surrounded Chu Yunfan. Each attack by this military spirit was extremely terrifying. It was equivalent to a full-powered attack from a late Void Core. Some of them were even able to conjure a full-powered attack from a peak Void Core.","Chu Yunfan could only dodge these attacks, but as time passed, the encirclement of these shadows became smaller and smaller, giving him less and less space to move.","“Break!” Chu Yunfan shouted and threw a punch. The asura formed behind him shattered a shadow in the air.","Boom!","At the same time, more than a thousand of the 30 thousand Blood Barbarians spat out a mouthful of blood, exploded, and instantly died. The Blood Barbarians had placed all their energy into the military spirit, and they had gathered all their strength together. However, once the military spirit was broken, they would suffer a backlash. Not to mention that they were turned into ashes by Chu Yunfan’s punch. The backlash was so serious that they were blown up.","Although the army was strong, there was a price to pay.","But even so, the surrounding shadows rushed over. Although their strength was somewhat scattered compared to the beginning, these shadows could instantly condense into one again and then launch a fatal attack on Chu Yunfan.","Under the continuous attacks of the military spirit, Chu Yunfan had to retreat. Soon, he was forced into a corner. This military soul was too severe in restraining martial arts experts.","At this moment, two figures appeared at the periphery of the army. One of them was wearing bronze armor and was dressed in military attire. His figure was tall and straight, like a mountain between heaven and earth, and his aura was imposing. The other was an old man in a black robe. He was skinny, but the power contained in his body was not weaker than the other person.","Any one of them had the power to destroy the world.","If someone familiar with Great Wei saw the two of them, they would definitely exclaim in shock. These two people were none other than the number two and number three of Great Wei’s five great experts—the imperial family’s First Guardian and General Ye Fei.","These two experts rarely appeared in public, let alone at the same time.","Now, the two of them looked at Chu Yunfan, who was constantly moving left and right in the distant army formation, and their faces revealed a complicated expression. Both of them were martial arts experts, so they knew very well how effective this military soul was against martial arts experts.","Especially General Ye Fei. He was not only a martial arts expert but also an army general. His understanding of these things was far beyond the imagination of ordinary people.","“The Blood Barbarians are indeed the elites of Jinzhanghan,” said General Ye Fei,” If such an army were to invade Great Wei, I’m afraid no one would be able to stop them.”","“That’s right. Jinzhanghan has paid a huge price to kill Chu Yunfan,” the First Guardian said as he looked at the scene before him.","However, as an official, he could understand the emperor’s actions. Such an existence was too destructive for the balance. If he ignored it, Chu Yunfan might even have the ability to overturn the imperial family of Great Wei. Once Chu Yunfan had such thoughts, it would be a disaster for Great Wei’s imperial family.","As lords of the people, they definitely couldn’t accept such an outcome. Even if there was only such a possibility, it was still unacceptable to them.","The reason why these two people appeared here was to add a layer of insurance. They knew very well what a genius like Chu Yunfan meant. It was fine if they didn’t make a move, but once they did, they had to guarantee that they would kill Chu Yunfan in one breath. Otherwise, if Chu Yunfan escaped, the consequences would be unimaginable.","They would not place all their hopes on Jinzhanghan. Who knew what Jinzhanghan was thinking? In fact, their preparations were not wrong. Jinzhanghan did have the intention of accepting Chu Yunfan into their ranks and making him work for them.","Kingdoms were always scheming against each other, but Chu Yunfan was clearly a stubborn person, so he didn’t agree. If Chu Yunfan agreed to be a traitor, then the two of them would have a headache. However, they were here today as a last layer of insurance. If Chu Yunfan surrendered to Jinzhanghan, then they would destroy the Blood Barbarians. Although this would cost them dearly, it was still better than Chu Yunfan turning to Jinzhanghan to attack Great Wei.","If that were the case, the consequences would be unimaginable. Chu Yunfan’s strength was already extremely terrifying, and his talent was even more shocking. His future was limitless. Coupled with the strength of the Blood Barbarians, it was enough to pose a huge threat to Great Wei.","Therefore, even if they had to pay an unimaginable price to eliminate such a combination, they would still kill the traitor."]},{"number":1361,"title":"Chapter 1361 Chu Yunfan Is Finally Dead?","paragraphs":["1361 Chu Yunfan Is Finally Dead?","If Chu Yunfan didn’t die today, then Great Wei would have to pay an even greater price in the future. If Chu Yunfan escaped, then the two of them would be responsible for giving him the last stab.","Originally, there was no such step, but since Chu Yunfan had repeatedly surpassed everyone’s understanding, no one knew if he had any other trump cards. That was why the Emperor of Great Wei sent these two people as the last layer of protection.","In Great Wei, only Yun Huang and these two could suppress Chu Yunfan. However, Yun Huang was the sect master of the Monster Subduers. He was stationed at the western border of Great Wei to suppress the monsters all year round. He would not make a move easily. Moreover, Yun Huang was the chairman of the Core Council and would not listen to the emperor.","Therefore, these two were the final trump cards.","Ordinary late Void Cores were no match for Chu Yunfan. This was already beyond doubt. This was a lesson exchanged with Blood King’s life. However, the two of them were different. They had already stepped into the peak Void Core Stage, so both of them were confident in killing Chu Yunfan.","With the arrival of two great experts, it could be seen that Great Wei’s imperial family wanted to kill him. With them working together, even Yun Huang had no chance of escaping.","At this moment, the battle had already entered a white-hot stage.","“Die!” the prince of Jinzhanghan roared.","The army formation was shrinking, and the speed of the military spirit was getting faster. In contrast, the space Chu Yunfan could move around was gradually shrinking, and he had no choice but to fight the military spirit head-on.","Every time he took it head-on, even with Chu Yunfan’s cultivation, he felt his arms go numb. The Blood Barbarians’ military presence enveloped the entire space. The military spirit’s strength increased exponentially under the support of the military presence.","The prince was healing his wounds while roaring ferociously. It was as if he could already see Chu Yunfan unable to hold on any longer. He wanted to chop off Chu Yunfan’s head and use it as a wine jug to wash away the shame. Being heavily injured by Chu Yunfan’s punch was the greatest humiliation of his life.","Chu Yunfan, who had been forced to this point, had no other choice. A sharp look flashed through his eyes. Seeing that the Blood Barbarians’ encirclement was getting smaller and smaller, he sneered and dodged their attack again.","“Chu Yunfan, you will not escape!” the prince roared.","“If you want me to die, then let’s see if you have the ability!”","As he spoke, Chu Yunfan grabbed at the air and pulled out the nuclear missile launcher. On the launch pad, ten small tactical nuclear bombs were ready. Under the control of the artificial intelligence, they were shot out in all directions as soon as they appeared.","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","Swoosh!","Sharp air-piercing sounds could be heard as the tactical nuclear bombs left long trails of flames behind them as they bombarded the Blood Barbarians that were surrounding Chu Yunfan from all directions.","“Stop those things!”","At that moment, the prince felt an extremely terrifying sense of destruction engulfing his heart. He had never felt such a terrible feeling before, but he believed in his sixth sense. As a martial arts expert, his sixth sense was often more accurate than his own judgment.","He didn’t know what these things were, but he could tell that they were very, very dangerous. Once they fell, it would be really dangerous.","It was not only the prince, but all the experts of Jinzhanghan present immediately reacted and launched attacks at the tactical nuclear bombs. Their reaction was fast, and their strength was unbelievably strong. Although Chu Yunfan had caught them off, they still immediately hit the nuclear bombs.","However, it was completely useless because when they hit the nuclear bombs, the bombs exploded.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","The bombs exploded on the battlefield. The terrifying explosion was like ten suns appearing at the same time, illuminating even the sun. The aftermath of the explosion turned into endless flames that devoured everything.","Everything was swallowed!","The Blood Barbarians did not even have the time to unleash their full strength before they were instantly vaporized.","“Army Shield!” the prince of Jinzhanghan roared and fled frantically. However, his body was soon engulfed by the flames of the explosion.","Boom, boom, boom!","The ground shook violently, and the shaking ground formed a turbulent flow in the air.","In the distance, General Ye Fei and the First Guardian watched this scene and were incomparably shocked. The terrifying light illuminated their faces until they were pale.","“Is this Chu Yunfan’s trump card?” General Ye Fei looked at this scene in disbelief. “Although I’ve read the information before, it’s still too shocking to see it in person!”","“It is. When I read the information that Chu Yunfan razed the entire Great Formless Sect to the ground, I felt that it was an exaggeration. You know, a lot of information is a little exaggerated. Now, I feel that not only was the information not exaggerated, but it was also said to be light,” the First Guardian said.","“No wonder His Majesty didn’t want us to take action but lured Jinzhanghan to take action. He must have expected Chu Yunfan to have such a method of mutual destruction.” General Ye Fei finally understood the Emperor’s good intentions.","If it were them, they would not only have to personally kill Chu Yunfan, but they would also have to mobilize the most elite troops in Great Wei. At that time, Chu Yunfan’s nuclear bomb would be aimed at them. When that happened, they would have to pay a huge price.","It was simply unimaginable.","They saw the terrifying flames engulfing everything. If it were them, they would not be in any better shape. But now, not only had the fire eliminated Chu Yunfan, but also the 30,000 Blood Barbarians.","There were dozens of Cores and thousands of Divines!","If they had to fight head-on, it would be a huge price to pay to destroy either one of them. But now, one could sit back and reap the benefits.","“That’s right. We originally had to pay a painful price, but now we’ve killed two birds with one stone. Whether it’s Chu Yunfan or the Blood Barbarians, they’re both our biggest worries.”","The First Guardian nodded. He looked at the battlefield and narrowed his eyes.","Chu Yunfan was finally dead!"]},{"number":1362,"title":"Chapter 1362 Hurrying to Yunshan City","paragraphs":["1362 Hurrying to Yunshan City","The nuclear explosion enveloped everything. Under such circumstances, even a Core would die.","The two of them glanced at each other and sensed that there were no longer any living people at the scene and nodded in satisfaction. Both parties would suffer losses in a fight. This was exactly what they wanted to see.","The two of them turned around and left the scene.","The aftershock gradually dissipated, leaving only the crystallized ground. A terrifying scene that was like the end of the world swept across the entire battlefield. No living being could survive on this battlefield.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan appeared. Just now, at the critical moment, he had hidden himself in the Mountain River Diagram. The Blood Barbarians could not survive the bombardment of these ten nuclear bombs since they were too close to Chu Yunfan. They thought that they had him trapped in a circle and slowly sealed off his escape route.","Who knew that it was a trap Chu Yunfan had set up? Because it was too close, even the Cores did not have time to escape and were drowned by the nuclear bombs.","Their strategy was not wrong. The problem was that they did not expect Chu Yunfan to have such a method. The officials of Great Wei who knew about it had also hidden this matter from them. Therefore, they were completely killed by Chu Yunfan in one breath.","Faced with the power of a nuclear explosion, even a Void Core would not be able to withstand it.","Chu Yunfan scanned the surroundings with his divine will. After confirming that General Ye Fei and the First Guardian had left, he heaved a sigh of relief. Although the two of them were very strong, they clearly thought that Chu Yunfan was dead.","Earlier, they didn’t even bother to conceal themselves and were easily discovered by Chu Yunfan. It was just that Chu Yunfan had no time to deal with them because of the Blood Barbarians.","He had used the nuclear bomb not only to destroy the Blood Barbarians, but also to deceive them. Chu Yunfan’s trump cards were probably known by the imperial family of Great Wei. As long as he had used a method, they would probably know.","However, they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan could hide in the Mountain River Diagram. Because even though martial arts in Great Wei was advanced and had spatial equipment, it was impossible to hide a person inside. It was because the space opened up by ordinary spatial equipment was a dead space. It only had the spatial attribute but no time flowed within it.","Living creatures would be stuck in a dead path once they entered. It could only be used to store inanimate objects. However, the Mountain River Diagram was different. It was truly a world of its own. It was just that this world was relatively small.","This was Chu Yunfan’s greatest trump card.","It was simply impossible for Great Wei’s imperial family to plot against him. If they had known that Chu Yunfan had such means, they would have been more careful before taking action. At least, they wouldn’t be so impulsive.","“Those two should be the two greatest trump cards of Great Wei’s imperial family, General Ye Fei and the First Guardian.” Chu Yunfan frowned. It was not difficult for him to guess their identities.","However, it was precisely because of this that he showed a hint of fear on his face. Because neither of these two people was easy to deal with. Chu Yunfan could only protect himself at most. If he wanted to deal with these two people, his strength was far from enough unless he could unleash all his potential and step into the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage in one go. At that time, no matter how strong they were, they would not be his match.","However, it would take a certain amount of time to achieve that. Before he unleashed all his potential and stepped into the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, he did not plan to return.","Now, the officials of Great Wei must have thought that he was dead. Since that was the case, he would let them continue to think so. It was not his style to not take revenge, but it was not the time yet.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s body shook slightly. His bones, flesh, and skin trembled. In just a moment, his appearance had changed. His height had increased by a whole lot. Compared to Chu Yunfan himself, his current appearance looked more energetic. He was like a sword that had been unsheathed.","This was a method recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book to change one’s muscles and bones. Martial arts masters could easily see through ordinary disguises, but this was a fundamental change, so it could not be seen through at all. Now, no one would think that this was Chu Yunfan, but a sword cultivator expert with shocking cultivation.","“Let’s call this disguise Jian Wuchen,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently. Then, a sword light appeared under his feet and he rushed in the direction of his original destination, Yunshan City.","Chu Yunfan’s movements were extremely fast, as fast as lightning. But even so, he still flew for a whole day and night before finally arriving at Yunshan mentioned on the map. In order to win his trust, Great Wei did not lie in this aspect because it was unnecessary.","Yunshan was located on an incomparably huge mountain peak. However, this mountain peak seemed to have been flattened by someone with great divine power, opening up a platform that was enough to accommodate a huge city. As the mountain peak was extremely high and surrounded by clouds, the area below the city was completely covered by clouds. It looked as if it was floating in the sky.","Looking from afar, it was extremely shocking.","Of course, it was also because of the steep mountain roads that other than the original residents of Yunshan, outsiders who wanted to climb up the mountain could only do so through the steep mountain roads. Ordinary warriors would probably run out of true energy halfway up the mountain and would not be able to climb up. Only Innate experts could rush up to Yunshan as if they were walking on flat ground.","Of course, when one reached the Divine Abilities Stage, it would not be so troublesome. They could just fly up directly. And such Divines were definitely not in the minority in Yunshan.","From time to time, there would be a streak of light that would pierce through the sky from afar. In a moment, they would enter Yunshan. Chu Yunfan too stepped on a sword light and swiftly entered Yunshan.","Yunshan wasn’t very big. It only had a population of a million. However, almost all the residents in the city had astonishing cultivation levels. Innate experts could be seen everywhere. Even Divines could be seen on the streets from time to time.","The number of experts in Yunshan was definitely terrifying. However, for an expert like Chu Yunfan, it was nothing.","Soon, Chu Yunfan chose his first target."]},{"number":1363,"title":"Chapter 1363 Picking up the Trick, Essence Gathering Pill!","paragraphs":["1363 Picking up the Trick, Essence Gathering Pill!","After entering Yunshan, Chu Yunfan was greeted by a huge market.","In the market, many people were selling all kinds of things. There were magic weapons, natural treasures, and even many people selling martial arts manuals. Almost everything related to cultivation could be found here, but the quality was different.","Unlike the Federation, which emphasized both martial arts and science, in the Spirit Realm, martial arts were the mainstream. All the schools that were derived from this revolved around martial arts. Whether it was making pills or weapons, it was the same.","Chu Yunfan saw someone setting up a huge alchemical furnace and helping others make pills on the spot. Everyone was already used to it. For alchemists who had no background, if they didn’t do this, they wouldn’t be able to subsidize the huge cost of making pills and increase their proficiency. For ordinary people, finding the raw materials themselves and then looking for an alchemist to make the pills was undoubtedly a better way to obtain a better quality.","All kinds of shouts instantly broke into Chu Yunfan’s mind but he walked through the throng. He didn’t even need to look at the wares. With just a casual sweep of his spiritual sense, he could see the situation of each stall. None of the items these people were selling couldn’t hide from Chu Yunfan’s vision, but after looking around, there was nothing that caught his eye.","Suddenly, a shout attracted Chu Yunfan’s attention. “Starpoint Grass! Selling at a low price!”","Chu Yunfan swept his gaze over and saw a stall owner peddling his wares in front of a stall. On the stall, a few medicinal herbs that were about a foot tall were placed side by side on the stall that was engraved with a spirit gathering array. These medicinal herbs were densely covered with white spots.","The stall owner was of medium build and had an ordinary appearance. His eyes darted around, and when he saw Chu Yunfan looking at him, he quickly went forward and said, “Brother, come and take a look. This is a top-grade Starpoint Grass, a sacred healing medicine.”","The stall owner enthusiastically pulled Chu Yunfan over. “Outside, this grass can be sold for at least 100 thousand low-grade spirit stones. I’m only selling for 50 thousand.”","The stall owner looked at Chu Yunfan and quickly made a bid.","Information about the Starpoint Grass appeared in Chu Yunfan’s mind. This grass was a kind of medicinal herb with healing effects. Many high-end healing pills were mainly composed of this herb. However, Starpoint Grass was rare and expensive. According to the stall owner, it was worth at least 100 thousand low-grade spirit stones.","Usually, medicinal pills refined from Starpoint Grass could easily be sold for a high price of 200 to 300 thousand yuan. It was not even something that ordinary Divines could afford. Usually, Divine Abilities Stage experts would hold on to a life-saving pill when they obtained it and would only use it at the most critical moment.","However, since it was originally 100 thousand low-grade spirit stones, how could this stall owner actually sell it for 50 thousand low-grade spirit stones? This was very unreasonable in itself.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s suspicious gaze, the stall owner looked like he was about to cry, “To be honest, the reason why I’m selling this herb at a low price is because the elders in my family urgently need money for treatment.”","Chu Yunfan looked at the stall owner, then at the herb. He suddenly realized that this was not Starpoint Grass, but another kind of herb, the Stardust Grass. This herb was more common than Starpoint Grass, but it looked similar. They were both covered in white spots, but the effects were completely different.","Starpoint Grass was mainly used for healing, but Stardust Grass was completely different. Most people didn’t know the effects of this herb, but Chu Yunfan knew that Stardust Grass could be refined into a pill called the Essence Gathering Pill. This pill could help cultivators in the Core Stage to quickly increase their strength. It could even help the cultivator increase the speed and probability of breaking through to the Core Stage.","This was very important to Chu Yunfan at the moment.","Although he was confident that he could break through to the Void Core Stage, it would take at least several years. Although this was not a long time for a Divine Abilities Stage breakthrough, he did have that much time.","The Essence Gathering Pill could easily be sold for more than two million low-grade spirit stones. The value of the Starpoint Grass could not be compared at all.","The stall owner clearly didn’t recognize the Stardust Grass. However, Chu Yunfan immediately understood the stall owner’s plan. He definitely didn’t know the value of the herb he had and was trying to pass off the Stardust Grass as Starpoint Grass than he thought was more valuable.","Chu Yunfan instantly understood the stall owner’s intentions. He sneered in his heart, but his expression remained unchanged. His face revealed a somewhat moved expression as if he was moved by the stall owner’s words.","“All right then. Since you have urgent needs, brother, I won’t say anything more. I want all five stalks of Starpoint Grass,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Then, Chu Yunfan quickly took out 250 thousand low-grade spirit stones and placed them in a spatial bag before handing them over to the stall owner. Then, he put the five stalks of Stardust Grass into the Mountain River Diagram.","“As expected, another person has been deceived. This guy’s heart is black, and he specializes in deceiving outsiders.”","“But that guy’s really rich. Ordinary people can’t even afford one stalk, but he bought five in one go.”","“Isn’t that so? He’s so rich!”","The surrounding stall owners looked at each other and then communicated with each other using telepathy. It was not the first time they had seen this stall owner use such a method to deceive people. They felt that it was a pity. However, they did not call out because it had nothing to do with them. There was no conflict of interest with them, so they were naturally unwilling to say anything.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan with sympathy on their faces, but they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan was secretly laughing in his heart. These people were the ones who didn’t know what was good. When he made the Essence Gathering Pill, even if he was in the Core Stage, his cultivation would increase very quickly. At that time, he would go back and settle the score with Great Wei’s imperial family.","However, the most important thing now was to find other supplementary herbs. Just the Stardust Grass was not enough. Yunshan was a large neutral city, so there should be a medicinal store.","After Chu Yunfan took the Stardust Grass, he was about to leave when the stall owner suddenly spoke up from behind.","“Wait a minute. I don’t want to sell the herb anymore!”"]},{"number":1364,"title":"Chapter 1364 Dying in Vain","paragraphs":["1364 Dying in Vain","The stall owner jumped in front of Chu Yunfan and looked at him suspiciously.","“Why not?” Chu Yunfan glanced at the stall owner.","“In short, I’m not selling it unless you give me 200 thousand low-grade spirit stones per stalk,” the stall owner looked at Chu Yunfan suspiciously.","Doubt rose in the stall owner’s heart because Chu Yunfan had paid the money too quickly. He had given 250,000 low-grade spirit stones just like that. Although Chu Yunfan didn’t show any emotion on the surface, he had a feeling that he must have been deceived by the guy in front of him. Although this feeling was ridiculous and he didn’t know where it came from, he just had this feeling.","And martial artists like this often trusted their sixth sense very much. He dared to be sure that there was definitely something that he did not know, and this kid had picked up a loophole. When he thought of this, he felt terrible. He felt like he had been hunting geese all day and had finally been pecked in the eye by a wild goose.","What kind of person was he? He had actually been deceived by Chu Yunfan.","The more he thought about it, the angrier he became.","“What? Are you trying to blackmail me?” Chu Yunfan looked at the stall owner coldly. “Since I’ve already bought it, and now you want it back?”","“I don’t care what you think. You must be lying to me. These herbs are definitely worth more than this. I don’t want to sell them now, okay?” the stall owner said loudly.","“You can sell it when you want to and can take it back whenever you like. Do you think this market is run by your family? Do you think I don’t know that these aren’t Starpoint Grasses? You actually dare to dress them up and sell them? What else do you want to say?” Chu Yunfan did not hesitate to expose the stall owner’s plan.","The stall owner was exposed by Chu Yunfan, and his face turned pale from embarrassment. “You clearly know that this isn’t Starpoint Grass, yet you still paid for it. There must be a trick. Kid, I advise you to hand them over, or else you’ll have to bear the consequences!”","This time, the stall owner was completely certain that he had seen through Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan must have known something, which was why he was willing to pay so readily even though he knew it was not Starpoint Grass. Thinking of this, he couldn’t help but fly into a rage. He had actually failed in the gutter. If he hadn’t felt that something was wrong in the end and chased after Chu Yunfan, Chu Yunfan might have really deceived him.","He didn’t know what these herbs were, but they were definitely not Starpoint Grass. They were definitely more expensive than that. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t have paid so easily.","“Hehe, you’ve used this trick to deceive many people, right? Now, you actually dare to find trouble with me. I think you’re really tired of living.” Chu Yunfan sneered and stared at the stall owner. “I advise you to get lost. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being rude.”","“You brat, you dare to be rude to me?!” The stall owner sneered and whistled.","Then, five or six burly men appeared in the sky. The men arrived behind the stall owner. Their cultivation levels were not weak, and they were at least at the seventh level of the Divine Abilities Stage. They formed a strong sense of oppression toward Chu Yunfan.","The surrounding stall owners all looked as if they had expected this. They had seen it many times. Occasionally, when this stall owner wanted to take back his wares, he would do the same thing and call people over. How could an ordinary outsider dare to continue being unyielding?","“See this, brat? I advise you to obediently kneel and kowtow to me. I might even be merciful and let you live.” The stall owner sneered. He had met many people like this. No matter how arrogant they were, they still had to obediently lower their heads in the end.","“Looks like this isn’t your first time doing this.” Chu Yunfan sneered at the stall owner. “There’s a way to die. Death is not worth regretting.”","“What did you say, kid? Men, kill him!” the stall owner roared.","Swish!","Swish!","Swish!","Before these people could get close to Chu Yunfan, they were slashed into a bloody mist by the sword light that Chu Yunfan had transformed into. They were unable to pose any threat to him.","When the stall owner saw this scene, he was scared out of his wits. He never thought that Chu Yunfan would be so terrifying. He was so powerful that he was abnormal. He had killed all the experts above the seventh tier of the Divine Abilities Stage with a single strike.","In the past, the stall owner had used these men o intimidate outsiders and had never failed. After all, who would dare to provoke such a lineup? Who knew that they couldn’t even block a single sword strike from Chu Yunfan?","“You... You... What are you doing? You dare to kill people in Yunshan! The city lord will definitely not let you go!” the stall owner stuttered as he looked at Chu Yunfan, who was walking toward him, with a terrified expression.","“It’s too late for regrets now.” Chu Yunfan sneered as a sword light flashed. The stall owner was slashed into a cloud of blood mist.","The stall owner was only an ordinary Divine. How could he block Chu Yunfan’s sword?","This stall owner must have done this more than once. His subordinates must have been involved in many lives. He was a fugitive himself, and death was not worth regretting.","After doing all this, Chu Yunfan left.","The surrounding stall owners all held their breaths, afraid that Chu Yunfan, the god of death, would suddenly notice them and kill them as well. This was because such a thing was common. There were too many of those grumpy experts. One wrong word could get them killed.","“S-So terrifying! Those were upper-stage Divines, yet they couldn’t even block a single sword light!”","“A Core... He must be a great Core!”","“Do you think the city lord will care about this matter?”","“Of course, the city lord will let this go. They’re not going to find trouble with a Core for this d*mn guy.”","These stall owners were well aware of the city lord’s reaction. If the city lord really cared about it, they wouldn’t have let this guy sell fake goods here. Moreover, this guy tried to trick a Core. If that wasn’t courting death, then what was?","Even in the outer realm, a Core was an overlord-level existence. Whoever dared to provoke and deceive such a person would die in vain."]},{"number":1365,"title":"Chapter 1365 The Power Hidden Beneath the Water","paragraphs":["1365 The Power Hidden Beneath the Water","After killing these people, Chu Yunfan quickly left the market. He did not take this matter to heart at all. They were just a few ants to him. Even if the city lord wanted to come out and find trouble with him, he had nothing to be afraid of.","The city lord of such a place was at most a Void Core. There was nothing to be afraid of. Even if it was a peak Void Core, Chu Yunfan was not afraid as he could easily protect himself.","However, he estimated that the Yunshan city lord would not step forward to manage it. After all, if he really cared about this matter, he would not condone this stall owner to deceive outsiders.","Sure enough, after Chu Yunfan left, the law enforcement team of the city lord sent people over. However, when they found out that this matter might involve a Core, they immediately retreated and did not plan to interfere at all. What a joke! If they offended a Core, they would be killed in an instant. There was no need to sacrifice their lives for this guy. Moreover, this guy was an old fox who had been complained about countless times. If he died, so be it. If he died, he would die in vain.","At this time, Chu Yunfan had already entered a restaurant in the city and sat down at one of the tables. He didn’t ask for a private room. He didn’t care much about these red tape. He immediately summoned the waiters. He knew that in this city, these waiters were relatively well-informed. After all, there were customers from all walks of life in the restaurant, and they had heard a lot of things. If he wanted to find out something, he definitely had to go to them.","!!","“Sir, what would you like to order?” the waiter eagerly asked.","After Chu Yunfan threw him ten low-grade spirit stones, the smile on his face became even more attentive. Ten low-grade spirit stones were his salary for several months.","“I just want to ask you something.”","“Sir, what do you want to know? I will tell you everything I know,” the waiter quickly said.","“I just want to ask, which is the largest medicinal shop or chamber of commerce that sells medicinal herbs in this city?” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","“Sir, you have asked the right person. There’s nothing in the city that I don’t know. If you want to buy medicinal herbs, you can look for the Alchemist Association,” the waiter quickly asked.","“There’s an Alchemist Association in Yunshan?” Chu Yunfan said with some doubt.","“Of course, there has been an Alchemist Association since a long time ago. Sir, you must be from a foreign place, so you might not know. Not only is it Yunshan, but there are Alchemist Associations in many places in the outer realms,” the waiter quickly added.","When Chu Yunfan heard this, he frowned slightly. He didn’t expect Yunshan to have an Alchemist Association. Moreover, it sounded like this Alchemist Association’s power wasn’t small. They actually had branches in the outer realm. Thinking about it, this Alchemist Association must have some relationship with the Alchemist Association in Great Wei.","This was out of Chu Yunfan’s expectations. Originally, he thought that the Alchemist Association in Great Wei was only in Great Wei and was only a national organization. But now it seemed that the Alchemist Association’s influence was far greater than he had imagined. Even the Alchemist Association of Great Wei was only a branch.","If that was the case, then the power of the Alchemist Association was very shocking. Unlike the aggressive Jinzhanghan, the Alchemist Association had the ability to cross the country without revealing their strength. As expected, none of the organizations that could establish themselves in the Spirit Realm were simple.","However, this proved that behind this Alchemist Association, there was probably some kind of power that could support the Alchemist Association to extend its tentacles throughout all of the Spirit Realm. Perhaps it had such strength, and the so-called headquarters in Great Wei was just the tip of the iceberg. If that was the case, then the hidden power of the Alchemist Association could not be underestimated.","However, Chu Yunfan temporarily suppressed his guess about the Alchemist Association’s hidden strength and asked, “If I want to ask for some information, where should I go?”","“If you want to ask more, you can go to the Mysteries Pavilion. This organization sells all kinds of information to the outside world all year round. Just like the Alchemist Association, the Mysteries Pavilion also has branches all over the outer realm,” the waiter quickly said.","Chu Yunfan frowned slightly. The Mysteries Pavilion was the same as the Alchemist Association. They actually had such a huge force. The situation in the Spirit Realm was probably not what he saw now. What he saw now was only the forces that floated on the surface, but there were even more forces hidden under the surface.","“This is interesting!” Chu Yunfan smiled. “All right, thank you. Please help me prepare some of the best dishes in your establishment.” He nodded.","“Please wait a moment.” The waiter took Chu Yunfan’s low-grade spirit stones and happily went to inform the kitchen.","The Alchemist Association in the Federation was similar. It should be said that they were all Alchemist Associations that had been inherited from the Ancient Zenith Civilization. From the root, they were all the same.","After Chu Yunfan entered, an attendant quickly came forward. “Sir, are you here to buy pills, sell pills, or find an alchemist to make pills?” the attendant asked respectfully.","“I’m here to purchase medicinal herbs. Do you have this service?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Yes, sir. What kind of herbs do you need?” the attendant said.","Chu Yunfan immediately took out the list of medicinal ingredients and handed it to the waiter. He said, “Here’s the list. Will they be a problem?”","“I’ll help you check.”","After the waiter had Chu Yunfan sit in a corner, he took the list of herbs and went in to find the person in charge. After a while, he came out with the results and informed Chu Yunfan, “Sir, we can provide all the herbs you want on this list. However, it’ll take about a day to transfer the goods from the other branches. Also, the final price will be a total of 100 thousand low-grade spirit stones.”","“Sure, no problem.” Chu Yunfan nodded and then happily paid the 100 thousand low-grade spirit stones. With the Alchemist Association’s help, he had nothing to worry about."]},{"number":1366,"title":"Chapter 1366 News of Tang Siyu","paragraphs":["1366 News of Tang Siyu","The Alchemist Association clearly had a huge influence in the outer realm. As long as Chu Yunfan was willing to pay enough low-grade spirit stones, he would be able to collect the medicinal herbs he wanted. This saved him a lot of effort.","The entire industrial chain that revolved around martial arts cultivation flourished in the spirit world, and it was not inferior to the Federation, which emphasized both science and martial arts.","After placing the order, Chu Yunfan left the Alchemist Association. He went straight through more than half of Yunshan and arrived at another organization located in Yunshan—the Mysteries Pavilion.","This was an intelligence organization that was spread throughout the entire outer realm. As soon as Chu Yunfan entered, an attendant immediately came forward and asked, “Sir, are you here to buy information or sell information?”","The attendant glanced at Chu Yunfan with a very respectful attitude. He had been a receptionist here for a long time and had seen all kinds of people. The young man in black looked unfamiliar, but this was normal. Yunshan was a neutral city. It was not strange for various forces and experts to come and go.","“I wish to buy information,” Chu Yunfan said.","“What kind of information do you want to know? Mysteries Pavilion is definitely second to none in this aspect. We definitely won’t disappoint you,” the attendant said in a carefree manner.","“I want to know about Tang Siyu and Nine Stars,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","When the attendant heard these two words, his expression immediately changed. He immediately said, “Sir, please follow me.”","The two of them passed through the bustling crowd. Chu Yunfan was arranged to stay in a private room. After the attendant arranged for Chu Yunfan to rest here for a while, he left.","Soon, two figures walked in. Chu Yunfan looked up and saw that the man in the lead was an old man of medium height wearing a luxurious robe. Behind him was a young man who looked to be in his thirties.","“How should I address you?” The old man looked at Chu Yunfan and cupped his hands.","“I’m Jian Wuchen,” Chu Yunfan said.","The old man looked at the young man and saw that the young man shook his head slightly as if he wanted to say something. The old man’s expression immediately turned indifferent as he said, “Greetings, Jian Wuchen. I am the elder of the Mysteries Pavilion, Zhu Lilun, and this is my disciple, Wang Chao.”","After saying that, Zhu Lilun sat down. Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows. Although he didn’t know the scale of the Mysteries Pavilion, it was obvious that as an elder, they should be a group of people high up in the air. Now, they were actually personally dealing with a matter of intelligence for him.","This made Chu Yunfan feel a little strange.","“Earlier, I heard from the attendant that you wish to ask about Tang Siyu and Nine Stars?” Zhu Lilun said.","“That’s right. I want to know all the information, including the beginning and end of the matter.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Sure, but the fee will be expensive. It’ll be 500 thousand low-grade spirit stones because this information involves Nine Stars,” Zhu Lilun said.","Chu Yunfan nodded. He knew that the Mysteries Pavilion that dared to sell information to all sides was definitely not a simple entity. However, when he saw how easy it was to charge 500 thousand yuan, he could not help but sigh. Selling information was really profitable.","Zhu Lilun glanced at Chu Yunfan in surprise. He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to agree. After all, 500 thousand low-grade spirit stones were not a small amount. The importance of information varied from person to person. It might be priceless to the relevant people, but it was worthless to unrelated people.","The Mysteries Pavilion was in this business, selling the most suitable information to the people who needed it the most. It was precisely because of such a huge amount of intelligence funds that he, as an elder, came personally. After Chu Yunfan made his request, someone would quickly sort out the document for Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan immediately paid 500 thousand low-grade spirit stones without hesitation. It was not a lot for his current wealth. Even if most of the spirit stones in his Mountain River Diagram were used to water the Brahma Tree, the remaining portion was still not something that ordinary people could hope to catch up to.","Along the way, he killed many experts. Many of their spatial bags or rings had been broken by Chu Yunfan, and their wealth had fallen into his hands. All kinds of wealth added up to hundreds of millions of low-grade spirit stones. A mere 100 thousand low-grade spirit stones were just a drop in the ocean to him.","After seeing Chu Yunfan pay the bill, Zhu Lilun said, “According to the information Mysteries Pavilion obtained, Tang Siyu appeared in the outer realm about a year ago. We can’t find any of information about her from before then,” Zhu Lilun said as he glanced at Chu Yunfan.","Tang Siyu and Chu Yunfan were the same. He had just asked his disciple Wang Chao, but Wang Chao had said that he had never seen this person before. Although his disciple didn’t show it, he actually had a photographic memory. As long as he had read the information, he wouldn’t forget it. If he didn’t, then there was only one possibility. He hadn’t never seen Chu Yunfan before.","Judging from Chu Yunfan’s power, he was probably not an ordinary person. However, how could such a person have roots? When he thought of Tang Siyu, who had no background, he suddenly felt a little playful.","Then, Zhu Lilun slowly told Chu Yunfan about the information that the Mysteries Pavilion had obtained. The incident started more than a year ago. After separating from Chu Yunfan, Tang Siyu landed in the outer realm. With her beautiful appearance and shocking strength, she quickly caused a commotion in Yunshan. After all, such powerful and young female martial artists were rare.","As she defeated some experts in Yunshan, her reputation rose even more. As her fame rose, she also attracted the attention of Nine Stars. To be more precise, it attracted the attention of Ye Tiannan, the young master of Nine Stars.","Ye Tiannan wanted to marry Tang Siyu but was rejected by her. He was so angry that he ordered the masters of the school to capture her. However, Tang Siyu noticed it first and escaped. Later on, Nine Stars chased after Tang Siyu many times.","The most recent information he had was that Tang Siyu had broken through to Core Stage and killed an elder of Nine Stars when she was being hunted down."]},{"number":1367,"title":"Chapter 1367 Betrayed? He Was Sold Out?","paragraphs":["1367 Betrayed? He Was Sold Out?","This matter immediately shook the outer realm. Nine Stars was considered a major force here. Those who could become elders in Nine Stars were definitely Void Cores.","Such an existence was extremely terrifying in the boundless grasslands of the outer realm. However, Tang Siyu had cut off his head with a single sword strike.","At this point, the entire Nine Stars was furious. It was the young master of Nine Stars who used his father’s power to mobilize Nine Stars’ experts to kill Tang Siyu. After this incident, the entire Nine Stars could no longer tolerate her. Because of this incident, Nine Stars had become a joke in the outer realm.","Now, Nine Stars had issued a wanted order. If Tang Siyu could be caught and delivered, they would be rewarded with 50 million low-grade spirit stones. If they could provide information, they would be rewarded with 1 million low-grade spirit stones.","Tang Siyu had stirred up a great storm in the outer realm in this one year.","After Zhu Lilun finished speaking, he carefully glanced at Chu Yunfan as if he wanted to see some expressions on Chu Yunfan’s face to determine the relationship between him and Tang Siyu.","However, Chu Yunfan’s expression was extremely indifferent as if he didn’t care. But this was just a facade. If someone could see his heart, they would be able to see the anger boiling within.","“Who is Ye Tiannan?” Chu Yunfan asked after reigning in his anger.","“Ye Tiannan is a very interesting person in the outer realm. His father is the leader of Nine Stars, and his mother is a disciple of an extremely distant and mysterious sect. It is said that it is a dual cultivation sect. Ye Tiannan has more than 9,000 concubines, and all of these concubines are warriors with cultivation. He has been cultivating with these people over his lifetime. In less than 50 years, he has broken through to the Core Stage,” Zhu Lilun said slowly.","“I’m afraid that these concubines are from questionable backgrounds, right?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“That’s right. Many of these concubines are female disciples of various sects, and many of them have husbands. Then, they were kidnapped by Ye Tiannan and became his cultivation vessels.” Lilun nodded.","“But no one cares?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“Who can? Who dares to? After all, he’s the son of Nine Stars’ leader. Although he is not the only son, he is more favored than all the other sons combined,” Lilun said, “According to the information we obtained, many sects and families are angry but dare not speak up.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. If that was the case, then it was very normal.","‘Nine Stars’ Ye Tiannan?’ A sharp glint flashed through his eyes.","“It is said that Ye Tiannan fell in love with Tang Siyu at first sight. He was so shocked that he wanted to take her as his wife,” Zhu Lilun said gingerly as he glanced at Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly and then fell silent for a while.","“What about now? Is there any more information about Tang Siyu?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“There’s more. In the past, Tang Siyu was hunted down many times, and even attracted the attention of Nine Stars’ leader. It was said that the battle was extremely tragic, and Tang Siyu was severely injured,” Zhu Lilun said, “That’s all we know.”","When he heard that Tang Siyu was seriously injured, Chu Yunfan could no longer suppress the anger in his heart. He thought that Tang Siyu, who had a Core Stage cultivation base, could at least protect herself in the outer realm. He didn’t expect that not long after they arrived, she would encounter Nine Stars and be hunted down by them many times.","“Nine Stars’s leader. Ye Tiannan. The Nine Stars Cult!” Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “I need all the information about Nine Stars, including how many people they have and what kind of experts they have. I think this should be included in the imposed fee.”","“Of course,” Zhu Lilun quickly said. Although he didn’t have much information about Tang Siyu, he had a lot of information about Nine Stars. Unlike Tang Siyu, who came and went without a trace, Nine Stars was a big force, and it was much easier for them to gather information about Nine Stars.","Wang Chao, who was next to Zhu Lilun, handed over a crystal used to record information to Chu Yunfan. This was also a method of martial arts. The information was recorded in the crystal. When the information was needed, one just had to use their divine will to scan it.","After receiving the information, Chu Yunfan immediately left the Mysteries Pavilion. The matter was more complicated than he had thought. Compared to the previous vague information from the agency director, this was much more detailed.","After he left, Zhu Lilun looked at Wang Chao and asked, “What do you have? You still can’t find any records?”","“None whatsoever.” Wang Chao shook his head. “Could he have been cultivating in some deep mountain or old forest? Logically speaking, as long as it was exposed, even if it was within the various kingdoms, we should not be completely ignorant about him.","“Was he perhaps using a disguise technique?” Wang Chao said with some doubt. “From what I know, no one who is around his age and is an expert in using the sword can match up to him.”","“How could it be a disguise technique? There’s always an array in operation in Mysteries Pavilion. Someone using a disguise technique will be immediately seen through when they enter this place,” Lilun said, “It’s as if Jian Wuchen fell from the sky. We can’t find his roots.”","“Master, are you saying that Jian Wuchen is related to Tang Siyu?” Wang Chao asked in shock,","“That’s obvious. Otherwise, who would come here to buy information about Tang Siyu? Tang Siyu’s incident was so big back then. If he was there at that time, he should have heard some things,” Zhu Lilun said lightly, “Do you still remember the spy from Great Wei’s Agency of Secrets that was dealt with previously? The information he sent out was also related to Tang Siyu and that bracelet.”","“That’s right!” Wang Chao was suddenly enlightened. “So this Jian Wuchen is very likely from Great Wei.”","“That’s right. Ask Great Wei’s branch later if there’s a person called Jian Wuchen from their country,” Lilun said, “Also, when the time comes, you can ask someone to inform Nine Stars. Didn’t Nine Stars also leave a reward of five million for us? As long as it had anything to do with Tang Siyu, they’ll reward us.”","Wang Chao nodded and didn’t express any doubts. It wasn’t the first time he had sold information to two parties."]},{"number":1368,"title":"Chapter 1368 Night Attack","paragraphs":["1368 Night Attack","After Chu Yunfan left the Mysteries Pavilion, he scratched his head.","Mysteries Pavilion was the most powerful intelligence agency in the entire outer realm. However, after that battle, they also lost track of Tang Siyu. This was extraordinary. After all, with the Mysteries Pavilion’s ability, it would be difficult to hide much information from them. It was unknown how many years it had developed to become such a behemoth.","According to the intelligence records of the Mysteries Pavilion, there was no record of Tang Siyu’s death, nor did she fall into the hands of Nine Stars. Judging from the time, with the recovery ability of a Core, she should have recovered by now. However, there was no trace of her. There was only one possibility, that she had already left this area.","Chu Yunfan was a little annoyed. It wasn’t easy to get news of Tang Siyu, but she might have already left.","“Nine Stars?” he sneered. Since Tang Siyu couldn’t deal with them before leaving, then let him deal with them.","However, whether it was to deal with Great Wei’s imperial family or to deal with a behemoth like Nine Stars, he had to think about it carefully. The most important thing now was to increase his strength. He was already at the ninth tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. The next step was to reach the peak and unleash all his potential.","After Chu Yunfan found a random inn to stay in, he entered the Mountain River Diagram to cultivate quietly while waiting for the Alchemist Association to gather all the herbs he needed tomorrow. At that time, his strength will also achieve a leap in development.","It was late at night. In Yunshan, the night was silent. Suddenly, outside the city, figures appeared in the night sky like ripples on a water’s surface.","There were more than 20 of them, and each of them was an expert above the Divine Abilities Stage. They wore luxurious robes with nine stars embroidered on their chests. If anyone who knew them saw them, they would definitely understand that they were members of Nine Stars, which dominated the outer realm.","Among these people, the leader was a middle-aged man with a medium build. His eyes were as sharp as an eagle’s as he looked through the layers of darkness. His gaze was locked onto an inn in the city.","“Have you asked clearly? Is Jian Wuchen in this inn?” the middle-aged man said.","“That’s right. According to the intelligence of the Mysteries Pavilion, he should be in this inn.” A Nine Stars elite nodded.","The middle-aged man nodded slowly. “That’s for the best. Surround him so that he won’t be able to escape even if he has wings. This was ordered by the young master. It’s best to keep him alive. He wants to know what relationship Jian Wuchen has with Tang Siyu.”","The middle-sized man gave his orders. Behind him were more than 20 experts who were at least at the seventh tier of the Divine Abilities Stage. There were even two half-step Cores among them. Such a lineup was extremely terrifying no matter where it was placed.","No one knew that there were so many experts hiding in the dark night, but this was destined to be no ordinary night.","The middle-sized man suddenly grabbed out with one hand. His large hand turned into a large hand of spirit energy, which swelled up with the wind and suddenly slammed down on the entire inn.","Bam!","There was a defensive barrier above the inn, but how could it withstand the powerful slap of this Core? In an instant, the inn was smashed into pieces, turning into a cloud of smoke and dust. Countless people in the inn were slapped to death before they could even react in their sleep.","However, this middle-aged man didn’t show any change in his expression. Nine Stars didn’t care about what others thought. However, his expression immediately froze.”Why isn’t there anyone?”","He had deduced from the information he had obtained from the Mysteries Pavilion that Jian Wuchen was most likely a Core or at least a half-step Core. Logically speaking, he shouldn’t have been slapped to death like this. And this slap of his was too smooth. There was no resistance at all.","It wasn’t that there weren’t any experts in the inn. There was a Divine, but in front of this man, they were an ant.","“Could it be that the information was wrong?” At this moment, even the others reacted and looked at each other.","“Why is Xu Shijie and these people here?” Someone recognized the middle-aged man of medium build.","It was Nine Stars’ Elder Xu Shijie.","Xu Shijie was famous throughout the outer realm. He had made great contributions to Nine Stars and was later promoted to the position of elder of Nine Stars.","Some of them had dealt with Xu Shijie before.","Originally, they had thought that there was an invasion from the outer realm. However, it seemed impossible now. After all, Xu Shijie had only brought a total of 20 or so people with him. It would be a joke if they wanted to invade Yunshan on such a scale.","Many people weren’t stupid. They quickly understood that Xu Shijie was here to seek revenge.","A casual move was a ruthless killing move!","However, they didn’t know who had provoked a colossus like Nine Stars to make Nine Stars’ elder personally take action. As for the innocent ordinary people who died in the inn, it was not within the consideration of these big shots. They were just some ants.","“Why? Are you looking for me?”","Just as Xu Shijie was wondering if the information was wrong, a figure suddenly appeared in the air. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","Chu Yunfan’s expression was cold, and there was a hint of anger on his face as he looked at Xu Shijie. Although he was in the inn, he was actually cultivating in the Mountain River Diagram. Therefore, this attack did not cause him any harm. However, the other party’s intention to kill him was already as clear as day.","“You’re Jian Wuchen?” After all, Xu Shijie was a top expert in the Core Stage. He reacted immediately and looked at Chu Yunfan.","However, when he sensed that Chu Yunfan didn’t have the aura of a Core and was clearly only in the Divine Abilities Stage, he immediately heaved a sigh of relief and his expression returned to its lofty state."]},{"number":1369,"title":"Chapter 1369 Nine Stars’ Expert Team Exterminated","paragraphs":["1369 Nine Stars’ Expert Team Exterminated","Regardless of what the information said, a mere Divine Abilities Stage cultivator could not pose any threat to him. Everyone knew the huge gap between the Divine Abilities Stage and the Core Stage.","“You even know my name. Did the Mysteries Pavilion betray me?” Chu Yunfan sneered. He immediately thought of the possibility.","If he had appeared in his original appearance, it would not be a big deal if someone recognized him. However, he had put on a disguise, and Nine Stars had coincidentally come looking for him. Moreover, he had asked the Mysteries Pavilion about Nine Stars and Tang Siyu during the day.","It wasn’t hard to guess that the Mysteries Pavilion had sold out information about him.","Xu Shijie didn’t hear what Chu Yunfan was saying in a low voice. He said, “What’s your relationship with that sl*t Tang Siyu?”","When Chu Yunfan heard the word “sl*t,” a sharp killing intent flashed through his eyes.","“The young master wants to know about that sl*t Tang Siyu, so you better come with me obediently. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being impolite,” Xu Shijie said forcefully. He did not put Chu Yunfan in his eyes at all.","“Xu Shijie? An elder of Nine Stars?” Chu Yunfan sneered at Xu Shijie and said,” I heard that you were involved in the pursuit of Tang Siyu.”","Chu Yunfan had read about this matter in the information provided by the Mysteries Pavilion.","“I was,” Xu Shijie said with a cold smile. He saw the killing intent in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, but he didn’t care. Chu Yunfan was just a Divine. No matter how angry he was, could he overturn the heavens?","Thinking of this, the corners of Xu Sjijie’s mouth curled into a disdainful smile.","“In that case, then you can die,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","“What?” Xu Shijie didn’t seem to understand what Chu Yunfan meant.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had already crossed the sky and appeared in front of Xu Shijie.","Swish!","Chu Yunfan’s arm was wrapped in powerful electric coils. With the force of ten thousand bolts of lightning, he pierced through Xu Shijie’s chest.","Spurt!","Xu Shijie spat out a mouthful of blood. His eyes were wide open as if he still couldn’t believe that he had been killed by Chu Yunfan in one hit. He was a martial artist who had already stepped into the Void Core Stage.","Thinking of this, he finally understood why he felt that something was wrong at the beginning. He was a Core, and there were several half-step Cores present too. However, Chu Yunfan, who was only an ordinary Divine in his eyes, was not frightened in the least.","“How are you so fast?” Xu Shijie said in disbelief. However, it was already too late. The life force in his body disappeared.","Dead silence.","Not only Nine Stars’s experts, but also the experts of Yunshan who were watching the battle with their divine will were completely stunned.","Chu Yunfan was too fast!","They had finally witnessed what it meant to say that speed was the only thing that could not be defeated in the world of martial arts. He had effortlessly killed Xu Shijie who was at the fledgling Void Core Stage. He opened a big hole in Xu Shijie’s chest, and instantly shattered his internal organs.","After Chu Yunfan threw Xu Shijie’s body into the Mountain River Diagram, he stared coldly at the other Nine Stars experts. As for them, they were immediately frightened by Chu Yunfan’s glance as if they were being stared at by a wild beast. They immediately quivered and reacted instantly.","They didn’t communicate with each other. They instinctively ran back without any intention of avenging Xu Shijie. What a joke. Even a powerful expert like Xu Shijie had died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. What could they do?","“You want to leave? None of you will be leaving today!” Chu Yunfan raised his arm high. Around him, more than twenty sword lights rose up and shot toward the fleeing Nine Stars experts.","Swish, swish, swish!","Almost without any suspense, the sword lights that Chu Yunfan unleashed easily killed them. In just a moment, Nine Stars’ group, who had been aggressive before, had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","They did not have the slightest ability to retaliate.","The various forces in Yunshan were completely dumbfounded. When did such a terrifying existence appear in Yunshan? Forget about the Divines and half-step Cores. Even Xu Shijie, who was in Core Stage, was killed in one move!","Those masters who knew Xu Shijie’s many achievements were absolutely dumbfounded. Xu Shijie had fought for Nine Stars and established a great reputation. In the outer realm, he was a terrifying existence that everyone respected. However, this killing god was killed by Chu Yunfan in one move.","“Just how strong is Jian Wuchen?”","“This guy must be in the Core Stage. What Divine Abilities Stage?”","“So scary. Isn’t Jian Wuchen afraid of offending Nine Stars? Nine Stars will definitely not let this go.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but the shock in their eyes did not decrease at all. This was because they knew that Chu Yunfan’s one-shot kill of Xu Shijie seemed to be a very simple matter, but in fact, it was not so. In the world of martial arts, speed was the only thing that could not be broken. It sounded simple, but in fact, there were very few people who could do it.","The ones who were truly shocked were Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao. They had just sold the information on Nine Stars to Chu Yunfan in the afternoon. At the same time, they had also sold information on Chu Yunfan to Nine Stars.","Initially, Zhu Lilun had thought nothing of it. After all, the Mysteries Pavilion claimed that they would sell any information they had as long as one was willing to pay. In the past, it was common for them to sell information to two parties. Even if many people were angry, they could not do anything to the Mysteries Pavilion. It was precisely because of this that he sold Chu Yunfan out without hesitation.","However, after seeing Chu Yunfan easily kill Xu Shijie, he immediately began to regret it. This move might be useful for ordinary people, but when faced with a powerful existence like Chu Yunfan, he suddenly felt a little regretful.","However, what frightened him more was that Chu Yunfan flew over almost immediately after killing Xu Shijie and the others.","“He’s coming here!” Wang Chao’s face revealed a frightened expression.","As the saying goes, if you don’t do anything wrong, you won’t be afraid of ghosts knocking on your door in the middle of the night. And they had done something wrong!"]},{"number":1370,"title":"Chapter 1370 Slaughter Into the Mysteries Pavilion","paragraphs":["1370 Slaughter Into the Mysteries Pavilion","As the saying goes, what one fears will come true. Just as the two of them began to get nervous, they saw Chu Yunfan fly above the Mysteries Pavilion.","“Master, what should we do?” Wang Chao looked at Zhu Lilun in panic. He had seen all kinds of experts. Even Cores had to lower their heads obediently in front of the Mysteries Pavilion. Therefore, he didn’t think that there was anything wrong with it before. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would be so fierce?","The illustrious Xu Shijie was actually not his match.","Ordinary people could only swallow their anger when they suffered, because they were powerless to fight against a behemoth like the Mysteries Pavilion. However, Jian Wuchen was clearly different from the others.","“What are you panicking for? I don’t believe that he will dare to invade Mysteries Pavilion. If he goes against Mysteries Pavilion, there will be no place for him in the world!” Zhu Lilun gritted his teeth. He was also very nervous at this moment, but since things had come to this, he had no other choice.","They had sold the information because they were looking at people, but it was obvious that they had misjudged Chu Yunfan. From the information given by the intelligence department, Chu Yunfan was only suspected to have the cultivation of the Core Stage.","That was just a suspicion, but now that Chu Yunfan had made his move, they realized that it was not just a suspicion. This b*stard could kill a Core like killing an ant. It was not as simple as a suspicion.","However, Zhu Lilun was still confident at this moment. The name of the Mysteries Pavilion was his best shield. Everyone knew how powerful the Mysteries Pavilion was, even though it only dealt in information. Just this alone was enough to exchange for countless experts to work for him. Offending the Mysteries Pavilion meant offending countless experts at the same time. It was impossible for them to escape the Mysteries Pavilion’s pursuit.","Chu Yunfan flew straight to the top of the Mysteries Pavilion with an extremely cold expression. Most people were afraid of the Mysteries Pavilion, but he was not. At most, he would just change to a new disguise. He would let them go around the world to catch Jian Wuchen.","“Zhu Lilun! Wang Chao! Come out!”","Chu Yunfan’s shout shook the whole of Yunshan.","Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao, who were in the Mysteries Pavilion, felt their faces fall. Chu Yunfan had directly named them. If people found out that they were the ones who provoked Chu Yunfan, they could imagine how the others would look at them.","“This d*mned Jian Wuchen!” Wang Chao gritted his teeth.","Zhu Lilun’s face was ashen. He didn’t look as calm as when he sold out Chu Yunfan’s information.","Everyone in the Mysteries Pavilion immediately knew what was going on. In the Mysteries Pavilion, which sold intelligence for a living, it was almost impossible to keep any secrets. Although Zhu Lilun’s status was low, there were obviously some people who were on par with him.","“Did Zhu Lilun provoke this killing star?”","“Looks like he’s been exposed. Something will happen sooner or later.”","“But this guy definitely wouldn’t dare to rush in.”","As everyone was discussing, the two stone lions in front of the Mysteries Pavilion suddenly moved. Everyone thought that they were just ordinary stone lions, but in an instant, they turned into two huge ferocious beasts that pounced toward Chu Yunfan. The strength of these two stone lions was not inferior to an ordinary fledgling Void Core.","“Golems!”","Many people immediately realized that only golems could have such power. The Mysteries Pavilion usually did not reveal its strength, but it actually had such a foundation. This immediately shocked many people. It was no wonder the Mysteries Pavilion dared to open branches to enemies from the outer realms.","Such strength was indeed extraordinary.","Boom!","Boom!","The two stone lions were blown into pieces in mid-air. Although they had the strength of fledgling Void Cores and were more than enough to deter ordinary powerful enemies, it was a pity that they encountered Chu Yunfan. In Chu Yunfan’s hands, they were simply unable to withstand a single blow.","Even if Chu Yunfan restrained himself from using only his sword cultivation, his powerful foundation was there. Golems of this level could not pose any threat to him.","To Chu Yunfan, this was a trivial matter, but to Yunshan, it was a complete sensation. The various forces in the city were shocked that the Mysteries Pavilion had such a trump card. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would casually slash the two stone lions and explode them?","It was obvious who was stronger and who was weaker!","For a time, all kinds of discussions continued.","“Who is this Jian Wuchen? His cultivation of the sword is simply superb!”","“The strength of his cultivation is the rarest thing I’ve seen in my life!”","“Can one’s sword cultivation really be this powerful? It has been a long time since I’ve seen such a powerful swordsman.”","Everyone sighed with emotion, but more people were skeptical.","“He has just offended Nine Stars. Is he going to offend the Mysteries Pavilion as well?”","In the eyes of many people, these two were giants. Offending one was already enough to make them restless, let alone offending both at the same time.","A moment later, an old man in a yellow robe flew out from the depths of the Mysteries Pavilion and looked at Chu Yunfan. “I’m Huang Shouyi, the master of the Yunshan’s Mysteries Pavilion. Why are you trying to ruin our reputation?”","“Master Huang, do you really not know why I want to ruin the reputation of Mysteries Pavilion?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “I came here asking for information, and you sold my information.”","Everyone was in an uproar. After hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, everyone was stunned. It had to be known that many of them had bought or sold information from the Mysteries Pavilion.","If Chu Yunfan was right, they too might have been sold off by the Mysteries Pavilion the moment they asked for the information. From a business perspective, there was nothing wrong with that. As long as the person could afford the price, there was no information that they would not sell.","However, when they thought about it, they couldn’t help but feel their hair stand on end. If that was really the case, they would have to be wary of the Mysteries Pavilion in the future.","This was especially true for the Mysteries Pavilion. It was obvious that they could sell information to two parties. At that time, it would be like what happened to Chu Yunfan, Xu Shijie, and the others today. Life and death were determined by fate. Whoever was stronger would survive.","Huang Shouyi’s expression instantly changed. He could also imagine what kind of blow this news would cause Mysteries Pavilion’s image once it was spread out."]},{"number":1371,"title":"Chapter 1371 Forcing the Pavilion Master to Lower His Head","paragraphs":["1371 Forcing the Pavilion Master to Lower His Head","Some things were unspoken rules. Although everyone knew about it, no one wanted to expose it. However, once it was exposed and put on the table, the impact would be huge.","This was especially true for an organization like the Mysteries Pavilion that sold intelligence for a living. The fact that it had been revealed that it sold intelligence to both parties made many people wary.","“Jian Wuchen, you can’t say such things without evidence. Otherwise, don’t blame the Mysteries Pavilion for being rude,” Huang Shouyi said loudly.","“Evidence? Do you think I’m a policeman? Talking about evidence. Everyone knows what’s going on,” Chu Yunfan said coldly. “Whoever betrayed me will come out and die. It’s that simple.”","Upon hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao’s expressions changed. Not only was Jian Wuchen strong, but he was terrifyingly strong. Even though Huang Shouyi had used the name of the Mysteries Pavilion, it did not scare Chu Yunfan in the slightest.","What they didn’t know was that Jian Wuchen just Chu Yunfan’s disguise. So what if he abandoned it? There was nothing to care about. Even if he were to fight against the Mysteries Pavilion, he was not afraid at all.","“This is too much, this is too much!” Zhu Lilun was instantly enraged. Not only did Chu Yunfan want him to go out and die, but he also knew that even if he didn’t die in Chu Yunfan’s hands today, he had only provoked such a terrifying expert for the Mysteries Pavilion. His future here was completely destroyed.","All of this was because of Chu Yunfan. His eyes were locked on Chu Yunfan, and he wanted to tear him into pieces. However, he had never thought that if it wasn’t for his greed, he wouldn’t have been forced to this point.","“Master, what should we do?” Wang Chao was panicking at this moment. Chu Yunfan had flown directly to the Mysteries Pavilion and wanted them dead.","“Jian Wuchen, don’t go overboard!” Huang Shouyi angrily rebuked. He was also angered by Chu Yunfan’s request. Chu Yunfan was trying to put the Mysteries Pavilion in a difficult position.","“Overboard? Is this too much? If I didn’t have enough strength to protect myself, if it were an ordinary person, I’m afraid they would have died at Xu Shijie’s hands. At that time, who would find trouble with you? What a good plan!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","His words resonated with the various major powers in the city. They were worried that the Mysteries Pavilion would destroy them one day. Chu Yunfan had only gone to ask for some information, and in the blink of an eye, he had attracted such a terrifying enemy. Although it turned out that Chu Yunfan’s enemies weren’t as terrifying as him, they had to be careful in the future.","Everyone had a few enemies, so they could not tolerate such behavior.","“Chu Yunfan, if you leave now, I won’t pursue your crime of trespassing into the Mysteries Pavilion.” Huang Shouyi looked at Chu Yunfan coldly. “Otherwise, the Mysteries Pavilion will kill you even if we use all our abilities. You have to consider this carefully.”","“Are you threatening me?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “If I don’t teach you a lesson, how would you know how powerful I am?”","As soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, he raised his hand and swung his sword. The sword light slashed through the sky, leaving behind a long trail of light in the dark night. However, this trail of light was extremely fast, and it instantly slashed down on Huang Shouyi.","Huang Shouyi was shocked. He never thought that Chu Yunfan would make a move just like that.","Bam!","Huang Shouyi felt a sharp pain in his chest. Then, he saw that his chest was bleeding profusely. Fresh blood spurted out from his neck to his waist. Chu Yunfan’s sword had slashed a huge gash.","Huang Shouyi spat out a mouthful of blood. He quickly circulated his internal energy and frantically healed his injuries. At the same time, his eyes were filled with fear when he looked at Chu Yunfan. He finally understood why Xu Shijie couldn’t even last one round against Chu Yunfan. In the world of martial arts, speed was the only thing that could not be broken. This was a truth that many people understood.","He knew that Chu Yunfan had shown mercy. Otherwise, he could have been killed with just one sword strike. His heart was filled with endless surprise. How could Chu Yunfan be so strong?","It was one thing to kill Xu Shijie in one move, but Xu Shijie was only an ordinary fledgling Void Core while he was a powerful existence who had already stepped into the intermediate Void Core Stage. How could he be so vulnerable?","Huang Shouyi didn’t even see how Chu Yunfan used his divine power before he failed. Everything happened in a flash!","At this moment, he finally understood what Chu Yunfan meant. He thought that he could be on equal footing with Chu Yunfan. Chu Yunfan, who had killed Xu Shijie, was at most on the same level as him. Now that they had exchanged blows, he realized how ridiculously wrong he had been previously.","It was simply a joke!","“I’ll repeat myself. I don’t care what kind of existence the Mysteries Pavilion is. I’m a person who makes a clear distinction between gratitude and resentment. Hand over Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao, or I’ll flatten the Mysteries Pavilion,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","When everyone heard Chu Yunfan’s words, they were in an uproar. Almost everyone thought that Chu Yunfan had gone crazy. He actually provoked the Mysteries Pavilion and even said that he wanted to flatten them. This was unprecedented. Although Nine Stars seemed powerful on the surface, the other major powers were more afraid of the Mysteries Pavilion.","This old force had existed for countless years. No one knew how powerful the Mysteries Pavilion was, but there was no doubt that it was far superior to Nine Stars. And Chu Yunfan actually wanted to force the Mysteries Pavilion to give in.","How bold.","“Isn’t he afraid the Mysteries Pavilion will come after him?”","Many people couldn’t help but have such a thought.","“Very well.” Huang Shouyi’s eyes flashed with a bright light. He spread out his divine will and immediately found Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao. His eyes flashed with killing intent. It was these two people who had provoked such a terrifying enemy!","He couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan now, so he could only vent all his anger on these two people.","At the same time, he knew that because of Chu Yunfan’s words, the image of the Mysteries Pavilion had begun to become unreliable in the eyes of many people. He had to deal with it immediately."]},{"number":1372,"title":"Chapter 1372 The Whole City Shakes","paragraphs":["1372 The Whole City Shakes","Thinking of this, Huang Shouyi didn’t hesitate. Now that Chu Yunfan was forcing his hand, he had no other choice.","He could feel that Chu Yunfan’s words were not a lie. In other words, Chu Yunfan really wanted to flatten the entire Mysteries Pavilion.","Huang Shouyi waved his hand, and Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao immediately felt a powerful suction force. The two of them were sucked into the air under the watchful eyes of everyone. Then, Huang Shouyi gritted his teeth and said word by word, “Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao has violated the rules of the Mysteries Pavilion and sold information without permission. As the master of Yunshan’s Mysteries Pavilion, I hereby sentence the two of you to death!”","Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao were shocked by Huang Shouyi’s words. They had never thought that Huang Shouyi would betray them like this. They had thought that they could scare Chu Yunfan away with the reputation of the Mysteries Pavilion. This was not the first time they had done something like this, and they had never encountered such a backlash.","They finally understood that they had really kicked a hornet’s nest this time.","Previously, the victims could only swallow their anger because they could not do anything to the Mysteries Pavilion. In the face of the Pavilion’s powerful might, they could only swallow their anger. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He would take revenge for the smallest grievance and had the strength to repay it.","After understanding this, the two of them immediately turned pale. Even the master of Mysteries Pavilion, who they relied on the most, wanted to personally capture them and bring them to trial.","“Master Huang, I’m innocent! It was all my master’s doing! I didn’t get a single cent. He took everything!” Wang Chao immediately betrayed Zhu Lilun.","“You wicked disciple!” Of course, Zhu Lilun was immediately furious. Although he had heard of monkeys scattering when the tree fell, he had never heard of anyone scattering so quickly. However, he soon realized that now wasn’t the time to be angry. He hurriedly said to Huang Shouyi, “Master Huang, this is all a misunderstanding. I’ve made great contributions to the Mysteries Pavilion. Master Huang, please let me off this time. My disciple did all this without my knowledge.”","Huang Shouyi watched as this pair of master and disciple exposed each other and pushed the blame onto each other. He was so angry that he burst out laughing. However, this affected his injuries, causing him to grimace in pain. He could feel the attention of all the major factions turning over, and the two of them had done such a thing in front of everyone.","What a disgrace. They had marred the reputation of the Mysteries Pavilion!","At this moment, Huang Shouyi wished he had medicine for regret. He would pinch these two people to death as soon as he came up so as to prevent them from embarrassing themselves.","“Shut up, you idiots!” Huang Shouyi was enraged. He waved his hand and crushed the two of them in mid-air.","Although he was severely injured, Zhu Lilun was only a half-step Core, and Wang Chao was only a Divine. How could he possibly withstand Huang Shouyi’s rage?","After killing Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao, Huang Shouyi turned to Chu Yunfan and said, “Jian Wuchen, are you satisfied now?”","“I am. Wouldn’t it have been better if this had happened earlier?” Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction.","“Hmph!” Huang Shouyi snorted coldly before turning around and entering the depths of the Mysteries Pavilion to recuperate.","Chu Yunfan turned around and descended into another inn.","This battle had finally come to an end. However, to the people of Yunshan, it was like a big show. High tides came one after another.","First, Nine Stars’ expert, Xu Shijie, appeared unexpectedly, but he was killed by Chu Yunfan in one move. Then, another good show started.","Chu Yunfan had attacked the Mysteries Pavilion. Although there were only a few words between the two sides, it was not difficult for everyone to deduce the process of the matter with their intelligence.","Chu Yunfan had come to ask for information about Nine Stars, but the Mysteries Pavilion had sold this matter to Nine Stars.","What was even more surprising was that they thought that even if Chu Yunfan suffered such a loss, he could only grit his teeth and swallow it. Who knew that Chu Yunfan did not have any scruples and attacked the Mysteries Pavilion and heavily injured the master of the Pavilion, Huang Shouyi.","That attack was too fast, so fast that most people could not see it clearly, or even react to it.","Although Huang Shouyi didn’t often fight in Yunshan, the upper echelons of the various major powers knew quite a bit about him. He could be considered an outstanding expert in Yunshan, and he was definitely one of the top few people.","However, such a powerful existence was severely injured by Chu Yunfan’s attack. This reflected how terrifying Chu Yunfan was and overturned everyone’s previous inference that he had not yet entered the Core Stage.","But no matter what, Chu Yunfan’s terrifying image had already been established. He was powerful and vengeful. Even if he could not be roped in, he could not be made an enemy of. That was what everyone thought at the time.","What was even more unexpected was that under Chu Yunfan’s coercion, the Mysteries Pavilion, which had always been strong, would execute Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao. The viciousness of his methods made many people secretly shocked.","However, this matter was like a nuclear bomb exploding in their hearts.","The Mysteries Pavilion had actually given in!","This was unprecedented!","In the past, many people had suffered losses, but no one had ever forced the Mysteries Pavilion to the point where they had no choice but to kill their elders and disciples to retreat. Many people could imagine that the Mysteries Pavilion would fight to the death with Jian Wuchen in the future. They would definitely send a large number of experts to kill him.","Otherwise, the reputation of the Mysteries Pavilion would be swept away.","But for now, Chu Yunfan was probably the only person who could force the Mysteries Pavilion to give in. Whether the Mysteries Pavilion had no choice but to give in or was really scared of him, there was no doubt that this swordsman who had suddenly appeared out of nowhere was definitely one of the people they could not afford to provoke.","“Which sect is Jian Wuchen from? Why don’t we have any clue?”","The names of many sword experts flashed through the minds of many people, but none of them matched the person in front of them. Everything seemed to have popped out from the cracks in the rocks. They didn’t even know anything other than that he was Jian Wuchen.","All of a sudden, all the major forces began to move out. All the forces began to investigate all kinds of things related to Jian Wuchen."]},{"number":1373,"title":"Chapter 1373 Ten Feet Tall, Ten Feet Wide, Green-Faced, and Fanged Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["1373 Ten Feet Tall, Ten Feet Wide, Green-Faced, and Fanged Chu Yunfan","Huang Shouyi returned to the depths of the Mysteries Pavilion, and his eyes flickered with a terrifying light. Today’s matter would probably spread throughout Yunshan by tomorrow morning. Their Mysteries Pavilion’s reputation would completely crumble.","This was especially true because of this incident. The various powers began to feel uneasy about the Mysteries Pavilion. After all, although they knew that the Mysteries Pavilion had been selling their information, they didn’t have evidence.","However, being caught by others was another matter. From now on, the prestige of the Mysteries Pavilion would plummet.","Thinking of this, the fire in Huang Shouyi’s chest rose. He had always been the one looking down on the masses. He never thought that one day, he would be completely ignored by others. He could tell that Jian Wuchen was still somewhat wary of the Mysteries Pavilion. Otherwise, he himself would probably be in danger.","The Mysteries Pavilion’s token had more or less played a role, although this effect seemed ridiculous no matter how one looked at it. Jian Wuchen was angry with Zhu Lilun and Wang Chao. Even when selling information to two parties, one had to look at the target, but they had both misjudged. If they had known how terrifying Chu Yunfan was, they would never have dared to act so casually.","As Huang Shouyi circulated his divine power to heal himself, his mind was filled with thoughts. How could such an expert appear out of thin air? Jian Wuchen was just like Tang Siyu. He couldn’t find out anything about Jian Wuchen.","This was the most abnormal thing. As long as someone had appeared and made a name for themselves, the Mysteries Pavilion would be able to quickly investigate. Even when they were young, there would be no exception.","However, these two people seemed to have jumped out of a rock. When they first appeared in front of everyone, they both had considerable strength. Tang Siyu was nothing to worry about. Although she was stunning, she was not a threat. Who was truly terrifying was Jian Wuchen.","He was ruthless and powerful!","What was truly terrifying was that he was fearless. He had killed Nine Stars’ experts and threatened to destroy Mysteries Pavilion. One could judge his character from his style of doing things. This kind of person was the most difficult to deal with.","In Huang Shouyi’s heart, he had already completely raised Chu Yunfan’s strength to another level—the late Void Core Stage. If that was really the case, then it would be really troublesome. Even he was not a match for an expert of this level.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary late Void Core. Huang Shouyi was already at the peak of the intermediate Void Core Stage. It was not easy for an ordinary late Void Core to defeat him, let alone severely injure him with a single strike.","If Jian Wuchen had not shown mercy, he would have been killed in one move.","“Investigate this. We must find out who he is!” Huang Shouyi said through gritted teeth.","However, he chose to wait to get his revenge. After today’s event, Nine Stars would not let it go easily. They would definitely take revenge. At that time, he would wait and see before making a decision.","Moreover, judging from today’s incident, even an ordinary late Void Core might not be a match for Chu Yunfan, unless he mobilized a peak Void Core. However, which expert didn’t hold great power in the Mysteries Pavilion? It wasn’t that easy to persuade them.","Thinking of this, Huang Shouyi could not help but feel a little discouraged.","It was a quiet night. All the major forces were searching for a lot of information about Chu Yunfan. However, they still did not find anything. They could not find this person at all. Not a single sword expert in the entire outer realm looked like this.","It was as if he had appeared out of thin air!","However, although they couldn’t find him, they still listed Chu Yunfan as someone who couldn’t be provoked.","There was no doubt that Chu Yunfan, who had killed Xu Shijie and forced the Mysteries Pavilion to lower their heads, was currently in the limelight. Moreover, he was a terrifying expert. He must not be provoked. Otherwise, it would definitely be a disaster.","For a time, even the scouts around the inn where Chu Yunfan was staying had decreased by a lot. They didn’t have the guts to spy on a powerful Core. Although Chu Yunfan appeared to be in the Divine Abilities Stage, no one believed that he was only in the Divine Abilities Stage. He was simply pretending to be a pig to eat a tiger.","“You don’t know how powerful the legendary Jian Wuchen is. It’s said that he’s ten feet tall tall and has a girth of tell feet. He has a green face and sharp fangs, and he holds a great sword in his hand!” A guest was talking about the news he had heard. “You must have heard of Xu Shijie, one of Nine Stars’ elders. Tsk tsk, he’s a Core. But Jian Wuchen shouted, ‘Hey, I see you! Hand over your life!’”","“What’s wrong?”","“Hurry up and tell us!”","“If you don’t tell us, I’ll fall out with you!”","The guests hurriedly urged him to tell them the rest of the story. They had heard some things last night, but they had not seen it with their own eyes.","“That sword light flashed by, and Xu Shijie’s head was cut off and sent flying. Xu Shijie didn’t even have time to react. Tell me, how fast is that speed? It’s faster than sound!” the guest said.","“That’s amazing. It would be great if I could have such a cultivation.”","“Don’t even think about it. Dream on. Didn’t you hear what he said? The reason why Jian Wuchen was so powerful was that he had to eat a child’s heart and liver every day to cultivate.”","“Nonsense. How can there be such a ridiculous cultivation method.”","“Who says so? My cousin’s neighbor’s second cousin’s son is working in the Mysteries Pavilion. Why would I lie to you? It’s said that Jian Wuchen’s technique is related to the demonic path.”","“Why did I hear that he cultivates dual cultivation of the sword path?”","Everyone was discussing animatedly as if they were about to explode. They had no idea that the Chu Yunfan they were talking about—who was ten feet tall, ten feet around the waist, had a green face and sharp teeth, held a great sword, and ate a child’s heart and liver every day—was right next to them.","At first, Chu Yunfan listened to their discussion with interest, but the more he listened, the more his face turned ashen. The corner of his mouth twitched slightly. Although he knew that rumors couldn’t be trusted, it had only been one night. How did the rumors become like this? They all acted as if they had insider information.","It sounded as if it was true!","Chu Yunfan left the hall speechlessly and rushed to the Alchemist Association. The herbs he ordered yesterday should have arrived."]},{"number":1374,"title":"Chapter 1374 Secluded Meditation, Striking for the Peak of the Divine Abilities Stage","paragraphs":["1374 Secluded Meditation, Striking for the Peak of the Divine Abilities Stage","Chu Yunfan left the inn and arrived at the Alchemist Association in no time.","This time, the person who came out from the Alchemist Association was not the attendant from yesterday, but a tall and well-built old man dressed in a luxurious robe with a graceful bearing.","“Jian Wuchen, I am the president of Yunshan City’s Alchemist Association, Gongsun Zheng,” the old man said.","“President Gongsun.” Chu Yunfan nodded in greeting.","Gongsun Zheng looked at Chu Yunfan with a complicated look in his eyes. He had witnessed the battle yesterday and knew very well how terrifying this seemingly harmless young man was. Chu Yunfan killed Xu Shijie with one strike and severely injured Huang Shouyi with one strike.","Both of them were famous existences, but against Chu Yunfan, they could not fight back. One could imagine how amazing Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was.","“We’ve found all the herbs you ordered yesterday,” Gongsun Zheng said, “I’ll hand them over to you later.”","“All right.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Wait a moment, Jian Wuchen!”","Chu Yunfan was about to go collect the herbs when he was stopped by Gongsun Zheng.","“What’s wrong, President Gongsun?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“I wonder if you’d be interested in taking on a mission.” Gongsun Zheng said slowly.","“What kind of mission? Tell me about it,” Chu Yunfan said,","“It’s not convenient for me to tell you the details now. I can only tell you that if you are interested, I will fill you in via comms talisman.” Gongsun Zheng shook his head. “It’s a mission with a good reward. I haven’t received any instructions yet, so it’s not convenient for me to disclose details just yet.”","“All right, then let me know when the time comes.” Chu Yunfan nodded. He was a little curious. With Gongsun Zheng’s identity, he should be considered a high-level member of the Alchemist Association, but even he had to accept orders. Was the mission from a high-level member of the Alchemist Association’s headquarters?","However, since he didn’t say anything, Chu Yunfan didn’t ask. He just left a trace of his primordial spirit on Gongsun Zheng’s communication crystal so that they could contact each other later.","“Oh, yesterday’s incident has alerted the higher-ups of Nine Stars. I’m afraid they won’t let it go.” Gongsun Zheng kindly advised him, “I don’t want you to be killed just like that.”","“Just in time. I can’t wait any longer,” Chu Yunfan said, his eyes flashing with a sharp light.","Nine Stars had tried to kill Tang Siyu several times, and now it was time to settle the score. With the help of the Spirit Spring Water, Chu Yunfan should be able to reach the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage in no time. When that happens, he would be fearless even if it was a Peak Void Core and could easily kill them.","He did not choose to return to Great Wei immediately because he knew that his strength was not enough. He would not be able to gain any advantage against General Ye Fei and the First Guardian. At most, he could barely protect himself.","However, when he reached the peak of the Divine Abilities Stage, he was absolutely confident that neither of them would be his match.","Time. What he needed now was time!","Gongsun Zheng also wanted to test Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan couldn’t even resist Nine Stars, then he should forget about it.","Chu Yunfan quickly got the herbs he wanted and scanned them with his divine will. After checking that there were no mistakes, he left the Alchemist Association and returned to the inn.","At this moment, in the inn, the guest who was talking about Chu Yunfan’s secret was still talking about Chu Yunfan’s secret.","“As for Jian Wuchen’s beheader sword, it’s really something...”","Chu Yunfan laughed and shook his head. After entering his room, he went straight into the Mountain River Diagram.","Compared to when Chu Yunfan first obtained the Mountain River Diagram, the space inside had expanded many times. From afar, he could see the embryonic form of a world. However, in this vast space, the herb mountain had already occupied half of it. As the Brahma Tree grew, the herb mountain continued to grow.","This was a treasure that could change according to the environment required for various divine materials. Without the mountain of precious herbs, Chu Yunfan would not have been able to transplant the Brahma Divine Tree.","In this space, Chu Yunfan sat cross-legged in mid-air. He began to circulate the Emperor Method with all his might. His magic power boiled over his body like flames. Balls of lightning power were released around his body, turning into a sea of lightning.","He was already at the ninth level of the Divine Abilities Stage. If he wanted to take another step forward, he needed to unleash all his potential and step into the peak. Only then would he have the stepping stone to the Core Stage.","The potential of ordinary people was limited, so it was easy to release their potential because their potential was obvious. However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had the Imperial Phsyqiue and the Thunderclap Physique—two top physiques—and they were fused into one. His potential was more than a hundred times that of ordinary people. If he wanted to release it, it would take a long time through ordinary methods.","Fortunately, he had the Spirit Spring Water to speed up this process.","Chu Yunfan took out a porcelain bottle and poured a drop of Spirit Spring Water into his mouth. It was as if he had been enlightened. His entire body trembled and a clear stream flowed through his limbs and bones.","He immediately realized that the cells in his body seemed to have been stimulated by something. They continuously produced divine power, increasing his divine power by a large margin.","This had already exceeded the usual limit.","Chu Yunfan knew that he was on the right path. His body’s potential was indeed being stimulated. Although the speed was not very fast, it was much faster than his own constant use of various methods to stimulate his potential.","“This Spirit Spring Water lives up to its reputation!”","Chu Yunfan quickly circulated the Emperor Method and refined the Spirit Spring Water, stimulating the potential in his body to be released bit by bit.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan finally stopped. His mana had increased by a third. Don’t underestimate this third. For a Core who could fully release their power, a third increase in mana could double their combat strength.","“Not enough, not enough!” Chu Yunfan poured out another drop of Spirit Spring Water and swallowed it. More potential was stimulated."]},{"number":1375,"title":"Chapter 1375 Three Days Later, the Strong Enemy Arrives","paragraphs":["1375 Three Days Later, the Strong Enemy Arrives","Time flew by, and three days passed in the blink of an eye.","Three days passed peacefully in Yunshan. To ordinary people, these three days were no different from the past. However, to the major forces in the city who knew the situation, it felt like a year.","After all, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had completely fallen out with Nine Stars and the Mysteries Pavilion. However, during these three days, the three parties were very strange. Chu Yunfan did not run away, but hid in the inn and cultivated in seclusion. He did not see anyone.","If it weren’t for the fact that there were people from the various forces watching, they would have thought that Chu Yunfan had already run away. However, Chu Yunfan didn’t look like he was going to run away. On the contrary, he seemed to be waiting for the revenge of Nine Stars and the Mysteries Pavilion.","There was nothing to be afraid of.","Although he was powerful, many people thought that he was far weaker than Nine Stars, let alone the entire Mysteries Pavilion. They didn’t know where Chu Yunfan’s confidence came from.","Correspondingly, Chu Yunfan did not flee, and the expected revenge of the Mysteries Pavilion did not appear. The Pavilion did not seem to care about the fact that they had bowed their heads in front of Chu Yunfan and suffered a loss.","On the other hand, Nine Stars didn’t seem to be taking any action either. Compared to their usual aggressive style, this was like a completely different entity.","Therefore, the entire atmosphere was very strange.","Finally, just when everyone thought that this matter would continue to drag on like this, there was a sudden violent fluctuation in the void. Immediately after, a group of more than a thousand people appeared above Yunshan.","Many experts immediately sensed that this was a spatial teleportation array.","Everyone looked over and saw that these thousands of people were all dressed in the uniform of Nine Stars disciples. However, they were all female disciples. Each of them was as beautiful as a flower, and each of them was powerful.","What shocked many even more was that these beautiful female disciples were all at the Divine Abilities Stage.","Many people could not help but exclaim in surprise. Just what kind of faction had actually made such a big move? Over a thousand Divine Abilities Stage female disciples. No matter where they were placed, this could be said to be a huge formation.","In the middle of the thousands of female disciples was a huge carriage. This carriage was extremely luxurious and decorated with carved beams and painted pillars. It was like a luxurious ride, and it was extraordinary in every way.","However, to everyone’s surprise, the carriage was pulling an incomparably huge bed. On the bed, there was a young man with a lazy expression. There were actually a few beautiful maids accompanying him.","“It’s Ye Tiannan, the young master of Nine Stars!” someone exclaimed, immediately revealing the identity of this person.","Many people suddenly thought of who else could it be other than Ye Tiannan, with such a big lineup and such a lavish way of traveling. As long as one had seen such a lineup once, they would never forget it. It was even more awe-inspiring than an emperor’s trip.","Ordinary people didn’t understand what was happening. Although some people had heard about the young master of Nine Stars, they didn’t know why he was here. However, the major forces in the city knew about it—it was because Chu Yunfan had killed more than 20 experts of Nine Stars a few days ago.","Many people sighed. Finally, the main character appeared.","In the Mysteries Pavilion, Huang Shouyi looked at Ye Tiannan, who had appeared in the sky, and a cold smile appeared on his face. In the past few days, his injuries had already recovered. Although it looked very serious, with the recovery ability of a Core, he had recovered very quickly.","However, even after mobilizing all sorts of resources, they still could not find out Chu Yunfan’s background. It was as if everything had appeared out of thin air. This made him very puzzled.","On the other side, the president of the Alchemist Association, Gongsun Zheng, was also looking at Ye Tiannan and the others who were extremely gorgeous in the sky. However, he didn’t say anything in the end. It all depended on whether Jian Wuchen could survive this calamity.","In the inn, everyone was scared silly. Ye Tiannan and the others appeared out of thin air above the inn. No matter how stupid they were, they knew that Ye Tiannan and the others had come with ill intentions. As soon as it arrived, it had already released all its pressure, oppressing everyone until they could not raise their heads.","After a long time, the young man in the carriage, Ye Tiannan, said lazily, “Such an eyesore. Go down there and kill everyone alive in this area.”","When the people in the city heard this, they couldn’t help but be in an uproar. There were at least tens of thousands of people in the entire area, and Ye Tiannan wanted to kill them all with just one sentence.","“This is too brutal!”","When the experts from other places saw this scene, they couldn’t help but tremble in anger. No matter what, they were still people from Yunshan. When they saw outsiders wantonly slaughter their hometown people, boundless anger spewed out from their hearts.","“That’s Ye Tiannan. Is this the first day you’ve heard of him? I heard that there was once a female disciple of a sect he wanted to take but she rejected him. In a fit of anger, he massacred her entire sect. There were tens of thousands of people, and not a single one was left.”","“I also heard that he later sold that female disciple to the lowest brothel and she was played to death.”","“If this kind of person didn’t have a powerful father, he would have been beaten to death long ago.”","“However, what method does he have? Who dares to provoke Nine Stars’ cult master?”","Everyone discussed animatedly, feeling indignant. However, no one dared to go up and stop them. They all understood that if they attacked, it would be like a mantis trying to stop a chariot. They would be courting death. Just the thousands of Divine Abilities Stage female disciples were already shocking enough.","Everyone in the inn, including the people in this area, felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave. There was no reason for him to kill them all at the slightest disagreement.","They didn’t even have a chance to retort. What was even more terrifying was that they were suppressed by a terrifying pressure and couldn’t move. Even if they were killed, they could only wait for death.","They wanted to shout, but they realized that they could not make a sound no matter what. It was as if someone had strangled their necks. It was obvious how terrifying those people above were.","Why did such misfortune befall them?","That feeling of waiting for death, every minute and every second felt like a year. No one would stand up to save them.","All the forces in the city fell silent, silently agreeing with Ye Tiannan’s every move. So what if they stopped him? They would only attract Nine Stars, who was even more terrifying. One blow was enough to destroy Yunshan.","They were no match for Nine Stars."]},{"number":1376,"title":"Chapter 1376 Acting Tough Was Useless, Getting Angry Out of Humiliation","paragraphs":["1376 Acting Tough Was Useless, Getting Angry Out of Humiliation","Even the city lord, which should have stood up, was silent.","Against a giant like Nine Stars, it was impossible for the city lord of Yunshan to be an opponent, and it was impossible for them to completely offend Nine Stars for the lives of those ordinary people who were like ants.","Everyone in the entire area could only kneel on the ground, trembling and waiting to die. On the street, a middle-aged woman was trembling with a child in her arms, her legs completely kneeling under this pressure.","However, she tried her best to protect the child in her arms and transferred all her only true energy to the child, but her bones cracked under the pressure. The little girl was about six or seven years old, and she looked terrified. She didn’t know why things had suddenly become like this as if a mighty force was crushing her young body. All the people in the street were prostrate on the ground.","Above the sky, the female disciples of Nine Stars scattered and flew away from the area to escape. Everyone was in despair, but they couldn’t even make a final cry.","Suddenly, at this moment, a more majestic breath was released and the pressure that was crushing on everyone instantly disappeared without a trace. Everyone looked up and saw an unforgettable scene.","A sword flew out of an inn, and its light shot out across the sky. When the air turned into thousands of small sword lights, it cut through the sky and swept toward the thousands Nine Stars disciples.","That scene turned into a curtain of light, like meteors sweeping across the sky.","The thousands of female disciples who came aggressively were instantly swept away. Those sword lights seemed to have eyes, and they hit their target every time they struck. From a distance, it seemed as if these female disciples had burst into blood-colored fireworks, and they were chopped down in mid-air.","Slice!","Slice!","Slice!","Almost in an instant, all the thousands of female disciples were beheaded. None of them escaped.","“Who did that?!” Ye Tiannan was shocked. Thousands of his female disciples were beheaded all at once, which made him feel as if he was being grabbed and slapped severely, and he was furious.","“Since you’re aiming for me, why would you hurt the innocent?” Chu Yunfan walked out of the inn slowly, walked up to the sky step by step, and confronted Ye Tiannan from afar.","Ye Tiannan looked a bit annoyed. He looked at Chu Yunfan with reddened eyes, wishing he could swallow Chu Yunfan. It was this guy who disrupted him.","He had cultivated these thousands of female disciples carefully, and every time he travels, he went out in grandeur, and these female disciples are indispensable as a foil.","“Hurt the innocent? Innocent my foot. Since they are around here, they are guilty. Do you think you can save them?” Ye Tiannan said with a somewhat ferocious expression. “I want them all to die!”","Chu Yunfan shook his head, his eyes flashed with murderous intent. Ye Tiannan was incompetent. He looked like a second-year middle school boy who puts on airs and became angry from embarrassment. A little mishap is enough to make him go completely berserk. He was clearly just another playboy relying on his powerful parents.","Seeing the disappointment in Chu Yunfan’s eyes, Ye Tiannan was furious. “How dare you be disappointed with me! Who are you? Are you worthy of looking at me that way?”","Since he was a child, he had been favored and aloof, and the most unsightly thing was this kind of look. This damned guy, who did he think he was?","“Not only do I want you to die, but I also want to rip your soul out. Then, I will torture your soul. I want to see what kind of relationship you have with that bitch Tang Siyu!”","Boom!","In an instant, Chu Yunfan moved, and a long sword unsheathed from behind his back, turning into a terrifying sword light and slashing toward Ye Tiannan.","“Are you worthy of mentioning her name?!”","Chu Yunfan’s speed was so fast that no one expected he would suddenly make such a move. He brought out the essence of the word “speed” to the fullest.","Ye Tiannan was taken aback by Chu Yunfan and completely frightened. He was tyrannical, and when Chu Yunfan was furious, he was even more tyrannical than him. He was the young master of Nine Stars, but in front of Chu Yunfan, he was nothing.","Although he himself had cultivation and had even stepped into the Core Stage, he obtained it through double cultivation, and it was a strength cultivated in a greenhouse, which was completely different from Chu Yunfan, who had killed a mountain of corpses and poured out a sea of blood.","Clang!","With a huge roar, the sword light in the sky was blocked, and a terrible storm was set off, sweeping across the city.","The city barriers were activated immediately, blocking most of the waves. Otherwise, the aftermath of this blow alone would be enough to destroy the entire area. A confrontation between Cores was like a nuclear bomb collision, extremely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan looked up but saw that his sword had been blocked. At some point, a man wearing armor and holding a dagger-axe appeared in front of him. It was he who blocked Chu Yunfan’s sword at the critical moment. Otherwise, even if Ye Tiannan had great abilities, he could not escape death.","Ye Tiannan finally realized that he almost died at the hands of an unknown soldier, and he was afraid for a while when he thought of this. Immediately, he became furious and furious.","“Tie Nu, kill him! Tear him into pieces! Kill everyone here! I want them to be buried with him!” Ye Tiannan roared ferociously. Thinking about how he had almost died at Chu Yunfan’s hands, the anger in his heart boiled up.","At this time, the experts in the city finally came to their senses and realized that Chu Yunfan almost killed Ye Tiannan with just one strike. Although Ye Tiannan’s strength is not the strongest, and many people were stronger than him in other regions, he was so arrogant and could live so well because he had an extremely terrifying father.","According to rumors, the leader of Nine Stars may even be an existence above the realm of the Void Core, and Nine Stars had been developed to the point where it was outside the territory.","Chu Yunfan really dared to kill him, and he did it just because there was a disagreement.","At this moment, even Huang Shouyi had nothing to say. Yesterday, when Chu Yunfan attacked the Mysteries Pavilion, he felt that it was already the limit. Who knew that it would look like a drizzle today?","Considering that he even dared to kill Ye Tiannan, it is not surprising that he attacked the Mysteries Pavilion branch."]},{"number":1377,"title":"Chapter 1377 Treated Like a Dog","paragraphs":["1377 Treated Like a Dog","In Ye Tiannan’s eyes, Chu Yunfan was a lunatic. For a moment of pleasure, Ye Tiannan would do anything.","However, he didn’t know that to Chu Yunfan, Jian Wuchen was just a disguise. He could change into someone else in mere minutes. Without the shackles of his true identity, Chu Yunfan could be even more unrestrained and kill as he wished.","Being able to act according to one’s heart was a rare carefree state in cultivation.","Of course, this was also thanks to his secret technique. If it were anyone else who wanted to change their appearance, they would not be able to hide it from others at all, not even those in the Divine Abilities Stage.","Divines could judge one’s age by looking at their surroundings. All these unbelievable abilities were divine powers.","Ye Tiannan’s roar shook the entire world. All the experts in Yunshan heard it, but they only became more silent and did not stand up.","“Kill me? A piece of trash like you?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “If you didn’t have your father, you would have been beaten to death and fed to the dogs!”","Ye Tiannan laughed sinisterly and said, “So what? I have such a fate, but you are lowly people who don’t have such a fate. You are just like that sl*t. Last time, that sl*t Tang Siyu hurt me and ran away. Do you think you can run away this time? You better tell me what your relationship with that sl*t is, and I will save you a few days of torture.”","He didn’t feel embarrassed about the things that ordinary people didn’t want to talk about. On the contrary, he was proud of it. To him, this was proof of his noble bloodline. Otherwise, why would some people be born as high and mighty as him, while others were born as slaves?","This was fate. And he was the one with the best luck!","And that damned sl*t and this damned guy in front of him actually dared to resist fate. They deserved to die ten thousand times over!","“You’re courting death!”","Chu Yunfan could not hide the killing intent in his eyes. Ye Tiannan had completely angered him. Ye Tiannan was like a pile of dog shit, but he still thought that he was so great.","However, if he wanted to kill Ye Tiannan, he would have to go through Tie Nu.","Tie Nu exuded a heavy aura. Just by standing there quietly, Chu Yunfan felt as if a mountain was collapsing toward him. This was an extremely powerful opponent.","The peak Void Core stage!","Tie Nu was a peak Void Core!","This kind of expert should be a proud and arrogant person, but he was being ordered around by Ye Tiannan like a servant.","Chu Yunfan recalled that the information about Nine Stars that the Mysteries Pavilion had given him had records of this Tie Nu. He was the number one expert under Nine Stars’ cult master. He was known as the Iron General. Every time Nine Stars went out to war, he would be the first to charge. He was powerful and liked to wear armor, so he was called the Iron General.","In Nine Stars, he was one of the most powerful existences!","According to Nine Stars’ declaration, Tie Nu was willing to work for Nine Stars because the cult master had saved him when he was young. Many people scoffed at this statement. At this level, even if there was any kindness, he should have long repaid it. How could he be ordered around like a cow or a horse?","However, there was another explanation in the information provided by the Mysteries Pavilion, which was that Tie Nu was being controlled by the cult master. He was under a restriction, so he had no choice but to be ordered around by Nine Stars’ leader.","According to the information obtained from the Mysteries Pavilion, Tie Nu was definitely at the peak Void Core Stage, yet he was now a servant. It was simply lamentable.","“Back down!” Tie Nu scolded Chu Yunfan, his voice buzzing as if he was stuck in a tin can.","He didn’t attack immediately because he sensed the dangerous aura around Chu Yunfan. His first instinct told him that he couldn’t underestimate this man with a sword.","“Tie Nu, go! I want him torn to pieces!” Ye Tiannan shouted in dissatisfaction, “I want to extract his soul and torture him day and night. I want him to know the consequences of fighting against fate. I was born nobler than him!”","“Young master, this beast is dangerous and shouldn’t be underestimated,” Tie Nu said, seemingly unaffected.","“Dangerous? Of course, he’s dangerous. Otherwise, why would I ask my father for you?” Ye Tiannan slapped Tie Nu’s head hard, producing a loud metallic sound. “If you don’t go, do you want me to take the risk? Aren’t you Father’s number one expert? Why do you not dare to step forward like a dog?”","A hint of anger flashed across Tie Nu’s eyes, but a painful expression soon appeared on his face, and the anger in his eyes was immediately restrained.","“Don’t you feel sad? To be a slave to such trash and be ordered around by him?” Chu Yunfan asked coldly.","Those who could cultivate to the peak of the Void Core Stage were heroes and geniuses. Yet, Tie Nu was being treated like a dog. This was the greatest humiliation for a peak Void Core.","There was a hint of struggle in Tie Nu’s eyes, but it soon turned cold. “Jian Wuchen, there’s no need to say anything else. It’s good if you come with us obediently today. Otherwise, don’t blame me for being rude,” he said coldly.","Boom!","As soon as Tie Nu finished speaking, Ye Tiannan hit him hard on the head. Ye Tiannan made a hand seal and Tie Nu immediately rolled on the ground as if he had suffered a violent attack. Pain erupted from the depths of his soul and every cell.","Even with Tie Nu’s willpower, he couldn’t withstand it!","Ye Tiannan kicked Tie Nu hard.","“You dog! Who told you to act on your own? I want him dead. I want him to be torn into pieces!”","No one had expected things to develop like this. Ye Tiannan began to teach Tie Nu a lesson in front of everyone. Tie Nu, who was known as the number one expert under Nine Stars’ master, was beaten like a dog by Ye Tiannan.","All the masters in the city glared at Ye Tiannan. No matter which camp they were from, they all felt a little sympathetic and moved. After all, they were like Tie Nu, both pursuing the supreme martial arts. It was just that their cultivation levels were different.","Such a person was actually treated like a dog. Worse than a dog even.","At this moment, it was inevitable that the fox would grieve for the rabbit’s death."]},{"number":1378,"title":"Chapter 1378 Crushing Tie Nu","paragraphs":["1378 Crushing Tie Nu","At this moment, Chu Yunfan made his move. His figure was like a bolt of lightning, turning into a sword light. In an instant, he arrived in front of Ye Tiannan, and the sword light tore apart everything.","Boom!","In an instant, it swept across. However, just as the sword light was about to hit Ye Tiannan, it was blocked by a dagger-ax. The sword light was shattered in the air.","“You want to save him despite the way he treats you?” Chu Yunfan looked at Tie Nu coldly.","“This is none of your business. Cut the crap!” Tie Nu said as he forced himself to get up.","Although he had been tormented badly just now, he was still a peak Void Core after all. He recovered in a moment.","“Go, Tie Nu! Kill him!” Ye Tiannan roared.","He was covered in cold sweat. He had almost been killed by Chu Yunfan just now. He finally realized that if he couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan today, he might be killed by Chu Yunfan instead. Although he was a Void Core, he now understood how big the gap between him and Chu Yunfan was.","It was simply terrifying.","He had never known that someone could be so powerful. In the past, even if those people had such strength, they would not attack because they were afraid of his father. Consequently, he became arrogant.","Who would have thought that he would meet Chu Yunfan, who didn’t care about his identity at all?","He knew that this was not the time to teach Tie Nu a lesson. If it weren’t for Tie Nu, he would have died at Chu Yunfan’s hands a long time ago, and twice at that. Bringing Tie Nu here today was the right choice. If it weren’t for Tie Nu, he would have died here today.","When Tie Nu heard this, a sharp light flashed through his eyes. In an instant, he arrived in front of Chu Yunfan. The dagger-ax in his hand was like a huge mountain crushing over. A terrifying pressure was released, and it swept across the sky like a long dragon, sweeping toward Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan raised his sword to block, but with a hum, the sword light swept up and collided with the dagger-ax.","After his first attack failed, Tie Nu was about to attack again, but who knew that Chu Yunfan would instantly counterattack? His speed was extremely fast.","There was nothing special about Chu Yunfan’s sword power. It was just fast. The sword power condensed was invincible and terrifying.","Tie Nu could only switch from offense to defense.","Clang!","With another loud explosion, Chu Yunfan’s sword slashed the spear.","Tie Nu retreated back a few steps back before he finally stabilized himself. A look of horror flashed across his eyes. Chu Yunfan’s speed was fast, and his strength was also great. He was clad in iron armor, so his strength was naturally extraordinary. However, Chu Yunfan forced him to retreat.","“Interesting. Again!” Chu Yunfan laughed out loud.","Tie Nu was shocked by that attack, but Chu Yunfan was pleasantly surprised. He had yet to release all his potential, but his combat strength had already advanced from the peak of the late Void Core Stage to the peak of the Void Core Stage.","And his strength was still growing. This feeling was too good.","“Again!” Chu Yunfan’s sword slashed down again.","The three-foot-long sword in his hand swept down like a mountain range. This was a level that Chu Yunfan had long reached. From lifting heavy objects as if they were light, to lifting light objects as if they were heavy. Even a needle in Chu Yunfan’s hands could exert the power of Mount Tai.","Boom!","The strike once again struck Tie Nu’s dagger-ax.","Thud, thud, thud!","Tie Nu retreated again. He felt that Chu Yunfan’s power had increased too much. Every sword was faster and stronger than before.","“Hahaha! Again!”","Chu Yunfan laughed and slashed down again.","Bam!","Tie Nu felt his whole body trembling. Chu Yunfan’s sword momentum was upright and ferocious. It was just a sword slash from top to bottom. There was no lack of words, and there was nothing strange about it. However, it was this kind of upright sword move that was the most difficult to resist. Because there were no tricks, there was nothing that could be tricked.","A sword was a sword, and he had no choice but to block it because if he didn’t, Chu Yunfan’s sword would directly cut his body. This kind of fair and square fight was more troublesome than any strange method.","Tie Nu had fought countless battles, and he had even fought against peak Void Cores. However, he had never met an opponent like Chu Yunfan. He was simply unable to withstand Chu Yunfan’s fair and square attacks.","He had no way to dodge. Ye Tiannan was right behind him, so he could only choose to fight back. If Ye Tiannan made the slightest mistake, Nine Stars’ master’s attack would be something he couldn’t handle. It would be worse than death.","However, what shocked him the most was that Chu Yunfan’s strength kept increasing. Other people might not have felt it clearly, but he felt it the most clearly when he fought with Chu Yunfan because he was constantly enduring Chu Yunfan’s growing power.","What made him even more uncomfortable was that Chu Yunfan had used him as a stone to test the limits of his strength. Yet, he had no choice but to resist.","The experts in Yunshan were dumbfounded. What was going on?","The famous Peak Void Core expert, the number one expert under Nine Stars’ master, was being suppressed by someone.","Who was this Jian Wuchen?","“My God... Jian Wuchen is too scary. I’m afraid Ye Tiannan has kicked a hornet’s nest!”","“Previously, no one dared to touch him because of his father. Now, there’s finally someone who dares to look down on his father.”","“He’ll be beaten to death sooner or later. Even if Jian Wuchen isn’t here, there will be others.”","“But where did Jian Wuchen come from? Is there such a terrifying expert in the outer realm?”","The crowd discussed animatedly as they watched Tie Nu being suppressed and beaten. If the experts of Yunshan were in the mood to watch the show, then Ye Tiannan’s expression had completely darkened.","Tie Nu was forced to retreat step by step, which meant that he was also forced to retreat step by step. He had come with an aggressive attitude, but he was forced to retreat instead of putting on a show.","“Trash! You’re all trash1 Aren’t you Father’s number one expert? How can you be so useless?!” Ye Tiannan cursed loudly.","However, Tie Nu, who was in front of him, did not have the mood to think about it. If he was still at ease at the beginning, as Chu Yunfan’s strength continued to grow, he felt a suffocating feeling.","It was as if someone was strangling his neck!"]},{"number":1379,"title":"Chapter 1379 Comprehending the Path, Great Increase in Strength!","paragraphs":["1379 Comprehending the Path, Great Increase in Strength!","This airtight attack made Tie Nu feel like he could not breathe. Even his hands began to gradually become numb. He held his dagger-ax with both hands but was suppressed by Chu Yunfan’s sword with one hand.","He had to go all out even against Chu Yunfan’s casual swing of his sword!","What was even more terrifying was that he could feel that Chu Yunfan had not only improved his strength but also his understanding of the sword. If Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the sword was nothing in the beginning, he was just bullying others with his speed and strength.","Now, Chu Yunfan’s sword momentum was catching up.","This was the most terrifying thing.","Tie Nu had seen people break through during battle before. After all, there were so many people, and there would always be a few geniuses like this. This was not a big deal, but Chu Yunfan’s amazing improvement in a battle was unique.","He found it strange that Chu Yunfan, who seemed to be an expert in the path of the sword, was so unfamiliar with it. However, he did not have the time to think about it anymore.","Chu Yunfan’s attack had already swept over.","What he didn’t know was that in Chu Yunfan’s mind, the records about the path of the sword in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book kept appearing.","The Mighty Emperor Battle Book was a collection of martial arts and related records the Alchemy Emperor had collected throughout his life. It recorded countless powerful martial arts.","There were many records of the sword path, and among them, there was even the legendary Sword Emperor’s Sword Path Basic, which was said to be the foundation of all sword paths.","Although Chu Yunfan had learned some sword techniques before, at most, it was just some sword techniques. It could not be said to be the true sword path. At most, they were just simple techniques.","Because for Chu Yunfan, sword techniques were just tools. With his super strength, he could use sword techniques as a medium to release it. However, now, in the midst of battle, he had actually begun to comprehend the Sword Path Basics.","The Sword Path Basics recorded the foundation of all sword principles. Some ordinary moves were the foundation of the entire sword path.","Every move had thousands of variations, and this was the beginning of everything!","If one learned the basics of the sword path, the deeper one’s comprehension was, the more one could learn the essence of other sword techniques in a short period of time. No matter what sword technique it was, in essence, it evolved from the general outline of the sword path.","The Sword Path Basics could be said to be vast and profound. Even a swordsman might not be able to master it even if he studied it for a lifetime.","From an ordinary sword technique to the level of sword path, it was a qualitative change from technique to a way of life. From sword path to technique, it was a technique born from understanding, which was a very high realm.","Ordinary people would need to study for a lifetime just to advance. However, Chu Yunfan had a strategic position and started with the sword path. He started from the general outline of the sword path. This was an opportunity that many people would not encounter in their lifetime.","In his mind, the godhead in his mind kept flashing, and Chu Yunfan himself seemed to have entered an inexplicable state of comprehension. It was almost like it had become an instinct. He was absolutely calm, and he was absolutely comprehending the path. His comprehension of the sword path advanced by leaps and bounds.","With the help of the godhead, his comprehension speed reached an astonishing speed. Every second was equivalent to the comprehension speed that others might need to cultivate for several days or even months.","This was the reason why Tie Nu could feel that Chu Yunfan’s comprehension speed was getting more and more astonishing. His cultivation of the sword had gone from being unfamiliar at the beginning to being proficient.","What was even more terrifying was that Tie Nu discovered that as Chu Yunfan started to learn the sword path, he began to become more and more terrifying. His moves were no longer as fast, accurate, and ruthless as before, but began to change unpredictably.","Some sword moves were as fast as lightning, some were as heavy as Mount Tai, and some were like a gentle breeze. Hiding killing intent, fast or slow, light or heavy, everything depended on the heart.","He was like a sword cultivator who had been immersed in sword cultivation for more than a hundred years. All the moves were in his heart, and he did not feel sluggish at all.","The more time passed, the more it became like this. Facing such a strange Chu Yunfan, Tie Nu felt that it was increasingly difficult to resist.","Finally, after an unknown period of time, Chu Yunfan finally woke up from his frenzied comprehension. The spirit stones in the Mountain River Diagram had also been exhausted. If not for this, the godhead would have drained all of Chu Yunfan’s blood essence.","For Chu Yunfan, the godhead was still too advanced and too distant. Every time he used it and entered the state of enlightenment, he had to pay a price.","Chu Yunfan, who had woken up from the state of enlightenment, immediately felt that his understanding of the sword had reached an unprecedented level. In the past, his deepest understanding of enlightenment was fist techniques, but now it could be said that his deepest understanding had become sword techniques.","As long as he had the Sword Path Basics, it would be much easier for him to download and learn any martial arts. No sword technique could escape the scope of the Sword Path Basics, he could easily learn all the sword techniques and find their flaws.","On the opposite side, Tie Nu heaved a sigh of relief. His hands were trembling, and the web between his thumb and forefinger had been completely cracked, with blood flowing out. He had not expected to be forced to this extent.","“Have you finally come out of your state of enlightenment?”","Chu Yunfan’s martial arts were simply terrifying. Tie Nu had wanted to kill him while Chu Yunfan was comprehending, but who knew that Chu Yunfan would become like a robot under the state of enlightenment, with terrifying accuracy and coldness?","“You’ve done well,” Chu Yunfan said as he looked at Tie Nu.","If it was an ordinary person, they would have been killed by Chu Yunfan in the state of enlightenment. Then, his enlightenment would have ended early.","“In return, I’ll help you relieve this pain!”","As soon as he finished speaking, Chu Yunfan made his move. The long sword in his hand slashed out a long river. It was a Core sword technique recorded in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book.","“River Sunset Slash!”","Chu Yunfan’s sword light was like a long river, flowing endlessly. Chu Yunfan was already very terrifying when he used ordinary moves. Now that he used this sword technique that could be considered top-notch in the Core Stage, his entire strength was increased to a terrifying level.","Tie Nu roared and tried to block the attack with his dagger-ax again. However, the moment he touched the sword light, his weapon was sent flying. Everyone seemed to only see an illusion that looked like the setting sun in the river crashing onto Tie Nu’s body.","Bam!","Tie Nu was sent flying. The armor on his body exploded with a loud bang. His muscles were torn apart, and he was covered in blood."]},{"number":1380,"title":"Chapter 1380 Complete Annihilation, Leave","paragraphs":["1380 Complete Annihilation, Leave","Tie Nu was sent flying. His armor was shattered, revealing his true appearance. He was a muscular man.","His face revealed a look of horror. Chu Yunfan’s attack was more terrifying than before. If he could barely block Chu Yunfan’s attack before, then Chu Yunfan’s casual slash made him feel invincible.","And this was Chu Yunfan’s strength after the enlightenment!","Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction. If it was said that before he comprehended the path that his strength was at most a little stronger than an ordinary peak Void Core, now, he could completely suppress them. His potential had been completely unleashed. With the stimulation of this battle, he had completed a magnificent transformation.","His foundation was solidifed. He was only one step away from stepping into the legendary Void Core Stage. Ordinary Peak Void Cores would be no match for him.","“You treated me like a whetstone,” Tie Nu said with difficulty.","“That’s right. Ordinary people aren’t qualified to be my whetstone. For example, that Ye Tiannan behind you.” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Didn’t you say you want to kill me? Didn’t you want to extract my soul? Why are you hiding behind others like a coward?”","Ye Tiannan’s face was ashen, but he didn’t dare to rush forward. He knew too well how terrifying this guy was. Even with Tie Nu’s help, he still felt a sense of destruction. He didn’t dare to leave Tie Nu’s protection.","The luxurious carriage he had brought with him had been completely destroyed, and his maidservants had died under Chu Yunfan’s sword. Tie Nu could only protect him and was unable to protect anything else.","“D*mn you, Jian Wuchen! You’ll die! You’ll definitely die! Tie Nu, stall him! I want him dead! I’ve already informed my father. It won’t be long before he comes to kill him!”","Ye Tiannan’s words immediately caused an uproar in Yunshan. Today, not only would they be able to see the most powerful expert under Nine Stars’ maste cult master, they would also be able to see the cult master himself.","It was said that the Nine Stars master was an expert who had surpassed the Void Core Stage. Thinking of this, many people began to get excited.","However, Tie Nu’s expression changed and he smiled bitterly. What was a stupid teammate? This was a stupid teammate. Ye Tiannan had told them the news. Even if Chu Yunfan was afraid of the Nine Stars master, he would still kill them faster than he would spare them.","As expected, Chu Yunfan’s expression turned cold as he said, “In that case, I won’t play with you anymore.”","“Take my next move! River Sunset!” Chu Yunfan shouted.","At this moment, he did not want to fight with the Nine Stars master directly. After he refined the Essence Gathering Pill and broke through to the Void Core Stage, he would naturally find trouble with the Nine Stars master.","The sword in Chu Yunfan’s hand suddenly tore through the sky. The sky once again turned into a scene of a long river and sunset. The illusion pressed down on Tie Nu.","Bam!","Tie Nu was powerless to resist. He could only watch as the sword light slashed down.","“Ah!” Tie Nu let out a miserable cry and spat out a mouthful of blood. His entire body exploded in mid-air. Though he was at the peak of the Void Core Stage, he could not withstand Chu Yunfan’s sword.","However, before he died, his eyes revealed a look of relief. Because he was controlled by the Nine Stars master, he couldn’t even commit suicide. Once he had the thought of suicide, his soul would suffer a heavy blow, and he would be instantly tortured. Under such circumstances, he had no choice but to fight for Nine Stars Master.","But now, dying in Chu Yunfan’s hands was a relief.","Chu Yunfan saw this and decided to make a move.","When Tie Nu died, Ye Tiannan, who was standing behind him, felt as if he had lost his parents. He was scared out of his wits. Tie Nu, who he thought could definitely protect him, had actually died in front of him to protect him.","He shuddered at the thought of it.","Almost instantly, he turned around and ran, grabbing a scroll from the air and tearing it apart. Then, a teleportation portal appeared in front of him. This was a teleportation array sealed in the scroll. It was a directional teleportation array used to save one’s life. One could imagine how precious it was.","If he was not about to die, Ye Tiannan would not have used it so easily. But now, he had no other choice.","“Just a little more. A little more!”","Ye Tiannan flew to the portal and could see the scene on the other side of the portal. His father was there.","However, at this moment, a sword light shot out from Chu Yunfan’s hand and chased after Ye Tiannan.","Bam!","Ye Tiannan was struck by the sword, and he let out a blood-curdling scream before exploding into a cloud of blood mist.","“Who did that?!”","A loud shout came from the other side of the portal. It was extremely angry. Then, an extremely terrifying aura swept over from the other side of the portal.","The faces of everyone in Yunshan changed. What kind of terrifying expert was this. He had the power to destroy the city. That was an expert who was above the Void Core Stage!","However, the entire portal began to collapse because of Ye Tiannan’s death.","“You’re not getting away!”","A terrifying attack swept out from the other side of the portal, sweeping through the shattered hole. It was a shock wave with astonishing power.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it and swept the shock wave into nothingness with his sword. However, his arm was trembling slightly.","Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a look of horror. This shock wave was indeed shocking. With his current strength, even ordinary peak Void Cores were not his match. For example, Tie Nu was not his match at all. This attack was actually able to make his arm tremble slightly.","It was indeed amazing.","It seemed that on the other side of the portal was indeed the Nine Stars master. Judging from the strength of his attack, the legend was not wrong. This cult master should be an expert above the peak Void Core Stage.","He didn’t expect that there were such masters in the outer realm. However, if it wasn’t so, he wouldn’t have been able to build such a huge foundation like Nine Stars.","After killing Ye Tiannan, Chu Yunfan took his and Tie Nu’s interspatial rings and flew out of the city.","His target was Great Wei."]},{"number":1381,"title":"Chapter 1381 Great Wei Has Changed","paragraphs":["1381 Great Wei Has Changed","As Chu Yunfan flew, he checked Ye Tiannan and Tie Nu’s interspatial rings.","In comparison, although Tie Nu’s cultivation was stronger, perhaps because he was a slave, there were less than five million low-grade spirit stones in his ring. Although this was an astronomical figure for a Divine, it was pitifully little for a peak Void Core.","On the contrary, Ye Tiannan was much richer. He had more than 30 million low-grade spirit stones and a vast amount of various treasures. Tie Nu could not compare to his wealth.","Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but click his tongue in wonder.","As expected, one was just a servant, while the other was the young master. Their positions were completely different, even though Tie Nu’s strength far exceeded Ye Tiannan’s.","In the end, Chu Yunfan had benefited from all of this.","As he counted, Chu Yunfan entered the territory of Great Wei. He went straight back to Conglong, but his return didn’t alarm anyone.","Just as he returned to Marquis Zhongxin’s residence in Conglong, he discovered that the entire residence was being sealed up, and the servants were being dragged away by a group of soldiers with their hands tied.","In just a few short days, the residence had already changed greatly.","How could Chu Yunfan not understand? Great Wei’s Imperial Court must have made a move on the residence.","“Chu Yunfan, is it really you?” a surprised voice called out. Chu Yunfan turned around and saw a delicate figure striding over in surprise.","Chu Yunfan was at the corner of the street. He turned around and saw Situ Miaoyi.","Situ Miaoyi’s delicate face was filled with surprise and disbelief. Her beautiful eyes were filled with tears. “You’re not dead!” She quickly came to his side.","Chu Yunfan could hear the surprise in Situ Miaoyi’s voice. “How could I have diead?” he said lightly. “What’s going on?” He pointed at the residence that had been sealed up.","“You don’t know? A few days ago, the Imperial Court suddenly announced that you despised the Imperial Court and intended to rebel,” Situ Miaoyi said after she had calmed down.","Seeing Chu Yunfan return safely, Situ Miaoyi was overjoyed. Although she had always believed that he would be fine, that was only what she thought. Some people even said that it was wishful thinking.","She would come here every day, trying to wait for Chu Yunfan, but after so many days, he was nowhere to be seen. Even she was a little discouraged. If Chu Yunfan was still here, he should have returned long ago, but there was no sign of him coming back at all.","It was as the Imperial Court had said, they already killed him in the outer realm.","However, who knew that she would suddenly see Chu Yunfan’s return today? She was overjoyed.","“Killed in the outer realms?” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. Great Wei’s Imperial Court really had a good plan.","Even someone like Chu Yunfan, who had become famous in a short period of time and was not afraid of anything, had died at the hands of the Imperial Court. One could imagine that everyone had to look at the Imperial Court in a new light during this period. The stronger the Imperial Court was, the more people did not dare to show themselves.","“Three days ago, the second prince made a comeback and personally ordered that all the direct relatives of the Chu clan within three generations be executed. The distant relatives were banished as slaves, and all the property of Marquis Zhongxin’s residence was sold and confiscated,” Situ Miaoyi said.","She too felt that it was too much. It was clearly the second prince who plotted against Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan was accused of attempting to rebel and was killed. However, her words carried little weight and she could not do anything.","Who knew that she would be pleasantly surprised by Chu Yunfan’s return?","Chu Yunfan’s eyes suddenly flashed as he said, “Then the entire Chu clan has been executed?”","He knew that if the Imperial Court made up its mind, the Chu clan would not be able to resist. Even though Marquis Zhongxin’s residence seemed to be a noble family of Great Wei and had an awe-inspiring presence, at this time, they were even more fragile than those ordinary sects.","This was because his power came from Great Wei’s Imperial Court and not his own strength. Therefore, once the Imperial Court turned hostile, killing them was just a matter of words. A few small officials were enough to put the entire Chu clan to death.","On the contrary, because the strength of ordinary sects came from themselves and their inheritance, even if Great Wei’s Imperial Court wanted to turn hostile and attack, it was impossible for them to uproot a sect with just a few words.","“I’m too late.” Chu Yunfan immediately regretted it. He had only stayed in the outer realm for just a few days. He had thought that the Imperial Court would not be so cruel and would at most deal with him alone.","After all, the Marquis Zhongxin residence was one of the founders of the kingdom. From the founding of the country until now, they had made countless contributions to the court. Even the deaths of several generations of heirs were due to the court.","As the saying went, one should look at the Buddha’s face. Even if there was no merit, there was hard work. On account of the many years that the Marquis Zhongxin residence had worked for Great Wei, they would not be implicated.","But now, Chu Yunfan realized that he had underestimated the viciousness of the Imperial Court. The current emperor was indeed a ruthless and decisive person. Once he decided to make a move on him, he did not beat around the bush and directly attacked ruthlessly.","And attacking the residence was clearly to eliminate future troubles. Chu Yunfan was the hope of the residence to rise, but now it was killed by the Imperial Court. It was impossible to say that the residence had no complaints. But if there really wasn’t one, as long as the emperor felt that one might have one, then it was the path to death.","A single groundless accusation was enough!","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s killing intent completely erupted, and he couldn’t control it at all.","“No. Yesterday, Marquis Zhongxin’s family was escorted to the execution ground, but they were saved on the eve of execution,” Situ Miaoyi quickly said.","Hearing Situ Miaoyi’s words, Chu Yunfan’s killing intent was slightly restrained. “Saved by someone? Do you know who it is?” he asked.","“I don’t. No one does. It’s said that the second prince is completely enraged and has ordered for an investigation to get to the bottom of this. However, no one knows who it is so far. For people like us who have contact with you, there are many spies from the Agency of Secrets near our homes,” Situ Miaoyi said."]},{"number":1382,"title":"Chapter 1382 The Person Behind the Scenes Appears","paragraphs":["1382 The Person Behind the Scenes Appears","Situ Miaoyi continued, “I shook off the spies from the agency and came here today. I didn’t expect to see you here. It’s great that you’re okay.”","To her, Chu Yunfan was fine, so everything else was not important. She had never told anyone that she had secretly cried a few times in the past few nights. She knew that she had fallen in love with Chu Yunfan, but she had buried it in her heart and did not show it.","To her, there had never been anyone as special as Chu Yunfan. Ever since he had saved her from that blind date, and at her birthday party, that unique congratulatory gift had helped her break through to the Divine Abilities Stage, and from then on, she could control her own destiny.","After that, Chu Yunfan rose like a comet, completely breaking her understanding that a person could be so outstanding.","“When the Imperial Court said that you were killed, I felt terrible for a long time...” Situ Miaoyi muttered to herself.","Chu Yunfan smiled bitterly. He wasn’t a robot, so how could he not notice Situ Miaoyi’s love for him? But now was not the time to think about it.","He could finally breathe a sigh of relief upon hearing the Chus were rescued. If the entire Chu Clan was executed because of him, he would feel incomparably guilty.","Although he had nothing to do with the Chu clan, it was undeniable that the Chu clan had given him shelter when he was at his weakest. This was very important to Chu Yunfan, who was seriously injured and on the verge of death.","Especially the matriarch, who treated him like her own child, made him respect her from the bottom of his heart. If they died because of him, then Chu Yunfan would feel guilty for the rest of his life.","Now that they were saved, Chu Yunfan could finally breathe a sigh of relief. However, he was even more puzzled. Who was the force that saved the Chu clan?","The Imperial Court had made it clear that they wanted to uproot Marquis Zhongxin and execute his entire family. By taking action now, it was cleat that this force wanted to go against the Imperial Court.","After the second prince returned, to vent his anger, he took revenge on the Chu clan. At this time, saving the Chu clan would definitely cause the second prince to be furious, followed by a storm of revenge.","Who exactly had such guts?","Moreover, this was not something that could be done just by having the courage. One had to have enough strength to do it.","There were a few people in Great Wei who had the courage and strength to do this. However, he could not think of anyone who had the reason to attack. He felt that this matter was not that simple. It might even be directed at him. The Chu clan alone would not be worth the person behind the scenes to oppose the Imperial Court.","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan could not figure out who had attacked, a figure leaped over from not far away. In a moment, he had already arrived in front of Chu Yunfan.","“Are you Master CHu?” The figure’s voice was trembling as if he couldn’t believe that Chu Yunfan was still alive.","‘Chu Yunfan is still alive. My lord had made the right bet!’","This was the only thought that echoed in that person’s mind!","“That’s right, it’s me.” Chu Yunfan nodded and looked at the figure. It was a thin middle-aged man who looked no different from an ordinary person. However, Chu Yunfan could tell that this seemingly ordinary person was actually a Divine.","“It really is you, Master Chu. I thought my eyes were playing tricks on me. My lord has invited you to meet him. Master Chu, do you have the time to come over and talk?” the middle-aged man quickly said.","He carefully glanced at Chu Yunfan. He didn’t dare to force Chu Yunfan. What a joke. This person in front of him was a super expert who didn’t even care about the Core Council. All the Cores who died at Chu Yunfan’s hands were famous, but they were killed by Chu Yunfan like dogs.","A small fry like him could be crushed to death with just one finger.","“Interesting. Lead the way,” Chu Yunfan said calmly. Since he knew that the Chu clan had been rescued and that their lives were not in danger, Chu Yunfan was relieved. He was not as anxious as he was at the beginning.","Then, Chu Yunfan turned to Situ Miaoyi, who was a little dumbfounded, and said, “Miss Situ, you go on home first. After things settle down, I’ll go over and reminisce about the past. However, I hope that you won’t tell anyone that I’m back.”","“I won’t tell anyone!” Situ Miaoyi quickly said.","Chu Yunfan smiled and nodded, then left with the skinny middle-aged man.","“This is great!” Situ Miaoyi looked at Chu Yunfan’s back and smiled. Then, she turned around and left the corner of the street. She skipped as she walked, like a little girl who had just eaten her favorite candy.","Chu Yunfan followed the man and left the street corner near the residence. They came to a lake in the city ten streets away. This lake was huge, but there was only one house by the lake, which was very special.","The entire house looked majestic, but it was low-key. There was no golden splendor or carved beams, but from afar, one could see that it was unusual.","“Who’s your lord?” Chu Yunfan stepped on the surface of the lake and walked toward the house.","The skinny middle-aged man who was leading the way in front of him trembled slightly and said, “Master Chu, please allow me to keep you in suspense. We’re almost there. When the time comes, my lord will introduce himself personally.”","Chu Yunfan looked at him and didn’t comment. However, he didn’t say anything else.","Soon, they arrived in front of the house. The man made a hand seal, and the barrier that enveloped the courtyard immediately dispersed and the door slowly opened with a heavy creak.","Chu Yunfan followed him inside. He wasn’t afraid of any traps. Now that he was in Great Wei, he really wasn’t afraid of any traps. There was no trap that could render him helpless.","In just a few short days, his strength had changed drastically compared to before.","They crossed the pavilions and came to a courtyard. In the courtyard, a figure was sitting there drinking tea. When he saw the man bringing Chu Yunfan in, his face immediately revealed a somewhat shocked expression."]},{"number":1383,"title":"Chapter 1383 A Shocking Fight","paragraphs":["1383 A Shocking Fight","Chu Yunfan looked over and saw a young man in his thirties. He was tall and slender, and he wore a bright yellow robe. He looked dignified and could indeed be considered a dragon among men.","“Master Chu? It is indeed better to see than to hear!” The shocked expression on the young man’s face only lasted for a moment before it immediately disappeared.","“I am Chu Yunfan. May I know who you are?” Chu Yunfan nodded.","“Truth be told, I am the eighteenth prince of Great Wei, Wei Wuya,” the young man said slowly.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed sharply. He had guessed the identity of the person behind the scenes, but he never expected it to be a prince of Great Wei.","The emperor of Great Wei had ordered the execution of the entire Chu clan, and Wei Wuya, as his son, had gone against his father’s wishes and saved the Chu clan. This was something completely out of Chu Yunfan’s expectations.","However, after thinking about it carefully, he could not recall any information about the eighteenth prince. There were dozens of princes in Great Wei, and there were a few who were powerful and had the ability to fight for the throne. But no matter what, there was definitely no such eighteenth prince among them.","Chu Yunfan knew this. However, no one expected that the eighteenth prince would actually save the Chu clan.","“So, it’s the eighteenth prince. I heard that you saved the entire Chu clan, Your Royal Highness. I am extremely grateful.” Chu Yunfan cupped his hands and said.","“You’re too polite, Master Chu. I don’t agree with my father’s and brother’s actions. The Maquis Zhongxin residence is the founding marquis of Great Wei. They have made many contributions to the country. And they were going to be executed for plotting rebellion? That is too much!” Wei Wuya said.","Then, he made an inviting gesture and invited Chu Yunfan into the pavilion and to sit opposite him.","“I’m afraid you aren’t telling tell the whole truth, Your Royal Highness,” Chu Yunfan said with a faint smile as he glanced at Wei Wuya. “Perhaps this is a reason, but since the Imperial Court has already confirmed that I’m dead, why would you take the risk to save the Chu clan? If the Imperial Court finds out, you will probably be sentenced to death.”","Wei Wuya looked at Chu Yunfan and paused for a moment before saying, “Since you have already said as much, I will not beat around the bush and get straight to the point. Indeed, according to the propaganda of the Imperial Court, you should be dead. This news came from the mouth of General Ye Fei and the First Guardian. It is highly credible. To be honest, I also thought that the chances of you surviving are very slim.”","Chu Yunfan nodded. He believed this. From Wei Wuya’s expression after seeing him, he could tell that this was the truth.","When Wei Wuya first saw him, he was extremely shocked as if he had never expected Chu Yunfan to return alive. After all, the Imperial Court had already publicized it with such great fanfare, so it must have been quite accurate. Otherwise, wouldn’t they be waiting to be slapped in the face?","No one would have thought that Chu Yunfan would actually be able to escape from the Imperial Court’s inescapable net.","“In that case, why did you attack?” Chu Yunfan asked calmly.","“To be honest, I was betting. I was betting on that slim possibility,” Wei Wuya said, “Although this matter was confirmed by General Ye Fei and the First Guardian, I still feel that with your strength, there was still hope for you to escape. Although the chances were slim, it was still my only hope.” Wei Wuya’s voice grew louder.","“You want to seize the throne?” Chu Yunfan suddenly asked.","“That’s right, I want to seize the throne. In the imperial family, how many people don’t want to obtain that supreme position,” Wei Wuya said, “But compared to my brothers, I’m too weak. My mother’s clan isn’t considered a powerful clan, and I’m still young. There’s nothing that can compare to the accumulation of my brothers over the years. I’m afraid that no one has even looked at me properly over the years, let alone treated me as someone who could compete for the throne,” Wei Wuya said with a self-deprecating expression.","However, he was unwilling to accept this. He was unwilling to just be an idle prince. He could not even be a prince because every emperor of Great Wei had too many princes. If every one of them was conferred the title of emperor, it would be an abnormal disaster for the finances of Great Wei. There were only a few people who could be conferred the title of emperor in each generation. For someone like him, he was only a duke or even a marquis. His descendants would become commoners in a few generations.","Since he was born into the imperial family, he would not give up so easily.","“And I know that with what my father and brother have done to the Chu clan, if you were still alive, you definitely would not let it go. Then there will be no room for reconciliation,” Wei Wuya said as he glanced at Chu Yunfan.","He had studied Chu Yunfan’s information and knew that Chu Yunfan was someone who would seek revenge for the smallest grievance. If he was willing to swallow such a huge loss without retaliating, then the Imperial Court would not be so wary. They had even cooperated with Jinzhanghan.","As a prince, although he did not have much power, he knew much more than ordinary people. Ordinary people would think that Great Wei was the one who took action, but he knew that it was not the case. In fact, it was Jinzhanghan who really took action.","“This is also my only chance. In Great Wei, it is impossible to become the emperor without the support of a strong person. Now, there is no one else in the world who is willing to support me except you, Master Chu,” Wei Wuya said, “That’s why I took the risk to save the Chu clan. Those are all my reasons.” Wei Wuya looked at Chu Yunfan as if waiting for him to express his stance.","Chu Yunfan nodded slightly. He believed this reason, but he didn’t expect Wei Wuya to be so bold as to make such a huge gamble. If he died, Wei Wuya’s rescue would be discovered by the agency sooner or later, and he would probably die.","However, he had willingly took the gamble. Clearly, the eighteenth prince was no ordinary person."]},{"number":1384,"title":"Chapter 1384 Reaching a Cooperation Agreement","paragraphs":["1384 Reaching a Cooperation Agreement","This eighteenth prince, Wei Wuya, was definitely a ruthless character. If Chu Yunfan was really dead, then his pledge of allegiance would be in vain. At that time, she would be throwing flirtatious glances at a blind person. He would be blind for nothing.","This was a shocking gamble.","Moreover, it seemed that the success rate was not high for anyone, or even basically zero. The only thing he could believe in was Chu Yunfan’s past achievements. He believed that Chu Yunfan would be able to survive the Imperial Court’s encirclement.","This was a kind of blind trust, or rather, Chu Yunfan was like his last straw. If he could grab hold of it, he might be able to turn things around. Of course, the biggest possibility was that even if he could grab hold of it, he might sink to the bottom of the water.","He had to ensure that Chu Yunfan had the ability to overturn the entire Great Wei. After all, with the current propaganda of Great Wei, it was pushing the Chu clan and Chu Yunfan to death. In short, as long as the current emperor was around, Chu Yunfan would never be recognized.","Even if Chu Yunfan survived, he would only have two choices. Either he overturned the entire system of Great Wei, or he would leave the outer realms and establish his own sect. Chu Yunfan had such strength.","However, in everyone’s opinion, Chu Yunfan did not have the ability to do so. After all, no matter how they looked at it, he could not overturn the entire Great Wei. Although Chu Yunfan already killed Mi Siyuan and Blood King, they were at the bottom of the five great experts.","Especially Mi Siyuan. He was able to be ranked among the five great experts largely because the previous Great Formless Sect’s master was one of the five great experts. He was merely taking over the position.","Putting aside the attitude of the Yun Huang of the Monster Subduers, Chu Yunfan could not compare to the two experts, General Ye Fei and the First Guardian. Many people knew this. Although Chu Yunfan had a bright future, that was still the future, not the present.","Wei Wuya had placed all his hopes on Chu Yunfan. In the end, it was very likely that the matter of him robbing the execution ground and saving the Chu clan would be exposed. At that time, he would face a dead ened.","And the probability of Chu Yunfan choosing to leave Great Wei with the Chu clan was also very high. This was why Wei Wuya had made such a huge gamble!","Seeing Chu Yunfan remain silent, Wei Wuya continued, “I feel that I am your best partner. I lack an expert who will fully support me, and you also need me to ascend the throne to clear the grievances of you and the Chu clan. You know that father will never admit that he was wrong. He will definitely do everything he can to deal with you. If it were my elder brother or second brother, in order to declare their orthodoxy, they would definitely deal with you even if they ascended the throne, right?","“But I’m different.”","Wei Wuya said with a self-deprecating expression, “What orthodoxy do I have? If I can become the emperor of Great Wei, it will definitely be the most unorthodox choice. I can overturn all of Father’s decisions.”","Chu Yunfan knew that Wei Wuya was trying to increase his own weight. He had many choices. If he was lucky, he could leave with the Chu clan and come back in a few years to turn Great Wei upside down. His strength was his capital, and his youth was his best insurance.","But Wei Wuya had no choice. If Chu Yunfan didn’t choose to cooperate with him, he would be dead.","Wei Wuya’s expression was calm, but his arms were trembling slightly. He clenched his fists in his wide sleeves, his fingernails digging into his flesh. He knew that this was his only chance. If he didn’t want to die a mediocre death, and Chu Yunfan was his only hope.","The gamble that he had made up his mind back then was now about to be reaped.","“All right, I’ll cooperate with you. I appreciate your hard work,” Chu Yunfan said calmly. Although he wasn’t even half as old as Wei Wuya, this didn’t stop him from speaking to Wei Wuya from above. His strength was his greatest confidence and assurance. “Moreover, I don’t care why you saved my clansmen. It doesn’t matter if you really can’t stand the Imperial Court framing them or if you have a favor to ask of me.”","Chu Yunfan knew very well that although Wei Wuya had no other choice, he didn’t have a better choice either. He didn’t have any direct contact with the imperial family of Great Wei. He planned to turn Great Wei upside down, but he didn’t want the entire Great Wei to be in chaos. Great Wei still needed an emperor.","Although Wei Wuya might not be the best choice, he was the most suitable candidate for Chu Yunfan.","“That’s great!” Wei Wuya couldn’t hold it in any longer and excitedly said, “Master Chu, on the day I ascend to the throne, I will confer Marquis Zhongxin the title of Prince, and you will become the Imperial Advisor of Great Wei. In the future, as long as Great Wei has resources, you can use them!”","In fact, if Chu Yunfan had said a word, he would have been able to become the marquis. The entire Chu clan would not have objected.","Because Chu Yunfan was too strong, and no one could match him!","However, Chu Yunfan unexpectedly refused and left the opportunity to Chu Hongcai. Chu Yunfan could reject titles, but he definitely could not reject all kinds of resources for cultivation. This was the greatest guarantee that Great Wei had to attract many experts to join.","“Very well,” Chu Yunfan nodded. He was very satisfied with this promise.”I’d like to see them.”","“Master Chu, please follow me. They are staying in this manor.” Wei Wuya naturally knew who Chu Yunfan was referring to.","The entire lakeside area was under his name. Although he wasn’t doing well, he still had this bit of financial resources. After all, he was born in the imperial family, and countless people wanted to curry favor with him.","Under Wei Wuya’s lead, Chu Yunfan entered the depths of the manor. At this moment, everyone from the Chu clan, who had already received the news, was waiting.","When they saw that Chu Yunfan was not dead, everyone was excited. During this period, they could be said to be riding a roller coaster, from heaven to hell, and then being rescued from hell.","Now that they saw that Chu Yunfan was still alive, they could not help but sigh. The ups and downs of life were too fast!"]},{"number":1385,"title":"Chapter 1385 I Want to Turn Great Wei Upside Down","paragraphs":["1385 I Want to Turn Great Wei Upside Down","“Brother Fan, you’re alive! That’s great! I knew you would be fine and that those people from the Imperial Court were talking nonsense!” Chu Hongcai quickly said. He was extremely excited. Too many things had happened recently.","To him, Chu Yunfan was like his big brother. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, he wouldn’t be where he was today.","However, he was suddenly informed that Chu Yunfan was dead. How could he accept this? He did not believe it either.","However, the Imperial Court suddenly sent people to arrest them. They could not resist and were escorted to the execution ground. If it was not for the sudden appearance of the eighteenth prince, they would have been dead a long time ago.","“I’m fine.” Chu Yunfan nodded, “Look at you, you’re already the marquis’ heir. Why are you still so anxious? Those people are still far from being able to kill me.”","!!","“Yunfan, it’s good that you’re fine.”","On the side, the matriarch strode forward and grabbed Chu Yunfan’s hand, her expression extremely gratified. During this period, she had learned from the Imperial Court that Chu Yunfan had died. It was really heartbreaking as if she had seen the scene of her youngest son’s tragic death again.","She hadn’t been able to eat or sleep well for the past few days. If it wasn’t for the news that the eighteenth prince had said that Chu Yunfan might still be alive, she probably wouldn’t have been able to hold on any longer.","Although Chu Yunfan was a grandson in the residence, the matriarch really treated him like a son. Now that she finally saw Chu Yunfan return safely, she couldn’t help but cry.","“I’ve made you worry, matriach.” Chu Yunfan’s face revealed a somewhat guilty expression. Rather than saying that he had feelings for the Chu clan, it was more accurate to say that he missed the matriarch who had always treated him like her own. Now, looking at the matriarch, it was as if she had aged ten years in just a few days. He could not help but feel extremely guilty.","“Thank goodness you’re fine.Thank goodness!” the matriarch said repeatedly. To her, as long as Chu Yunfan was fine, everything else did not matter.","On the other side, Chu Yaowei was also extremely excited. Compared to before, he looked much more haggard, but he knew that it was all worth it. No matter how much they had suffered before, now that Chu Yunfan had returned, it meant that everything had to be reshuffled.","A few days ago, he had suffered countless taunts. Everyone thought that the Chu clan was finished this time and was about to lose power. Now, he could tell everyone that they had all misjudged him.","The other clansmen were equally excited. Chu Yunfan was their only hope. His return meant that they could still turn the tables and not completely become fugitives.","“But Brother Fan, how did you come back? The people from the Imperial Court said that you died under their encirclement,” Chu Hongcai hurriedly asked.","This was what everyone was most concerned about.","“Them? They need tens of thousands of years to kill me!” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly and immediately recounted everything that happened. Although he avoided the main point and didn’t mention more details, he roughly mentioned the fact that he was besieged by the Blood Barbarians.","Everyone couldn’t help but suck in a breath of cold air, especially the eighteenth prince, who felt his hair stand on end.","Wei Wuya and Chu Yaowei were both considered high-ranking officials of the kingdom. They knew more about Jinzhanghan than anyone else, and of course, they had heard of the legends of the Blood Barbarians.","They were the elites of Jinzhanghan. Jinzhanghan was known to have tens of millions of cavalry, but there were only 100 thousand Blood Barbarians. It could be said that each of them was one in a hundred elites.","The Blood Barbarians were known to be terrifying existences that even Cores would be unable to escape death if they encountered them.","In Great Wei, there were not many troops that could contend against the Blood Barbarians.","Besides the Blood Barbarians, there were also more than 20 Cores.","With such a formation, even if they were to attack the capital of Great Wei, they might be captured if they were not careful. If an ordinary Core were to encounter it, wouldn’t they die?","Wei Wuya finally understood why the Imperial Court dared to declare that Chu Yunfan was dead. Against such a lineup, not to mention Chu Yunfan, even the number one expert in the world, the Yun Huang, would have died.","In the end, they would die in battle. Killing more Blood Barbarians would be considered impressive.","Of course, Chu Yunfan did not mention that he had used a nuclear bomb. He only mentioned the entire process slightly. After all, this was related to his biggest secret, the Mountain River Diagram.","The others were shocked that Chu Yunfan could escape. Although most of the people did not know the reputation of the Blood Barbarians, it was common for an army to encircle and suppress experts in Great Wei.","In Great Wei, there was also a punitive army that specialized in dealing with experts. They could understand the same concept.","Chu Yunfan’s return was already the biggest miracle.","At the same time, they could feel the danger.","“They clearly didn’t make a move, yet they still dare to claim that they were the ones who surrounded and killed you, Brother Fan,” Chu Hongcai said indignantly.","“That’s right, I’ve never seen such a shameless person!”","“How shameless!”","“The Imperial Court is shameless enough to join hands with our archenemy, Jinzhanghan, to deal with Yunfan!”","The members of the Chu clan started to complain. If it was any other time, they would never do this. Their respect for the Imperial Court had been instilled into their bones. But now that they had gone through a life-and-death situation, their respect for the Imperial Court had disappeared without a trace. There was only deep hatred now.","On the other hand, Wei Wuya was expressionless as if they weren’t talking about their own kingdom.","“They didn’t attack? How do you know that they didn’t make a move? In fact, General Ye Fei and the First Guardian were there at that time. It’s a pity that they didn’t know that I was still alive. Otherwise, they would probably have carried out a second encirclement on the spot!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Everyone’s eyes widened. They did not know that the situation was so dangerous. The Blood Barbarians of Jinzhanghan were only the first wave. General Ye Fei and the First Guardian would have made their move next.","Most of the Blood Barbarians did not know what kind of existence they were, but General Ye Fei and the First Guardian were still lying in ambush outside. They simply wished that Chu Yunfan would die without a burial ground.","It was a miracle that Chu Yunfan was able to escape unscathed from the layers of encirclement.","“But it doesn’t matter. Since I’m back, I’ll turn Great Wei upside down!” Chu Yunfan sneered."]},{"number":1386,"title":"Chapter 1386 Is That Chu Yunfan? What the Hell?!","paragraphs":["1386 Is That Chu Yunfan? What the Hell?!","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, no one was worried. On the contrary, they were all very excited.","The experiences they had went through during this period had long made them disheartened with the Imperial Court. Chu Yunfan was going to challenge the Imperial Court, and Marquis Zhongxin they were distinguished people who shared weal and woe with Great Wei.","If Great Wei was good, then they would be good. If Great Wei collapsed, then they would also be destroyed. When the nest was destroyed, there would be no intact eggs.","But now, Great Wei wanted them to die without a burial ground. It was only because Chu Yunfan might be a threat. They had long lost any gratitude in their hearts.","Now that Chu Yunfan wanted to turn Great Wei upside down, it was only beneficial for them. Even Wei Wuya, who was born in the imperial family, was excited beyond control.","No matter what, they were on the same boat as Chu Yunfan. The bigger of a blow he dealt to the arrogance of the Imperial Court, the more benefits they would receive.","“Brother Fan, what are you planning to do? Are you planning to attack the capital?” Chu Hongcai asked excitedly.","“That’s right. If we want to do it, we have to catch him off guard,” Wei Wuya said frankly, “As far as I know, General Ye Fei is leading the expedition army to suppress a monster swarm. If we want to make a move, this is the best time.”","Wei Wuya had been paying attention to the movements in the Imperial Capital. It was unrealistic to overthrow the entire Great Wei with their strength. There was only one way to capture the leader of the thieves—capture the emperor. Only then could the situation be reversed.","More importantly, he knew how terrifying General Ye Fei and the First Guardian were. In his heart, even Chu Yunfan was no match for them.","If they really wanted to make a move, there was only one way. That was to make a time difference and take advantage of the time when they were not around to attack the capital in one fell swoop and force them to admit reality.","This was also the only method that Wei Wuya and his strategists had come up with to overthrow the Imperial Court after countless calculations. If they were to fight for a city and a land, how could they compare to the behemoth of Great Wei?","“No need.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. “If I want to make a move, why do I have to wait until they are not here? Even if they are here, I have absolute confidence. After all, it is impossible to take advantage of the situation. I will only suppress the world.”","Chu Yunfan immediately saw that Wei Wuya’s plan wasn’t feasible. Even if he took down the Imperial Capital in one fell swoop, he wouldn’t be able to win the hearts of the world. Wei Wuya was just a prince without any power or influence, and had never stood at the peak of the world.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He had once been at the peak of the Federation, so he knew this all too well. If he wanted to use force, he had to make everyone fear him and have nothing to say. Otherwise, the entire Great Wei would be in chaos.","“But before that, I still have to settle scores with another person,” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Wei Wuya saw that there was no way to convince Chu Yunfan, so he could only give up. He knew that Chu Yunfan was not a reckless person, even though he was unwilling to bend. Since he said so, he should have absolute confidence.","“Are you going to find my second brother?” Wei Wuya immediately guessed.","“That’s right. It’s fine if he’s obediently grounded, but since he’s out jumping around again, don’t blame me for being rude.” Chu Yunfan sneered.","The organization’s purge of the Chu clan was the second prince’s doing. In just a few days, he had mobilized the court to convict the Chu clan and exterminate them.","The second prince was the most excited among them. He even took the initiative to apply to come to Conglong to supervise the execution. One could imagine how much he hated Chu Yunfan.","If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, the second prince wouldn’t have suffered such a huge loss. Two of the experts who supported him had been defeated by Chu Yunfan in succession. This could be said to have a huge impact on the future competition for the throne.","Chu Yunfan nodded. The second prince had personally come out, of course, not only to supervise the execution of the Chu clan, but also to seize the interests left behind by the Great Formless Sect.","Originally, this part was to be taken over by the Chu clan. Now that the Chu clan had fallen, the benefits left behind by the Great Formless Sect had become a piece of fragrant cake. Anyone who wanted it could take a bite.","“Hmph, I’ll kill him first, then I’ll turn the heavens and earth upside down. I want to see who dares to be high and mighty!” Chu Yunfan coldly snorted, then stepped into a streak of light and flew toward the Imperial Army camp that Wei Wuya had mentioned.","Wei Wuya sighed. This Chu Yunfan was truly a hot-blooded person. However, he didn’t dare to delay and immediately followed him. He was now connected to Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan succeeded, he would be the emperor of Great Wei. If he failed, he would be a traitor.","The rise and fall of the world was in the hands of one person.","From the west of Conglong, in a huge valley, a huge military stronghold rose from the ground in just a few days. Everything was awe-inspiring and orderly. Countless powerful auras were transmitted from it, causing the scouts from the various families in the distance to tremble in fear.","This was the strongest Imperial Army of Great Wei. They had always been in the Imperial Capital. Now, they were actually heading south from Conglong. This had even frightened the various large factions in the south.","The powerful battle energy emitted by the tens of thousands of Imperial Army soldiers surrounded the entire camp. Ordinary warriors would be overwhelmed by this energy.","The various factions in the south had sent their spies to monitor this Imperial Army.","Suddenly, they saw a figure stepping on a streak of light from the direction of Conglong. He didn’t conceal his monstrous aura as he flew over at lightning speed.","“Who is it?” someone asked.","“How arrogant. Don’t they know that this is the Imperial Army camp? Now that they have crashed into the camp, and even if they are beaten to death, they would die in vain.”","“Why does that person look so familiar? I seem to have seen him somewhere before.”","“That’s Chu Yunfan... It’s Chu Yunfan!” someone exclaimed.","His voice attracted everyone’s attention. Who else could it be but Chu Yunfan?","All the scouts were stunned as if they had seen a ghost.","However, to them, what was the difference between this and seeing a ghost? This was seeing a ghost!"]},{"number":1387,"title":"Chapter 1387 Slaughter Into the Imperial Army’s Camp","paragraphs":["1387 Slaughter Into the Imperial Army’s Camp","Everyone was dumbfounded. They couldn’t believe that they were actually seeing Chu Yunfan. Some of them even rubbed their eyes to make sure that they were not seeing things.","They had no choice but to do so because they had all heard the Imperial Court announce to the outside world that Chu Yunfan had rebelled and was eliminated by the Imperial Court’s army.","The Chu clan was said to have joined forces with him to rebel, and three generations of their members were to be executed. Although they were later rescued from the execution ground, no one cared about this matter anymore. No one cared about the whereabouts of the Chu clan. After all, this was a fallen family. Even if they were lucky enough to survive, so what?","However, no one had thought that at this juncture, Chu Yunfan, who was known as the Chu clan’s pillar, not only did not die, but also returned.","After confirming that Chu Yunfan was not dead, everyone immediately thought of a problem. The Imperial Court had sworn that Chu Yunfan was dead, but now, Chu Yunfan was not dead. What did this mean?","This meant that a storm was about to hit!","Judging from Chu Yunfan’s personality, he was definitely someone who would rather break than bend. He would seek revenge for the smallest grievance. This kind of person was like a poisonous snake. If he couldn’t be killed, then there would be endless trouble in the future.","Such a person was terrifyingly powerful. He could be ranked among the top few terrifying existences in the entire Great Wei.","“Chu Yunfan will definitely not let the matter rest when he returns to the battlefield. He might even fall out with the Imperial Court!”","“The entire Chu clan has been exterminated. It would be strange if Chu Yunfan could tolerate this.”","“That’s right. A proud young man like him must be young and impetuous. He definitely won’t be willing to let go so easily.”","“I know why Chu Yunfan is here. It’s because the second prince is here!”","Someone suddenly thought of something. The Imperial Court said that Chu Yunfan was already dead, but he wasn’t. With Chu Yunfan’s character, he would definitely not let it go and would definitely come to take revenge.","Now that the main culprit of the Chu clan’s massacre, the second prince, was here, Chu Yunfan’s goal was clear.","“What? Does he want to charge into the Imperial Army? The Imperial Army is the elites of the elites of Great Wei, the masters of the masters. When tens of thousands of Imperial Army soldiers are gathered together, even Cores would not dare to take them lightly. They have to take a detour.”","“That’s right. The tens of thousands of Imperial Army soldiers are almost invincible in the military stronghold. Even if a Core wanted to attack, it would be impossible.”","“That’s right. I still remember that the second prince not only brought tens of thousands of Imperial Army soldiers, but also a large number of experts in the military stronghold. Although many of them have gone out to fight for territory in the past few days, there should still be many experts in the military stronghold.”","“Then wouldn’t Chu Yunfan die if he attacks directly?”","Everyone thought that Chu Yunfan had gone crazy. He actually dared to charge into the army formation. Even a Core would not dare to take advantage of an elite like the Imperial Army and had to take a detour.","However, some people didn’t think so at all.","“You all think he’s crazy? I don’t think so. Have you all forgotten that he still has a trump card? That terrifying magical artifact that destroyed the entire Great Formless Sect?” a scout said.","At this moment, everyone remembered that Chu Yunfan had previously uprooted the entire Great Formless Sect. Compared to that, this military stronghold formed by tens of thousands of Imperial Army soldiers seemed to be nothing.","They all knew very well that the reason why Great Wei had suddenly attacked Chu Yunfan was because they were afraid of his future development. More importantly, Chu Yunfan’s method of uprooting the Great Formless Sect had completely frightened them.","Such a strategic weapon, once used, was enough to wipe out a city and destroy a country. It was too terrifying.","Although the barracks of the Imperial Army was well organized and looked good, iy only had cold weapons. Compared to the war fortresses of the Federation that Chu Yunfan had seen before, it was far inferior.","It was not worth mentioning at all.","Chu Yunfan might have felt a little troubled if facing the military stronghold of the Federation, but this imperial army was nothing.","The moment he arrived above the stronghold, the already dense battle energy in the stronghold seemed to have been provoked. It immediately launched a counterattack and bombarded Chu Yunfan.","This was the manifestation of the will of the tens of thousands of Imperial Army soldiers. This was also the most terrifying method of an army formation. If it was an ordinary Core, they would probably be severely injured immediately.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan snorted coldly, and a sky full of lightning appeared under his feet. As soon as the battle energy reached his feet, it was shattered.","It couldn’t affect Chu Yunfan at all.","“Enemy attack!”","All the Imperial Army soldiers in the stronghold immediately reacted. A powerful enemy had invaded, and even their battle energy couldn’t kill him.","Soon, they saw a figure in a black robe looking down at them from high up in the sky.","“Men, shoot him down with the ballistas!” someone in the Imperial Army shouted.","In just a few seconds, the ballistas were ready, hundreds of them lined up and aimed at the sky.","The Imperial Army was the most elite army in Great Wei, so their reaction speed was fast.","Swish!","Swish!","Swish!","With shrill sounds, the arrows, which were several feet long, swept across the sky and headed in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","When the arrows were only three feet away from Chu Yunfan, they were blocked by his protective energy shield and exploded.","Chu Yunfan frowned slightly. The Spirit Realm took a different path from the Federation, which emphasized both science and martial arts. However, it also unique. The explosive power of these ballistas was almost comparable to the missiles of the Federation.","They were very powerful.","Although an expert could decide everything in the Spirit Realm, in order to deal with such an expert, various methods had been developed in the end.","However, this attack was far from enough to affect Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1388,"title":"Chapter 1388 Showing Off His Might","paragraphs":["1388 Showing Off His Might","“Attack him with all your might!” a general in the Imperial Army shouted.","Immediately after, the tens of thousands of Imperial Army soldiers took out their bows in unison.","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","***","After a series of piercing sounds, the scouts watching from afar clearly saw the sky full of arrows sweeping toward Chu Yunfan like a torrential rain.","It was like a terrifying storm, borrowing power from each other in the sky, borrowing the power of the army to increase its power.","“My God... Even a Core would be shot into a porcupine!”","A scout couldn’t help but say this in shock. These Imperial Army soldiers were all elites of the elites, and they instantly shot out several arrows, forming a terrifying storm of tens of thousands of arrows.","If a Divine encountered it, they would be shot into a porcupine.","Even a group of Divines would die.","Even Cores could only run away, unable to get close.","This was the most terrifying method of a military formation.","Some of them came from the military, so they understood this very well. Many people felt that Chu Yunfan was overestimating himself. The Imperial Army was the elites of the elites of Great Wei, and it was completely different from the unprepared Great Formless Sect.","However, what they saw next was a terrifying scene.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even blink in the face of the storm of arrows. He raised his arm high and countless divine power boiled behind him. It turned into knives, spears, swords, halberds, and many other weapons, forming a dense wall of weapons behind him.","He suddenly swung his arm down, and the weapons on the wall of weapons swept down at lightning speed toward the arrows that formed a tide.","Rumble!","A series of violent tremors and endless explosions swept through everything. The strong light blocked their vision. They could only see through their divine wills that the countless weapons formed by the power of lightning collided head-on with the arrows, causing countless explosions.","Every soldier in the Imperial Army was an expert above the Innate Stage, and there were even hundreds of Divines among them. Everyone was like a machine that would not tire, constantly shooting arrows at Chu Yunfan.","The Innate Stage was insignificant compared to the Core Stage. However, the power of tens of thousands of people gathered together with the help of the military formation was terrifying.","Everyone watched in shock as Chu Yunfan resisted the tens of thousands of Imperial Soldiers lmost single-handedly. Fighting against tens of thousands of people with his own strength was simply a miracle that they could not imagine. Even experts would have times when they were exhausted. Human strength had its limits, but the power of heaven and earth was endless.","But Chu Yunfan did it. Facing such an offensive tide, he didn’t dodge at all and faced it head-on. No matter what kind of attack it was, it could not pose a threat to him. Within a radius of 100 meters around him, there was a huge torrent of lightning power. This lightning power seemed to have eyes and spirit energy.","No matter what kind of attack it was, it would be crushed into pieces when it fell into this tide. It could not pose a threat to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s body was like a mill, crushing all the attacks.","After a long time, even the strong-willed soldiers of the Imperial Army were moved. They looked at Chu Yunfan in disbelief. They knew very well how terrifying their continuous attacks were. Even a Core had died in their hands. After all, how could one person’s strength contend with tens of thousands of people?","Who knew that Chu Yunfan had done it.","After releasing all his potential, Chu Yunfan’s strength increased several times, and his divine power accumulation soared more than ten times. He was now like a mobile cannon. His divine power was endless, and the speed of consumption could not even catch up with his recovery speed. Countless weapons formed by the power of lightning continued to form and then fell down.","If one were to look at it from the sky, Chu Yunfan was gradually gaining the upper hand. He was slowly pushing the area where the two sides collided toward the direction of the stronghold.","How shocking was this?!","To Chu Yunfan, this was nothing. Although these 10,000 Imperial Army soldiers were elites, how could they compare to the strength of the Blood Barbarians?","Compared to the Blood Barbarians, they were still far inferior.","“Wei Xingfeng, I’m here to take your life!” Chu Yunfan said loudly, his voice shaking the entire valley.","The scouts in the distance looked at each other. Sure enough, Chu Yunfan was here for the second prince, Wei Xingfeng. However, they never expected Chu Yunfan to have the terrifying strength to fight against tens of thousands of Imperial Army soldiers alone. Even General Ye Fei couldn’t have done what Chu Yunfan did.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s relentless assault on the weapons, many scouts couldn’t help but be speechless.","“Isn’t Chu Yunfan tired at all?” many people speculated maliciously.","However, there was no response from within the stronghold. It was as if Wei Xingfeng, was not there at all. There was no response.","“This b*stard is rebelling! Kill him!”","At this moment, a martial arts expert suddenly appeared in the Imperial Army. He was a powerful Core. In the midst of countless arrows, he held a longbow and shot out an arrow. In an instant, a terrifying tornado swept toward Chu Yunfan.","The tornado formed by this arrow was too shocking. It directly occupied one-third of all the attacks.","“Petty trick!”","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it. With a flick of his sleeve, he shattered the tornado into pieces.","“Since you want to play, then I’ll play with you. Wei Xingfeng, I want to see how long you can be a coward!”","Chu Yunfan snorted coldly. A ball of lightning power appeared in his hand and began to spin rapidly. Then, it turned into a bow at a speed visible to the naked eye. It was vaguely similar to the Sun Shooter.","In fact, Chu Yunfan had imitated the Sun Shooter and condensed it with his divine power.","Whoosh!","Chu Yunfan’s palm turned into an arrow of light and shot it out.","The arrow turned into a stream of light and shot through the sky. Its momentum was shocking. It directly cut through the arrows coming from the opposite side like a hot knife through butter. In an instant, it destroyed the arrows coming from the opposite side and swept toward the Core with lightning speed.","Bam!","The Core was shot directly. With a miserable cry, his body exploded in mid-air and turned into a cloud of blood mist."]},{"number":1389,"title":"Chapter 1389 The Imperial Soldiers Were Completely Annihilated","paragraphs":["1389 The Imperial Soldiers Were Completely Annihilated","This Core might be very powerful to other people. If it wasn’t for the elites like the Imperial Soldiers, even if there were 100,000 soldiers in an ordinary army, they would be slowly slaughtered by him as long as he was given time.","But now, he was facing Chu Yunfan, and he couldn’t even block a single move.","After killing this Core, Chu Yunfan didn’t have any intention of stoppinh. He directly attacked again!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Whoosh!","Ear-piercing sounds could be heard, and each explosion took away one expert.","The generals of the Imperial Army were killed by Chu Yunfan one by one. There was no way they could escape. As long as they were targeted by him, they would die. There was no other possibility.","Chu Yunfan’s arrows were much more powerful than missiles.","In the distance, when the scouts saw this scene, they broke out in cold sweat. What were they seeing?","They saw Chu Yunfan disregard the Imperial Army and kill the Divines among them. Even with the protection of the battle energy, it could not stop Chu Yunfan’s arrows.","Compared to when he was surrounded by the Blood Barbarians, Chu Yunfan was at least several times stronger. It was not a power they could imagine. If he met the Blood Barbarians again, he kill could several times over. The Blood Barbarians could not stop Chu Yunfan, whose strength had increased greatly.","Not to mention, although the Imperial Soldiers of Great Wei were quite strong, they were clearly inferior to the Blood Barbarians.","That was why they were able to witness this scene. He had suppressed Great Wei’s Imperial Soldiers with his own strength.","It was almost like a miracle!","“This is absolutely terrifying. The world-famous Imperial Soldiers were completely powerless in front of him!”","“He is even stronger than the rumors. I remember that when he killed Ancestor Wusheng, he used a lot of energy. Now, he can kill Cores effortlessly.”","“If this continues, I feel that instead of him dying, the Imperial Soldiers will be the ones killed.”","“He wants to rebel and kill the second prince in public. He really wants to fight the Imperial Court to the death!” someone exclaimed.","However, another scout immediately sneered and retorted, “Do you think he is afraid of falling out with the Imperial Court? The Imperial Court suddenly attacked and surrounded him. They already shed all pretense of cordiality. If he doesn’t plan to avoid the Imperial Court’s attack, then rebellion is the only way out.”","Only then did everyone remember that this lord would not explode for no reason. The Imperial Court could not tolerate him. It was said that even General Ye Fei and the First Guardian had been mobilized just to kill him.","Although they didn’t know how he managed to escape, it was clear that he wouldn’t let this matter rest.","Moreover, everyone knew that Chu Yunfan had a trump card in his hand. The legendary weapon that uprooted the entire Great Formless Sect had not been used yet, which meant that Chu Yunfan had not used his full strength.","This was the most terrifying thing, because the unknown was scarier than anything else.","Everyone could see that Chu Yunfan was at ease, and the Imperial Soldiers were starting to lose their hold. The army formation began to shake, and it seemed that it was unable to stop Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan’s arrows were fast and ruthless. In just a moment, he had killed all the experts among the Imperial Soldiers. But this was not the end. Chu Yunfan began to kill a large number of soldiers.","With a casual arrow, hundreds of soldiers were killed on the spot.","These tens of thousands of experts were simply unable to withstand a single blow. In just a quarter of an hour, they were completely slaughtered by Chu Yunfan.","The Imperial Soldiers were the elite of the elites of Great Wei’s army. Even if they could only stand and die, not a single one of them fled. But it was also because of this that tens of thousands of people were completely wiped out, all of them died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. Even if they wanted to escape, they would not be able to escape from Chu Yunfan’s endless thunder weapons.","When the scouts from the various forces who were watching the battle from afar saw this scene, they were dumbfounded. They held their breaths and did not even dare to breathe, afraid that their breathing would attract Chu Yunfan’s attention and he would kill them.","As they watched Chu Yunfan, it was as they were seeing a ghost.","It wasn’t that they hadn’t heard of an expert slaughtering an army, but if the target was the Imperial Soldiers, then it would be a little shocking.","At this moment, Wei Wuya, who had just arrived, witnessed this scene with his own eyes. The shock in his heart was simply indescribable!","It was as if there were 100,000 monsters galloping past!","In his heart, the Imperial Soldiers of Great Wei were the symbol of invincibility. He had never thought of rebelling because even if he gathered all the forces that he had developed over the years, 10,000 soldiers, or even 5,000 of them, would be enough to wipe out all the forces that he had developed.","Among the higher-ups of Great Wei, there were many legends about the Imperial Soldiers. This was one of the most effective methods used by Great Wei’s Imperial Court to deter many experts.","But now, the Imperial Soldiers that he thought were invincible were all killed by Chu Yunfan in a short time. This completely overturned his worldview. It made him understand how powerful Chu Yunfan was.","In fact, Chu Yufan might even be far more powerful than he had imagined!","If it was before, Wei Wuya might have been afraid, but now he was only excited, because the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the more likely his plan would be successful. It would not just be a flower in the mirror or a moon in the water!","However, he didn’t dare to come forward. He could only hide and watch the battle from the side. Now he’s not the time to expose himself.","“Wei Xingfeng, are you still not coming out?” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile. He looked at the battlefield below that had long turned into hell, and his expression did not change.","This was the advantage of being in the Spirit Realm. If he was in the Federation, they could use nuclear bombs and other high-tech weapons to deal with an expert like him. Even if he could not be killed, he could be driven away.","However, there was nothing the Spirit Realm could do against him!","An expert was enough to settle everything!","“Chu Yunfan! You’re rebelling!”","At this moment, a dozen figures slowly flew out from the depths of the valley. The middle-aged man in the lead was none other than the second prince, Wei Xingfeng.","Behind him were more than ten powerful figures, all of whom were experts."]},{"number":1390,"title":"Chapter 1390 Reinforcements Arrive","paragraphs":["1390 Reinforcements Arrive","The experts behind Wei Xingfeng all had ashen expressions. They never expected that they would be in such danger under the layers of protection of the Imperial Soldiers.","This should have been one of the safest places in the entire Great Wei, but in the end, all of the tens of thousands of soldiers had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","This was simply a monster-like miracle. Even General Ye Fei or the First Guardian could only choose to temporarily avoid the edge of the blade when they encountered tens of thousands of Imperial Army soldiers.","However, Chu Yunfan’s appearance completely broke their understanding and made them see another possibility. Martial arts could really develop to such a shocking level. If they truly developed, even the elites of the elites like the Imperial Soldiers would not be a match for them.","In their eyes, there was even a hint of disbelief and fear.","A moment ago, one of them couldn’t help but jump out, but Chu Yunfan has shot him to death with an arrow.","That man was not an ordinary person. He was a Core, a true overlord of a region. But now, he was shot to death by an arrow.","Since then, they did not dare to jump out. They wanted to let the Imperial Soldiers exhaust Chu Yunfan’s divine power and force him to leave.","However, Chu Yunfan’s divine power was not exhausted in the slightest. Instead, he had slaughtered the soldiers.","‘Is this guy a monster?’","Such a thought could not help but appear in their minds.","Not to mention the second prince. Other than hatred, his eyes were also a little dull as if he had seen a ghost. He knew much more than the average person. He even knew the outcome of that battle. Chu Yunfan must have been surrounded by the Blood Barbarians. In the end, he had no choice but to release the nuclear bomb. Both sides suffered and died together.","Even after that, General Ye Fei and the First Guardian had confirmed with their divine wills that there were no living creatures at that time. All of them were dead.","This was the reason why he dared to attack the Chu clan. Chu Yunfan was dead, so he could only vent his anger on the Chu clan.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan would actually come back alive, and he seemed to be unscathed.","Wei Xingfeng couldn’t believe it. He didn’t know how Chu Yunfan had done it and survived such a dangerous situation. What was even more terrifying was that not only did Chu Yunfan survive, but his cultivation had also improved greatly!","How could he have advanced further?!","How long had it been? Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had already improved from half-step Core Stage to this level. He was simply a monster!","However, Wei Xingfeng quickly came back to his senses. It was meaningless to think about it now. He glared at Chu Yunfan fiercely as if he could kill him.","“You finally dare to come out now?” Chu Yunfan looked at Wei Xingfeng coldly.","“Chu Yunfan, do you know what you’re doing? You’re rebelling!” Wei Xingfeng said through gritted teeth.","“Do you think I care?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Since the Imperial Court wants to kill me, I’ll overturn the entire Imperial Court.”","“How dare you!” Wei Xingfeng shouted, but it didn’t scare Chu Yunfan. On the contrary, it seemed like he was bluffing.","“What do you think?” Chu Yunfan sneered, “I recall never having offended you, but you kept chasing me.”","“You ruined my plans. How could I let you off?” Wei Xingfeng said coldly, “If not for you, how could I be in such a sorry state and be grounded by my father? Mi Siyuan originally supported me, but in the end, he died at your hands. You uprooted and destroyed the Great Formless Sect. I then sought out Blood King, but in the end, he too killed by you.”","At this point, Wei Xingfeng’s eyes flashed with intense hatred.","“If it weren’t for you, I wouldn’t have needed to cooperate with Jinzhanghan. Speaking of which, you’re really lucky that you didn’t die a few times.”","This was what Wei Xingfeng, and perhaps everyone else, was thinking. Whether it was against Mi Siyuan, Blood King, the Jinzhanghan warriors, or the Blood Barbarians, General Ye Fei and the First Guardian had led a large number of experts as the final line of defense.","No matter how one looked at it, Chu Yunfan should have died. However, under such a threat, he had survived time and time again. It was simply a miracle.","“What a pity. I didn’t want to participate in this too much.” Chu Yunfan shook his head. He originally did not want to have too much to do with Great Wei. He even wanted to borrow the power of the Agency of Secrets to find Tang Siyu and then leave Great Wei.","Although this place was good, it was not what he wanted.","However, when he wanted to leave, someone repeatedly wanted to find trouble with him and kill him. He had no choice but to walk step by step to where he was today.","Wei Xingfeng’s eyes were filled with regret. He had already done his best in this matter. Every time, he had decisively killed Chu Yunfan. If it was an ordinary person, they would have died long ago, but Chu Yunfan was still alive!","Chu Yunfan couldn’t be stopped.","Wei Xingfeng began to regret it. If he had chosen to cooperate with Chu Yunfan, perhaps the outcome would have been different. But now, he didn’t have the chance to go back on his word.","Chu Yunfan sneered at Wei Xingfeng and said, “You’re not running now because you want to stall for time.”","Wei Xingfeng’s face revealed a hint of panic. He knew that Chu Yunfan had seen through his plan.","When he felt that the Imperial Soldiers were about to falter, he had sent out a distress signal. It was a distress signal unique to the Imperial Soldiers. As long as it was within the borders of Great Wei, it would immediately be known by the Imperial Capital.","The capital was thousands of miles away from Conglong, but they could still rush over through a teleportation array. And this required time.","Therefore, he didn’t come out even after Chu Yunfan killed all the Imperial Soldiers. He had been talking to Chu Yunfan until now to stall for time.","He needed time!","Sure enough, as soon as Chu Yunfan finished speaking, a powerful aura surged from the sky above Conglong, and waves of nattle energy soared into the sky.","Reinforcements had arrived, and they were the Imperial Soldiers.","Only the Imperial Soldiers could react so quickly and arrive before Chu Yunfan killed them all.","“That’s right, I was stalling for time. Chu Yunfan, you’re deadmeat. This time, the First Guardian will personally take action. You won’t be able to escape!” Wei Xingfeng roared, his face revealing an excited expression."]},{"number":1391,"title":"Chapter 1391 One Arrow to Kill Them All","paragraphs":["1391 One Arrow to Kill Them All","When they noticed the powerful aura coming from the teleportation array of Conglong, not only Wei Xingfeng, but even the experts behind Wei Xingfeng revealed excited expressions.","The plan they had discussed was indeed very effective. They had been waiting for the arrival of reinforcements.","“That’s right, Chu Yunfan. It’s not too late to surrender now!”","“Chu Yunfan, just surrender obediently. Do you think you can escape?”","“That’s right, you’re deadmeat!”","These people shouted one after another, especially when a terrifying aura enveloped the entire area starting from Conglong. It spread out directly, allowing them to sense it. This terrifying aura made them tremble. Who else could have such a terrifying cultivation besides the First Guardian?","They felt even more arrogant now, especially when the First Guardian was rushing over at an astonishing speed.","In the distance, Wei Wuya revealed a look of pity and anxiety. Chu Yunfan was too indecisive. At this point, why was he still talking to them? Now that the First Guardian had arrived, it was impossible for Chu Yunfan to kill him.","At this time, he could not show his face at all. On the contrary, he hid even further away and did not dare to approach. Once he was discovered, he would be finished.","The First Guardian was too strong. He did not dare to take the risk.","“Do you think that stalling for time will be of any use? Can the First Guardian save you?” Chu Yunfan sneered, and a cold smile appeared on his face. “If I want to kill you, even the gods in the sky can’t save you!”","The ball of lightning energy in Chu Yunfan’s hand began to spin wildly, turning into a longbow. He then grabbed another ball of energy and turned it into a long arrow, pointing it directly at Wei Xingfeng and the others.","Wei Xingfeng and the others were instantly dumbfounded. They had not expected that at this time, Chu Yunfan did not have the slightest intention of escaping. On the contrary, he actually wanted to kill them.","In their original imagination, Chu Yunfan should have started running for his life at this time.","“Why you...” Wei Xingfeng’s eyes widened. Then, he suddenly thought of another possibility. The reason why Chu Yunfan did not kill them immediately was not because he was confused by their strategy of stalling for time. He was planning to use them to bait the First Guardian and swindled him out of the Imperial Capital.","Originally, he did not even think about this possibility. It was simply impossible. But if Chu Yunfan’s goal was to rebel and take revenge, then all of this was possible.","And they were just bait!","After all, this was the most suitable place to strike. If it was in the Imperial Capital, then the geographical advantage would not be on Chu Yunfan’s side. As everyone knew, the Imperial Capital was heavily guarded and it was not the best place to strike.","“You used us!” Wei Xingfeng roared.","“It’s too late to realize it now!” Chu Yunfan shouted and released the arrow in his hand. The arrow’s light expanded in the wind and instantly grew to a large size, like a small mountain crushing over.","“Run!” someone shouted from behind Wei Xingfeng. Everyone began to flee in all directions. However, it was already too late for them to escape.","Boom!","The arrow light swept across and exploded in mid-air. A small mushroom cloud rose up and spread out at an astonishing speed. The terrifying air wave swallowed everything. In an instant, all the experts, including Wei Xingfeng, were swallowed by it.","Not a single one of them escaped.","Everyone waited for a while, but no one escaped. Everyone understood that those people were all dead. When they looked at Chu Yunfan, he was like a living demon god walking in the world.","“Is that really human power?”","“Can human cultivation really reach that level?”","“There were a few Cores and the rest were half-step Cores, but they were killed in one hit!”","“He’s too terrifying. He actually has such strength. No wonder he has the confidence to challenge the Imperial Court. It’s already terrifying enough that he slaughtered the Imperial Soldiers earlier. But I’m afraid that he was still holding back and didn’t use his full strength.”","“That’s right, that must be the case. Otherwise, if he attacked a few times like this, the Imperial Soldiers wouldn’t be able to last that long.”","“What level has he reached? Has he already surpassed the Void Core Stage?”","After a brief moment of shock, everyone was in an uproar. Chu Yunfan’s attack was shocking. They thought that if he had his eyes on Wei Xingfeng, who was the leader, Wei Xingfeng would not be able to escape. However, Chu Yunfan couldn’t kill everyone in such a short time, and there would always be someone who could escape. After all, First Guardian was about to arrive.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would give them a huge shock once again? He killed Wei Xingfeng and the others in one blow!","“No!”","An extremely loud and furious voice erupted from the direction of Conglong. Everyone saw that an old man had arrived on the battlefield and was looking at Chu Yunfan with a ferocious expression.","If that wasn’t the First Guardian, then who was it?","He had seen Chu Yunfan slaughter Wei Xingfeng and the others from afar, but he was too far away and could not catch up in time.","The First Guardian’s eyes were wide open, and he wished he could tear Chu Yunfan into pieces.","“You’ve finally appeared!” Chu Yunfan looked at the First Guardian indifferently. “It’s a pity that General Ye Fei isn’t here. Otherwise, I could’ve taken care of him too.”","Chu Yunfan calmly stated his plan, which immediately frightened the spies of the various major forces. They were scared to death.","Chu Yunfan planned to wipe out General Ye Fei, who was ranked second among Great Wei’s five experts, and the First Guardian, who was ranked third.","What a big tone and ambition!","At this moment, they all understood that not only did Wei Xingfeng want to stall for time, but even Chu Yunfan also wanted to stall for time so that Wei Xingfeng could call for help.","However, what everyone found strange was what kind of methods Chu Yunfan had. He was so confident that he could even wipe out General Ye Fei and the First Guardian.","“Chu Yunfan, you really aren’t dead.” The First Guardian said through gritted teeth. He stared at Chu Yunfan with killing intent."]},{"number":1392,"title":"Chapter 1392 Killing a Core With an Arrow Is Like Cutting Grass","paragraphs":["1392 Killing a Core With an Arrow Is Like Cutting Grass","When he received the news, he had rushed over immediately. At first, he did not believe that Chu Yunfan was still alive.","After all, he and General Ye Fei had seen Chu Yunfan die in the nuclear explosion with their own eyes. Although he didn’t know what kind of attack it was, they could feel the power of the explosion.","Not to mention Void Core Stage, even if it was an expert who had surpassed the Void Core Stage, if they were directly swept by that weapon, they too would die. Moreover, Chu Yunfan was clearly at the center of the explosion. In that position, no matter what kind of preparations he made, he would still die.","They First Guardian had personally confirmed this. Therefore, when he first received the news, he did not believe it at all. However, he didn’t dare to ignore the distress signal sent by Wei Xingfeng. After all, this was the highest level of distress signal, and as the First Guardian, he had to personally take action.","Who knew that he would actually see Chu Yunfan here?!","“Very well. I don’t care how you survived that explosion, but this is good. I’ll kill you myself!” the First Guardian said coldly.","Not far behind him, there were already more than 20,000 Imperial Army soldiers flying toward Chu Yunfan. As the saying went, tens of thousands of people covered the sky, let alone more than 20,000 people. They blotted out the entire sky, and the terrifying battle energy brought by the orderly army formation turned the world upside down.","“As expected, the Imperial Soldiers are coming!”","At this moment, the scouts who were watching the battle from afar were frightened by this terrifying aura. The overwhelming momentum of the army was not something that ordinary people could resist. Many felt themselves tremble. This was a completely different level of deterrence from when the Imperial Army had been stationed.","“Not only the Imperial Army has been mobilized, but the imperial family’s guardians have also been mobilized on a large scale. There are more than 20 Cores... They’ve really come out in full force!” Some people saw that there were more than 20 powerful experts at the forefront of the army. All of them were above the Core Stage.","“Chu Yunfan is in big trouble this time, but it’s hard to say. Chu Yunfan hasn’t used his true trump card yet.”","“Tsk, tsk. A war like this is rarely seen in decades!” Someone clicked his tongue in wonder.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think you can run away this time?” The First Guardian looked at Chu Yunfan coldly.","“Run away? Why should I run away?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “Everything I did was to lure you out. Now you expect me to run away? What a joke. Do you think this lineup can do anything to me?”","In a flash, Chu Yunfan formed a ball of lightning energy in his hand, and this ball of lightning energy turned into a longbow. Then, he grabbed another arrow.","Whoosh!","The arrow instantly tore through the sky, heading straight for the charging Imperial Army soldiers.","“D*mn it!” The Imperial Guardian did not expect Chu Yunfan to suddenly make things difficult for him. He couldn’t stop it in time. In fact, the arrow was too fast. Even if he could react in time, he couldn’t stop it.","Boom!","The arrow swept into the formation of the Imperial Army, and the battle energy formed by the Imperial Army could not stop Chu Yunfan’s arrow. It was broken on the spot.","Boom!","The arrow of light exploded, killing thousands of Imperial Army soldiers on the spot. Although only a few thousand soldiers fell, it was enough to scare everyone.","In the face of an army formation, ordinary martial arts experts could only choose to escape and would not dare to lightly attack. However, Chu Yunfan dared to charge forward and meet it head-on. The key was that he could break through the army formation as if it had no effect on him.","“D*mn it!”","The Imperial Guardians who were following the army glared at the arrow. Although the arrow was not aimed at them, it was like a slap to their faces.","However, before they could express their anger, Chu Yunfan’s next arrows followed closely behind and locked onto them. Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast. More than 20 arrows exploded in an instant and shot at them.","“Watch out!” The First Guardian suddenly realized that something was wrong. He had suddenly discovered something extremely dangerous.","However, it was too late. The arrows hit the other guardians. Although they were all Cores and their reaction speed was far faster than ordinary people, they were nothing in front of Chu Yunfan.","It pierced through them almost instantly as if it had teleported in front of them in an instant.","Stab!","Stab!","Stab!","These Imperial Guardians were directly swept by by the arrows, and they all screamed miserably. Their bodies exploded in mid-air, and not a single one of them could escape.","The terrifying attack happened within a short time. The spies were dazzled for a while. Before they could see what was going on, Chu Yunfan had already slaughtered more than 20 Imperial Guardians.","These powerful Cores were no match for Chu Yunfan. In just a moment, they were all slaughtered.","How...How dare you!” The First Guardian was so furious that his entire body was trembling.","More than 20 of the Imperial Guardians had died tragically. It should be known that the people he brought out this time were all his trusted aides and elites. The batch of people who listened to his orders in the Guardian Bureau were shot dead by Chu Yunfan’s arrows on the spot.","“What’s there to be afraid of? Don’t be anxious. You turn will come.” Chu Yunfan looked at the First Guardian and shot out another arrow.","Whoosh!","The arrow swept across the sky and arrived before the First Guardian in the blink of an eye.","“Sh*t!”","The First Guardian immediately felt a sense of danger, from the soles of his feet to his brain. He gritted his teeth, and a stone shield appeared in front of him. This shield was engraved with an ancient pattern as if it was a magic tool born from the Stone Age. It had an amazing defensive ability.","Boom!","The arrow landed on the stone shield, and the shield exploded. Although it did not pierce through the stone shield, the intense rebound force pushed back the First Guardian. He felt the blood in his chest churning, and he almost bled from the shock.","Suddenly, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan appeared in front of him.","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and threw a punch."]},{"number":1393,"title":"Chapter 1393 Slaying the First Guardian","paragraphs":["1393 Slaying the First Guardian","Quick!","Quick!","Quick!","Chu Yunfan’s speed was too fast!","It was as if he had teleported before the First Guardian. To outsiders, it was as if he had transformed into a golden eagle.","A powerful fist pressure instantly erupted and swept toward the First Guardian.","A stone shield appeared in front of the First Guardian to block Chu Yunfan’s path. However, how could he resist it?","Chu Yunfan’s fist smashed into it, and a sound of metal clashing rang out.","Bam!","The First Guardian grunted and flew backward. Then, like a kite with a broken string, he finally stabilized himself after a long time.","Spurt!","The First Guardian finally could not contain the surging blood in his heart and spat out a mouthful of old blood. A look of horror flashed through his eyes. He never expected Chu Yunfan to be able to unleash such a terrifying attack. The fist that swept out was like a spirit weapon.","No, it should be said that Chu Yunfan’s physical body had the power of a spirit weapon and was able to tackle his shield with his bare hands.","This was the most terrifying part. The First Guardian’s cultivation had reached the peak Void Core Stage, but in terms of physical cultivation, it was impossible for him to reach the level of a spirit weapon. At most, it was equivalent to an ordinary magic tool.","This was already very shocking. After all, a physical body was a physical body, not a magic weapon. It was already shocking to be able to reach such a level.","However, someone like Chu Yunfan was simply a monster!","‘How can anyone’s body be so strong? Even monsters can’t do it!’ The First Guardian thought in horror. What he was even more terrified of was that Chu Yunfan had not reached the Core Stage yet.","Chu Yunfan did not have the characteristics of the Core Stage, although he could already display some of that level of power. However, he was clearly not in the Core Stage.","Even the First Guardian, who was in the Core Stage, could not reach the point where his physical body cultivation could be compared to a spirit weapon. Chu Yunfan was only in the Divine Abilities Stage, but he could do this. And once he broke through to the Core Stage, how terrifying would his physical body be?!","However, the First Guardian did not have time to ponder over this. In an instant, Chu Yunfan had already pounced on him again.","Bam!","Chu Yunfan threw another punch without hesitation.","Boom!","There was another huge explosion. The stone shield shook violently. The ancient patterns on the stone shield turned into a barrier to resist Chu Yunfan’s fist force.","However, how could it withstand it? Chu Yunfan’s fist force exploded.","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","Explosions sounded as Chu Yunfan’s fist force spread out and exploded on the stone shield.","Boom!","The stone shield finally couldn’t withstand it anymore. It exploded and shattered into pieces, turning into flowing lights that scattered in all directions.","The First Guardian let out a blood-curdling scream as he was sent flying into the midst of the charging Imperial Army soldiers.","Spurt!","The First Guardian spat out another mouthful of blood. His face was extremely pale. It was as if his internal organs had shifted positions, and countless bones in his body had been broken.","Under Chu Yunfan’s violent attacks, he had no room to fight back at all. He could only resist continuously. However, as the saying goes, a long defense will lead to a loss, and this was his situation.","He finally managed to retreat back into the Imperial Army. Just as he heaved a sigh of relief, his eyes immediately widened. He didn’t know when Chu Yunfan had already charged into the Imperial Army’s formation.","“He’s courting death!”","For a moment, he did not know what to say. Ordinary martial arts masters would definitely avoid falling into a military formation. Facing attacks from all directions, no matter how strong he was, it was impossible to resist. There would always be a time when he was exhausted.","If it were him, his only choice would be to run away when faced with an army formation like the Imperial Soldiers. He wouldn’t dare to resist at all.","He didn’t care about one or two Imperial Soldiers. He could kill hundreds of Imperial Soldiers, but when there were tens of thousands of them, it wasn’t something he could deal with just because he wanted to.","However, he immediately became excited. No matter what Chu Yunfan’s reason was, it was a good thing for him.","“Kill him!”","The Imperial Army didn’t need the First Guardian’s orders. They all exploded with terrifying attacks. The attacks of one or two Imperial Army soldiers weren’t much, but when they all converged into a flood, they were extremely terrifying.","However, no one expected that this was the time for Chu Yunfan to truly display his might. If Chu Yunfan had not released all his potential, he could only use nuclear bombs to deal with such an army formation.","Now that the quantitative change had caused a qualitative change, his strength had completely surpassed the previous level.","Rumble!","These attacks all landed on Chu Yunfan’s body, but everyone found that Chu Yunfan’s body had turned into a black dragon, protecting him.","It was none other than the Black Dragon Night Robe. The quality of this spirit treasure was not particularly high, but it was much stronger than when it was in the hands of the Black Emissary of the Netherworld Sect.","The spirit weapon itself was very important, but what was more important was the person who used it. In Chu Yunfan’s hand, the black dragon bared its fangs and brandished its claws, swallowing the torrent of attacks from all directions in one gulp. It was extremely terrifying.","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed and appeared in front of the First Guardian. Immediately after, his fist swept out like a bolt of lightning tearing through the night sky. In the blink of an eye, it had already arrived before the First Guardian.","The First Guardian never expected Chu Yunfan, who was surrounded, could still be so brave. He could not resist and was punched until blood spurted out. His entire chest collapsed and many of his bones were broken.","The First Guardian instantly sensed danger. He hurriedly turned around and wanted to escape into the distance.","However, how could Chu Yunfan let him escape?","In the next moment, a pair of thunder wings appeared behind Chu Yunfan. With a slight flap, he caught up with the First Guardian. He casually grabbed a sword light and turned it into a long sword.","Slash!","The Imperial Guardian screamed as his body was cut in half, dying on the spot."]},{"number":1394,"title":"Chapter 1394 Great Wei Shocked","paragraphs":["1394 Great Wei Shocked","It was too fast!","The speed of Chu Yunfan’s successive attacks was too fast. It was so fast that everyone didn’t even have time to react before it ended.","Many people widened their eyes and trembled. “The First Guardian is dead!”","Many people were trembling. That man was the First Guardian. He was even closer to the imperial family than a general of the outer court like General Ye Fei. Moreover, he was one of the top three experts in the world. According to various rumors, he was an existence who had truly stepped into the peak Void Core Stage. He was not an intermediate Void Core like Mi Siyuan, nor was he a late Void Core like Blood King who was one step away from the peak Void Core Stage.","The world’s third most powerful expert had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands just like that. Although many people had predicted that it would only be a matter of time before Chu Yunfan reached this step, they thought that it would be decades later.","He was the youngest expert in Great Wei, after all. But now, after his resurrection, Chu Yunfan had achieved this.","“That’s way too strong! The First Guardian was unable to retaliate at all and was tortured to death!”","“That’s right. It’s not as simple as standing at that level. He’s also an expert at the peak of the Void Core Stage, right? Who dares to say that they’re his match?”","“If I hadn’t seen it with my own eyes, I wouldn’t have believed it even if you beat me to death!”","Many people realized that Great Wei was about to welcome a bloody storm.","Compared to Chu Yunfan, the First Guardian was so weak that he couldn’t even withstand a single blow. It seemed that even General Ye Fei might not be able to stop Chu Yunfan.","Maybe it would be the legendary number one expert in the world, Yun Huang. Perhaps he would be Chu Yunfan’s match.","This conclusion made countless people tremble with fear. Chu Yunfan’s arrival would bring about a brand new era!","On the other side, Wei Wuya, was trembling from excitement. He didn’t know how Chu Yunfan had cultivated to such an astonishing level, but he knew that Chu Yunfan’s strength was only beneficial to him.","Ever since he had saved the Chu clan, he had no other choice. He could either ascend to the throne with Chu Yunfan’s help or die under the Imperial Court’s army. There was no other possibility.","“This is great! There’s hope for me to ascend the throne!” Wei Wuya tried to control his body, but he couldn’t help but tremble.","For others, the battle was over, but for Chu Yunfan, the battle had just begun. It was not over yet.","Although the Imperial Soldiers were not his match, they were still the most elite army in Great Wei. Even if they had no chance of winning, they would never retreat.","Their minds had long been instilled with the belief that they would never retreat.","Chu Yunfan did not show any mercy to these people and began to slaughter them. Their attacks landed on his body, but they were unable to break through the Black Dragon Night Robe’s defense. He casually shot an arrow, and hundreds of people died in the explosion.","For Chu Yunfan, this was not a problem at all. Although there was an army of more than 20,000 people, and the battle energy formed was enough to kill a Core, it was still far from enough to face Chu Yunfan, who had surpassed the ordinary peak Void Core Stage.","The battle lasted for two hours. Chu Yunfan didn’t use any big moves. With just simple attacks, he killed the 20,000-man army.","After the battle ended, everyone was immersed in shock.","In the past two hours, the scouts of the various large factions had spread the news. More and more scouts gathered in the surroundings. At the same time, the results of this battle spread to all the major factions in Great Wei.","The major forces in the south of Great Wei were extremely frightened. When the Imperial Court attacked the Chu clan, many of them chose to hit them while they were down. After all, everyone thought that Chu Yunfan would never return. Without Chu Yunfan’s support, the mere Chu clan was no match for them.","During this period, many of the Chu clan’s businesses had been annexed. Now that Chu Yunfan was back, didn’t that mean he wanted to take back everything?","It was fine if he just wanted to take back everything, but they were afraid that Chu Yunfan would settle the score later.","If they thought that even if Chu Yunfan returned, he would not be able to do anything to them, but the result of this battle had fully proved that Chu Yunfan did have such strength.","If the Imperial Soldiers of Great Wei could not stop Chu Yunfan, it was only a matter of time before they were exterminated. Even a top-notch expert like the First Guardian was no match for Chu Yunfan.","This was terrifying!","However, what made many people feel at ease was that the Chu clan was saved when they were sent to the execution ground. Chu Yunfan was not so angry that he went crazy. Otherwise, none of them would be able to escape.","Previously, they thought that the person who had saved the Chu clan was simply a busybody. However, now they felt that it was not a bad thing for someone to be a busybody.","After killing all the soldiers, Chu Yunfan went to find the Wei Wuya who was in a state of excitement. Thinking that he might succeed, he was so excited that he couldn’t stop himself from shaking.","“You are most impressive, Master Chu. Even the First Guardian is no match for you!” Wei Wuya quickly said. He wasn’t just complimenting Chu Yunfan, but he actually thought this way. Chu Yunfan had killed First Guardian, which had completely changed his impression of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan was strong. With such an expert holding the fort, there was no other outcome for Wei Wuya than to succeed.","“Killing the First Guardian was nothing. The next step is to kill General Ye Fei and change the kingdom,” Chu Yunfan said calmly.","Wei Wuya quickly collected his thoughts and nodded. “But now that the news is all over the place, I’m afraid the Imperial Court and Father have already made begun making preparations,” he said with some distress.","“That is the effect I want. If I had attacked the Imperial City from the beginning, it would have been easier. However, how am I to suppress the dukes and experts of the various places after that? Those people will continue to raise their troops to resist. At that time, even if I can suppress them all, it will hurt the vitality of the entire country,” Chu Yunfan said slowly."]},{"number":1395,"title":"Chapter 1395 Raising an Army and Clearing the Emperor’s Side","paragraphs":["1395 Raising an Army and Clearing the Emperor’s Side","“Therefore, the best way is to beat them into fear and then pacify the world in one go,” Chu Yunfan said, “It’s time for you to stand up.”","“Me?” Wei Wuya’s eyes widened in shock.","Chu Yunfan had always been standing at the forefront, so no one knew that Wei Wuya was involved.","“Of course. Otherwise, how am I supposed to convince the masses with just little old me?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Wei Wuya thought about it and agreed. If he didn’t step forward now, he wouldn’t be able to convince the public afterward. Moreover, he didn’t want Chu Yunfan to steal all the limelight.","This was the instinct of a superior.","Although he couldn’t say that he had overshadowed his master, even if he did, he couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan. Experts of this level would usually be roped in by the imperial family. If it were not for the potential that Chu Yunfan had displayed, which made the imperial family afraid, they would not have suddenly made a move.","For the imperial family, Chu Yunfan might become their combat strength in the future, but it was more likely that he would become their stumbling block. After all, if his strength was so strong that they could not restrain him, then the existence of Great Wei would depend on Chu Yunfan’s thoughts.","Such a situation was too unpredictable. In order to avoid such a situation, they would rather destroy him.","Of course, their judgment was wrong. Chu Yunfan was more difficult to deal with than they had imagined, which was why Wei Wuya had a chance.","Chu Yunfan had never thought of replacing Wei Wuya, because firstly, he didn’t have any ambition to do so. Secondly, if the person he recommended was a member of the Wei imperial family, it would be easier for the people to accept him after the battle ended.","On the contrary, if he wanted to support a person from the Chu clan to ascend the throne, then Great Wei would probably welcome all kinds of rebellions.","“I believe that you should’ve developed your forces. This time, whether it’s the military or the local forces, pull them all out,” Chu Yunfan instructed, “If you want to be an emperor, you have to take responsibility. You can’t always be behind me.”","“Very well.” Wei Wuya nodded. After saying that, he departed, beginning to contact his own forces.","The commotion caused by this battle had just begun to ferment in Great Wei. Especially in the south, countless forces held their breaths. Great Wei’s Imperial Court suppressed all directions and was invincible. However, the strength that Chu Yunfan displayed shocked them.","Just the fact that Chu Yunfan had killed the First Guardian in a single battle made countless people’s jaws drop.","In total, about 30,000 Imperial Soldiers had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. In addition, the First Guardian and more than 20 Core Guardians had died at his hands too. To Great Wei’s Imperial Court, although it was not a serious injury, it was definitely a heavy loss.","The Imperial Soldiers were the elites of Great Wei’s army. It wasn’t easy to nurture every single one of them. In one breath, they had lost more than 30,000 soldiers. To the Imperial Soldiers, it was definitely a huge blow.","The forces in the north of Great Wei were also watching.","Just when many people thought that Chu Yunfan would stop while he was ahead and leave after rescuing the Chu clan, no one expected Wei Wuya, the eighteenth prince , to suddenly stand out and lead a 100,000-strong army toward the capital of Great Wei.","Wei Wuya used the excuse that the emperor of Great Wei had been deceived and harmed by a traitor to launch a vigorous purge of the Imperial Court. With him stepping out from behind the scenes, it was clear who had saved the Chu clan.","The person behind the scenes was none other than the eighteenth prince.","With the slogan of eliminating the Imperial Court, Wei Wuya quickly led his army to conquer many cities in the south, including Conglong.","Conglong was on the lookout and did not dare to resist. It was precisely because Chu Yunfan came from Conglong that they knew Chu Yunfan’s strength. With him overseeing the army, the city could not resist. It was not difficult for them to kill all the soldiers in the city.","After taking down Conglong, they used it as their base and attacked everywhere. They took down dozens of cities in the south of Great Wei. For a time, their momentum soared.","Great Wei had fallen into chaos. In just half a month, everything had happened.","Naturally, the Imperial Court reacted. When the emperor heard that Wei Wuya was rebelling, he was instantly enraged. He announced that he would remove Wei Wuya from the ranks of the imperial family and remove him from the Imperial Court. He also imprisoned Wei Wuya’s mother. At the same time, he ordered the various regions to help the king. In just half a month, he had gathered a million troops from all over the world.","The 100,000 soldiers of the Imperial Army, led by General Ye Fei, swept toward the south. As for Wei Wuya, in just half a month, he had recruited an army of 200,000 soldiers, increasing his army from 100,000 to 300,000.","The battle between millions of people on both sides was about to break out. This battle would determine the fate of Great Wei. Who would be the one to decide who would rise and fall?","As Great Wei’s rebel army marched south, Chu Yunfan and Wei Wuya sat opposite each other in Conglong.","“Master Chu, the Imperial Court’s army is heading south. Based on their speed, they will arrive outside the city in three days,” Wei Wuya said as he looked at Chu Yunfan.","This was the information he had obtained from the spies. Because they were all martial artists and were not ordinary people, Great Wei army could travel day and night without much rest. They traveled thousands of miles a day all the way south.","“Yes.” Chu Yunfan nodded, his expression noncommittal as if he didn’t care about this news.","Wei Wuya smiled bitterly as he looked at Chu Yunfan. In just half a month’s time, he had gone from a prince to the ruler of the southern region of Great Wei. It could be said that he had experienced a feeling that he had not experienced for decades.","However, what followed were all kinds of troubles. The recruitment of hundreds of thousands of troops and the management of dozens of cities instantly made him unable to make ends meet.","He had previously built up a team of people in the middle of his undercover period. At this time, it was not enough. He could not even maintain the basic operations of the team."]},{"number":1396,"title":"Chapter 1396 Deciding the Universe in One Battle","paragraphs":["1396 Deciding the Universe in One Battle","Only now did Wei Wuya truly understand how troublesome it was to manage a huge empire. All his previous preparations seemed like a joke.","As for the people he had brought with him before—those few aides and people who had secretly submitted to him—it was already not bad for them to manage a city.","As for the dozens of cities, they had only surrendered on the surface. Even the garrison was the original batch of people. They surrendered because they were scared of Chu Yunfan.","The Imperial Court’s army was far away, but Chu Yunfan was close at hand. It wasn’t that there weren’t any cities that tried to resist, but after Chu Yunfan killed thousands of soldiers with a single sword strike, they immediately surrendered in fear.","The other cities also followed suit and were watching from afar. However, those cities had only surrendered on the surface. Who knew how much information they had secretly sent to the north?","Even though Wei Wuya knew this, he had no choice. There were not many people who cared about it. Even the managers of the various cities were the original nobles. The only gain was that his territory seemed to have expanded, and he could recruit troops from various cities. If they wanted to recruit hundreds of thousands of troops from Conglong alone, they were thinking too much.","And this was only a small part of the problem. The hundreds of thousands of soldiers were simply a motley crew. They had only been recruited for less than half a month. Let alone fighting against the wind, it was probably not even easy to say if they would win. If there was even the slightest bit of something wrong with the situation, they would probably immediately collapse.","If they were to rely on this kind of army to go to the battlefield, they probably wouldn’t even be able to scare people.","The Imperial Court’s one million soldiers were truly elites, and the one hundred thousand Imperial Soldiers were the elites of the elites.","On their side, even the 100,000 people in Wei Wuya’s original team were only second-line guards. Otherwise, he could not have so easily recruited them.","At first, they thought that they were helping Wei Wuya fight for the throne. Who would have thought that he would raise an army to rebel? If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan’s battle achievements, they would probably mutiny on the spot.","All in all, it was a mess. The only thing that could be said to be in control was Conglong. With Chu Yaowei, a local tyrant, and the Chu clan’s connections in Conglong, they quickly took control of the city. They weren’t like the other cities that openly agreed but secretly disobeyed.","Of course, the main reason was that Chu Yunfan was in Conglong. The nobles in Conglong didn’t dare to act rashly. They didn’t even dare to say anything and obediently cooperated.","However, Wei Wuya knew that the reason why they were so willing to cooperate was not only because of Chu Yunfan’s deterrence, but also because Wei Wuya himself was a prince of Great Wei. He was not a peasant who rebelled. If Wei Wuya ascended the throne, he would inherit the noble system of Great Wei.","They were nobles, so they didn’t suffer too much loss. At most, they would be loyal to another emperor.","It could be said that Wei Wuya was in a terrible state. What was even more troublesome was that the spies of the Agency of Secrets were everywhere. In half a month, he had suffered at least dozens of assassinations. His father seemed to have made up his mind to kill him and end this rebellion.","There were currently two core figures in the revellion. One was Chu Yunfan, and the other was Wei Wuya. Assassinating Chu Yunfan was just a thought. Even if they wanted to do it, the agency could not find anyone who could do it.","With his cultivation, ordinary assassins could not even get close to him.","As soon as they appeared, Chu Yunfan would immediately notice them.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan was fine, but Wei Wuya was in trouble. In the end, he moved into Marquis Zhongxin’s residence. With Chu Yunfan in charge, no one would dare to be impudent.","“I know that is your last resort. This is your limit.” Chu Yunfan nodded seriously.","Wei Wuya didn’t even need to tell him about these things. He naturally knew that the people he had recruited were not just a motley crew, but many of them had different aspirations. If they were to directly fight, it would immediately lead to a situation of complete collapse.","As long as the situation was slightly unfavorable, these dozens of cities that had already surrendered would immediately betray them.","Thus, Chu Yunfan couldn’t be bothered and didn’t allow Wei Wuya to send people to manage those cities. What was the use of that? Those people who were sent would probably be immediately killed when the situation was unfavorable.","The reason why he had Wei Wuya conquer the several dozen cities in the south was to recruit new soldiers. At the very least, he had to make himself look presentable in order to attract the attention of the Imperial Court. He didn’t want to send 120,000 soldiers to their deaths.","From then on, the world would be settled in one battle.","“Don’t worry, those are just a motley crew. They are just tools I use to attract the attention of the Imperial Court. Otherwise, would the Imperial Court pay attention to just those few people? How long would they continue to send people to encircle and suppress them?” Chu Yunfan said as he stood up.","He wasn’t interested in such tactics, although from the perspective of rebellion, this kind of tactics was the best opportunity to develop.","“Besides, you know Jinzhanghan in the outer realms. They are stronger than Great Wei. If we drag this out for too long and they discover us, who will stop them when millions of iron hooves march south?” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Wei Wuya couldn’t help but break out in a cold sweat when he thought of the outcome. Even if Jinzhanghan didn’t send all of its soldiers south, two to three million would be a disaster for Great Wei.","“Thus, settling the world in one battle is the least harmful method to Great Wei,” Chu Yunfan said.","He had been in Great Wei for almost two years. He didn’t want the kingdom to be destroyed, but he didn’t want to waste any more time here. At the same time, he also wanted to leave this place as soon as possible to find Tang Siyu.","“I understand, but I’m afraid that the Imperial Court will seek help from the Monster Subduers’ sect master, Yun Huang.” Wei Wuya looked at Chu Yunfan as if he wanted to see his reaction.","Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. He just said, “No matter what Yun Huang is like, so what if he appears? As long as he doesn’t surpass the Void Core Stage, I have the confidence to defeat him. I’m not afraid even if he joins forces with Ye Fei.”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, Wei Wuya heaved a sigh of relief.","“Friend, since you’re here, why don’t you show yourself?” Chu Yunfan suddenly said."]},{"number":1397,"title":"Chapter 1397 Slaughtering Core Assassins","paragraphs":["1397 Slaughtering Core Assassins","Chu Yunfan’s voice echoed before Wei Wuya could figure out what was happening. Suddenly, he felt a terrifying presence in the air, followed by a tingling sensation.","Then a shocking sword-shaped light appeared out of thin air and slashed toward Chu Yunfan. The light was swift and deadly, with a pitch-black light inside it.","Clang!","This strike landed on Chu Yunfan’s body. At that moment, a black dragon appeared on Chu Yunfan’s body, blocking the sword-shaped light. Soon after, a figure appeared before the two. It was a man in black with a medium build.","‘He was the one hiding in the air just now!’","With that thought in mind, Wei Wuya instantly broke out in a cold sweat. He had not sensed the other party’s existence. Although his cultivation was not at its peak, he was still at the seventh tier of the Divine Abilities Stage.","The terrifying pressure the other party had just shown made Wei Wuya feel suffocated.","‘He’s a Core! It’s a Core assassin!’","Wei Wuya’s scalp tingled at that thought. He knew Core assassins were much more terrifying than ordinary Cores. An ordinary Core could not escape if a Core assassin targeted them. Only a few top-notch assassins like these existed, but each was an illustrious existence.","However, Wei Wuya knew no such assassin organization existed in Great Wei. That was because an assassin organization in the empire had killed the emperor in the past. It had caused a massive uproar then, and this organization had suffered insane strangulation. Although Great Wei paid a terrible price to kill the organization, various important Imperial Court officials suffered substantial casualties.","After that, there were no Core assassins in Great Wei. It was something everyone knew. There were other Core assassins had come up, but the Imperial Court quickly found and killed these people, or they fled Great Wei’s borders.","Wei Wuya was the prince of Great Wei, so he knew far more than the average person. He instantly thought of a terrifying possibility. The only one who would assassinate Chu Yunfan at this time was Great Wei.","‘This person is undoubtedly a Core assassin the Imperial Court had found from the outer realm!’","The Imperial Court had not taken action against Chu Yunfan. Instead, they were holding back a significant move.","Ordinary Cores were no match for Chu Yunfan. Even if someone sent them here, they would die. They might not even be able to block Chu Yunfan’s move. They could only assassinate Chu Yunfan through Core assassins.","However, they underestimated Chu Yunfan as he discovered them before they could get close.","The assassin instantly fled backward. As an assassin, he would flee a thousand miles away if his attack failed. Still, it was already too late for the assassin to escape.","Chu Yunfan reached outward with one hand and condensed his spirit energy, forming a giant hand.","The Core assassin was so fast that he had already run hundreds of meters away. Although fast, he could not escape Chu Yunfan’s speed and got caught by the giant hand.","“Are you leaving?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Indeed, detecting these Core assassins was difficult, and others might need to get closer to detect even ordinary Cores. However, it was different for Chu Yunfan since he possessed the Imperial Physique and the Thunderclap Physique—special abilities that far exceeded ordinary people’s imagination.","His control over the power of thunder had reached the peak of perfection, especially with his Thunderclap Physique. An electromagnetic field around his body allowed him to detect anyone approaching him.","The Core assassin struggled to escape from Chu Yunfan’s grasp.","“Hmph!” Chu Yunfan snorted and suddenly exerted force, crushing the assassin in mid-air.","The former did not even ask who hired him because it was already self-evident. It must have been the Imperial Court. There were no other possibilities.","Chu Yunfan did not care and knew such things would happen sooner or later since he had already embarked on this path.","Wei Wuya sighed in relief. After all, the pressure he felt from the assassin was too great. These Core assassins might not even hold a candle to Chu Yunfan, but it was too terrifying to Wei Wuya.","Wei Wuya returned to his senses and saw Chu Yunfan suddenly stretching out his giant hand to grab him. Then the former saw five powerful sword-shaped lights slash downward, almost killing him.","Bang!","A colossal explosion sounded as Wei Wuya got dragged to Chu Yunfan’s side. The former was still in shock because he was also one of the assassins’ targets.","To the Imperial Court, Wei Wuya was even more detestable than Chu Yunfan. After all, a mighty rebellion had been set of because of Wei Wuya’s betrayal.","Chu Yunfan’s body emitted waves of electromagnetic force. Suddenly, five approaching figures appeared before them in the sky. The five people were Cores.","Wei Wuya trembled as he watched. Again, he was sure there was no such assassin organization in Great Wei. There could not be that many Cores even if there were assassins in Great Wei who had secretly broken through to the Core Stage.","The five figures instantly made a decision. They formed a small battle formation and launched a surprise attack on Chu Yunfan.","Bang!","Chu Yunfan did not even look as a black dragon appeared from his body and blocked the attacks. Then he casually waved, turning a powerful ball of thunder into a giant hand to slap one of the five people.","Bang!","A loud explosion echoed, and the assassin were smashed into pieces."]},{"number":1398,"title":"Chapter 1398 The War Begins After the Slaughter","paragraphs":["1398 The War Begins After the Slaughter","Chu Yunfan instantly vanished after crushing a Core in one move. He then appeared before another black-clothed man.","The black-clothed man could not even react, and Chu Yunfan’s punch smashed through him, causing him to die on the spot. Afterward, Chu Yunfan condensed a powerful sword-shaped light and slashed it outward.","Before they knew it, two more assassins got cut in half in midair. Although it took a while to describe, everything happened in a split second. The remaining men in black immediately sensed the extreme danger.","They were astonished as they had never faced such a terrifying person. Cores resembled ancestors in an assassin organization. They had seen various experts like them and killed countless Cores. There were numerous experts and even terrifying existences they could fight against. However, none could compare to Chu Yunfan since he could kill them as quickly as breathing in and out.","Six assassins came after Chu Yunfan, and he had already killed five. The remaining assassin was horrified as it was the first time they had felt like this since breaking through to the Core Stage.","It almost made them want to turn around and escape.","“You want to flee now?” Chu Yunfan sneered and pulled out his bow before shooting an arrow he formed with his thunder power. It shot across the sky and nailed the remaining assassin to the ground.","Everything happened so quickly to Wei Wuya that it seemed like a split second. He thought it was too dazzling. He only sensed danger, but Chu Yunfan had already killed all six assassins.","Wei Wuya looked at Chu Yunfan in a daze as if looking at a monster. He knew how terrifying Core assassins were. Previously, Great Wei had paid a great prince to eliminate these assassins. Wei Wuya and the Imperial Guards trapped and attacked the assassins in a valley. They fought day to night, trying to kill each other.","Wei Wuya and the others paid an excruciating price in the process.","‘How can they stand up to someone like Chu Yunfan, who easily killed these terrifying experts as quickly as chopping fruits and vegetables?’","It made Wei Wuya realize Chu Yunfan might have surpassed the current Cores’ levels. Although he might not have entered the Core Stage, his combat strength had already surpassed theirs.","After a long while, Wei Wuya finally spoke. “You’re absolutely formidable. I didn’t expect you to be so powerful, Master Chu!”","Chu Yunfan grabbed the assassin’s corpses and put them into the Mountain River Diagram. He thought he might as well recycle their corpses.","Chu Yunfan said lightly, “They were too weak.”","Wei Wuya sighed despite himself when he saw Chu Yunfan’s calm expression. The former thought, ‘Now that’s the right way to show off!’","However, he did not know these assassins were too weak for Chu Yunfan. They were not even as strong as Mi Siyuan because these assassins were only good at assassination.","Their combat strength would be at the bottom of the Core Stage if they were discovered. Therefore, eliminating them was a breeze for Chu Yunfan, not much more challenging than killing Divines.","Still, it was simply too awe-inspiring to Wei Wuya. He knew it was not a matter of acting cool to Chu Yunfan. After all, this was reality.","“The Imperial Court has invested a lot into this matter.” Wei Wuya sighed. He knew hiring Divine assassins, let alone Cores, was costly because of the target they intended to eliminate.","Still, no expert was easy to deal with. Hence, the cost was so high that it would be unimaginable for ordinary people, especially since they had hired six assassins in one go.","‘That would empty almost the whole national treasury!’","“It’s useless. The Imperial Court thinks I’m just an ordinary Core, so they’re playing these boring tricks,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Even the Imperial family’s First Guardian, a peak Void Core, was not Chu Yunfan’s match, let alone these Core assassins. After all, Chu Yunfan’s physique was unique. One would say he had the most robust physique in the era of emperors, not to mention the modern era. After reaching this stage, he could sweep through them immediately. Those who used the First Guardian, or General Ye Fei, to measure his strength were genuinely mistaken.","Such a lineup was enough to assassinate General Ye Fei. Still, for Chu Yunfan, his solid defense was enough to resist such an assassination, even if he overlooked the assassins.","“Yes, it might be a small trick to you.” Wei Wuya looked at Chu Yunfan enviously. However, he quickly collected his thoughts because he knew his path differed from Chu Yunfan’s, as the latter was the path of an emperor.","“Since you’ve already used such a move, the final battle is about to begin. Go and prepare,” Chu Yunfan said.","“Yes.” Wei Wuya immediately went to do as Chu Yunfan instructed. After all, the assassination attempt gave him a sense of urgency. If it were not for Chu Yunfan, he would have died. The protection of a top-notch expert was imperative.","The three hundred thousand-man army gathered under Wei Wuya’s orders. The whole of Conglong began moving at breakneck speed. Still, just feeding these soldiers was a massive issue. Fortunately, both sides wanted to quickly end the battle and not to drag it out for long.","Three days passed in the blink of an eye, and a mighty army of over a million people arrived at Conglong—the long lines and countless soldiers surrounded the place.","Although Conglong was massive, a million soldiers could surround it. Meanwhile, Wei Wuya’s army of three hundred thousand men had left the city to set up a formation that stretched as far as the eye could see.","The battle to determine the fate of the world had finally begun."]},{"number":1399,"title":"Chapter 1399 Shocking the Army in Front of the Battle Formation","paragraphs":["1399 Shocking the Army in Front of the Battle Formation","What kind of scene was it when millions of troops moved? It could be said to be endless as if dark clouds were covering the sky and crushing over.","Wei Wuya’s 300 thousand soldiers were all newly recruited. Even the original 100 thousand were only second-tier troops, not elite troops, and were only garrison troops. Now seeing an army of a million coming from all directions, they were so scared that their legs went weak. They were unable to raise their heads in front of the imposing manner of a million million troops.","This was the situation when a regular army faced a mob like this. Unless it was the end of the dynasty, the strength of these regular armies could not be compared to those mobs.","At the very front of the army, Wei Wuya’s expression was extremely unsightly. He was also being suppressed by the aura of the army. It was as if a huge mountain was pressing down on him.","He was dressed in military uniform, and behind him were his trusted aides. There were only a few thousand people who could be considered elites. One could imagine how much of a failure he had been in the past. Without Chu Yunfan, there was no possibility of him successfully rebelling. A local guard force was able to suppress a motley crew that he had brought up. The generals behind him too were ashen. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan at the front, the entire army would have collapsed.","Not far away was Chu Yunfan. Behind him were Chu Yaowei and Chu Hongcai, who were dressed in military attire. Behind the two of them were the elites and trusted aides of the Chu clan. They were also the troops that the Chu clan had controlled for many years.","There were only a few thousand of them, and Wei Wuya’s army only had a little over ten thousand. Compared to a million elites, there was simply no comparison.","“What should we do now? We’re all out, I’m afraid we can’t defend Conglong.” Chu Yaowei looked at Chu Yunfan.","During this period, the power of Conglong had been in his hands. This was the first time he felt the feeling of being a top power figure. Although he was also a noble before, he was only a middle-level noble. He could not even control Conglong.","Power was like poison. Once one had control over it, no one would want to give it up. It was the same for him. Therefore, he had placed all his hopes on Chu Yunfan. At this moment, he could only believe in Chu Yunfan.","“Defend the city? These mobs can’t even defend the city. If they are defeated in the city, it will be even more troublesome. Since they want this city, then let them have it,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","“Didn’t I tell you to move your clansmen? Now, they have to capture the leader first and defeat us in one battle,” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","In any case, he had no intention to fight a regular battle with the Imperial Court’s army. The mob behind him had no chance of winning.","In front of him, in the endless army formation, a figure in armor was like a lamp in the darkness. In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, it was impossible to hide it.","“That’s right, we can only gamble now.”","Chu Yaowei looked at the army in front of him. His hands trembled slightly and his entire body tensed up. This battle would determine the survival of the Chu clan. If they won, the Chu clan would become the top noble of Great Wei. If they lost, they would die and their family would be wiped out.","Thud, thud, thud!","A series of orderly footsteps sounded out as the million-strong army began to move. As time passed, they became faster and faster as they began to charge. The terrifying aura formed by the charge of millions of soldiers covered the sky and covered the earth, crushing over from all directions. Everyone within Wei Wuya’s army felt as if a mountain was pressing down on them and suffocating them.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan suddenly leaped up. His entire body was like a divine dragon as he flew into the air. He was like an unsheathed sword, bringing with him a terrifying aura that directly broke through the formation formed by the millions of soldiers.","In his eyes, even the aura formed by an army formation was divided into many levels. If it was an army like the Blood Barbarians, with a terrifying aura formed by millions, he could only turn around and run when he saw it. This was just an ordinary army of a million. Even if it was an elite army, he was not afraid.","Chu Yunfan stepped on thunder that filled the sky. His figure seemed to flash, and in an instant, he appeared in the middle of the two armies. Then, in a few more flashes, he had charged in the direction of General Ye Fei, who was among the Imperial Court’s army to suppress the rebellion.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you come here!”","“I regret not killing you back then, but it’s not too late to kill you now!”","“Hahaha, you speak as if you didn’t want to kill me. Didn’t you also fail to do anything to me?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","He didn’t take Ye Fei’s high-sounding words to heart. He knew that Ye Fei and the First Guardian had indeed wanted to kill him, but they did not have the chance. Or rather, they thought that he was already dead, but in fact, he had escaped through the Mountain River Diagram. Otherwise, why would they not make a move?","A spear appeared in Ye Fei’s hand. His entire body was like a mountain, and he instantly attacked Chu Yunfan, who was like a shooting star that swept across the sky.","Chu Yunfan wanted to capture the leader first, so he did the same.","Ye Fei knew very well that although the Wei Wuya was nominally the leader of this rebel army, in reality, Chu Yunfan was their spiritual pillar of support. Once Chu Yunfan was defeated, even if he showed the slightest sign of being unable to hold on, the entire army would collapse. They were just a bunch of motley crew. When the time came, killing them or forcing them to surrender would only be a matter of a word from him.","Boom!","The spear was like a long dragon, aimed directly at Chu Yunfan’s forehead. Then, he saw Chu Yunfan wave his hand casually, forming a terrifying tide that instantly blocked his spear. The terrifying power even passed through his low-grade spirit weapon spear and rebounded onto his own body.","Thud, thud, thud!","Ye Fei retreated. The powerful force forced him to retreat continuously to reduce Chu Yunfan’s strength. His eyes flashed with a hint of horror. If he did not fight with Chu Yunfan personally, he would never have imagined that Chu Yunfan had such terrifying power.","He had attacked with all his might, but he was still forced back by Chu Yunfan."]},{"number":1400,"title":"Chapter 1400 Surrounded","paragraphs":["1400 Surrounded","Ye Fei had cultivated military combat techniques to this stage. Every move and stance was powerful and heavy, suppressing powerful enemies with an upright might. Even the First Guardian, who was equally famous as him, would not choose to fight him head-on.","But Chu Yunfan was different. Chu Yunfan was facing him head-on, and he was not at a disadvantage. This was the most terrifying thing.","At this moment, he finally understood how the First Guardian had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. He and the First Guardian were both enemies and friends. Both sides had competed for many years, so he naturally understood how terrifying the other party was. Even when he fought the First Guardian, he had to be careful and not be careless. Otherwise, he might lose.","Although he was ranked second among the five great experts and the First Guardian of the imperial family was ranked third, the difference in strength between the two sides was not that big. They were basically on the same level, but the First Guardian was easily killed by Chu Yunfan.","He knew the result of that battle, but he couldn’t really guess Chu Yunfan’s strength without fighting him personally.","Before Ye Fei could think further, Chu Yunfan had already taken a step forward. His fist pressed down like hell. His fist swept through the sky and ruthlessly smashed toward Ye Fei.","From the battle formation, countless attacks swept toward Chu Yunfan. The dense arrows formed a tidal wave that swept toward him. A long black dragon coiled around him, roaring into the sky. When the attacks landed on this dragon, they made a banging sound, but they couldn’t break it.","On the other side, Ye Fei trembled and dispersed the force that Chu Yunfan had sent back to him. His divine power boiled and turned into a white tiger with menacing eyes. His spear swept out like the claws of a fierce tiger.","“Roar!”","The spear pierced through the air, turning into the roar of a fierce tiger.","Chu Yunfan’s fist force was extremely fast. It turned into a golden roc. It spread its wings for more than 100 meters and swept across the battlefield, invincible.","From afar, Chu Yaowei and the others saw this scene and all of them gripped their weapons tightly. Everyone understood that the outcome of this battle depended on Chu Yunfan.","Wei Wuya looked on from afar. It was as if one of them had transformed into a golden roc, while the other had transformed into a white tiger. The two fierce beasts fought in the air, looking extremely terrifying. Everyone knew that it was the manifestation of both sides ‘martial wills.","“Great General’s Tyrant Tiger Spear is terrifying! He would have stabbed an ordinary Core to death.”","“Who’s even more terrifying is Chu Yunfan. What kind of punch technique is that?”","“Generally speaking, the more terrifying a person’s martial will is, the stronger his own strength is. This Chu Yunfan is really bold. He actually dared to charge into the army.”","Far away from the two armies, countless scouts were gathered to watch the battle. Unknowingly, Wei Wuya’s side, which they had thought had no chance of winning, had gained a bit of a chance with Chu Yunfan’s participation. This was an invisible influence that had been unknowingly achieved. The others did not notice this, or perhaps they were unwilling to admit it. It was precisely because of this that countless scouts had gathered outside the battlefield, wanting to know the outcome of the battle as soon as possible. If they thought Wei Wuya had no chance of winning, they wouldn’t have sent anyone to spectate.","Now that they saw this fierce battle, they were shocked and their blood boiled!","Ye Fei’s strength was needless to say, he was the second strongest expert in the world, but Chu Yunfan was also bold enough to directly charge into the army formation alone. He actually wanted to capture the leader first. They knew this theory, but only Chu Yunfan dared to attack a million soldiers. If it was anyone else, they would be dead!","However, just as everyone thought that the battle between the two sides would continue to be in a stalemate, the situation suddenly changed. The golden roc tore through the sky and bombarded the white tiger.","After the tiger dispersed, Ye Fei’s original appearance was revealed. At this moment, he was in a sorry state. The armor on his body were somewhat damaged, and his arms were trembling slightly. Although he was extremely strong and could be said to be born with divine strength, able to take to the military like a fish in water and rise to the top to become the general who controlled the world’s armies, as the saying went, there was always a strong opponent among the strong.","And he had encountered a freak like Chu Yunfan!","After a series of battles, Ye Fei was actually at a complete disadvantage. Chu Yunfan’s body was unbelievably strong. Not only was he extremely strong, but he was also indestructible. He fought Ye Fei’s spirit weapon with his bare hands without losing the slightest bit.","His hands did not even crack!","Facing the attacks from all kinds of experts, Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at them. He swiftly approached Ye Fei. “If I kill you, this battle will be over.”","Ye Fei sneered and said, “Kill me? Chu Yunfan, haven’t you noticed the problem?”","Chu Yunfan looked around. He had already entered the depths of the rebel army. He had rushed in without any mercy. Just the aftermath of the battle between the two sides had probably killed thousands of people. Both sides were experts at the peak of the Void Core Stage, and any one of them possessed strength that ordinary people could not imagine. The battle between the two sides was like a comet crashing into the earth. Just the aftershock of the battle was enough to wipe out the affected army.","However, at this moment, dozens of figures were already approaching. There were a total of thirty-six figures, and all of them were Cores. These thirty-six figures formed a Great Energy Force Array, and they were flying straight at Chu Yunfan.","These thirty-six figures borrowed the power of the military formation and their auras covered the sky and earth. Although most of these thirty-six people were at the fledgling Void Core Stage, there were a few at the intermediate Void Core Stage. None of them were considered too strong, but with the help of the military formation, they had become much stronger all of a sudden.","The battle energy of millions of soldiers, even if only a little bit of it was guided, could form a terrifying power.","Chu Yunfan instantly understood that this was a trap. From the beginning to the end, this was just a trap. It was to lure him into the depths of the army formation so that they could kill him.","And the various actions of Ye Fei were just to lure Chu Yunfan in. He had never thought of fighting Chu Yunfan."]}]);
